window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4901,"title":"Chapter 4901 Everyone Joins the Battle","paragraphs":["4901 Everyone Joins the Battle","Under his kick, hundreds of top cultivators were caught off guard and were directly kicked back into the Immortal Array Formation.","“Damn it...” Before one of the Yan Immortals could finish his sentence, he was cut into palm-sized pieces by Jian Wushuang.","All the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators subconsciously retreated. Looking at this god of death in front of them, they felt an inexplicable pressure.","Jian Wushuang did not intend to waste any time. He lifted his leg and kicked another group of Yan Immortals and peak cultivators into the Immortal Array Formation.","At the same time, he stretched out his hand, and his five fingers merged together to form a sky-splitting palm that smashed down.","The Immortal Array Formation formed by nearly 10,000 Immortal patterns could not withstand this power at all and collapsed!","As the first Immortal Array Formation shattered, only three of the original four Immortal Array Formations remained!","The headless Armadillo Bull had also fallen. It was like a shattered Heavenly Region, sinking into the shattered void!","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and turned to look at the other three Immortal Array Formations that were slowly opening.","Such an Immortal Array Formation, when stopped in time, had already killed close to a hundred Yan Immortals and countless peak cultivators. If they did not stop it, the Six Heavens Realm would have been destroyed!","Therefore, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He took the Young Emperor and went to the next Immortal Array Formation.","At this moment, the entire Six Heavens Realm had fallen into chaos.","Even with Di Qing protecting them, the Six Heavens Realm could barely be defended.","The original 60-plus Yan Immortal experts were now reduced to less than 30. With the addition of new blood, the original army had nearly 400 Yan Immortal experts.","Furthermore, the Yan Immortal army had already known the importance and terror of Di Qing, so they no longer charged forward madly. Instead, they let the top cultivators who came later take the lead and exhaust the Six Heavens Realm’s strength.","Prince Qian’s face turned pale. In his opinion, the Six Heavens Realm could no longer be defended. Moreover, he was already considering how to escape back to his Ethereal Immortal Province as soon as possible.","Chen Qing was fighting beside Di Qing and was clearly unable to escape.","At this moment, several streaks of light rushed over from the Six Heavens Realm. They were Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, Wei Liujia, and a bald man who was as strong as a divine mountain.","When they saw this scene, all of them had solemn expressions.","Chun Qiu flew over to Chen Qing and said with a dark expression. “Why didn’t you inform us about such a big thing?”","Chen Qing touched the divine blood on his face and said anxiously, “The situation is too urgent. There’s no way to escape. Even if I wanted to go back and call for you, there’s nothing I could do.”","Chun Qiu’s expression softened slightly. He looked at the turbulent situation and was about to speak again when an impatient roar rang out.","“Where’s My Lord? Where did he go? Is he here too?”","The person who let out the roar was the bald man, Feng Shan. He roared with an extremely anxious expression.","“Isn’t this idiot the guy who was lying outside Brother Jian’s palace?” Chen Qing was somewhat puzzled.","The bald man, Feng Shan, rushed to Chen Qing and said anxiously, “You must know where My Lord is, right? Tell me quickly. I can’t let My Lord get hurt at all! ”","Hearing this, Chen Qing stretched out his hand and pointed at the location of the three Armadillo Bulls in the distance. “He’s right there.”","Before he could finish his sentence, Feng Shan flew up. Although his body was extremely strong, his movements were also extremely agile. He rushed towards Jian Wushuang with great agility.","“He’s really a good-for-nothing.” Chen Qing shook his head helplessly.","Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the others were also preparing to go to Jian Wushuang’s aid, but they were stopped by him. “Brother Jian is not in too much danger for the time being. Help relieve some pressure on me.”","Looking at Di Qing, who had a pair of wings on his back, Chun Qiu did not say anything. He summoned his eight-armed Arhat and stood in front of Di Qing to protect him.","Cui Jing also joined the battle, holding the eight-foot-long black staff and fighting alongside Chun Qiu.","Wei Liujia, who had not fully recovered, joined the battle without hesitation. He thought that he would be helping Jian Wushuang if he could protect the bottom line of the Six Heavens Realm.","Zhao Ting also clenched her teeth slightly. After a moment of hesitation, she joined the battle.","With Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the few Yan Immortals protecting him, Di Qing felt the pressure around him relax, allowing her to catch her breath.","Chun Qiu’s calmness, Cui Jing’s boldness, Chen Qing’s experience, and Wei Liujia’s seemingly gentle yet deadly speed were all suitable for this chaotic situation.","They were compatible with each other and had greatly offset the waves of impact. Even Di Qing was secretly certain of them.","As Chun Qiu and the others joined the battle, thousands of streams of light emerged from the Six Heavens Realm.","They were the last remaining Yan Immortals and peak cultivators of the Six Heavens Realm.","They were all cultivating in the sword discussion Dao Field in the southernmost region of Little Lonely Heaven, but now they were all here. None of the peak cultivators and Yan Immortals were absent.","Stepping into this chaotic battlefield, all the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators did not say a word, silently welcoming their fate.","From a certain perspective, this was indeed a battle of fate.","The sword cultivators all drew their True Swords, and the top cultivators all released their most powerful Yan power.","There were less than ten Yan Immortals who charged into the chaotic battlefield, killing the enemies and being killed.","This was the purest war, and also the largest war since the establishment of the Great Si Region.","There were close to 600 Yan Immortals and countless peak cultivators participating in the battle, and there was an endless stream of Yan Immortals joining the battle.","This was also a war between Imperial Princes, and it involved five or even six Imperial Princes.","This war was also the turning point of their relationship.","...","The originally one-sided situation once again fell into a stalemate.","Prince Qian’s pale face eased a little, but he was still in shock.","Where did the people under the Young Emperor Prince Yan come from? They were so powerful that they could turn the tide of the battle on their own!","Naturally, no one could answer Prince Qian. If he knew that these people who could turn the tide did not even listen to the orders of the Young Emperor, he would be completely shocked.","The originally defeated situation was once again salvaged, and the chaotic battle was even more chaotic than before.","If the void had color, the countless drops of divine blood would have dyed it dark red.","The Yan Immortals were constantly dying, and the Ancestor-level cultivators were dying in batches, not even their bodies could be preserved.","This shattered void was the burial ground of the Yan Immortals and top cultivators."]},{"number":4902,"title":"Chapter 4902 Protector Feng Shan","paragraphs":["4902 Protector Feng Shan","A land of death of Immortals, a pile of bones.","The Yan Immortals fought to the death, the top cultivators fought to the death.","As far as the eye could see, the shattered void was filled with Immortal bones and corpses.","And this situation would only become more and more intense and would not end. This was because only one of the four Immortal Array Formations had been destroyed at the source of the war.","There were still three Immortal Array Formations that were about to be activated and enter the explosive stage.","Once the remaining three arrays were activated, everything would enter a dead end.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang would never let that happen.","After destroying the first Immortal Array Formation, he immediately rushed to the second Immortal Array Formation!","He wanted to stop this battle from happening.","Under the protection of Di Qing, the situation was in a stalemate. However, this situation could not last for long. Therefore, Jian Wushuang had to finish the battle quickly and then return to defense.","As nearly 10,000 Immortal patterns rotated, the second and third Immortal Array Formations were about to be activated.","Jian Wushuang had already arrived before the second Armadillo Bull. He held an Invisible Sword in his hand and his entire body was like a peerless divine sword. He slashed at the Armadillo Bull’s head fearlessly.","The Armadillo Bull’s body was simply too huge. It was even several times larger than some ordinary Heavenly Regions. This caused its movements to slow down. If it encountered a strong opponent, it would basically be waiting for death.","Facing Jian Wushuang, the second Armadillo Bull also opened its mouth and swallowed him.","The same scene happened again. Billions of beautiful lights exploded on the Armadillo Bull’s head, eventually turning it into dust.","Jian Wushuang held his sword and climbed to the top. He looked at the huge Immortal Array Formation on the back of the Armadillo Bull and saw that it had been completely activated.","There were already Yan Immortals stepping out of the Immortal Array Formation, rushing towards the battlefield!","In just a few seconds, another hundred or so experts had joined the broken void battlefield!","Furthermore, there was an endless stream of Yan Immortals pouring out from the Immortal Array Formation.","The Six Heavens Realm was in danger!","Originally, there were still 300 plus people in the Yan Immortal army, but after the addition of the new blood, it was now close to 500.","Jian Wushuang held the Invisible Sword in his hand and arrived in front of the second Immortal Array Formation in an instant. He wanted to close the Immortal Array Formation as soon as possible.","However, this time, it was not as smooth as the first time.","Almost at the same time, the Yan Immortals who walked out of the Immortal Array Formation became alert and surrounded Jian Wushuang.","“Are you a remnant of the Six Heavens Realm?”","A clear voice rang out. Then, a young Yan Immortal expert wearing silver Thousand Leaves Silver Armor and holding a silver spear walked out of the Immortal Array Formation and looked at Jian Wushuang arrogantly.","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and used the seventh move of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Sword Style.","Folding Grass and Leaves.","In an instant, boundless Sword Intent surged out from the blade, like green leaves, flying forward.","The eyes of that youth brightened, his competitive spirit rose.","He suddenly took a step forward and pointed the silver spear in his hand at the void. Then, he used his palm to block the spear and directly used a flat stab.","This seemingly ordinary stab carried the momentum of a whale swallowing the galaxy and actually broke Jian Wushuang’s Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","At this moment, even the Young Emperor who was standing beside Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked.","This was the first time that someone in the same realm as him had broken through Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent without much difficulty.","Jian Wushuang was also slightly surprised. The young Yan Immortal expert in silver armor and spear was able to find a way to deal with the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style so quickly. It was indeed impressive.","The entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style started from the seventh move, from simple to complex, and the Sword Intent contained within it was also close to majestic.","And that youth used the simplest attack to break through the seventh move, Folding Grass and Leaves.","“Not bad, you can be my opponent.”","The young Yan Immortal’s eyes lit up and he was ready to fight Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang did not want to fight him. His goal was the Immortal Array Formations.","The Young Emperor understood what he was thinking, he held his sword and faced the young Yan Immortal!","The young Yan Immortal’s eyes flashed with doubt, then he seemed to have thought of something, “You are Prince Yan?!”","The Young Emperor ignored him and released his Immortal Style, attracting the attention of all the Yan Immortals.","“All Yan Immortals, listen to my command, kill Prince Yan with all your might!”","He suddenly raised the silver spear in his hand, and the earth-shattering sound echoed in the shattered void.","At this moment, close to 100 Yan Immortals gathered around.","Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer. He jumped into the Immortal Array Formation that was flowing with Immortal patterns.","The young Yan Immortal who was fighting with the Young Emperor saw this scene and immediately guessed his intentions. He hurriedly shouted, “Don’t just stand there, protect the Immortal Array Formation!”","Immediately, the group of Evolved Immortals chased after Jian Wushuang.","This kind of Immortal Array Formation that was built with tens of thousands of Immortal patterns was extremely sturdy. Even the full-power attacks of dozens of Yan Immortals might not be able to break through its defense. Unless a Grand Yan Immortal attacked, the Immortal Array Formation would be stable.","However, Jian Wushuang could easily destroy the Immortal Array Formation, so the only thing he was worried about was being obstructed.","It seemed like the more worried he was, the more it would come true. When he appeared in front of the Immortal Array Formation, 60 to 70 Yan Immortals surrounded him, and thousands of peak cultivators also came over.","This scene was extremely troublesome.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to rush out of the encirclement, a deafening roar resounded.","“My Lord, Protector Feng Shan is late!!”","Even Jian Wushuang felt his eardrums swell when he heard the explosion.","By the time he reacted, he saw a blazing meteor-like figure break through the void and resolutely rush into the encirclement.","There were over ten Yan Immortals who could not dodge in time and were sent flying 10,000 feet away.","Rumble!","The entire back of the Armadillo Bull was covered in cracks under this huge tremor.","The encirclement was thrown into chaos, and the figure that came from afar climbed up from the back of the Armadillo Bull in a daze.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched. “Why are you here?”","“My Lord, it’s indeed you. Feng Shan knew that you were here, so I came to protect you. Fortunately, I wasn’t late!” The bald man, Feng Shan, ran over excitedly.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. When he saw that the encirclement had become chaotic, he said in a serious voice, “Get ready to rush out with me. As long as you rush out, you can follow me from now on.”","“Feng Shan accepts the order. My Lord, just watch!” Feng Shan said excitedly.","As soon as he finished speaking, his originally extremely sturdy figure instantly expanded several times. His entire body was like a divine mountain, filled with an intimidating aura.","Then, he charged forward like a small Armadillo Bull.","In the next moment, the overwhelming Yan power poured onto his body, scattering countless terrifying radiant energy."]},{"number":4903,"title":"Chapter 4903 Accidentally Entering the Death Immortal Heavenly Region (1)","paragraphs":["4903 Accidentally Entering the Death Immortal Heavenly Region (1)","Even Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched when he saw this scene.","This was a full-powered attack from dozens of Yan Immortals, as well as countless top cultivators. Even a beast like the Armadillo Bull, famous for its tough body, would not be able to withstand it.","But in the next moment, a shocking scene appeared.","Feng Shan suddenly shouted. His sturdy body that was like a divine mountain suddenly doubled in size. At the same time, veins that were as thick as arms bulged out, and his skin turned dark green.","All the attacks from the Yan Immortal and peak cultivators seemed to have lost their effectiveness, they actually could not leave any marks on his body.","“M-My Lord... Hurry up and leave!”","He looked back at Jian Wushuang and roared. He had done his best.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. The Invisible Sword in his hand was extremely bright.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","It was as if it was descending from the void dome, carrying endless Sword Intent. Every Sword Intent reflected a dazzling starlight and then swept over heavily.","Under this sword, close to 1000 peak cultivators and over 30 Yan Immortals were killed on the spot, and countless were heavily injured.","Feng Shan was stunned on the spot, looking at this scene in disbelief.","The encirclement was completely disrupted.","“Live well.”","After Jian Wushuang said that to Feng Shan, he stood in front of the Immortal Array Formation with Immortal patterns.","In the Immortal Array Formation, there was an endless stream of Yan Immortal and Peak Cultivators, but they were all kicked back by Jian Wushuang. Then, he stretched out his hand and released the Immortal Style.","After the battle with Chang Duoling, all of Jian Wushuang’s Ancestral Skills, Immortal Styles, and Sword Principles had been tempered.","Therefore, the Immortal Style he released at this moment was even more majestic than before.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River.","With Jian Wushuang as the center, the surrounding void became his territory. In this territory, he could mobilize and transform any substance.","A divine mountain directly tore through the void and pressed down, directly crushing the second Immortal Array Formation!","At this point, only two of the four Immortal Array Formations were left!","The Immortal Array Formation collapsed and the boundless power spread out in all directions. This scene was taken in by nearly 100 Yan Immortals. Then, they all lunged at Jian Wushuang as if they had gone mad.","Feng Shan grimaced in pain. “You dogs, you want to run after hitting me?!”","Jian Wushuang did not stop. After destroying the second Immortal Array Formation, he went straight to the third Immortal Array Formation.","The young Yan Immortal who was fighting with the Young Emperor saw this and immediately pushed the Young Emperor back with his spear. Then, he chased after Jian Wushuang in an instant.","But then, a figure that looked like a divine mountain blocked their way.","“If you want to catch up, you have to step over me first!” Feng Shan’s eyes were also extremely arrogant as he said disdainfully.","The young Yan Immortal raised his eyebrows, pointing his silver spear at him, “All of you, step over his body.”","Rumble...","Nearly 100 Yan Immortals and countless top cultivators stepped over him...","Looking at Feng Shan who was deeply embedded in the back of the Armadillo Bull, the youth shook his head, “What a strange request.”","...","The third Immortal Array Formation was already activated. As tens of thousands of immortal patterns circulated, many Yan Immortals walked out.","Now that Jian Wushuang had destroyed only two Immortal Array Formations, the chaotic battlefield had become a stalemate.","In an instant, he arrived before the third Armadillo Bull. This time, he did not kill the Armadillo Bull, but directly arrived before the third Immortal Array Formation.","Just as he was about to slash down with his sword, there was a sudden sound of air being torn behind him.","Jian Wushuang was forced to turn around and block it.","The silver spear in the young Yan Immortal’s hand stabbed over and the extremely swift and violent Yan power burst out.","Jian Wushuang was forced to take half a step back.","“I thought you were plotting something. So you want to destroy the Immortal Array Formation?”","He tilted his long spear and said arrogantly, “It’s not impossible to destroy the Immortal Array Formation, but you have to defeat me first and I’ll let you go. How about it?”","“Boring.” Jian Wushuang retracted his gaze and turned to walk towards the Immortal Array Formation.","The young Yan Immortal’s gaze froze. “You look down on me?”","As he spoke, his right hand formed the shape of a bow, and the arm that held the silver spear made a full circle. Then, as if he was shooting at the sun, he ruthlessly threw the silver spear.","Jian Wushuang did not turn around, even though the spear behind him had arrived.","In the next moment, a bull-like figure rushed into the encirclement and resolutely faced the silver spear that was flying towards him.","A dark yellow energy that looked like the color of the earth gushed out and formed an impassable barrier in front of Feng Shan.","The spear that seemed to be able to pierce through the sky was actually unable to advance a few steps further when it collided with the dark yellow barrier.","Feng Shan roared, his feet digging deep trenches in the back of the Armadillo Bull. Then, he shook his arms and sent the silver spear flying.","“Good fellow, your skin is really thick.”","Grabbing the silver spear that flew back, the young Yan Immortal raised his eyebrows and looked at him. “Make way, my target is not you.”","“No matter who your target is, defeat me first.” Feng Shan spat out a mouthful of saliva and said.","“How foolish.” The young Yan Immortal shook his head, the silver spear in his hand shone brightly, a thousand Silver Spear True Souls appeared behind him, and they all shot towards Feng Shan.","The void collapsed, and each Silver Spear True Soul was extremely violent. If it all fell on him, he would probably not be able to take it.","Just as thousands of Silver Spear True Souls were shooting down, Feng Shan, who was still in a life-and-death situation, was suddenly pulled over by a stream of Yan power.","Rumble...","The Armadillo Bull wailed as the thousand spears merged into one, carving out a deep ravine that was hundreds of millions of feet deep on its back, causing the void to tremble.","“My Lord.” Feng Shan was shocked.","After letting go of him, Jian Wushuang said solemnly, “Follow me closely. Don’t take any risks.”","He nodded heavily and followed closely.","The Immortal Array Formation was only a foot away, but with dozens of Yan Immortals guarding it, it was still extremely troublesome.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to unleash his strongest attack, the young Yan Immortal expert rushed over with his spear.","“Little rat, come and fight with me. If you win, I can give you this Immortal Array Formation.”","Jian Wushuang looked back at him and said calmly, “You will lose within two moves.”","“Two swords? How arrogant!” The young Yan Immortal pointed his silver spear at him, his expression extremely arrogant. “Forget about two swords strikes, even if it was 200 swords strikes, you still wouldn’t be able to defeat me! I’m invincible in the same cultivation realm!”","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up as if he had heard the funniest joke. Even Feng Shan could not help but laugh heartily."]},{"number":4904,"title":"Chapter 4904 Accidentally Entering the Death Immortal Heavenly Region (2)","paragraphs":["4904 Accidentally Entering the Death Immortal Heavenly Region (2)","Even if he was not lying and was invincible in the same realm, he had no chance of winning against Jian Wushuang.","Before the battle began, Jian Wushuang was already strong enough to fight against a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Chang Duoling.","In other words, they were no longer equal opponents.","Jian Wushuang was confident that he could defeat him in two moves.","“What, you don’t believe me?” The young Yan Immortal’s brows raised as he asked coldly.","“Of course I believe you. If it was any other day, I might have a fight with you, but not now.” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and then turned around.","Feng Shan tilted his head and spat. His Immortal body doubled in size.","When the young Yan Immortal saw this, he was furious, “You dare to ignore me?”","In the next moment, he held his spear and flew toward Jian Wushuang’s back.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Just as he was about to give him a thunderous blow, an extremely strange aura suddenly appeared.","The aura appeared so quickly that Jian Wushuang did not even have time to react before it appeared on his back.","“Tsk tsk, damn you, you won’t be able to escape this time!”","The strange aura condensed into a black-robed figure. Its body was huge, and two black lights shot out from its eye sockets. The aura of death also soared into the sky.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. This black-robed figure was the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal that he had killed previously!","However, at this moment, he actually appeared again!","The black-robed Grand Immortal seemed to be unharmed. He extended two huge bone palms from under his black robe and held Jian Wushuang up before dragging him into the Immortal Array Formation.","Everything happened so fast that Jian Wushuang was dragged into the Immortal Array Formation before he could react.","Feng Shan also reacted instantly and rushed straight into the Immortal Array Formation.","“You have guts!” The young Yan Immortal was furious, he raised his spear and charged into the Immortal Array Formation.","The Immortal patterns circulated and absorbed their bodies in an instant, teleporting them to an unknown place.","The battlefield was still chaotic, but no Yan Immortal noticed this change.","As the third and fourth Immortal Array Formations were completely opened, the entire void battleground entered the most tragic and grand stage.","More and more Yan Immortals walked out from the last two Immortal Array Formations to join the battle. Just one Immortal Array Formation alone had more than 300 Yan Immortals.","At this point, close to a thousand Yan Immortals charged toward the Six Heavens Realm.","Standing on the back of the dead Armadillo Bull, Young Emperor held his sword and watched the scene unfold. The void gales tore everything apart.","The complete destruction of the Six Heavens Realm was a foregone conclusion.","...","As the Immortal patterns in the Immortal Array Formation circulated, it seemed like a long time had passed, but it also seemed like only a moment. Jian Wushuang was transported to a Heavenly Domain.","The strange black-robed Grand Yan Immortal that was restraining him had long disappeared, as if it had never appeared.","His feet landed on the ground. He looked around and saw withered grass and dried rivers. They were the main colors of this Heavenly Region.","The sky was extremely chaotic. The extremely dense death energy even covered and swallowed the scattered Yan power.","Standing under the sky, an extremely strange and inexplicable atmosphere quietly pervaded the air.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to take a look, Feng Shan’s huge body fell from the sky and landed heavily on the ground.","“Aiyo...”","Feng Shan wailed in pain, rubbing his head as he got up from the ground.","Immediately after, another Yan Immortal in silver armor and holding a silver spear descended from the sky. His expression was arrogant and puzzled.","“What is this place...”","Jian Wushuang glanced at him, but he had no intention of attacking.","Coming to such a strange place, it was imperative to thoroughly investigate it.","Feng Shan continued, “My Lord, is this the lair of the guy who dragged you here?”","“It’s very possible.” He nodded and looked into the distance.","The withered grass extended all the way to the horizon. On the cracked and dilapidated land, there were many huge graves, almost uncountable. There were even many black and dilapidated coffins that were slanted on the ground, and the death aura was emitted from them.","The pale white soul-beckoning banner rustled along with the wind, giving off an indescribable desolate and eerie feeling.","Jian Wushuang felt that this extremely strange Heavenly Region was extremely similar to a place in his memory.","That place was the God Refining Sect in the Void Universe, which was also where he was undercover.","The God Refining Sect used refined divine corpses as battle puppets. As long as the sect disciples could refine any divine corpse, they would be much stronger than Void Masters of the same realm. It was because of this that the God Refining Sect could be considered a super sect in the entire Void Universe.","The aura of death in this desolate and strange Heavenly Region was a hundred times or even a thousand times denser than the God Refining Sect Star Field.","Jian Wushuang began to suspect that there was an evil sect like the God Refining Sect in this Heavenly Region.","Just as he was at a loss, a strange laughter resounded throughout the entire Heavenly Region plane.","“Not bad, not bad. Originally, I thought that it would be a great opportunity to swallow one of you. Now that two of you have come to my door, I will reluctantly swallow all of you alive.”","As the voice rang out, a huge, awe-inspiring face that was hundreds of millions of feet tall gradually appeared in the originally chaotic void.","This huge face was like a taut skin on a skull. Its mouth was sharp and its cheeks were bulging. It was as ugly as a hairless monkey.","Although his face had changed greatly, Jian Wushuang recognized the giant face at a glance. It was the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal who had died at his hands!","When the young Yan Immortal saw this, he frowned and shouted, “You Yun, why didn’t you go to the Six Heavens Realm to fight? Why did you return to your own Heavenly Region?! ”","In the sky, the huge face froze. When he saw this scene, he could not help but reveal a smile.","“I was wondering who it was. So it’s great Heavenly Official Shu Yang. How is it? Are you satisfied with my Heaven Domain?”","The young Yan Immortal frowned. “Cut the crap, hurry up and follow me to the Six Heavens Realm!”","“No problem, but you have to eat before you can work, right?” The giant face revealed a strange smile.","He suddenly raised the silver spear in his hand. “You Yun, what do you mean?!”","“Nothing much. Actually, what I want to say is that since you’ve come to my territory, why don’t you let nature take its course and become my nourishment to fill my stomach?”","The giant face suddenly laughed strangely and endless Death Qi descended from the sky. It was like a million feet long chains that immediately wrapped around Jian Wushuang and the others!"]},{"number":4905,"title":"Chapter 4905 The Death Immortal","paragraphs":["4905 The Death Immortal","The young Yan Immortal called Shu Yang’s eyes darkened, “You Yun, you’re courting death!”","In the next moment, the Silver Spear True Soul condensed from the purest Yan power emerged from Shu Yang’s back. It was thousands of meters tall.","When the chains came down, they burst forth with the most magnificent light.","The two collided, and a heaven-shaking force completely surged out, causing the chaotic sky to shatter.","The Silver Spear True Soul instantly shattered the endless chains and stabbed straight at the giant face.","Whoosh...","Like a hot knife cutting into butter, the Silver Spear True Soul completely crushed the giant face and turned it into powder.","“Small tricks.” Shu Yang snorted coldly, he was not afraid at all, as if he did not put the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal in his eyes.","“Tsk tsk, you can all die.”","The sky collapsed and a black-robed figure appeared. He slowly opened his arms and endless death energy came out from under his black robe, “Here, I am the only Heavenly Dao. Any Yan Immortal who tries to break the shackles will receive the most severe punishment!”","With him as the center, the thick Death Qi transformed into a barrier that trapped Jian Wushuang, Feng Shan, and Shu Yang.","“Damned dog, you actually dare to attack me in the face of a great battle?!” Shu Yang gritted his teeth.","“My Lord, shall we charge out?” Feng Shan looked at Jian Wushuang and asked nervously.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. He sensed something unusual in the formation.","That was the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal that he had killed. He had used some secret technique to survive and had used this extremely strange Heavenly Region to set up a Death Heaven Array to trap them completely.","Just as he said, in this Death Heaven Array, he was the only Heavenly Dao. It was the easiest thing to trap a few Yan Immortals to death.","However, he underestimated the variable, which was Jian Wushuang.","He had killed a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal on his own. He had a great chance of winning against the weakest Grand Yan Immortal, even if the situation was extremely unfavorable to him!","Shu Yang’s expression was ugly. He naturally also realized how troublesome You Yun was. If he wanted to escape from here, it would probably be as difficult as ascending the heavens.","Just as he was about to risk his life, Jian Wushuang moved.","He did not release his Wushuang Sword Dao or his Ancestral Skill. He just calmly stepped on the air.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal, who was in the center of the Death Heaven Array, subconsciously took a few steps back when he saw this. The red light in his eyes was somewhat evaded.","Towards this young Immortal who had struck him like lightning earlier, he had an inexplicable sense of fear and danger.","If it was not for the life-saving secret technique that allowed him to escape, he would have been completely annihilated by now.","“I can kill you once, so naturally, I can kill you a second time. If you let us leave now, I promise to spare your life.”","Jian Wushuang’s calm voice resounded. He came before the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal and the distance between them was less than 30 meters.","“Otherwise, Chang Duoling’s fate will be your fate.”","His voice was not loud, but it exploded in Shu Yang’s mind.","A Yan Immortal dared to threaten a Grand Yan Immortal face to face? And he was fearless?","Was this an illusion, or did it really happen?","“You, are you threatening me?” the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal looked at him warily and said in a low voice.","“Not a threat, but a warning,” Jian Wushuang said as he formed an Invisible Sword in his palm.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal retreated quickly and his ferocious voice rang out, “After entering my Heavenly Region, no one can leave. All of you will become nourishment for me! ”","“Stubborn!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. Then, he extended his hand and pointed. Without any warning, a divine river appeared in the Death Heaven Array and swept toward the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River.","Seeing this mysterious scene, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was shocked and hurriedly fled.","The river swept out, tearing a crack in the Death Heaven Array almost instantly, and swept forward without any reduction in its momentum.","“What are you waiting for? Let’s help together. Do you want to be trapped here?” Feng Shan shouted and then flew up.","Shu Yang, who had recovered from his shock, had a sharp look in his eyes again. Facing the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal who was fleeing in panic, he exploded with a thunderous attack.","The Death Heaven Array, which was not very sturdy to begin with, shattered immediately, and that inexplicable restraint also completely disappeared.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s figure had already scattered into the void, but his voice still came over.","“Damned fellows, prepare to be devoured!”","As his voice fell, the originally dry and silent ground began to rumble and tremble.","A thick, ink-like aura of death also gushed out from the cracks in the ground.","The giant tomb exploded, and the coffins shattered. Figures that were almost condensed from Death Qi walked out of the ground and then flew into the sky.","Each figure that was wrapped in Death Qi was a Yan Immortal!","However, they were very different from ordinary Yan Immortals. Their bodies were emitting Death Qi, their eyes were blood red, and their exposed Immortal bodies were covered by finger-thick dark red meridians.","Seeing this scene, Shu Yang, who was holding the silver spear, gritted his teeth and said, “This You Yun is indeed abominable!”","“Why? Do you know him?” Feng Shan looked at him and asked.","Since they were on the same side, Jian Wushuang was not afraid that he would suddenly attack.","Shu Yang took a deep breath and said, “I’ve also heard about it before. You Yun is a notorious evil Immortal in this Heavenly Region. He absorbs the origin source and Immortal Source of top cultivators and even Yan Immortals to strengthen himself. He also transforms them into slaves for him to command.”","“Now it seems that he is really as evil as the rumors say.”","Shu Yang’s words were sincere and he did not seem to be lying. Jian Wushuang had more or less guessed some of the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s dirty deeds.","The Death Qi was so dense, it was definitely related to him absorbing the origin of top cultivators and the Immortal Source of the Yan Immortal.","For example, the 30 or so Evolving Immortals that surrounded him from all directions had all lost their Immortal Sources and were only driven by Death Qi.","“I have to be careful next. I heard that the slaves under You Yun can absorb anything, even the Immortal Source of the Yan Immortal. Once you are entangled by them, it won’t be so funny anymore. If you don’t want to become a slave like them, you have to do your best to break through this place,” Shu Yang reminded, as if he was facing a great enemy.","However, Jian Wushuang was not worried at all because he knew how to deal with this guy who could devour external objects to strengthen himself."]},{"number":4906,"title":"Chapter 4906 There’s Someone in the Cave","paragraphs":["4906 There’s Someone in the Cave","There were quite a few peak cultivators or Yan Immortals who used this unique ability to cultivate their own techniques.","This secret technique was extremely powerful. The only drawback was that the external force absorbed was too complicated, and it required constant time to digest and purify it.","However, there was a simple and crude way to deal with peak cultivators or Yan Immortals who relied on this secret technique.","That was to use all his strength to release his Yan power and cause his body to explode.","This method was indeed feasible, but if he was not careful, it was very likely that he would be killed.","Thus, even if a Yan Immortal knew of this method, he would not try it so easily.","Facing nearly 30 Death Immortals, Shu Yang did not even dare to breathe loudly.","They could not feel pain. Even if their limbs were cut off in battle, they could still release the last energy in their Immortal bodies.","“Tsk tsk, be devoured in peace and become my slave.”","The black-robed Great Yan Immortal You Yun appeared in the corner of the sky once again, looking at this scene with a dark gaze.","“Foolish fellow,” Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly. He did not stop at all. He moved his body and faced the 30 Death Immortals resolutely.","Ancestral Skill, Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","A magnificent Heavenly Gate materialized, and then a giant finger reached out from the Heavenly Gate and smashed toward all the Death Immortals.","However, the nearly 30 Death Immortals did not dodge. They all opened their mouths and formed a strange suction force that actually devoured this Ancestral Skill.","After they finished eating, the meridians on each of their Immortal bodies emitted a strange brilliance. It was extremely strange.","The next moment, a great battle erupted.","They all pounced on Jian Wushuang and the others crazily and soon surrounded them tightly.","Seeing this scene, You Yun smiled smugly, but his smile did not even have time to completely relax before it froze.","Tens of thousands of brilliant lights suddenly burst out from the encirclement, like the sun that could not be looked at directly, dazzling to the extreme.","Then, the encirclement formed by nearly 30 Death Immortals shattered with a loud bang. Nearly half of the Death Immortals turned into powder on the spot and could no longer be resurrected.","As the light circulated, a figure with majestic divine patterns flowing around his body slowly walked out with an Invisible Sword in his hand.","Shu Yang and Feng Shan followed closely behind, their eyes filled with extreme shock.","They had originally thought that it would be a bloody battle, but it had actually ended in an instant...","They only saw Jian Wushuang release his Yan power once and everything was over.","The encirclement was blown open, and only a dozen or so of the 30 Death Immortals were left. They were no longer able to do anything.","When You Yun saw the situation, he did not say any more harsh words and actually directly fled.","The remaining dozen or so Death Immortals were all a little afraid and could not help but retreat.","However, Jian Wushuang did not intend to let them go. In this treacherous Heavenly Region, any unstable factor was extremely important.","Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and tied up all the Death Immortals. Then, he crushed them into powder. Then, he looked at the place where You Yun disappeared.","Then, Jian Wushuang immediately chased after him.","Feng Shan followed Jian Wushuang without hesitation.","Shu Yang looked at the disappearing figure, his eyes burning with passion. A combative emotion surged in his heart.","...","You Yun’s whereabouts disappeared very quickly, but Jian Wushuang soon found his escape route.","This treacherous Heavenly Region could be considered a Super Heavenly Region. The entire Heavenly Region plane was several times larger than ordinary Heavenly Region.","The extremely abundant Yan power was replaced by a thick death aura.","As they continued to move forward, the dilapidated hall and the towering tomb became the main color of this place.","As for You Yun’s ghostly figure, he fled to a huge black mountain range.","Jian Wushuang arrived in an instant. Looking at the desolate and strange mountain gate in front of him, he reached out and pointed.","Immediately, a power that belonged to the suppression of the Heavenly Dao laws directly cut the mountain range in half.","In an instant, endless Death Qi gushed out from the mountain range, and the color of heaven and earth changed.","Even Jian Wushuang had to release his Yan power to protect himself from the corrosion of the Death Qi.","As half of the mountain was cut off by Jian Wushuang, the scene inside was exposed.","Countless dark caves appeared, and there were also dilapidated halls. It was extremely strange.","Shu Yang and Feng Shan arrived shortly after. When they saw this scene, they frowned.","“Looks like this place should be the You Yun’s home base,” Shu Yang said with a serious expression.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and went straight to the mountain.","Walking in the black mountain, the countless caves that were spewing out Death Qi were extremely mysterious.","One could also see that the bones that had long lost their color were lying in front of the cave. Even the slightest breeze would turn them into ashes.","This place was a complete purgatory.","Jian Wushuang frowned. He felt endless resentment in the Death Qi.","Just as he was moving forward, a hand suddenly reached out from a cave and grabbed his robe.","“Help...”","Jian Wushuang stopped Feng Shan and turned to look at the owner of the palm.","It was a Yan Immortal, but his Immortal Source was already broken, it was like a skeleton, with a breeze, it could fall apart.","His eyes were wide open, and he was about to die.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and a wisp of Yan power enveloped his body.","In an instant, he, who was originally like a skeleton, was filled up in an instant, and even his cheeks were flushed.","However, it was just the last moment. His Immortal Source had been shattered and his divine body was in a mess. If Jian Wushuang had not given him a wisp of Yan power, he would have died.","“Many, many thanks, Sir, for allowing me to live for a moment.” That Yan Immortal let out a long breath, as if he already knew his situation.","Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked, “Do you have anything to say?”","He nodded, and pain flashed in his eyes. “Yes, what I want to tell Sir is that you should go as far as you can now. This is a complete scam!”","“The so-called path of becoming an Immortal has always been a lie of that old dog. The price paid for this path of cultivation is too great.”","“I was a disciple of a prosperous sect in the Qingyu Heavenly Region. Later, the Sect Master’s wife left in a fit of anger, and the Sect Master sent 12 disciples to look for her. I was one of the 12 disciples. Due to my low cultivation level, it was very difficult for me to travel through the Qingyu Heavenly Region. Then, some unforeseen circumstances caused us disciples to get separated.”","“I can’t go back to the sect for a while, so I can only wander in Qingyu. I never thought that all of this would be the beginning of my nightmare.”","There was still some fear in his eyes as he said this. It was as if he could not forget that day even after so many years."]},{"number":4907,"title":"Chapter 4907 The Terrifying Cultivation Path","paragraphs":["4907 The Terrifying Cultivation Path","He panted for a moment and continued, “I was alone and wandering in the Heavenly Regions. I happened to come to a Heavenly Region with abundant energy. There, I saw a powerful Yan Immortal who opened a Dao Field and talked about the Dao. I sat down and listened to him. Soon, I was immersed in his discussion.”","“He promised us that as long as we join him, any top cultivator with extraordinary talent will definitely reach the Yan Immortal stage within a year. Even if they aren’t top cultivators, they will develop Immortal Roots within a few years and reach unimaginable heights.”","“During that debate, there were more than 100,000 top cultivators who followed him, and I was one of them.”","“I thought that this was a path with a bright future, but I didn’t expect that this path of cultivation would be beyond redemption.”","Jian Wushuang and the others could roughly guess what was going on.","The person that this apex cultivator was talking about was definitely the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal You Yun. He roamed the Heavenly Regions and opened up a wide Dao Field, attracting wave after wave of top cultivators and even Yan Immortals to follow him.","Then, he brought it to his nest and absorbed the origin to strengthen himself.","The result was just as Jian Wushuang had expected. After You Yun brought them here, he bared his fangs, tied them up, and sucked their Origin. However, the process was ten thousand times crueler.","“After that old dog brought us here, he no longer hid anything. He directly divided us into three, six, and nine grades.”","“The lowest grade, the first grade, has a huge population of tens of thousands. That old dog slaughtered them all and made every cultivator into a Soul Amber, which he distributed to the mid-grade cultivators for them to absorb.”","“After the mid-level cultivators were forced to consume these Soul Ambers, their strength increased rapidly. However, what awaited them were the top-level cultivators.”","“That old dog did the same thing. After slaughtering all the middle-level cultivators, he made Soul Ambers and gave them to the top-level cultivators.”","“As for me, because of my extraordinary talent, I was assigned to the highest level. Every 10,000 years, I have to absorb 100,000 Soul Ambers.”","“During this period of time, my cultivation level increased greatly and I successfully broke through to the Yan Immortal stage. There are more than 50 people in the same situation as me.”","“However, what awaited us was something even crueler. From then on, I knew that even if I became a Yan Immortal, I was just a chess piece.”","His eyes revealed a hint of bitterness. At the same time, his Immortal body was rapidly drying up and was about to die.","“After becoming a Yan Immortal, I thought that I would have the ability to fight him. I didn’t expect that I was still so powerless. All 50 of us were turned into praying mats by him, sucking our Immortal Source day and night.”","“This situation lasted for several years. Those who had their Immortal Sources sucked dry were made into dead Immortal slaves for him to command. They were beyond redemption.”","“In order to not become his slave, I crazily devoured the Immortal Source of the other Yan Immortals and lived until the end. When he left, I also took the opportunity to escape from the cave.”","When he said this, his aura was already weak and gradually dissipated.","Feng Shan said hatefully and then looked coldly at Shu Yang.","“Why are you looking at me? I have never interacted with him before. I just heard about him, ” Shu Yang quickly explained. “Didn’t you see that guy even tried to kill me?”","“Then why are you in the same camp?” Feng Shan asked again.","Shu Yang’s expression was a little awkward, and then he said seriously, “Forgive me for not being able to say anything, but since You Yun dared to attack me, then I want him to die under my spear!”","Feng Shan snorted and stopped talking. In his opinion, even Shu Yang’s full strength could not even compare to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang squatted down slowly and said to the Yan Immortal, “You’ve been tired for so long. It’s time to have a good sleep.”","He forced open his shriveled eyelids and forced a smile, “Thank you, Sir. It’s time to have a good sleep. From the day I found my master’s wife until now, I haven’t had a good sleep. Now, I can finally sleep...”","“What is the name of your sect?” Jian Wushuang asked softly. He had asked this on a whim.","It was as if he was opening up a memory that had been sealed long ago. Finally, he said slowly, “My Lord, it’s called Shangqing Pavilion. It’s located in Qingzhou, a very far away Heavenly Region. The scenery is very good. Master and Mistress are very good to me. It’s a pity that I won’t be able to see them one last time.”","After saying this, the Yan Immortal finally died. His Immortal body that could not hold on anymore turned into a pile of bones and scattered with the wind.","Jian Wushuang’s heart moved slightly, and his originally calm state of mind seemed to recall the past.","That reckless, bold, and meticulous girl had walked out from the Qingzhou and followed Di Qing to Great Mi Heaven.","Her name was Qing Xianchi, the daughter of the Sect Master of the Shangqing Pavilion.","The dead Yan Immortal was also one of the 12 disciples of the Shangqing Pavilion.","Everything seemed to be so coincidental, but it also seemed to be in the unseen world.","Jian Wushuang sighed and saw a finger-sized jade slip in the skeleton.","He raised his hand and picked up the jade slip. He saw that the two words ‘Shu Huan’ were engraved on it. After several years, it was still fresh.","Perhaps this jade letter was the identity of the dead Yan Immortal. When he was enduring the torment, the one that supported him was probably the Shangqing Pavilion where he cultivated in his youth.","Putting the jade slip in his bosom, Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at the dilapidated hall in the deepest part of the mountain range. His gaze was extremely cold.","Rumble!","The hall shattered, and even the entire mountain range could not withstand the power and collapsed.","With Jian Wushuang in the lead, Shu Yang and Feng Shan used all their strength to bombard anything they see.","Feng Shan roared and unleashed a series of extremely violent attacks that easily shattered anything that could be seen.","Jian Wushuang held the Invisible Sword in his hand and walked towards the dark hall at the front step by step.","In front of this pitch-black hall, under the huge and towering pitch-black pine tree, there were more than ten broken Immortal bodies guarding it. As far as the eye could see, the entire place was filled with deathly stillness and desolation."]},{"number":4908,"title":"Chapter 4908 The Dao Field Under the Abyss","paragraphs":["4908 The Dao Field Under the Abyss","Immediately after, the sound of bones cracking could be heard.","Without exception, they were all Death Immortals. Without their own consciousness, they were like corpses.","Crack...”","The Death Immortal in the lead seemed to have died a long time ago. All that was left was his Immortal bones. It could be said that he no longer had any combat power.","Jian Wushuang walked at the front. He waved his hand and wiped out the Death Immortals who dared to come forward, leaving no trace behind.","In an instant, the dozen Death Immortals had all disappeared.","This huge hall was built on the endless mountain range. It was the center of the mysterious Heavenly Region and also the place with the thickest Death Qi.","Feng Shan then stepped forward and protected Jian Wushuang. He rushed into the giant hall and started to wreak havoc.","He had smashed a few large holes in the ceiling of the hall. A faint light shone in, and the scene in the hall could barely be seen.","The hall was ancient, and the ground and walls were covered in deep red blood veins, making it look like a battlefield.","Moreover, the blood veins seemed to be alive as they slowly squirmed.","“Pretentious thing, I’ll kill you as well!” Feng Shan said in a deep voice. As he opened and closed his palms, a vast ocean of derived energy poured out and exploded in the hall.","Jian Wushuang suddenly had a bad premonition. However, before he could help, Feng Shan was already in danger!","Suddenly, millions of blood tendons were awakened like prey that smelled fresh blood. They covered the sky and covered the sun as they went to capture Feng Shan.","The great momentum of the Yan power was devoured by the countless blood tendons. Then, he was entangled by the blood tendons and dragged into the abyss.","Jian Wushuang’s slash only cut off thousands of blood tendons and failed to stop it.","Without any hesitation, he flew into the depths of the giant hall.","Shu Yang’s heart trembled and he followed closely behind Jian Wushuang. He couldn’t explain why he did this and followed his instincts.","The giant hall was broken, and there was a deep chasm in the deepest part. Even light could not shine in there. Countless blood veins as thick as real dragons were entrenched in the abyss, and it was extremely shocking.","Jian Wushuang held an Invisible Sword in his hand and majestic divine patterns flowed around his body, preventing all filth from approaching.","Boom!","Immediately after, a figure holding a long sword and flowing with divine patterns appeared. Shu Yang, who held a silver spear, followed closely behind.","Beneath the abyss was a vast and boundless Dao Field. No light could shine here, and it was extremely treacherous.","In the center of the vast Dao Field, Jian Wushuang saw a huge futon made of flesh and bones wiggling slowly.","This huge praying mat was actually made up of Death Immortals. There were at least hundreds of them!","At the same time, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal, You Yun, was sitting on the futon. His withered face was staring at Jian Wushuang with hatred.","“I miscalculated. I shouldn’t have brought you into my Heavenly Region,” he said fiercely.","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said coldly, “Cut the crap. Let him go and I’ll spare your life.”","You Yun suddenly stood up from the futon, and red light shot out from his sunken eyes. “Are you sure you have me cornered?!”","“I can kill you the first time, so naturally, I can kill you the second time. Do you still want to try?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“Then I’ll give it a try today. If you beat me, I’ll return him to you!” You Yun shouted. His arms shook, and a blood tendon that was a million feet thick appeared from the dark.","Feng Shan’s body was firmly fixed at the top of the blood tendon, unable to move at all.","You Yun wanted to say something, but Jian Wushuang obviously did not want to talk nonsense. He walked toward him with his sword.","He was shocked and hurriedly controlled the endless death energy to respond.","Crack, crack...","The ground shattered and suddenly, giant claws emerged from the ground and clawed at Jian Wushuang crazily.","Seeing this, Shu Yang hurriedly raised the silver spear in his hand and opened a path for him.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","The Sword Intent of the majestic temple gathered into a line and slashed forward with a momentum that was as if it was splitting open the sky!","The Sword Intent exploded out completely, and countless beams of light burst out along the way, shattering the giant claws that reached out from the ground.","This sword attack had the highest AOE damage and could easily eliminate threats.","You Yun was shocked. The Sword Intent that made him suffocate attacked again, and he was forced to attack.","In an instant, the praying mat under his feet began to squirm.","All the overlapping Death Immortals were struggling in pain. They opened their mouths and formed a strange suction force.","Under this suction force, the Sword Intent was directly devoured.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. He felt that something was wrong.","Shu Yang came behind him and said solemnly, “There’s something wrong with the futon that You Yun is sitting on. It can absorb all damage.”","He nodded, not in a hurry to make a move.","At this moment, Feng Shan, who was hanging on the blood tendon, shouted anxiously, “My Lord, leave quickly. Don’t stay here any longer. There’s something wrong with this old thing! He...”","Before he could finish his sentence, You Yun stretched out his hand and released a ball of Blood Qi to knock him out. “How noisy.”","Then, You Yun gave a strange smile, and his figure disappeared in the air.","Shu Yang’s expression changed and he moved toward Jian Wushuang without leaving a trace.","There was a natural chasm between the Grand Yan Immortal and the Yan Immortal, let alone a treacherous Grand Yan Immortal like You Yun.","It could be said that as long as You Yun had killing intent, even if Shu Yang was invincible in the same realm, he could only die obediently, let alone fight against him.","Shu Yang, who was proud and aloof by nature, did not doubt this at all. Therefore, he directly approached Jian Wushuang.","This person was also in the Yan Immortal stage, and could even be said to be his enemy, but now, he felt a great sense of security...","“This is my home. I am the eternal Heavenly Dao here. No one can hurt me!”","“Now, be my nourishment with your devout faith. You are enough for me to make another breakthrough!”","As You Yun’s voice resounded in the abyssal Dao Field, the huge futon made of Death Immortals moved at this moment.","Every Death Immortal was wailing in pain. It was as if they had suffered the most painful punishment before they completely died.","Endless Death Qi spread in the center of the Dao Field. Then, the huge futon moved. All the dead Immortals opened their blood-red eyes at this moment."]},{"number":4909,"title":"Chapter 4909 Undying You Yun","paragraphs":["4909 Undying You Yun","The Death Immortals were not scary enough to be feared, they were not even as troublesome as Yan Immortals of the same level.","However, the power emitted by the praying mat formed by so many Death Immortals could not be underestimated.","They wailed together and then flew up to Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, an endless suction force gathered from all directions, crazily devouring all the Yan power.","Even Jian Wushuang felt uncomfortable.","This huge Death Immortal Praying Mat was really troublesome. He immediately released his Ancestral Skill to deal with it.","Ancestral Skill, Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","A vast amount of Yan power burst forth, and countless divine weapons flew out from the Heavenly Gate. They connected with each other and shot down boundless light.","At this moment, all the Death Immortals in the Death Immortal Praying Mat raised their heads and opened their mouths to devour the Yan power.","To Jian Wushuang’s surprise, the move was completely devoured!","At this point, the Death Immortal Praying Mat had already reached its maximum size, and it wailed as it pounced at him once again.","Shu Yang’s expression changed drastically. He was already prepared to fight to the death.","However, Jian Wushuang was one step ahead of him. He leaped forward and the Invisible Sword in his hand was extremely dazzling.","In the next moment, the Wushuang Sword Intent lit up the entire Dao Field under the abyss.","Jian Wushuang’s calm eyes only focused on this ordinary sword attack.","The two collided, but there was no earth-shattering scene. In fact, there was no loud sound.","This ordinary sword strike was a supreme sword strike, the strongest sword strike. No one could block it.","The Death Immortal Praying Mat, which was originally filled to the extreme, exploded with a loud bang. It exploded into countless pieces of limbs.","Under this sword strike, the Death Immortal Praying Mat dissipated.","Shu Yang widened his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang’s back in disbelief. A huge question arose in his heart.","After killing the Death Immortal Praying Mat, Jian Wushuang went straight to Feng Shan. He wanted to save him.","“Get lost!” he shouted sternly and slashed the long sword in his hand at You Yun.","Crash...","Under this sword strike, You Yun’s figure was directly shattered, and then he was split into two.","“Idiot, you’re just a mere Yan Immortal, and you want to kill me in my Heavenly Region?”","Jian Wushuang ignored him and continued to slash.","With each of his strikes, You Yun’s body would shatter, but then another one would split. Soon, there were nearly a hundred You Yun’s, surrounding Jian Wushuang.","“Danger, run!”","Seeing this scene, Shu Yang warned in shock.","However, it was already too late. Nearly a hundred You Yuns all grinned hideously and opened their palms, blasting out a fatal blow.","It was a full-powered attack from the Grand Yan Immortal. The endless Death Qi light pillar bombarded Jian Wushuang from all directions.","Rumble!","The entire geocentric abyss was completely shaken. Even Shu Yang could not stand firm here and could only self-destruct.","The explosion lasted for a long time until everything returned to normal.","Then, a body riddled with holes fell from the sky and half-knelt on the ground.","Divine blood flowed out of the broken body like a stream, soaking a large area of the ground.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body had been shattered to the extreme. If he went one step further, his Immortal body would probably be completely shattered.","In the end, he was still careless and underestimated the true strength of a Grand Yan Immortal.","No matter how weak You Yun was, he was a genuine Grand Yan Immortal and could easily injure Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang still had not crossed that hurdle.","When Shu Yang saw this scene, his expression was extremely solemn. Then, he quickly regained his composure. He held the silver spear in his hand and directly rose into the air to face You Yun.","“Hmm? A mere Heavenly Official like you dares to stop me?” You Yun looked at him coldly.","Shu Yang snorted coldly and said, “You Yun, you have to remember. Now is the time to fight with the Six Heavens Realm. It’s not the time for you to be impudent!”","“So what if I went overboard? Do you believe that even if I kill you right now, Prince Hua won’t punish me?” You Yun smiled sinisterly, and a huge shadow appeared behind him.","Hatred rose in Shu Yang’s eyes. “Then let’s see how you can hurt me!”","A fierce battle erupted in the air again, but it was a one-sided battle.","You Yun was like a cat catching a mouse, toying with Shu Yang in the palm of his hand. The insurmountable gap between the Grand Yan Immortal and the Yan Immortal made him calm.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was half-kneeling on the ground. His Immortal body was recovering quickly, but it still needed some time.","He gritted his teeth, and his shattered Immortal body began to grow flesh.","At this moment, an extremely weak but abrupt voice sounded from behind him.","“You’re wasting your energy like this... He can’t be killed at all.”","Jian Wushuang turned around abruptly and saw a Death Immortal with only a head left crawling towards him.","“Don’t worry. I’m different from them. I’m not completely dead yet. I still have the last bit of divine sense.”","This Death Immortal’s head was indeed different. There was a pair of crystal clear eyes in his eye sockets.","“I was one of the top cultivators who was tricked by him to come here. Now, they are all dead, but I am still alive.”","“The reason why I still have the last bit of faith to live on is because I want to tell his weakness to the expert who can kill him. Fortunately, I waited.”","The Death Immortal’s head came to Jian Wushuang and his eyes were full of vigor.","“What I know is that he doesn’t have a main body, he’s in the form of a ghost. None of the attacks from the Yan Immortals were able to kill him.”","“But I know how to kill him completely. I’ve been enslaved by him until now, and I know his biggest secret.”","“He doesn’t have a True Body, but he is an illusion. I once saw him take out an ancient book. Now that I think about it, it must be his origin.”","“If you can find that ancient book, you can completely destroy him!”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked after a while, “Where is the ancient book?”","“In this Dao Field, it depends on whether you have the ability to destroy this place,” the head said slowly. “Can you do it?”"]},{"number":4910,"title":"Chapter 4910 Reversal Death Scripture","paragraphs":["4910 Reversal Death Scripture","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had already completely recovered. The damage that You Yun could inflict on him was extremely limited, and it was even far inferior to Chang Duoling.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was able to recover quickly.","After listening to the Death Immortal’s head, Jian Wushuang asked, “Can you tell me the exact location?”","“Of course, that ancient book should be under you. I hope you can destroy it. This is the last thing I can tell you.”","The Death Immortal’s head gradually collapsed and finally turned into a handful of ashes, disappearing.","Jian Wushuang stood up slowly and looked at the scene in the sky. Then, he condensed an Invisible Sword in his palm.","The next moment, he thrust his sword at the ground.","Boom!","The sound of a collapse from the depths of the earth rang out.","With a single sword strike of a million feet, the entire earth’s core beneath the abyss was dug apart by this sword strike of his!","You Yun, who was about to kill Shu Yang with a palm strike, changed his expression and dashed toward Jian Wushuang.","“You want to leave? I won’t let you have it easy today even if I have to die!”","Shu Yang was covered in blood. He held his silver spear and blocked in front of You Yun.","“Trash, you overestimate yourself!” You Yun was furious and directly slapped him flying.","However, a tall and strong figure that looked like a divine mountain blocked his way and spat fiercely.","“Old bastard, Grandpa’s still here!”","You Yun almost went crazy. Facing Feng Shan, he directly released endless Death Qi.","Feng Shan and Shu Yang could only stop him for a few dozen breaths, but it was also time for Jian Wushuang to fight.","Jian Wushuang had almost dug up the entire earth’s core. Under the cold and dry core, a red light suddenly flashed and lit up the entire abyssal Dao Field.","You Yun’s face was ashen as he instantly rushed towards the red light.","However, it was too late. Jian Wushuang reached into the red light and took out something.","“No, don’t!”","He was extremely terrified, but he did not dare to take another step forward.","When the red glow completely dissipated, a tattered ancient book fell into Jian Wushuang’s hand.","‘Reversal Death Scripture’.","There were only these three strange words on the entire ancient book. Other than that, there was nothing else.","“Return it to me and I will let you leave!” You Yun shouted in horror.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and flipped to the first page of the ancient book.","Red light flowed, and a picture of an ugly ghost engraved on a page entered his eyes.","“You Yun? Ghosts? Could he be the ghost on the first page?” He thought.","However, You Yun could not wait any longer. He pounced on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated and directly tore off the first page of the Reversal Death Scripture.","“You deserve to die!” You Yun was in complete despair. His entire body was instantly shattered without leaving any traces.","At the same time, the endless deathly aura began to dissipate, and the entire Dao Field began to collapse.","You Yun’s sudden death on the spot was simply inconceivable to the extreme.","Everything happened so fast that Jian Wushuang could not believe it.","He had merely torn off the first page of the Reversal Death Scripture and a Grand Yan Immortal had died just like that?","Jian Wushuang quickly came back to his senses. He looked at the page he had torn off and realized that it had become a yellow piece of paper.","Everything had reversed too quickly. You Yun died on the spot, and the Death Qi supporting the Dao Field had all dissipated. He could no longer stay in the abyss for long.","Jian Wushuang did not have time to think about what had happened. He stuffed the ancient book into his pocket and urged Feng Shan to leave.","“My Lord, what should we do with this fellow?” Feng Shan wiped the blood off his face and pointed at Shu Yang, who was lying on the ground.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Saving this guy was equivalent to saving an enemy.","However, he did not hesitate. He released his Yan power to wrap it up and flew out of the earth abyss.","...","The endless death aura had already dissipated, and the originally chaotic sky had returned to its original color.","However, the ground was still dry and withered. It would probably take a long time for it to recover.","As a Grand Yan Immortal’s Dao Field, this Heavenly Region was filled with bones. Countless peak cultivators and Yan Immortals had fallen here.","Jian Wushuang had intended to destroy this Heavenly Region, but he decided not to do so.","You Yun had completely fallen, and there was no possibility of recovery.","The energy contained in the ‘Reversal Death Scripture’ was probably beyond imagination.","Jian Wushuang did not plan to study it immediately. He had more important things to do.","Standing in the sky, Shu Yang had almost recovered.","Facing Jian Wushuang, he cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for saving my life. Shu Yang will never forget it.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, “How’s your recovery?”","Shu Yang said, “Not bad. I can protect myself now.”","“Then can you return to your own Heavenly Region?”","Shu Yang did not reply. After a while, he said, “Shu Yang has been defeated. He no longer has the face to attack the Six Heavens Realm. I shall return to my Heavenly Region immediately and never step into the Six Heavens again.”","“But before that, I have to return to the Six Heavens Realm with you and recall my Yan Immortal subordinates, to not participate in this battle.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him, puzzled.","Shu Yang smiled bitterly. “The reason why I did this was to recover some of my losses. I now understand one thing. With you around, the Six Heavens Realm will probably be hard to destroy.”","Hearing this, he nodded. “Sure. After you follow me to the battlefield, recall your subordinates and leave immediately. I won’t stop you.”","Shu Yang nodded. Then, as if he had made a decision, he asked tentatively, “Can you tell me your name?”","After blurting out this sentence, Shu Yang quickly regretted it. After all, their relationship was originally enemies. Asking for their names like this was simply a sign of ulterior motives.","However, Jian Wushuang did not care. “You can call me Wushuang. That’s my name.”","“Wushuang.” Shu Yang repeated, then cupped his hands solemnly. “Brother Wu, I’ll remember it. If we meet again in the future, I’ll definitely invite you to drink to your heart’s content.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand again, “There’s no need to drink to my heart’s content. I just hope that the next time we meet, it won’t be on the battlefield.”","Feng Shan grinned. “Even if we meet on the battlefield, you won’t be able to do anything. When the time comes, I’ll definitely beat you to a pulp!”","Shu Yang smiled bitterly. No one knew where they would meet next. Perhaps it would really be on the battlefield.","Being unable to control oneself was the true reflection of being a Great Heavenly Official.","It had been quite some time since Jian Wushuang was dragged into this Heavenly Region by You Yun.","The most urgent thing now was to return to the Six Heavens Realm battlefield and turn the tide."]},{"number":4911,"title":"Chapter 4911 Pure Suffering","paragraphs":["4911 Pure Suffering","The entire battleground was in complete chaos. The flames of war had spread to all the domains outside the Six Heavens Realm.","Nearly 100 Heavenly Regions had been destroyed in this battle.","The boundless void was shattered, and the Yan power mixed with the violent gales almost turned this place into a purgatory.","At this moment, the last two Immortal Array Formations had been completely opened up, close to 800 Yan Immortals had attacked for six days!","Even the void could not withstand the impact of so many Yan Immortals and was shattered.","They were all attacking the same place in an extremely crazy manner.","However, what could be seen was that these 800-plus Yan Immortals, as well as countless top cultivators, were all gathered in front of the Six Heavens Realm’s entrance. It was difficult for them to advance any further, as if they had fallen into a fierce battle.","There were constant Yan Immortals and large batches of top cultivators dying, their Immortal bones were scattered in the void and then shattered.","In this great battle, there was one figure that was the most dazzling. He had ten wings on his back, and each wing was of a different color, releasing a terrifying power.","Every time he attacked, he would crush the Yan Immortals who dared to come forward into dust. The entire Six Heavens Realm was protected by him alone.","Beside him, there were less than 20 Yan Immortals left.","20 against 800, this was unimaginable.","Prince Qian was also forced to join this battle, the 100 Yan Immortals he brought were all dead.","He was trapped in this battle and had no way to escape.","At this moment, he almost wanted to slap himself a few times. He thought he was smart enough to make this decision, but he did not know that he was walking towards a dead end.","If not for Di Qing’s protection as the last line of defense, they would have died hundreds of times already.","Among the remaining twenty or so Yan Immortals, Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, Wei Liujia, and the others were all spent. If they continued to fight like this, there would only be one outcome.","They were all destroyed.","Over 800 Yan Immortals, this was too terrifying.","One had to know that even the most ordinary Yan Immortal had the ability to destroy a Heavenly Region. They were all above the Heavenly Dao and could even form the Heavenly Dao.","Now that they were all gathered here, no one could stop them.","Di Qing’s life was damaged, he was barely able to withstand the attacks of 800 Yan Immortals by himself.","However, he still persevered until that figure appeared.","“Let’s retreat. We can’t keep the Six Heavens Realm anymore.” Prince Qian looked at Di Qing and said in a trembling voice.","Di Qing glared at him coldly before continuing to unleash his unparalleled strength.","Swallowing his throat, Prince Qian did not dare to speak anymore. He could feel the killing intent in Di Qing’s eyes, and he did not care about his identity as the Prince at all.","Thinking of this, he gritted his teeth and once again fought with all his might.","...","With Jian Wushuang’s disappearance, the entire battlefield entered the most chaotic state.","The Young Emperor stood in the void in a daze.","He was already surrounded by close to 100 Yan Immortals, it was hard for him to escape.","However, none of the Yan Immortals surrounding him dared to step forward, their eyes filled with hesitation.","Every single Yan Immortal who came to the Six Heavens Realm knew who this handsome and sinister young man in luxurious clothes was.","Because of this, no one dared to step forward.","After all, he was the Young Emperor under Zhen Wuyang.","He held a flexible sword in his hand, his gaze slowly sweeping across all the Yan Immortals in front of him, as if he wanted to remember them all.","At this moment, the void in front of him rippled and a black robe appeared.","As soon as the black robe appeared, a powerful aura that could not be detected spread out.","That was the aura of a Grand Yan Immortal.","Then, he slowly walked forward and reached out to grab the Young Emperor’s neck, lifting him up.","“Prince Yan.”","A playful voice sounded from under the black robe. Then, the hood was slowly pulled down, revealing an extremely old and skinny face.","This extremely old Grand Yan Immortal had a clean face without a beard and his eyes were cloudy. It was as if he had lived for countless years and his body had a strange aura that was decaying with time.","The Young Emperor looked at him coldly without any expression.","Then, the Grand Yan Immortal slowly said, “Before you die, do you have anything else to say?”","“Do you think you are worthy of killing me? Do you dare to kill me?” The Young Emperor smiled sinisterly, his eyes filled with madness.","“Why wouldn’t I dare?” He smiled as well, and his empty right hand suddenly released his Yan power, which directly bombarded the Young Emperor’s Immortal body.","His Immortal body shattered, and divine blood gushed out. A hideous wound was directly blasted open in his abdomen.","“Delightful! Old dog, continue attacking. I’ll see if you have the guts to attack again today.” There was no pain on the Young Emperor’s face. Instead, he smiled sinisterly. “If you don’t kill me today, I’ll make sure you have no way to live and no way to die in the future!”","The old Grand Yan Immortal turned his turbid eyes to look at him, “You can’t die now. When everything is settled, I will personally come and take your life.”","After saying this, he directly reached out and threw him into the void. Then, his figure disappeared.","The battle continued, more than 800 Yan Immortals and countless top cultivators had already devoured the remaining forces of the Six Heavens Realm.","Even Di Qing was unable to turn the tide.","There was nothing they could do.","However, Di Qing gritted his teeth. His Yan power was about to run out and when he faced the encirclement of over 800 Yan Immortals, he might lose another life.","“Wushuang, where did you go?” His voice quickly entered the ears of Chen Qing and the others.","Chen Qing, who had just returned from Jian Wushuang’s side, said, “Brother Jian went to destroy the Immortal Array Formation. However, it seems that he has encountered some unforeseen circumstances.”","“Impossible. Brother Jian will definitely be fine. He will be back soon.” Chun Qiu was covered in blood, but his tone was firm.","“I will wait for Big Brother Jian to return.” Cui Jing gritted his teeth. He had just entered the Yan Immortal stage not long ago and his foundation was the weakest, but he was still persevering.","Di Qing did not say anything else. He believed that Jian Wushuang would return soon. He had been waiting for Jian Wushuang.","He flapped the ten wings on his back and layers of golden light descended. Anyone who got close would be heavily injured, even if it was a Yan Immortal, but now, it was gradually weakening.","Just as Di Qing was about to summon the image form, a strong premonition suddenly rose from the depths of his heart.","Being able to walk out from the era when Zhen Wuyang proclaimed himself Emperor, his divine sense was already extremely powerful. He could sense danger coming from any direction.","In the next moment, Di Qing did not hesitate. He released all of his Yan power and the ten wings on his back closed at the same time to protect his Immortal body."]},{"number":4912,"title":"Chapter 4912 Xu Jin’s Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style","paragraphs":["4912 Xu Jin’s Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style","The void shook violently.","All the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators felt the void suddenly become sticky.","It was as if time had stopped for a moment.","Then, a black light that could tear the void flew across the entire battleground at an unimaginable speed and shot toward the beautiful figure.","It was as if the Heavenly Dao had collapsed and the great sun had withered.","A crisp cry resounded in the void battleground.","Di Qing’s precious image form shattered, and countless golden lights retreated from his Immortal body. His magnificent ten-sided wings also withered and shattered.","All the Yan Immortals could clearly see that there was a huge wound on Di Qing’s heart.","Pure golden blood flowed out, dyeing the shattered void with color.","Prince Qian, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Wei Liujia, Zhao Ting, and the others all had ashen expressions. Even the few remaining Yan Immortals and the less than 1,000 peak cultivators were in despair.","Every Yan Immortal and even peak cultivator knew that the reason why they could persist until now was because of Di Qing’s existence.","Now that Di Qing was severely injured, everything was finally coming to an end.","Cough cough...","Coughing out a mouthful of golden blood, Di Qing’s aura became weak and his eyes began to tire. He could no longer hold on and fell into the void.","Chun Qiu was the first to react. He instantly arrived in front of Di Qing and held him up. He took out a large number of Emperor-grade pills from his chest and stuffed them into Di Qing’s mouth.","“Don’t resist. Eat them all,” Chun Qiu said in a trembling voice.","As soon as the Di tier pill entered his mouth, it turned into rays of light that drilled into his body and began to rapidly repair the heavily injured areas.","Di Qing, who had almost died, was able to extend his life and his aura stabilized. However, he was still in a state of uncertainty, as if he could die at any moment.","The broken Void Battleground fell silent. The 800-plus Yan Immortals were like a collapsing mountain, silently walking toward them.","The indescribable aura almost made the Six Heavens Realm on the verge of collapse.","Immediately after, an old black-robed figure appeared in front of the huge Yan Immortal army.","He slowly walked forward, his turbid eyes filled with satisfaction.","“I didn’t expect that there would be a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal in this small void battleground.”","“What I didn’t expect was that I killed a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal by myself.”","As he said this, his turbid eyes were filled with arrogance.","This was indeed an honor. He was merely a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, yet he was able to kill a rank Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. If this matter spread, it would be his most glorious battle!","Chen Qing slowly took a step forward and looked at him with a gloomy expression. “Shameless person, actually doing something like a sneak attack! Although you are a Grand Yan Immortal, you are not even comparable to a beast!”","When the old Grand Yan Immortal heard this, he flicked his finger.","In an instant, Chen Qing’s expression changed. His right arm, which was holding the sword, was directly crushed into powder.","“You, a puny little Yan Immortal, dare to challenge me? No respect!” He snorted coldly.","Cui Jing stood up at this time and looked at him proudly. His words were full of disdain. “I’m not going to be nice. An old thing like you, all you can do is a sneak attack. If we fight in the open, you’re not worthy at all!”","The extremely old Grand Yan Immortal had not been angered in years. This time, he was completely enraged!","He did not expect that these ant-like fellows would actually dare to talk back to him. How could he not be ashamed and angry?","“You’re courting death!” The old Grand Yan Immortal flicked his finger and Cui Jing was heavily injured. Divine blood gushed out of his seven orifices.","“Today, none of you will live!”","After he finished speaking, he pointed his finger, and Chun Qiu, Zhao Ting, Wei Liujia, and the others were all heavily injured.","The remaining Yan Immortals in the Six Heavens Realm could not get up at this moment.","The suppression of a Grand Evolution Immortal on a Yan Immortal was too terrifying. He only moved his finger and the Yan Immortal was heavily injured.","No more Yan Immortal could stand up, the Six Heavens Realm gates opened.","The old Grand Yan Immortal’s eyes were filled with contempt as he looked ahead.","He only needed to destroy the Six Heavens Realms to complete the mission.","Just as he was about to destroy Six Heavens, something unexpected happened.","Facing the overwhelming army of Yan Immortals, a skinny top cultivator walked out. He drew the true sword hanging from his waist and looked ahead solemnly.","Seeing this scene, all the Yan Immortals felt that it was absurd, even the old Grand Yan Immortal was extremely surprised.","This cultivator who had just entered the Entry Yan stage actually dared to step up to face a thousand Yan Immortals?","One had to know, any random Yan Immortal could crush him as easily as crushing an ant.","However, he still did not run and stood up resolutely.","He held the sword hilt with both hands and pointed the sharp blade forward.","This ordinary-looking, thin top cultivator was Xu Jin.","Looking at this ridiculous scene, the old Grand Yan Immortal seemed to be interested. He waved his hand and three peak cultivators who were also in the Entry Yan stage flew out and stood in front of Xu Jin.","Xu Jin took a deep breath and stepped forward with his sword.","One top cultivator against three top cultivators, this was almost a result without suspense.","However, Xu Jin stood up alone. He had nowhere to retreat, and he knew what would happen to him.","In the next moment, the three top cultivators moved at the same time. Several streaks of Yan power burst out from their hands and shot forward.","Pointing his long sword forward, Xu Jin seemed to have entered some kind of ethereal state. Even his breathing had disappeared.","All the Yan Immortals looked at this farce-like scene with mocking expressions.","However, the expected result did not appear.","The streak of Yan power, which combined the power of three top cultivators, shattered inch by inch when it hit its target.","Some attentive Yan Immortals noticed that the violent energy did not break on its own, but was shattered by the dense Sword Intent.","That swordsman was not simple!","The three top cultivators also noticed this change, but none of them took it to heart. They all charged at Xu Jin.","The whole sword style of Flowing Cloud Grass Sword was made up of nine moves, from simple to complex. So far, only Jian Wushuang had mastered it.","As for Xu Jin, who was slow in talent and had poor control over his Yan power, he had only cultivated to the third move.","How powerful could the third move of Flowing Cloud Grass Sword be?","At this moment, Xu Jin had long forgotten all the dangers. His eyes were only on the sword in his hand. At the same time, his divine sense was deducing the Sword Dao over and over again.","Flowing Cloud Grass Sword, first move.","Star Bind.","This was the most basic sword move that laid the foundation for the entire Sword Intent of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword, starting from simple to complex.","The True Sword extended forward, and the simplest horizontal slash was the intent of Star Bind!","The void fluctuated, and the Sword Intent shone brightly."]},{"number":4913,"title":"Chapter 4913 The Arrival of the Heavenly Official","paragraphs":["4913 The Arrival of the Heavenly Official","The three top cultivators who flew over felt that something was wrong.","They hurriedly retreated, but they were still half a step too late.","Swish...","The sound of cloth being torn apart resounded, and a long and narrow hole was opened in the void.","The three top cultivators who retreated all looked at him solemnly.","At this moment, there was a scarlet line of blood on the same spot on their cheeks, and divine blood was dripping from the wound.","An ordinary horizontal slash had injured the three top cultivators.","They all felt the palpitating Sword Intent, but they were still unable to dodge it. If they had not stopped in time, the consequences would not have been just this.","“Motherf*cker, you’re courting death!” One of the youngest top cultivators was furious. He wiped the divine blood on his face and rushed forward.","Xu Jin raised his eyebrows. Facing this powerful top cultivator, he had no fear.","Flowing Cloud Grass Sword, second move.","Moon Link.","The True Sword slashed straight down, taking advantage of the remaining power of the previous move, Star Bind, to erupt with the coldest sword attack.","The cultivator smiled evilly as if he was prepared for this. He shook his arms and created a barrier around his body to counter the attack.","In the next moment, the two collided. The thin Xu Jin was directly sent flying a thousand feet away. Even the True Sword in his hand almost fell off.","The top cultivator stood rooted to the ground and laughed loudly.","“Cough cough...” Xu Jin slowly straightened his body, wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth, and looked at him calmly.","A shocking scene appeared. The top cultivator who was originally laughing loudly suddenly shut his mouth. His expression was solemn as he looked at his chest in disbelief.","His heart was pierced through by a sword, and his Life Source turned into mottled starlight that quickly seeped out.","“No, that’s impossible! How can my Life Souorce be damaged?” He was extremely terrified and then died.","All of this happened in the blink of an eye. In just one exchange, he had killed a top cultivator of the same realm. No top cultivator dared to underestimate such combat strength.","The remaining two top cultivators had extremely grave expressions. Clearly, the death of their companion had given them great pressure.","The two of them looked at each other and then moved at the same time. They directly flew towards Xu Jin and exploded with their strongest attacks.","The void trembled as two boundless energies arrived.","Xu Jin took another deep breath. He had relied on the second move of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword to kill a top cultivator of the same realm. He was not familiar with the third move, so he was afraid that he would not be able to unleash it to its fullest.","Even though he was thinking this, he still released the third move.","Water Travel.","The third move, Water Travel, was actually a move that combined the two Sword Intents and used them.","Although it seemed simple, it contained a myriad of hidden meanings. If one was not completely familiar with the first two Sword Intents, one would not be able to unleash them at all.","As soon as the Water Travel Sword Intent was released, the entire void seemed to turn into a spring.","The two peak cultivators who had been going all out felt like they were drowning when they stepped in. They were suddenly bound and could not even release their Yan power!","It was in this short moment that Xu Jin’s thin figure arrived. He held a True Sword in his hand, as if he was the Heavenly Dao that was in charge of punishment, and he began to harvest.","The void was silent. At this moment, the eyes of all the peak cultivators and even the Yan Immortals who saw this scene lit up.","Even the old Grand Yan Immortal with cloudy eyes looked at Xu Jin.","It was because this sword strike was simple and clear, but it was also extremely stunning, making everyone who saw it want to learn.","The two top cultivators who had been bound by the Water Travel sword strike were no longer alive. They fell into the abyss like stone statues.","Xu Jin withdrew his sword that was soaked in divine blood. He panted heavily. It was obvious that after completely releasing these three Sword Intents, he no longer had the strength to fight.","However, even so, his expression was still calm, as if he did not care about anything.","He was already very satisfied with killing three top cultivators of the same realm with three sword strikes. At the same time, he recalled the figure with fluttering clothes in his divine sense.","He was afraid that from now on, he would never be able to comprehend the subtlety of the second half of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","Even the wind in the void quieted down, and it was completely silent.","Immediately after, the voice of the old Grand Yan Immortal sounded, “Junior, tell me the Sword Dao you cultivate and I will let you live. I will also let you cultivate under me. How about it?”","The moment these words were said, all the Yan Immortals were in an uproar, to be able to gain the favor of a rank Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, his future cultivation path would definitely be extremely bright.","This guy was only a top cultivator, if he agreed, breaking through to the Yan Immortal realm was just around the corner. In an instant, many Yan Immortals were envious.","Xu Jin laughed. He seemed to be extremely happy, and his clear voice resounded in the void.","However, in the next moment, he returned to normal, and his clear eyes were filled with disdain.","“You think you’re worthy?”","All the Yan Immortals were stunned, they could not believe that a small top cultivator would give up such a generous offer and even insult the Grand Yan Immortal?!","Just when all the Yan Immortals thought that the old Grand Yan Immortal would be furious, they did not expect him to be expressionless, as though he was not scolding them.","“Since you don’t want to tell me the Sword Dao you cultivate, I won’t force you. Tell me the name of the creator of the Sword Dao, and I’ll let you live. How about it?”","The elderly Grand Yan Immortal slowly spoke with a gentle tone.","Xu Jin smiled coldly and glanced at him from the corner of his eyes. Then, he sheathed his sword.","“If my master’s name reaches your ears, it will dirty my master’s name. No matter how stupid a disciple is, he would never do such a thing.”","He was ready to die.","Before the elderly Grand Yan Immortal could get angry, a voice that seemed to descend from the nine heavens sounded.","“Since you want to know my name so much, why don’t I tell you myself?”","All the Yan Immortals were terrified, they all looked behind them as if they were facing a great enemy.","A black-robed ranger slowly walked over from the silent shattered void.","His entire body was covered in majestic divine patterns, exuding an indescribable aura that even Yan Immortals could not look straight at.","Two figures followed closely behind him.","One of them was a bald giant that was as sturdy as a divine mountain. He was rubbing his fists and rubbing his palms, as if he was waiting for an order before he would go all out.","The other figure held a silver spear in his hand. His arrogant aura was obvious, and he was filled with an invincible aura.","All the Yan Immortals held their breaths as they watched this scene.","“It’s, it’s Heavenly Official Jian!”","In the Six Heavens Realm, the few remaining Yan Immortals shouted at the same time, their eyes red.","“Heavenly Official Jian! Heavenly Official Jian!”","At this moment, all the remaining top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm spontaneously shouted."]},{"number":4914,"title":"Chapter 4914 Reappearance of the Lake-Style Sword Intent","paragraphs":["4914 Reappearance of the Lake-Style Sword Intent","That was a reaction that would only appear when a trace of life appeared in a desperate situation.","Chun Qiu clenched his fists tightly, unable to suppress the excitement in his heart.","“Big Brother Jian, Big Brother Jian is back!” Cui Jing waved his arms and shouted excitedly.","Wei Liujia let out a long breath. He felt that the hideous wounds on his body no longer hurt.","Prince Qian, who had been waiting for an opportunity to escape, felt relieved when he saw this.","However, he was still prepared to escape, because he didn’t think that a mere Yan Immortal would be able to turn this situation around.","The disdain and coldness in the eyes of the young man holding the True Sword in front of the Six Heavens Realm disappeared and were replaced by respect and anticipation.","Upon seeing this scene, the old Grand Yan Immortal who was originally somewhat bewildered immediately snorted.","Such a puny little Yan Immortal was just someone that could be easily crushed.","Now that he had killed the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal protecting the Six Heavens, he was confident that no other Grand Yan Immortal on the battlefield could resist him!","Thinking of this, he lazily extended a finger and ordered, “Crush them!”","However, this time, a considerable portion of the Yan Immortals did not move, they all looked at each other.","This was because they noticed that their Great Heavenly Official was actually standing behind that mysterious figure.","“Why haven’t you attacked yet?” The elderly Grand Yan Immortal roared angrily. His voice seemed to want to tear the void apart again.","But next, among the 800 plus Yan Immortals, 300 of them looked ahead and nodded solemnly.","Behind Jian Wushuang, Shu Yang, who was wearing Flowing Cloud Silver Armor and holding a silver spear, took a step forward and said in a serious voice, “Anyone who listens to me, Shu Yang, will leave the battlefield immediately!”","His voice shook the void and caused ripples.","When the 300-plus Yan Immortals heard this order, they all rushed toward Shu Yang without any hesitation.","Immediately, the mighty army of Yan Immortals was left with only 400 or so, nearly half of the numbers before.","“Shu Yang! How dare you!” The old Grand Yan Immortal was extremely furious. In his eyes, Shu Yang was still just an ant.","Since he was an ant, he had to listen to him on the battlefield.","However, at this critical juncture, Shu Yang actually retreated at the last minute. How could he not be furious?","Shu Yang looked at him calmly and said in a clear voice, “I have an urgent order. I have no choice but to leave. We will not accompany you in this battle.”","When the old Grand Yan Immortal heard this, he was furious beyond words. “I’ll see if you dare to leave!”","After he finished speaking, he waved his arms. Immediately, a chain-like light shot out from his palms and went straight for those Yan Immortals.","In the next moment, something unexpected happened. Jian Wushuang’s figure quietly blocked behind the retreating Yan Immortals and then he pointed his finger.","In an instant, millions of rays of light burst out and collided with each other.","The two collided, and the shattered void was torn apart again, creating a thousand-foot-deep abyss.","The extremely beautiful light illuminated the entire void, and even the nearby Yan Immortals retreated tens of thousands of feet!","The aged Grand Yan Immortal’s turbid eyes widened to the maximum at this moment.","He could not believe that a mere Yan Immortal could block his furious attack.","After the light faded, Jian Wushuang, whose clothes were still intact, looked at him calmly and then turned to Shu Yang.","Shu Yang took a deep breath and cupped his hands solemnly. “Brother Wu, take care!”","After he finished speaking, he brought the 300-plus Nan Immortals and headed straight for the Immortal formation, disappearing very quickly.","At this point, there were only 400-plus Yan Immortals and a rank three Grand Yan Immortal left in the Void Battleground.","On the battlefield, a large space was suddenly cleared. The remaining Yan Immortals and top cultivators of the Six Heavens Realm heaved a sigh of relief.","Prince Qian calmed down and looked at Jian Wushuang in confusion.","He did not quite understand. With the appearance of that guy, this war seemed to be reversed?","No, impossible, a mere Yan Immortal wanted to turn the tables? It was simply nonsense.","Prince Qian shook his head in denial. Then, he seemed to remember something. His eyes widened in shock.","Then, he hurriedly went to Chen Qing, who was the closest to him, and asked nervously, “Is that Heavenly Official Jian of yours the one who killed Chang Duoling alone?”","Chen Qing glanced at him and unconsciously tugged at the jade belt around his waist. He said arrogantly, “That’s right. Chang Duoling is nothing. Watch how Heavenly Official Jian will turn the tide!”","Prince Qian slowly let out a breath of turbid air. He was also beginning to look forward to what kind of monster the Heavenly Official Jian was. This was the man who was able to fight against the Grand Yan Immortal with the power of the Yan Immortal.","The void returned to silence as all the Yan Immortals stared at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked past them and fixed his eyes on the old Grand Yan Immortal.","The familiar scene seemed to be happening again.","The battle with Chang Duoling was also the same. The only change was that this old Grand Yan Immortal seemed to have been a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal for a long time.","The old man seemed to be even more unfathomable than Chang Duoling.","The battle with him was inevitable and Jian Wushuang felt that it was a tricky situation.","“Another guy who wants to die. Forget it, I’ll completely destroy the Six Heavens Realm today to prevent future trouble.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal said in a deep voice. At the same time, a scepter condensed in his palm and he slammed the void. “All Yan Immortals, listen up! Destroy the Six Heavens with all your might, don’t leave a single Yan Immortal alive!”","The Yan Immortal army seemed to be impatient, after receiving the order, they rushed towards the Six Heavens Realm.","Just then, Jian Wushuang’s cold voice rang out, “If you don’t want to die, go back the way you came.”","After he finished speaking, several Sword Intents shot out from his hand and flew forward.","A few of the fastest Yan Immortals had their Immortal Sources shattered, turning into dust.","However, this was not enough to stop the army. Nearly 400 of them descended from the sky like dark clouds.","Looking back at Di Qing and the others who were heavily injured and could no longer fight, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and then took a step forward resolutely.","He was facing the army of Yan Immortals alone. Every single Yan Immortal in the Six Heavens Realm, every single peak cultivator, all clenched their fists.","With his own strength, could he really withstand this attack? It was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse onto him.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang, who was all alone, suddenly had divine patterns all over his body. His entire body seemed to be made of billion Sword Intents, which was extremely dazzling and magnificent.","The entire void began to tremble violently.","The Yan Immortal who participated in that battle, when they saw this scene, were all shocked and excited to the extreme."]},{"number":4915,"title":"Chapter 4915 400 Immortals With One Sword Strike","paragraphs":["4915 400 Immortals With One Sword Strike","It was an incomprehensible strike, an unstoppable strike.","It was a sword strike that could destroy the Heavenly Dao and no Immortal could resist.","The power that was emitted from that sword strike even caused all the Yan Immortals who participated in that battle to have a misconception.","Even an Emperor would find it difficult to escape unscathed from that sword strike.","That sword strike was so shocking that it made the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Chang Duoling, despair and die.","It had even become the nightmare in the depths of the hearts of those who had escaped the battlefield.","The sword strike that had surpassed the knowledge of every Yan Immortal and even Grand Yan Immortal... It was about to arrive once again!","Wushuang Sword Dao.","Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, third move.","Lake.","This was the most magnificent sword move and its birth was far beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","There wasn’t even a single framework that could completely restrain it. The entire Wushuang Sword Dao had reached an insurmountable height because of this Sword Intent.","...","A heavenly gate that illuminated the void for billions of miles slowly appeared.","This could no longer be described as magnificent. Even the power of the Grand Yan Immortal was like a firefly competing with the bright moon under the Heavenly Gate.","This magnificent gate was made of endless Sword Intent, and it was extremely pure.","In the next moment, the Heavenly Gate that seemed to have been sealed for countless years slowly opened. A quiet lake that seemed to have been sealed for countless years flowed out.","Jian Wushuang held the Invisible Sword and stepped into the gate!","The lake flowed in the void like a clear spring. The sun, moon, and stars were born in it.","All the Yan Immortals who saw this scene were furious. No matter how crazy they were, no matter how desperate they were, they could still feel that extremely terrifying aura.","Even the elderly Grand Yan Immortal who was at the outermost perimeter had his eyes wide open at this moment. His murky eyes were filled with terror and disbelief.","Even he did not know how to describe this sword move.","The radiance from the Heavenly Gate was extremely resplendent. When it bloomed like a great sun, a true shadow walked out.","It was a True Shadow forged from pure Sword Intent. The radiance of his Sword Intent was so brilliant that it eclipsed everything else.","He led the sword with his hand and arrived from the Heavenly Gate!","Even the Heavenly Dao was prostrating at his feet!","This sword had even surpassed the knowledge of the old Grand Yan Immortal.","This was supposed to be just a sword move of the legends, but it was actually materialized?!","At this moment when the light was extremely bright, the old Grand Yan Immortal finally thought of a phrase to describe it.","This strike was like the rage of an Emperor!","It was so huge that it seemed to be made of the Heavenly River. It cut through the void and destroyed the Heavenly Dao.","All tangible objects were completely turned into dust at this moment.","The void had entered the deepest level of collapse. Even the uncontrollable void gales were torn apart.","With the giant sword as the center, the void was torn apart and formed a violent vortex, crazily swallowing everything. Even the Yan power could not escape.","Under this sword move, even the other Heavenly Regions billions of miles away were affected. They all began to shatter and be destroyed.","The 400-plus Yan Immortals that walked out of the Immortal Array Formation were all killed by this sword strike. Not a single one of them could escape.","A single sword strike had killed 400 Immortals!","The old Grand Yan Immortal had long been scared out of his wits. He had even fled with all his might the moment those 400 Yan Immortals were annihilated.","But could he escape?","The void battleground had gone out of control. All the Heavenly Regions outside the Six Heavens Realm had been destroyed and turned into dust.","Originally, the Six Heaven Realm could not avoid being killed by this sword strike. However, Di Qing woke up and used his damaged True Life to block Jian Wushuang’s sword strike.","Di Qing, who was a Nine Revolutions Grand Immortal and had walked out of the era when Zhen Wuyang proclaimed himself Emperor, felt a throb in the depths of his heart when he saw Jian Wushuang and his sword strike.","This sword strike had even threatened him.","Di Qing endured the dizziness in his head and looked at the True Shadow that made the Heavenly Dao prostrate under his feet. His eyes became clearer and brighter.","This sword strike lasted for quite a long time.","When the Wushuang Sword Intent turned into a lake and returned to the Heavenly Gate, the True Shadow standing in the void slowly opened its eyes.","Everything turned to dust as far as the eye could see, including the Heavenly Dao.","Even the void had turned into the most primitive state of chaos, filled with indescribable silence.","At this moment, there were only a dozen Yan Immortals and a thousand peak cultivators left in the void battleground.","Without exception, their eyes were lifeless as they looked ahead in a daze, as if they had not recovered from the scene just now.","The 400-plus Yan Immortal army had been completely crushed into dust, not even a single Immortal Source or Immortal bone was left behind, as if they had never appeared.","Opposite Jian Wushuang, there was only a lonely figure.","At this moment, there was only fear in his turbid eyes, as if he had just survived a disaster.","“A-all dead?”","The elderly Grand Yan Immortal muttered. Following that, a wisp of divine blood gushed out from the corner of his mouth.","He tried his best to escape, but in the end, he was still a step too late and suffered the most serious injuries.","It had been many years since he had tasted the feeling of being severely injured. Now, he had truly tasted it again.","He even believed that if he had not avoided in time, his Immortal body would have shattered and his Immortal source would have been destroyed.","The power of the sword strike terrified him.","At the same time, the old Grand Yan Immortal was puzzled.","How could a puny little Yan Immortal release such a sword move that was like the rage of an Emperor?","Slowly moving forward, Jian Wushuang, who was standing with his hands behind his back, finally arrived in front of him.","The old Grand Yan Immortal raised his head and looked at him with uncertainty in his eyes. Finally, he said, “I heard earlier that there was a Yan Immortal in the Six Heavens who killed the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Chang Duoling, by himself. Was it you?”","“It’s me.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He did not plan to hide it because he would not let him leave alive.","“Was the Sword Intent you used to kill Chang Duoling this time?”","“That’s right.”","After the old Grand Yan Immortal obtained this answer, his expression changed a few times before he finally said desolately, “I originally thought that the rumor was nonsense. Now, it seems that Chang Duoling was indeed killed by you.”","“To be able to die under that sword strike, his death was not in vain.”","“One last question. Did you create this sword strike, or did you receive the inheritance of a certain Emperor?” he asked, his eyes solemn.","Jian Wushuang looked at him and said calmly, “I created it. I didn’t receive any inheritance.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal trembled, his murky pupils also became somewhat bright at this moment."]},{"number":4916,"title":"Chapter 4916 Fighting a Grand Yan Immortal Again","paragraphs":["4916 Fighting a Grand Yan Immortal Again","He seemed to have entered a certain state, from fear to calmness.","“If you don’t participate in these disputes and live well, I’m afraid you’ll become an existence that will stir up the entire Great Si Region or beyond.”","“But you must also know that if you are too stunning, you will definitely be killed. I can also foresee that your future will definitely be too difficult.”","“If I am lucky enough to survive today, I would like to see how far you will go in the future, and whether you will completely overturn the Great Si Region.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal looked at him and said with emotion, “You are very different.”","Jian Wushuang also looked at him and an Invisible Sword had already condensed in his palm.","No matter what, the enemies who witnessed his sword attack could not leave alive, especially the Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang had never thought that Zhen Wuyang and the entire Heavenly Court were good people, so he walked around cautiously.","If there was a Grand Yan Immortal who went up to the Heavenly Court, all the unfavorable factors would probably be pressed against him.","If Zhen Wuyang, who had defeated nearly ten Emperors and established the Heavenly Court, wanted to kill him, he could do it with a finger.","Therefore, he had to eliminate it from the source.","The old Grand Yan Immortal could not leave this place alive.","“Looks like you don’t plan to let me leave?” he asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Yes.”","“Since that’s the case, then I’ll fight one last time!” The old Grand Yan Immortal seemed to have let go and was prepared to fight.","He had already been injured by the sword strike earlier. He was already confident that he would definitely die in this battle.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to underestimate the old man either. Although he had already killed two Grand Yan Immortals, he still did not dare to underestimate them.","There was an essential difference between the Yan Immortal and the Grand Yan Immortal. If he was not careful, Jian Wushuang might be seriously injured.","Right now, this old Grand Yan Immortal was a Three Revolutions expert, he was much higher than You Yun, so he could not let his guard down.","As he took a step forward, the black robe on his body surged, and thousands of strands of energy flowed around his body like chains, filled with earth-shaking power!","This was the power of a Grand Yan Immortal, causing even the Yan Immortal to tremble.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm were watching this scene solemnly.","This battle would be deeply imprinted in the hearts of every top cultivator and every Yan Immortal. Even they did not know how far-reaching the impact of this battle was.","“All my life, I had never seen someone as graceful as you. Even that lofty existence seemed a little dejected when you appeared.”","“That sword move of yours was too domineering and terrifying. Even I couldn’t face it, but even so, I still need this battle.”","“I want to see with my own eyes what kind of surprise you will bring me with your grace.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal spoke slowly. His expression had already become excited, as if he had returned to the ancient times.","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up, and his sword-like eyebrows sank. Then, 36,000 Sword Intents suddenly burst out from his back and twisted forward!","“Good!” He shouted in a deep voice. At the same time, the chains that covered his body all rose up, like True Dragons.","36,000 Sword Intents, all of them were peak sword strikes. They were nothing to scoff at, even against Grand Yan Immortals.","A terrifying energy burst out, causing chaos in the void battleground once again!","The pitch-black chains were rapidly breaking apart.","In the end, they were destroyed at the same time.","When the brilliance of the Yan power dissipated, Jian Wushuang had already quietly arrived in front of the old Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was calm as he faced such a Grand Yan Immortal. He raised the Invisible Sword in his hand and slashed down.","The old Grand Yan Immortal blocked it in time. At the same time, an extremely pitch-black True Shadow appeared behind him and crazily devoured Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang’s Selfless True Shadow, which was emitting an azure blue intent, augmented his body.","When the pitch-black True Shadow touched the Selfless True Shadow, it immediately emitted a large amount of black smoke before retracting back into his body.","The appearance of this scene shocked the old Grand Yan Immortal even more. He had already tempered his divine thoughts to the peak, yet he was unable to corrode Jian Wushuang?","“Could it be that he is also tempering his divine thought?”","Naturally, Jian Wushuang did not know what he was thinking at the moment. He was not the one who initiated the enhancement of Selfless True Shadow.","The Selfless True Shadow seemed to have a certain level of self-awareness. When its main body was harmed by external forces, it would automatically strengthen itself, which also prevented it from being harmed by its divine thoughts.","However, even without the automatic protection of the Selfless True Shadow, the divine thought erosion released by the old Grand Yan Immortal just now would definitely not be able to erode him.","When Jian Wushuang ascended to the position of Cosmos God in the Divine Power Universe, his divine thoughts had already reached mastery. No external force could interfere with his thoughts.","Sparks flew everywhere.","It was as if he was forging a sword. The old Grand Yan Immortal was like a Sword Embryo that was constantly being tempered.","If there was a closer observer, they would be able to see the obvious changes.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. Every sword strike could easily shatter a Heavenly Region. The face of the Grand Yan Immortal, who had endured the tempering, gradually turned red. He could not even resist and could only endure it silently.","This shocking scene was completely reflected in the eyes of all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm. Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air.","The one who was the most shocked was Prince Qian. His eyes were wide open as he murmured, “What...what is this guy doing? He’s too scary.”","Even though Prince Qian was the son of an Emperor, he had never seen such a scene before.","Xu Jin, who was all alone, had his eyes on Jian Wushuang. He was trying his best to comprehend the sword moves.","At the same time, he was fantasizing about when he would be able to fight alongside Jian Wushuang.","Today’s battle had left an indelible mark in the hearts of all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals.","With his own strength, he turned the tide. That kind of back view had long conquered many silent hearts.","With the help of the Selfless True Shadow, Jian Wushuang completely crushed the severely injured Grand Yan Immortal.","Under the heavy blows again and again, wisps of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth again.","The old Grand Yan Immortal already knew that his final destination was to die under this man’s sword."]},{"number":4917,"title":"Chapter 4917 Great Battle","paragraphs":["4917 Great Battle","He even regretted not choosing the right path.","However, if he died in such a situation, he would probably become a laughingstock for all eternity.","As a Grand Yan Immortal of the Great Si Region, he could not accept this result.","“Junior, you deserve to die!” He was furious and sent Jian Wushuang flying far away at the risk of his Immortal body being injured.","The invisible sword in his hand shattered. Jian Wushuang put his right hand behind his back and looked at him calmly.","His right hand, which was behind his back, was already dripping with divine blood, dripping drop by drop into his clothes.","He had underestimated the might of a Grand Yan Immortal. If he had not dodged in time, he would have been even more severely injured.","“Junior, don’t underestimate this old man. Although this old man is injured, it doesn’t mean that I don’t have the strength to fight!”The old Grand Yan Immortal said angrily.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and raised his palm. The Chaotic Void shook and 100,000 Sword Intents appeared behind him.","Each sword intent carried an extremely terrifying power. There were a total of 100,000 swords, all of which were the strongest attacks.","Looking at the 100,000 sword intents that were like a forest of swords, the elderly Grand Yan Immortal turned solemn.","In the endless years until now, he had seen too many Yan Immortals and even Grand Yan Immortals in the Ancient Moon Era. However, the only one he had never seen was a sword cultivator.","The so-called sword cultivator was actually a very vague term. After reaching the level of the Yan Immortal, very few Yan Immortals would rely on external objects to improve themselves. However, this was not absolute. Among them, there were Yan Immortals who opened up the way of the sword and controlled The true Sword to break through the bottleneck.","The result of doing so was two completely different outcomes.","The bad result was that it would drag down one’s cultivation, and the path of cultivation would fall into chaos, making it difficult for one to improve in their lifetime.","The good result would be that he would far surpass his peers at the same level and become a Heaven’s Favorite.","However, even the extremely experienced Grand Yan Immortal had never seen such a rare prodigy.","The only prodigy he acknowledged was the supreme existence who walked out of the forsaken land and single-handedly pacified the chaotic region and finally became an Emperor.","However, even that supreme existence purely cultivated himself and did not cultivate external things.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang, who had already reached the peak of Sword Principle, gave the old Grand Yan Immortal the same shock as when he first met the Emperor.","This was the second Heaven’s Favorite he had acknowledged, and he was also an existence that was about to take his life.","In an instant, 100,000 Sword Intents swept out and stabbed toward the old Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang stood where he was and looked calmly at the center of the explosion. He did not think that it could kill a Grand Evolution Immortal.","As if to confirm his guess, the Sword Intent that was still wildly leaking out completely stopped at this moment.","Then, the void distorted, and a barrier ring appeared. It was like a black hole that directly swallowed all the Sword Intent that was still leaking out, forcefully changing the battle situation.","When the 100,000 Sword Intents completely dissipated, the elderly Grand Yan Immortal holding the black scepter slowly appeared. That black hole-like barrier ring was released from the scepter, avoiding the attack of the Sword Intents.","Even so, the Sword Intent still more or less injured him.","At this moment, the old Grand Yan Immortal was no longer passive and chose to attack first.","He held the pitch-black scepter in his hand, and his entire body shot forward like a bolt of lightning.","Jian Wushuang tried to resist but was immediately sent flying by the overwhelming force.","At the same time, hundreds of True Dragon-like chains extended from his back, crazily pouring down.","Even Jian Wushuang found it hard to resist the waves of powerful attacks.","The old Grand Yan Immortal looked like he had returned to his youth. He swung his fists that could easily tear the Heavenly Region apart and punched his Immortal body again and again.","A million punches in an instant!","In just a few dozen breaths, their fight had reached a terrifying level. The chaotic void seemed to have been squeezed to the extreme by the Yan power.","Jian Wushuang could feel that his Immortal body was beginning to shatter and there were fine cracks on his chest.","If they continued to fight like this, it was very likely that he would not be a match.","Jian Wushuang made a prompt decision and took the Grand Yan Immortal Move head-on, using it to distance himself.","Enduring the intense pain in his Immortal body, the seven stars between his eyebrows slowly circulated.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River.","In this Immortal Style, all the rules of mountains and rivers were used by Jian Wushuang.","As Jian Wushuang waved his hand, a divine mountain suddenly grew out of the void and blocked the old Grand Yan Immortal.","Another water dragon appeared, roaring and crushing down.","Seeing this, the old Grand Evolution Immortal was shocked again. He had thought that Jian Wushuang had only trained his Sword Principle to the peak. He did not expect that he had even mastered an Immortal Style!","He did not dare to imagine how far a sword cultivator who had attained the Grand Yan Immortal Stage would go.","Recovering from his shock, the old Grand Yan Immortal still launched his attack.","With a punch, the divine mountain shattered and the celestial river was cut off. He stepped on the void and rushed forward.","Behind him, many chains covered the sky and covered the earth, trying to kill Jian Wushuang.","Facing the Grand Yan Immortal’s full-strength attack, Jian Wushuang slowly exhaled a mouthful of turbid breath and then released the Wushuang Sword Dao again.","Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The torrent surged like a Heavenly River pouring down from the horizon. It carried an unimaginable force as it tore through the chaos and rushed toward the old Grand Yan Immortal.","This Sword River was completely formed by countless Sword Intents. It was the most powerful Sword Intent that established the Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent.","Standing at the top of the Sword River tide, Jian Wushuang was no longer indifferent. He had a solemn expression on his face.","This sword move of his would definitely heavily injure the old Grand Yan Immortal, he could then kill the old man.","This war had been going on for quite a long time, and they could not wait any longer.","And killing the old Grand Yan Immortal was the final declaration of the end.","At this moment, all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals in the Six Heavens Realm were extremely nervous.","Could this sword strike kill a Grand Yan Immortal?","The chaotic void was instantly swept away by a huge force. Under the impact, it split and shattered again.","The boundless light of the Yan power lit up the entire void battleground. The afterglow of the Yan power flowed in the air like a tassel."]},{"number":4918,"title":"Chapter 4918 Ambush","paragraphs":["4918 Ambush","The vast and majestic river Sword Intent swept across the void, almost swallowing the entire void.","The void was deathly silent, and only the river of swordsmanship surged.","“Victory, victory...”","A top cultivator could not help but say excitedly.","Prince Qian, who had almost escaped death, was the most excited at this moment. The hundreds of Yan Immortals under him had all died, but he was still alive. He did not even lose much of his Yan energy.","This was something he did not dare to think about before. He was even prepared to be seriously injured and captured.","But now, everything was settled.","Prince Qian shouted excitedly, “Motherf*cker, Heavenly Official Jian is unparalleled in the world!”","Like a stone that caused a thousand ripples, all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals in the Six Heavens Realm shouted.","“Heavenly Official Jian, unparalleled in the world!”","“Heavenly Official Jian, unparalleled in the world!!”","Their voices shook the void.","They had won this battle.","This was an unimaginable battle, with close to a thousand Yan Immortals and two Grand Yan Immortals joining in.","The Six Heavens Realm only had a hundred or so Yan Immortals. Facing the assault of nearly a thousand Yan Immortals, they actually managed to protect the Six Heavens Realm.","This was an unimaginable and inconceivable battle.","However, every surviving Yan Immortal and peak cultivator knew that without those two, this would not have happened.","All the voices that they shouted out were the true thoughts in their hearts.","However, Di Qing was the only one who looked at Jian Wushuang with a serious expression. He looked at the void where the celestial river flowed out.","He had a premonition that the Grand Yan Immortal would not die so easily.","Jian Wushuang did not relax. He was still staring at the center of the Sword River.","When the Sword River completely dissipated, a figure that could barely stand still appeared.","It could be seen that his Immortal Source was about to dissipate.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. The collapse of the Immortal Source was an irreversible sign of death even for a Grand Yan Immortal.","The old Grand Yan Immortal was about to die.","Although he was about to lose his balance, he still straightened his body and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“You have far exceeded my expectations. This old man is utterly convinced of his defeat.”","After saying this, he knelt in the void listlessly as if he was waiting for his death. “But I still want to live...”","Jian Wushuang walked forward slowly. He did not hate the old Grand Yan Immortal. He was calm.","The reason why he had stepped forward was to ensure that he would not release his divine thought to escape.","Just when Jian Wushuang was less than three meters away from the old Grand Yan Immortal, the old man, who had been waiting to die with his eyes closed, suddenly opened his eyes.","Then, with an unimaginable speed, he shot toward Jian Wushuang like a thunderbolt.","Everything happened so fast that Jian Wushuang could not react in time.","A black and extremely sharp scepter ruthlessly stabbed into his heart.","The old Grand Yan Immortal’s previous decline was gone, his eyes were filled with madness and pride.","“Junior, although you are very strong, you are still a little too inexperienced. Are you so sure that I don’t even have the chance to counterattack?”","Looking down at the black scepter in front of his chest, Jian Wushuang’s calm eyes showed some fluctuations.","Then, he said faintly, “Idiot, you didn’t stab in.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal was stunned and immediately looked at his hand subconsciously.","Crack...","Immediately after, the sound of crystals breaking could be heard.","The black scepter was instantly covered in cracks and shattered from the tip!","“No, impossible. How could my scepter be like this?!”","The old Grand Yan Immortal was shocked, he did not dare to imagine what had happened.","Every piece of azure blue armor leaf seemed to have a life of its own. It was rhythmically moving, and it was extremely beautiful.","“This, this is, Chang Duoling’s Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens?!” The old Grand Yan Immortal was extremely frightened. He finally understood why his scepter had not dealt any serious damage to Jian Wushuang.","There was a rumor in the entire Great Si Region that the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens Chang Duoling had a supreme treasure that could resist all external forces and could even block a full-powered attack from an Emperor.","It was rumored that the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens was only blue in color and was formed from 99,000 armor leaves. It was extremely beautiful.","Wasn’t the azure armor on Jian Wushuang Chang Duoling’s Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens?!","The old Grand Yan Immortal felt the divine blood in his body turn cold. He had never expected Jian Wushuang to wear the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens and withstand his attack.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with ridicule. He allowed the black scepter in front of his chest to shatter completely. Then, he reached out and grabbed the neck of the old Grand Yan Immortal.","“Chang Duoling was... Killed by you? Did you also steal his Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens?” There was no fighting spirit in his eyes, only despair.","“I didn’t want to take his Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens. He gave it to me at the last moment,” Jian Wushuang said.","When the old Grand Yan Immortal heard this, he seemed to have sensed something. He suddenly grinned, “That’s right, that’s right. Who wouldn’t love a prodigy like you when they’re about to die?”","“We don’t have any blood feud, so this battle doesn’t have to happen. But since it’s irreversible, I’ll make one last request,” he looked at Jian Wushuang and said. “I want to kill myself.”","“No,” Jian Wushuang refused without hesitation.","Originally, he had some compassion for him, but if Jian Wushuang had not put on the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens in advance, he would have been severely injured and even his Immortal body would have been shattered.","The old Grand Yan Immortal also knew the reason, he had no face to ask for anything else, he could only close his eyes and die.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate anymore. Thousands of Sword Intents appeared in his right palm and then hit his Immortal body.","The Sword Intent surged wildly and tore the old Grand Yan Immortal apart without any obstruction.","The Immortal Source was destroyed, and the Immortal body turned into dust and scattered in the void.","A Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal had fallen at Jian Wushuang’s hands.","At this point, this battle that involved almost all five Princes ended with the loss of over a thousand Yan Immortals.","This battle was the most intense battle since Zhen Wuyang opened up the Great Si Region.","Countless Heavenly Regions and countless living beings disappeared silently in this battle. Even the Yan Immortals died, as if they had no value."]},{"number":4919,"title":"Chapter 4919 The Prince Arrives Personally","paragraphs":["4919 The Prince Arrives Personally","Not only did the Yan Immortal die for nothing, even Grand Yan Immortals died because of it.","Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens Chang Duoling, Death Immortal You Yun, and the old Grand Yan Immortal were all killed by Jian Wushuang in this battle.","This could no longer be described as a battle between ordinary Imperial Princes. If the degree of destruction was unleashed, only the Heavenly Court, which was guarded by Zhen Wuyang, could control the situation.","When this earth-shattering battle finally came to an end, the originally silent void battleground once again erupted with earth-shattering shouts.","“Heavenly Official Jian, unparalleled in the world!”","” Heavenly Official Jian, unparalleled in the world!! ”","...","Jian Wushuang, who had his back facing the Six Skies Realm, suddenly turned pale. Then, a wisp of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth and dripped onto the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens. It was quickly absorbed.","In the end, he still underestimated the sinister and terrifying nature of that old Grand Yan Immortal.","If he had not put on the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens in advance, just the final attack would have been enough to shatter his Immortal body.","The full-strength attack of a rank three Grand Yan Immortal was still terrifying.","Fortunately, he wore the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, so he was not heavily injured.","At the same time, what shocked Jian Wushuang was that he had pierced the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens at the heart area previously. If the attack of the old Grand Yan Immortal had deviated by an inch, Jian Wushuang would not have been able to escape the fate of being destroyed.","The battlefield was ever-changing, and the outcome could be reversed at any moment.","However, there was only one outcome. Jian Wushuang stood alone in the void, as if he was suppressing the world.","Jian Wushuang was unparalleled in the world!","All the cultivators and Yan Immortals rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","“Brother Jian!”","“Brother Jian!”","“Big Brother Jian!”","At this moment, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Chen Qing, Wei Liujia, and Zhao Ting all cupped their hands and greeted him with sincere smiles.","Even Di Qing, who had always been calm and extremely arrogant, nodded at Jian Wushuang. “Wushuang, you did well.”","Looking at the faces of those who had fought a bloody battle, Jian Wushuang smiled from the bottom of his heart. Then, he cupped his hands solemnly, “Everyone, we won.”","All the top cultivators cheered. Xu Jin, who was the most inconspicuous, looked at Jian Wushuang from afar with slightly red eyes.","He did not know when he could catch up to Jian Wushuang and he did not dare to expect it. He could only watch from afar.","Perhaps one day in the future, he would be qualified to stand by his side.","If it weren’t for the chaotic and broken void, Chen Qing and Feng Shan would have lifted Jian Wushuang up and cheered.","Immediately after, the thin purple-robed man who was hugging the Young Emperor rushed over from the chaotic void. Both of them were covered in divine blood and were about to die.","When Jian Wushuang saw this scene and was about to speak, the last Immortal Array Formation that had been silent suddenly flowed with Immortal patterns.","100,000 Immortal patterns circulated, and the chaotic void was illuminated at this moment.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators had solemn expressions.","They were all clear that the circulation of the Immortal Array Formation indicated that there would be another army arriving at the battlefield!","The excitement on their faces had yet to fade, but it was replaced by bitterness.","The skinny man in purple robe came to Jian Wushuang with the Young Emperor in his arms. He looked extremely old.","“Heavenly Official Jian, retreat. We can’t afford to lose any more of our remaining forces.”","Jian Wushuang was silent. The top cultivators and the Yan Immortals behind him were also silent, waiting for him to make the final decision.","At this moment, a cold and disdainful voice sounded from the Immortal array.","“You want to retreat? Dream on!”","As this voice resounded through the void, Yan Immortals with vast and powerful energy flowing around them walked out of the Immortal array.","Even Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he saw this.","Another few hundred Yan Immortals arrived at the void battleground!","A whole hundred full of Evolved Immortals entered the battlefield, this was a crushing blow to the Six Heavens Realm and the others who had almost no strength to fight.","Di Qing was already heavily injured while Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and the other Yan Immortals were all more or less heavily injured, they no longer had the strength to fight.","As for top cultivators, to a Yan Immortal, they were practically dispensable existences.","In the entire Six Heavens Realm, Jian Wushuang was the only one who could still fight.","The 100 Yan Immortals who walked out of the Immortal Array Formation scattered the moment they appeared in the void battleground. They surrounded them all, obviously not planning to let any of them go.","When the Immortal Array Formation was finally destroyed, a valiant Yan Immortal dressed in scarlet-gold armor walked out. He was surrounded by the Heavenly Dao, and even the Heavenly Dao submitted to him.","His extremely handsome face was filled with supreme authority and was extremely terrifying.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed when he saw him.","This valiant Yan Immortal wearing scarlet-gold armor was none other than the Third Prince under Zhen Wuyang, Prince Yu.","He was the representative of arrogance. During the battle for the Immortal Peach in the Heavenly Court, he had wanted to break the restriction of the Immortal Peach by himself and monopolize the Immortal Peach. In the end, he was eliminated.","Then, he was defeated by Jian Wushuang in the former Heavenly Court of Emperor Liu Ya and was almost beaten half to death.","Now that he had appeared in the void battleground, it showed that he was on the same side as Prince Jiu.","Although Prince Yu was arrogant, he had already mastered the Immortal Style, so he could not be underestimated.","Especially now, the pressure he emitted was extremely powerful.","At this moment, even if he wanted to escape, it would be an extravagant hope.","Prince Yu, who was standing on the Heavenly Dao and clad in golden armor, looked at the remaining Yan Immortals and peak cultivators from the Six Heavens Realm with his heroic eyes. He could not help but sneer.","Especially when he saw the Young Emperor who was covered in blood and barely breathing, he could not help but laugh out loud.","However, he quickly regained his cold expression and looked at the Young Emperor before speaking in a deep voice.","“Prince Yan, we have found the murderer who killed our Fifth Brother, and you are the murderer! Now, I will capture you and hand you over to Imperial Fater.”","Jian Wushuang did not expect Prince Yu would push the blame onto the Young Emperor.","He was the one who had personally witnessed the battle to kill the emperor.","Under the Fusang Tree, Zheng Ying chopped off the head of the Fifth Prince, Prince Mo, and crushed his Immortal Source, causing him to die completely.","Jian Wushuang guessed that the extremely mysterious Zheng Ying was most likely a mysterious Yan Immortal under Prince Jiu. It was absolutely impossible that she was sent by the Young Emperor.","Therefore, when Prince Yu pushed away the accusation, Jian Wushuang immediately concluded that he was just making a wild guess.","The weak Young Emperor glanced at Prince Yu and turned around slowly. He looked at Jian Wushuang and said softly, “Brother Jian, you can leave. I want to see if they dare to kill me.”"]},{"number":4920,"title":"Chapter 4920 Fighting Again","paragraphs":["4920 Fighting Again","Currently, there were only a dozen or so Yan Immortals left and only a thousand peak cultivators. Against the Yan Immortal army that had re-entered the void battleground, they had no chance of fighting.","Even with Jian Wushuang, it would be difficult to turn the situation around.","However, it was not that they did not want to escape, but that they had no way to escape. They could only fight like trapped beasts.","Jian Wushuang quickly sorted out several thoughts of escaping in his mind, but he rejected them all in the end.","Di Qing and the others were more or less severely injured. If they left, they would be even more passive.","After thinking for a moment, Jian Wushuang’s voice transmission reached the ears of Di Qing and the others, “You guys go first. I’ll stay behind to cover your retreat. Don’t worry.”","Hearing this, they all looked a little dejected, but they knew that this was the best plan. If they continued to stay in the void battleground, it would be meaningless.","At this moment, Prince Yu, who was clad in golden armor and stepping on the Heavenly Dao, suddenly pulled out the True Sword at his waist and pointed it at the sky. “Capture Prince Yan! ”","In an instant, all the Yan Immortals scattered around the void battleground released a majestic energy pillar.","A total of 100 Yan Immortals attacked. 100 streaks of energy surrounded them from all directions and trapped them almost instantly.","Each of these energy pillars was a full-powered attack from a Yan Immortal, it was almost impossible to break them.","At this moment, even the void was illuminated.","Prince Yu’s eyes were filled with pride and hatred. Clearly, he still remembered the fight for the Immortal Peach in the Heavenly Court. Now, he could finally wash away his shame.","Facing the overwhelming attack, Jian Wushuang quietly closed his eyes.","Countless tassel-like divine patterns quietly circulated around his body. Then, the Selfless True Shadow augmented his body, causing his entire body to emit a hazy light.","In the next moment, he suddenly opened his eyes.","Lightning and Sword Intent intertwined, and the True Shadow of a huge sword condensed from pure Sword Intent appeared behind him. It stood upright in the void with an imposing manner that could not be looked at directly.","The huge sword’s True Shadow was hundreds of millions of feet tall and could not be looked at directly. It was as if even the Heavenly Dao could be destroyed by it.","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice. He raised his arms and pressed them down as if he was holding the hilt of a sword.","In an instant, the Heavenly Dao vanished, and the primal chaos void collapsed once again.","The huge sword projection tore through all obstacles and slashed down.","Under this sword strike, the encirclement of a hundred Yan Immortals was shattered!","It was as if a disaster had descended. All the Yan Immortals looked at this scene in shock and even forgot to dodge.","Under this sword, close to 20 Yan Immortals were unable to escape in time and died on the spot, a hole was torn open in the encirclement.","The void was plowed open with a crack that was hundreds of millions of miles long, and crazy void gales raged.","“Leave quickly.” Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and looked at them calmly.","All of the top cultivators gritted their teeth and rushed toward the boundless void with all their might.","Di Qing and Jian Wushuang looked at each other and nodded silently. Then, he took Chun Qiu and the others with them and flew into the void.","At this point, in the entire void battleground, the number of top cultivators and Yan Immortals had decreased by more than half.","Prince Yu was tongue-tied. He had not recovered from the scene just now.","The scene just now was too shocking. Not only Prince Yu, but even the Yan Immortal army was still in shock.","“You should leave too. I’ll be there soon,” Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor and said in an unquestionable voice.","However, he only smiled weakly. “Since you’re here, I can’t leave by myself. Prince Yu only wants my life, and it has nothing to do with you. If I stay here, at the very least, I can give you a way out.”","Jian Wushuang was silent. He understood what he meant. But before he could continue, the Young Emperor tidied his clothes and stepped forward.","His handsome and charming face was cold. “Prince Yu, I, Prince Yan, am here. You can do whatever you want to me, but you have to let them go.”","After recovering from his shock, Prince Yu’s eyes flashed with fear. He naturally recognized Jian Wushuang, the mysterious man who had defeated Prince Jiu in the Heavenly Court.","Taking a deep breath, Prince Yu waved his hand. “Capture Prince Yan!”","In an instant, dozens of Yan Immortals surrounded him from all directions.","In the next moment, something unexpected happened!","A few of the fastest-charging Yan Immortals suddenly stopped on the spot, and their immortal bodies broke into countless pieces!","Clang-","The sound of metal clashing resounded in the air.","Jian Wushuang, who was holding an Invisible Sword and had majestic divine patterns flowing around his body, walked forward slowly.","He killed several Yan Immortals with one sword swing, it was terrifying to the extreme.","Prince Yu subconsciously took a few steps back. He felt a lingering fear when he faced Jian Wushuang.","Another Yan Immortal charged at Jian Wushuang brazenly and the unparalleled Yan power crashed down.","With a horizontal slash, the sword intent swept across, instantly swallowing that Yan Immortal, cleanly and cleanly turning him into pieces.","“Let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice as he came to the Young Emperor.","He no longer hesitated. After nodding lightly, he prepared to leave.","Seeing this, Prince Yu’s eyes narrowed. “You want to leave? Stay here!”","“All Yan Immortals, listen up, trap them here at all costs, you can’t let them go!” he shouted.","At this moment, there were more than 70 Yan Immortals left in the void battleground. They looked at each other and then flew toward Jian Wushuang.","The strength of the 70-plus Yan Immortals was extremely shocking.","The void shook and Jian Wushuang was slightly shocked. He still felt great pressure when facing so many Yan Immortals.","After killing Death Immortal You Yun, he continued to fight with the old Grand Yan Immortal without stopping. It had already exhausted the energy in his Immortal body to the extreme.","In this situation, he was unable to release the Lake-style Sword Intent.","Jian Wushuang was already at the end of his rope. Facing so many Yan Immortals, all he could do was to let the Young Emperor and the thin purple-robed man escape from danger.","Thinking of this, he suddenly threw the Invisible Sword in his hand.","The dozen or so Yan Immortals who had been surrounding them saw this scene and hurriedly made way.","The Invisible Sword tore a crack in the void.","Then, Jian Wushuang waved his arm and pushed the Young Emperor and the thin purple-robed man out.","A million miles in an instant!","“We can’t let Prince Yan escape!”","Prince Yu shouted anxiously, but he soon realized that Jian Wushuang was running toward him!","An indescribable fear surged into his heart, he immediately lost his strength and hurriedly ordered all the Yan Immortals to return to protect him.","The group of Yan Immortals who were chasing after the Young Emperor had no choice but to give up. They turned back and came to Prince Yu, controlling their Yan powers to surround Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4921,"title":"Chapter 4921 Blue Feather Bell","paragraphs":["4921 Blue Feather Bell","Seeing that his safety was guaranteed, Prince Yu let out a long breath and looked at him with a sinister smile.","“How funny. Not only did you not escape, but you also walked into a trap?”","“Tell me, what benefits did Prince Yan give you to protect him?”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Apparently, he was too lazy to reply.","Prince Yu seemed to feel that he was being looked down upon, so he was a little angry. However, he quickly calmed down.","“No matter what Prince Yan has given you, I will give you more. As long as you stay by my side, how about it?”","“Prince Yan is definitely not a good person. He can even kill his own brother. Think about it, if you follow him, will you have a good ending?”","“Instead of following him, why don’t you follow me? I promise you that I’ll give you whatever you want,” Prince Yu said slowly with a proud look in his eyes.","In the next moment, what responded to him was an extremely sharp Sword Intent.","He was shocked and hurriedly changed his body, but he was still a step too late. The incomparably sharp Sword Intent directly left a deep wound on his cheek.","The divine blood kept dripping, staining his golden armor.","“Damned thing, you actually dare to hurt me?!”","Prince Yu was extremely furious. He allowed the blood on his face to drip as he raised his sword, “All Yan Immortals, kill him at all costs!”","The overwhelming Yan Immortal pressed down, vast and mighty Yan power surged down.","Jian Wushuang stood still and used his hand to guide the sword. He tried to release the Wushuang Sword Dao again despite the exhaustion of his Yan power.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The celestial river of his Sword Dao that came out of nowhere shattered the void and surged out from every crack. Then, it gathered into a line and crazily pounced on every Yan Immortal.","When all the Yan Immortals saw this scene, they were all shocked. They could naturally feel the majestic power contained within this Sword River.","Those who had foresight retreated nearly 30,000 meters, but those who wanted to resist were crushed into pieces by the Sword River, they didn’t even make a sound!","Under this sword, another 20 or so Yan Immortals died.","In just these few exchanges, the number of Yan Immortals that Prince Yu brought with him was less than 50.","Cold sweat poured out from his temples. He finally understood why the Yan Immortal he had sent over had disappeared.","Jian Wushuang was very strong!","Although he was at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, he could easily kill another Yan Immortal without using any strength.","“Could it be that he really killed Chang Duoling?” Prince Yu’s pupils shrank. He was starting to regret coming to this mess.","Looking at the river of Sword Dao that was still erupting, more and more Yan Immortals died.","Prince Yu’s expression was uncertain, and finally, his valiant face showed some ruthlessness.","Then, he reached out and touched his waist. A bronze bell the size of a wine cup appeared in his hand.","With the appearance of the bronze bell, the Yan power in the surrounding void quieted down, showing a strange dark green color.","Around the bronze bell, dark green crystals were condensing, as if they were alive.","Looking at the bell that was exposed in the air, Prince Yu felt a pang in his heart.","“Blue Feather Bell, for the last time, I hope you can kill all the enemies in front of me for me.”","He muttered to himself, then gritted his teeth and threw the bronze bell in his hand into the void.","In the next moment, the bronze bell expanded with the wind and formed a terrifying cauldron that could cover thousands of Heavenly Regions in an instant!","This scene was too shocking. With the appearance of the bell cauldron, it was as if the boundless void was encompassed by it.","The appearance of this ancient-looking bell called Blue Feather Bell caused all the Yan Immortals to tremble. The already broken Heavenly Dao could not withstand the pressure and shattered.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the center, felt an unimaginable life-and-death crisis looming over him. He almost did not think twice and prepared to escape.","However, the ancient bell was too vast. The Heavenly Region it covered was almost unimaginable, so Jian Wushuang had no chance of escaping.","He was ready to escape at all costs, but he felt that the Yan power around him had turned into a puddle of stagnant water, trapping him in it and making him unable to move.","Cold sweat dripped from Jian Wushuang’s temples. He could feel the aura that was restraining him. It was the Heavenly Dao.","It was a very ancient Heavenly Dao that did not belong to this era. It was an extremely old and terrifying law.","Jian Wushuang had no way to deal with the Blue Feather Bell that carried the ancient Heavenly Dao. He was completely restricted and could not even blink.","This was a huge restriction. Even Di Qing at his peak would not be able to escape from the pressure of this bell.","Moreover, the Blue Feather Bell seemed to have its own consciousness. After binding Jian Wushuang, it rapidly shrank. From its original unparalleled distance, it instantly formed a huge bell that was thousands of miles long.","In the bell, Jian Wushuang was bound by the dark blue power of Heavenly Dao and could not move at all.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals were gathered outside the bell, looking into it solemnly.","Then, Prince Yu slowly moved over, his handsome eyes full of hatred.","His Blue Feather Bell was a Supreme Immortal weapon from the ancient era. It was once a treasure in the hands of his Imperial Father, Zhen Wuyang. It had killed countless Grand Yan Immortals and the Heavenly Dao laws contained within were irresistible.","In fact, even Emperors would be at a disadvantage.","However, this Blue Feather Bell was already on the verge of destruction, and its lifespan was only this last time.","As Prince Yu’s strongest trump card, Blue Feather Bell was used on Jian Wushuang.","“Damned thing, you wasted the last use of my Blue Feather Bell. I swear that I will turn you into blood and consign you to eternal damnation!” Prince Yu roared.","As his voice fell, the Blue Feather Bell rang, and countless magnificent lights bloomed from it, illuminating the boundless void.","In the Blue Feather Bell, Jian Wushuang’s seven orifices spurted out divine blood.","He felt that his Immortal bones were about to be shattered.","The unimaginable ancient rules of the Heavenly Dao contained unknown that could not be spoken of. Jian Wushuang was helpless.","“Am I going to die just like that?”","Divine blood gushed out from the corner of his mouth. He could not break free at all. The dark blue Heavenly Dao Laws were rapidly devouring everything about him.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body that was transformed from a super chaotic Perfect Life Form was shattering rapidly.","However, Jian Wushuang had no way to break free. This was the first time he was truly helpless.","That kind of irresistible power was too overbearing.","Prince Yu’s ferocious face was reflected in his eyes. All the Yan Immortals laughed."]},{"number":4922,"title":"Chapter 4922 The True Shadow of the Emperor Arrives","paragraphs":["4922 The True Shadow of the Emperor Arrives","A guy who could kill a Grand Yan Immortal and make all the other Yan Immortals bow their heads.","At this moment, he was trapped and suffering, and he was heading towards his inevitable demise. There was nothing more pleasant than this.","Prince Yu could not even be bothered to continue watching. This Blue Feather Bell was so terrifying that even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not escape, let alone a puny little Yan Immortal.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was collapsing like a star, never to return.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness was already blurry under the encirclement of the dark blue Heavenly Dao.","His Immortal body was inevitably on the path of decline. Even if he did not die, he would probably be silent for endless years.","Jian Wushuang wanted to resist the Heavenly Dao, but he found that it was useless. It was a suppression that completely surpassed his realm and was unimaginable.","Even if he tried his best, he did not have the slightest chance of destroying the Blue Feather Bell.","“Am I going to die just like that? But I’m unwilling, I’m unwilling!” Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes, which were red.","The divine blood flowing in his body was rapidly repairing his damaged Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, as if it was resisting the Heavenly Dao.","“Hmm?” Prince Yu’s eyes narrowed. He saw that the figure was fighting against the Heavenly Dao!","“How, how is this possible?!” He was greatly shocked. One had to know that even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could be intimidated by this Blue Feather Bell!","But soon, he relaxed again, and at the same time, his heart palpitated.","Because Jian Wushuang had only resisted for a moment before he could no longer resist his decline.","What made Prince Yu’s heart palpitate was that a mere Yan Immortal could actually contend against the Blue Feather Bell. It was simply unimaginable.","Just as Prince Yu was about to get to know Jian Wushuang in advance, two tottering figures came from the void in the distance.","The leader was the Young Emperor. His luxurious clothes were already in tatters, and his exposed skin was covered in wounds.","However, at this moment, his eyes were filled with the dignity of a prince.","He glanced at Prince Yu and walked towards the rapidly shrinking Blue Feather Bell.","Prince Yu was overjoyed when he saw this. He had never thought that the Young Emperor would walk right into his trap, saving him the trouble of searching.","“Your Highness, do you want us to capture them?” a Yan Immortal requested.","Prince Yu waved his hand arrogantly. “I want to see why this trash came back. I’ll take him down later.”","All the Yan Immortals agreed, all of them watching this scene with a smile that was not a smile.","The slender palm covered in divine blood was stuck to the outer wall of the Blue Feather Bell. Looking at Jian Wushuang who was suffering in the bell, the Young Emperor gently knocked on the outer wall with his fingers, “Wushuang, Wushuang.”","Covered in blood, Jian Wushuang, who was about to die, opened his eyes with difficulty. He looked at the figure outside the Blue Feather Bell and sighed.","“Listen to me,” the Upimg Emperor stuck to the Blue Feather Bell and said in a clear voice. “Take out the golden jade ring I gave you earlier and open it.”","Jian Wushuang could hear his voice, but it was almost impossible for him to move a finger, let alone take out the golden jade ring.","The Young Emperor outside the Blue Feather Bell seemed to know his difficulties and began to be at a loss.","Prince Yu, who was standing far away, sensed that something was wrong. He hurriedly ordered, “Quick, let’s catch Prince Yan together. Don’t let him speak!”","All of the Yan Immortals hurriedly moved and caught the Young Emperor.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang, who was about to die, put his palm into his chest at the risk of his Immortal body shattering.","Even the ancient and unknown Dao could not help but waver.","He took out the golden jade ring and a unique color appeared on Jian Wushuang’s palm, which had turned into a skeleton.","“Ah!”","He roared and pushed the jade ring in the middle of the golden jade ring.","In an instant, an even more ancient and unknown Heavenly Dao aura burst out from it, transforming into billions of tassels that descended.","The appearance of the aura made Jian Wushuang relax and the dark blue Heavenly Dao that bound him dissipated.","Immediately after, a supreme True Image in a white robe walked out of the golden jade ring.","At this moment, all the ancient Heavenly Dao in the Blue Feather Bell prostrated on the ground and trembled.","He was like an ordinary person without any power, but his eyes carried the dignity of a superior.","All the Yan Immortals who saw this True Shadow were scared out of their wits. They almost could not stand properly and hurriedly knelt in the void, their Immortal bodies trembling.","Even Jian Wushuang was shocked. He had never expected that the golden jade ring that the Young Emperor had given him contained Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s True Image!","Moreover, this True Shadow belonged to the True Shadow of Emperor Zhen Wuyang at his peak, and it was filled with a domineering and disdainful aura!","Prince Yu, who was already in a daze, had never thought that a puny little Yan Immortal would actually hold a True Shadow of his Imperial Father.","This was simply inconceivable and unimaginable.","One had to know that even he did not have the True Image of his Imperial Father!","With the appearance of the True Shadow of Emperor Wuyang at his peak, the Blue Feather Bell began to wail. It could not withstand the pressure of the Emperor at all!","The middle-aged Zhenwu Yang’s True Shadow had a faint doubt in his eyes. He looked at the barrier of the Blue Feather Bell and waved his hand.","The Blue Feather Bell, which contained the supreme Heavenly Dao, shattered directly!","The residue scattered in the air and quickly disappeared.","Then, Zhen Wuyang True Shadow looked at Jian Wushuang, who was on the verge of death. A look of satisfaction and uncertainty flashed across his eyes.","Finally, he said, “Are you Yan’er?”","Jian Wushuang, who did not even have the strength to speak, could not even shake his head. He could only stare at him.","The True Shadow of Zhen Wuyang laughed and said, “That’s right, my son Yan’er indeed has the bearing of an Emperor. Although you’re in such a sorry state, it’s fine. With me here, no one can hurt you!”","“...”","Jian Wushuang was completely speechless. They had only met once, but Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow had mistaken him for Prince Yan. Could it be that they didn’t recognize each other?","Just as Jian Wushuang’s divine thoughts were in a daze, Zhen Wuyang, who was furious, looked at the Yan Immortals who were kneeling in the void.","“A bunch of ants, how dare you hurt my Yan’er!”","Prince Yu fell to his knees in the air and exclaimed, “Imperial Father, it’s me. I’m Yu’er, your third son!”","“Hmm? The third?” Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow was confused. “I only have Yan’er, right? Why is there a third one?”","Prince Yu knew that this was a fatal matter. If he could not explain it clearly, he would never have the chance to leave this place.","Therefore, he made a prompt decision. He cut his wrist and threw out the divine blood in his meridians. “If Imperial Father doesn’t believe me, just check my divine blood.”"]},{"number":4923,"title":"Chapter 4923 Confusing","paragraphs":["4923 Confusing","Prince Yu’s voice resounded in the void battleground. All the kneeling Yan Immortals heaved a sigh of relief.","As long as they could verify the identity of an Imperial Prince, they would definitely be safe.","All the Yan Immortals could tell that the True Image of Emperor Zhen Wuyang had been sealed for too long, which was why he did not know of Prince Yu’s identity.","Looking at the colorful divine blood in the air, Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow looked at Prince Yu with a serious expression.","The corner of his eyebrows twitched. The wound on his wrist was a little big in his excitement just now, causing the divine blood to not flow out slowly but spurt out like a fountain...","If this continued, he would probably be weak in a moment.","“Imperial Father, we’ll know once we investigate,” Prince Yu said nervously and reached out his hand.","Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow no longer hesitated. He waved his hand and took out a drop of divine blood.","A drop of colorful divine blood lay in the palm condensed from an unknown aura that was above the Heavenly Dao.","Zhen Wuyang looked at the divine blood in his hand. The divine blood was like a swallow in his arms, jumping happily. In the blink of an eye, it entered the True Shadow and nourished it.","Taking back his palm, Zhen Wuyang took a deep breath and looked at Prince Yu with a much gentler gaze.","“You said that you are my third son?”","Prince Yu was overjoyed. He hurriedly cupped his hands and said, “Father, I am your third son, Prince Yu.”","When Zhen Wuyang heard this, his gentle eyes suddenly turned sharp. Like two Heavenly Daos, he pressed down on Prince Yu until he could not get up.","“Then why are you trying to kill your eldest brother?!”","Cold sweat instantly broke out again, but he quickly cupped his hands and made a bitter and hateful gesture as he said in a sad voice.","“Imperial Father, you might not know this, but although Prince Yan is the eldest brother, he has never done anything that an elder brother should do. He is extremely cruel to us six brothers.”","“Fifth brother Prince Mo was killed by him!”","“Poor Fifth Brother, his head was chopped off and his Immortal Source was shattered!”","Prince Yu stood up and said. His eyes were filled with tears, and he could not help but burst into tears.","When Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow heard this, he was so shocked that he could not help but clench his fists under his luxurious clothes.","Then, he muttered, “I actually have seven sons?! Zheng’er actually gave birth to seven sons for me?”","“...”","Prince Yu’s mouth twitched. It seemed that Zhen Wuyang did not notice that he had been brewing so many emotions...","Soon, Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow came back to his senses and frowned. If what he said was true and the fifth son was killed by Prince Yan, then today’s matter would be extremely troublesome.","This was a True Shadow left behind by Zhen Wuyang at his peak. He could not remain for too long and was even slowly dissipating.","Soon, Zhen Wuyang looked at Jian Wushuang, who was kneeling in the void and covered in blood, and asked, “Yan’er, what he said is the truth. Did you send the Yan Immortal to kill my fifth son?”","He had been severely injured by the supreme Heavenly Dao in the Blue Feather Bell, so much so that Jian Wushuang was still unable to speak.","When Prince Yu, who was far away, saw this scene, he hurriedly said, “Imperial Father, you are mistaken. He is not Prince Yan. The one behind you is Prince Yan!”","Zhen Wuyang was shocked. He looked behind him and saw a handsome young man standing behind Jian Wushuang.","As their eyes met, Zhen Wuyang quickly frowned.","The Young Emperor bowed slowly. “Yan’er greets Imperial Father.”","He did not say anything else and directly stretched out his palm to check between the Young Emperor’s brows.","Soon, a hint of sadness and pain flashed in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes.","There was no way to hide the uniqueness of the Young Emperor’s constitution.","“So, Yan’er, your physique...”","Zhen Wuyang could not continue. He turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang, who had already recovered. “Then, which son are you? ”","“Imperial Father, you’re wrong. He’s not an Imperial Prince, he’s Prince Yan’s Heavenly Official!” Prince Yu hurriedly corrected him.","When Zhen Wuyang heard that, he frowned and took out a drop of divine blood from Jian Wushuang’s body.","The divine blood was mysterious and ever-changing, it was a hazy color that even the Yan Immortal could not see its core.","In Zhen Wuyang’s palm, Jian Wushuang’s divine blood was also jumping. It seemed to have some unknown familiarity and probing. However, it did not merge with Zhen Wuyang’s real shadow. Instead, it kept swimming.","“Why do I feel a strong sense of familiarity?”","Looking at the divine blood in his hand that seemed to be protected by some kind of aura, Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow could not help but try to remove the aura.","However, he soon discovered to his surprise that he could not break the restriction on this drop of blood!","Zhen Wuyang’s gaze turned solemn. He looked at Jian Wushuang and asked again, “Are you really not my Imperial Son? Why do I feel a familiar feeling from you?”","Jian Wushuang was confused. It had only been a few decades since he came to the Great Yan Domain.","Prior to this, he had never interacted with the entire Great Si Region or the Heavenly Court of Zhen Wuyang.","To be able to feel a familiar feeling from him was no different from fantasy.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to deny it, the Young Emperor, who had not spoken for a long time, said, “Imperial Father, he is indeed not your son.”","Hearing this, Zhen Wuyang did not say anything else, but the confusion in his eyes deepened.","Jian Wushuang’s aura was too familiar to him. It was as if he could not cut off some kind of cognitive emotion.","Prince Yu, who was standing on the opposite side, could not help but feel anxious when he saw this scene.","Then, he gritted his teeth and cupped his hands again. “Imperial Father, please help Fifth Brother take Prince Yan’s Immortal bone!”","The void was deathly silent. Only this sentence resounded.","To a lesser Imperial Lord who was unable to cultivate and had no Immortal roots, the act of taking away his Immortal bones would completely strip him of his Immortal path.","Once the Immortal bone was stripped off, he would die in an extremely short period of time, and there was no way to reverse it.","Prince Yu wanted the Young Emperor to die.","After hearing this sentence, various complicated emotions flowed in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes.","In the end, he looked at the Young Emperor. “Yan ‘er, have you done that kind of thing?”","The Young Emperor smiled coldly, his gaze extremely calm. “Imperial Father, my personality has never changed since I was young. Whether you believe it or not, I would never do such a thing.”","“Even if my Immortal body is incomplete and I can’t cultivate, I still don’t acknowledge my brothers, so I naturally won’t argue with them.”"]},{"number":4924,"title":"Chapter 4924 Returning to the Battlefield","paragraphs":["4924 Returning to the Battlefield","When the Young Emperor said this, there was only a cold smile left in his eyes. “And only the person who did such a thing knows in his heart.”","Prince Yu felt his ears burning. He gritted his teeth and said, “He’s still trying to argue. Imperial Father, don’t listen to his one-sided story!”","“If my words are one-sided, then so are yours. Of course, if you have evidence, why don’t you bring it up and testify on the spot?!”","The Young Emperor said coldly, not giving in.","Prince Yu gritted his teeth after hearing that. He could not produce any evidence.","Prince Mo died too quickly. The mysterious person who killed him did not leave any evidence at the scene.","Even if there was evidence left behind, it would no longer exist with the complete destruction of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","In this frozen atmosphere, Zhen Wuyang looked at Prince Yu and waved his hand, “Let’s not discuss this anymore. You can leave with your Yan Immortal. ”","Prince Yu was taken aback. He hurriedly said, “Imperial Father, why....”","Before he could finish his sentence, Zhen Wuyang suddenly released an unparalleled pressure that suppressed everything!","Under this pressure, even the Yan Immortal could not stand still and almost died.","“Alright, alright, Imperial Father, we’ll leave now!”","Prince Yu, who was kneeling in the air, could not even lift his head.","Zhen Wuyang did not look at him anymore. He waved his palm and dispelled the pressure.","Prince Yu heaved a sigh of relief, hiding his resentment in his heart. Then, he left the void battleground with less than 50 Yan Immortals.","At this point, the entire void battleground finally calmed down.","Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow was about to dissipate. Countless stars appeared behind him and then disappeared into the void.","This True Shadow that had been sealed in the ring by Zhen Wuyang from an unknown era was about to dissipate.","“Yan’er...”","The True Shadow of Zhen Wuyang was filled with guilt and reluctance. He reached out his hand to touch the Young Emperor’s cheek.","However, the Young Emperor subconsciously dodged his palm and lowered his head.","A hint of loneliness flashed in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes, but he immediately regained his calm. In the end, his Emperor Body slowly dissipated.","As he dissipated, he suddenly said, “Yan’er, I’ve let you down.”","The Young Emperor raised his head. His eyes were filled with confusion, but he could not find the answer in the end.","As Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow completely disappeared, the void battleground became deathly silent.","Jian Wushuang, who had recovered a little, let out a long sigh. If it weren’t for the appearance of Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow, he would have been turned into blood in the Blue Feather Bell.","The Young Emperor stood rooted to the ground, seemingly recalling what had just happened.","“Hmph, Prince Yan, do you think you can escape?”","At this moment, a furious roar came from the depths of the void. Then, the chaotic void was lit up. The group of Yan Immortals led by Prince Yu did not leave but returned.","At this moment, his eyes were filled with anger, as if he wanted to swallow the Young Emperor alive.","Jian Wushuang thought to himself, ‘This is bad!’","He did not expect Prince Yu to be so bold as to return.","At this moment, he had not even recovered half of his strength. It would be difficult for him to deal with these dozens of Yan Immortals and Prince Yu, who had many tricks up his sleeve.","If Prince Yu took out another ancient Immortal Weapon, he would be helpless.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor and said, “You’d better leave quickly. I think this place can’t hold on any longer.”","When the Young Emperor heard this, he smiled and said, “The reason why I came back was to save you. Now that you’re chasing me away, that’s too unreasonable.”","“Listen to me, you can’t stay here any longer. Even if Prince Yu catches me, he won’t dare to do anything to me.”","“You want to leave?” Prince Yu grinned hideously and pointed at Jian Wushuang. “None of you can leave here alive today. Except for Prince Yan, kill the rest!”","“Yes!” All of the Yan Immortals responded and released their energy at the same time, surrounding them from all directions.","“Looks like I can’t leave even if I want to.” Jian Wushuang sighed and an Invisible Sword appeared in his palm.","Seeing this sword, all the Yan Immortals were terrified.","They had all escaped from Jian Wushuang’s sword, so they naturally did not dare to underestimate him.","Under his sword, the Yan Immortals all trembled.","This was the first time that each of the Yan Immortals had faced such a terrifying Sword Principle. Before this, they had never seen an opponent who could use the Sword Principle so terrifyingly.","However, they had orders, so they could only brace themselves and accept the challenge.","With the combined power of fifty Yan Immortals, layers of majestic barriers surrounded Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor.","Jian Wushuang, who had yet to recover, was afraid that he would not be able to fight again.","He estimated that he could only release two Sword Intents at most before he would be exhausted.","When the barrier around him was thick enough, the aura around Jian Wushuang, who was originally calm, suddenly changed. He was like a True Sword that had been completely unsheathed.","Tens of thousands of Sword Intents surrounded him, filled with a murderous aura.","The next moment, he slashed down with the Invisible Sword in his hand.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","As the first sword move of the entire peerless Sword Dao, Star was the thickest sword move, filled with an awe-inspiring indomitable will.","However, this ordinary slash shattered the countless amount of Yan power.","Boundless Sword Intent surged and poured out crazily. Nearly a hundred pillars of light exploded.","Under this sword strike, even the void trembled. The barrier that contained the power of 50 Yan Immortal experts was directly cut open and then collapsed uncontrollably!","Seeing this, Prince Yu turned pale with fright. “Hurry up and block him! If anyone dares to let him go today, I’ll skin you alive!”","All the Yan Immortals were terrified, but they still braced themselves and went forward. At this moment, each of them completely released their Yan power, trying to trap Jian Wushuang and the others.","They had done it. Jian Wushuang had used up all his energy in this attack. He was unable to escape from the attack.","The endless Sword Intent dissipated. Looking at Jian Wushuang, the Young Emperor, and the thin purple robe who were surrounded by the power, Prince Yu could not help but smile.","The destruction of the Six Heavens and Prince Yan’s capture was the ultimate goal of this battle!","However, before the smile on Prince Yu’s face disappeared, he saw several figures rushing over from the front. They were so fast that they arrived in the blink of an eye.","“Not good, there’s a change!” His eyelids twitched, only then did he see that all of them were Yan Immortals!","A total of seven figures with strong Yan power around their bodies slowly walked toward Prince Yu, like the sharpest Sword Intents.","He subconsciously retreated and gritted his teeth."]},{"number":4925,"title":"Chapter 4925 Killing Prince Yu","paragraphs":["4925 Killing Prince Yu","Led by Di Qing, seven Yan Immortals descended.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, Wei Liujia, Feng Shan, all of them were present.","“My Lord, Feng Shan is late!”","Feng Shan shouted angrily, and his chest was bare. He flew toward Jian Wushuang like a real divine mountain.","Following that, Chen Qing and Chun Qiu advanced one after another with an indomitable momentum.","Now, they had all recovered to their peak.","Di Qing had already recovered from the heavy injuries he had suffered previously to his peak condition.","The Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was still extremely terrifying. Even though Di Qing had not recovered, he had still easily outpowered many enemies.","They were fighting to save Jian Wushuang!","Boom!","Feng Shan, who was like a raging bull, directly tore a crack in the Energy Diffraction Barrier with all his strength and then desperately crawled inside.","“Why are you guys here!”","Jian Wushuang was both surprised and delighted.","“Of course we have to come. Otherwise, My Lord will be in danger!” Feng Shan’s face turned red. He tried his best to block the crack and prevent it from closing again. “I can’t hold on much longer. Let’s go quickly...”","Chen Qing followed closely behind. He drew the True Sword at his waist and placed it horizontally in the middle of the crack. Then, he said, “Brother Jian, Young Emperor, leave quickly!”","Jian Wushuang nodded heavily. Without any hesitation, he pulled the Young Emperor and the thin purple-robed man and rushed out of the crack.","“Damn it, kill them all!” Prince Yu was utterly exasperated.","He had damaged the Blue Feather Bell and sacrificed so many Yan Immortals, yet he was still unable to capture Prince Yan. He could no longer remain calm.","The remaining 40 plus Yan Immortals charged forward once again, they didn’t know that this unfair battle had already been reversed.","There seemed to be only seven ordinary Yan Immortals, but excluding Di Qing, the remaining six were enough to make them suffer.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the others all had two or three Emperor-grade pills stuffed into their mouths. Once they were injured, they could swallow them directly and instantly recover half of their strength.","After Chen Qing and Feng Shan brought him out, Chun Qiu sent over a large number of pills, all of which were pills that could heal serious injuries.","Jian Wushuang quickly stuffed a few pills into Young Emperor and the thin purple-robed man’s mouth.","Nearly ten Emperor-grade pills entered his mouth and directly transformed into violent energy that surged into his limbs and bones.","Caught off guard, Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body almost exploded.","All his injuries were healed and he was back to his peak condition.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang felt that the meridians in his Immortal body were about to explode and needed to be vented.","His eyes were bloodshot, and the shen glyphs around his body had almost doubled in size. He then looked at Prince Yu in the distance.","When their eyes met, Prince Yu felt a great sense of danger that made him tremble.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang rushed straight at him.","The void collapsed, and a scarlet streak of light cut through the void.","Jian Wushuang could not hold back the restlessness in his Immortal body. He probably did not even know that he had unknowingly activated the Slaughter Dao.","“Stop him!” Prince Yu was shocked and quickly retreated.","Nearly ten Yan Immortals arrived first and tried to stall Jian Wushuang with their own Yan power.","However, he was no longer in his previous unrecovered state.","At his peak, Jian Wushuang could already fight a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, let alone them.","A mantis trying to stop a chariot was overestimating its own strength.","Jian Wushuang, who had mastered the Slaughter Dao, didn’t even transform into an Invisible Sword. Instead, he directly threw a heavy punch.","This punch was enough to destroy the entire Heavenly Region.","The scarlet fist force gale smashed out, the first Yan Immortal who came forward did not even have time to make a sound before he was directly blasted into a bloody mist and disappeared!","Furthermore, the force of the fist did not decrease. After crushing the first Yan Immortal, it smashed six more!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The blood mist was spreading. Out of the dozen or so Yan Immortals who had come forward to block, only three were left under this punch.","Prince Yu was so shocked that he did not plan to stay here any longer. He turned around and flew toward the Immortal Array Formation in the distance.","“Get lost!”","Jian Wushuang, whose mind had been slightly changed by the Slaughter Dao, was furious. He chose to charge at the less than 30 Evolved Immortals in front of him.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Each punch was enough to destroy the Immortal Source of a Yan Immortal. Jian Wushuang was like a demon god that was above the Heavenly Dao, killing the Yan Immortals one by one.","All the Yan Immortals were so vulnerable in front of him, they could not even defend themselves, their Immortal Sources were smashed and they died miserably.","In less than ten breaths of time, only 7 out of the 30 were left.","They were all terrified and did not dare to resist anymore. They directly fled into the wilderness.","“You want to leave?”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and raised his palm. Suddenly, thousands of scarlet light beams shot out in all directions like chains.","The 7 Yan Immortals who were fleeing towards the wilderness were caught in an instant and dragged in front of him.","“Lord, Lord, please let us go. We don’t want to be enemies with you, it’s all because of Third Prince...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the 7 Yan Immortals were directly shredded into pieces by the scarlet chains.","Jian Wushuang never showed mercy to his enemies. It was impossible for him to let them live.","After killing all the Yan Immortals, he flew toward Prince Yu, who was about to escape.","The killing intent in his eyes intensified, and he had already listed this person as his target.","Prince Yu let out a long breath as he got closer and closer to the Immortal Array Formation.","However, just as he was about to rush into the Immortal Array Formation, a great sense of danger surged in his heart. He did not think and used all his strength to dodge to the side.","Boom!","The scarlet power covered the sky and directly destroyed the Immortal Array Formation.","Jian Wushuang walked over slowly with his eyes as dark as water.","Cold sweat dripped down from his temples.","Prince Yu stood rooted to the ground, trembling uncontrollably.","Judging from his previous behavior, Jian Wushuang, who was extremely cold and stern, obviously did not intend to let him leave.","He was very sure that Jian Wushuang would not be afraid of him because he was the Third Prince.","Because of this, Prince Yu had fallen into despair.","He had never thought that he would be so close to death one day.","Prince Yu said in a trembling voice out of fear of death.","“No, no, you can’t do anything. I’m the third Imperial Prince under the Emperor. If you do anything to me, you’ll definitely pay the price.”","“As long as you let me go, I will completely forget everything that happened today.”"]},{"number":4926,"title":"Chapter 4926 The Arrival of the Emperor","paragraphs":["4926 The Arrival of the Emperor","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he looked at him with a faint smile.","“As long as you don’t kill me, I promise that I won’t do anything harmful to you from now on.”","Prince Yu had completely abandoned the arrogance of an Imperial Prince and was almost begging.","“I, I am Prince Yan’s third brother. He, he is my brother. He definitely won’t let you touch me.”","As he said this, he even started to shamelessly call out the name of the Young Emperor.","However, he did not know that Jian Wushuang did not belong to the branch of the Young Emperor. In fact, their relationship was equal.","Wanting to use the Young Emperor to suppress him was simply a fool’s talk.","Prince Yu shouted the name of the Young Emperor at the top of his lungs. However, Jian Wushuang immediately cut off Prince Yu’s entire left arm with his palm!","Divine blood spurted out, and his immortal body was shattered. Prince Yu screamed and staggered backward while clutching his broken arm.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and he had no intention of letting him go.","If it was not for the Emperor’s True Shadow, the Blue Feather Bell would have killed Jian Wushuang.","It was also because of this that he had the intention to kill.","If he let Prince Yu go, Jian Wushuang would be in a passive position in the future.","Therefore, Prince Yu had to die.","At this moment, he did not even consider the existence of Zhen Wuyang and the Heavenly Court.","The palm that was surging with scarlet power fell again. Prince Yu’s right leg was cut off, and divine blood spurted out.","Without the support of one leg, Prince Yu sat in the Chaotic Void and looked at Jian Wushuang with a pale face.","He could see the killing intent in Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes. There was no room for redemption.","Prince Yu was extremely regretful. He should never have thought of cleaning up the battlefield and capturing the Young Emperor alive.","If he did not have such thoughts, he would not have ended up in this situation.","“Don’t, don’t kill me. I don’t want to die... I can give you anything you want.” Prince Yu’s face turned ashen. “Imperial Emperor’s fate energy. I’ll use the Imperial Emperor’s fate energy to exchange for my life. Is that okay?”","Jian Wushuang did not want to listen to him anymore. The killing intent in his hand was extremely dense and turned into a long and narrow Bloodblade.","The next moment, he raised the Bloodblade in his hand and slashed down without hesitation.","Prince Yu’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets, his face ashen.","However, the Bloodblade did not slash down. It seemed to have encountered some obstruction and hovered above his head.","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked behind him.","Di Qing had already arrived by his side and stopped him with a spell.","Di Qing placed his palm on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and patted it gently. Then, he said in a low voice, “Leave it to me.”","As he spoke, he slowly walked to the trembling Prince Yu.","Prince Yu felt as if he had been pardoned. “Save me! Save me! I can give you all of the Emperor’s fate energy!”","What responded to him were thousands of extremely sharp golden feathers.","Each golden feather was strong enough to break the heaven path and pierce through any super Heavenly Region.","Thousands of golden feathers pierced through his body and turned his immortal body into dust. Even his immortal Source was crushed!","The Third Prince under True Martial Yang, Prince Yu, had died just like that!","The void wailed as the Fate that belonged to the Prince returned to the universe and could no longer be collected.","Seeing this scene, the Young Emperor’s body trembled and he slowly took a few steps back. If it wasn’t for the thin purple robe holding him back, he would have collapsed.","Prince Yu died right in front of his eyes. All kinds of emotions were changing in his eyes, and he finally closed his eyes tightly.","The magnificent and majestic ten-sided wings slowly moved behind Di Qing, illuminating the primal chaos void.","Under a casual attack from a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, even a Prince was easily destroyed.","The insufferably arrogant Prince Yu had fallen.","After putting away the Slaughter Dao, Jian Wushuang regained his composure. He looked at Di Qing and asked slowly, “Why did you do that?”","Putting away the Ten Directional Wings, Di Qing said calmly, “Because he is the Prince of Zhen Wuyang. Once you kill him, you will definitely suffer Zhen Wuyang’s revenge. Moreover, you will definitely not be able to survive his wraith.”","At this point, he paused and continued, “I’m different. Even if he attacks me, I have a way to protect myself.”","Jian Wushuang was moved. He understood that Di Qing was doing this to protect him.","Then, he said solemnly, “Thank you. I owe you one.”","“There’s no need for thanks between us.” Di Qing raised his eyebrows and smiled. “However, I’m afraid I’ll have to leave for a period of time.”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to ask him where he was going, an indescribable aura shrouded the entire void battleground.","This aura was extremely majestic. Wherever this aura enveloped, time would stop flowing and it would be completely sealed.","The shattered Heavenly Dao was reconstructed, and the chaotic void was quickly repaired.","Jian Wushuang, who could not move at all, widened his eyes and looked ahead in disbelief.","Everything was going back in time!","Then what kind of power could complete the backtracking?!","The fate and aura that had originally dissipated began to condense like stars.","Soon, under the condensation of starlight, an extremely familiar figure appeared again!","Prince Yu, whose Immortal Source had been destroyed by Di Qing, had been reborn.","At the same time, the chaotic void was torn apart, and indescribably powerful figures appeared from the end of the void.","They all carried light wheels of various colors on their backs, and within the light wheels, there was hope that the ancient Heavenly Dao would circulate.","Only Six Revolution Grand Yan Immortals would condense light wheels, and they were all senior Grand Yan Immortals under Zhen Wuyang.","Every one of them was Nine Revolutions at the very least.","Even the newly born Heavenly Dao prostrated at their feet.","At the very front of these Grand Elders was a figure with a tired expression and no aura.","Although he was extremely ordinary, he made all the Grand Elders and Grand Yan Immortals behind him submit.","All of the berserk energies, auras, and even the Heavenly Dao in the Void Battleground were unable to get close to him.","The Lord of the Heavenly Court, Emperor Zhen Wuyang, had arrived!","Jian Wushuang felt that the divine blood in his meridians had frozen. In front of that aura, he could not even breathe.","Arriving at the void battleground, Emperor Zhen Wuyang looked tired, but he still carried a supreme aura.","Looking at the confused Prince Yu who had opened his eyes, his face turned ashen.","“I-Imperial Father, I’m still alive?”","Prince Yu, who had just recovered from his daze, was extremely excited when he saw the arrival of Zhen Wuyang.","However, what awaited him was not a concerned question, but a powerful slap.","The Emperor was furious and sent him flying 30,000 meters away!"]},{"number":4927,"title":"Chapter 4927 Sealed and Grounded","paragraphs":["4927 Sealed and Grounded","Prince Yu, who had just reconstructed his Immortal body, was in his weakest state. Divine blood gushed out of his seven orifices. He was almost killed by this slap.","Then, Zhen Wuyang stretched out his hand and pulled him back to the front.","Covering the divine blood spurting out of his nose, Prince Yu said timidly, “Imperial Father, why did you hit me?”","Taking a deep breath, Zhen Wuyang pointed at the shattered void and said in a deep voice, “Did you do this?”","When he heard this, he immediately became a little listless.”Yes, but not... It’s not just me...”","When Zhen Wuyang heard that, he was so angry that he wanted to slap him a few more times, but he eventually retracted his palm.","The magnificent and terrifying aura in the Void Battleground disappeared. Jian Wushuang and the others panted and retreated.","The aura that Zhen Wuyang had sent down was too vast. Even Di Qing, who was a Nine Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal, could not resist it, let alone them.","Jian Wushuang was sweating profusely. If Zhen Wuyang were to kill him, he would not be able to escape.","Then, Zhen Wuyang slowly swept his gaze across them. After pausing for a moment on Jian Wushuang and Di Qing, he quickly looked at the Young Emperor.","“Yan’er, tell me what happened.” He said in a deep voice, “The entire void was shattered like this. It was definitely not as simple as a battle!”","When the Young Emperor heard this, he did not hesitate and immediately told Zhen Wuyang everything that had happened.","This battle, which involved over a thousand Yan Immortals, was the largest battle that had taken place since Emperor Zhen Wuyang opened up the Grand Si Region.","The powers involved were complicated, the Immortal Evolution realm was vast, they were all ancient and modern.","As such, when the Young Emperor described such a tragic battle scene, Zhen Wuyang and the Grand Yan Immortals behind him were all shocked.","A Yan Immortal was an absolute existence in normal Heavenly Regions. They had transcended the Heavenly Dao and 99 percent of the shackles. Even in the Great Yan Domain, they were at the peak.","But now, they had all perished in the void battleground.","It was because of this inexplicable battle.","When Zhen Wuyang and the Grand Yan Immortals heard that the two factions were equal, they were truly shocked.","With less than 200 Yan Immortals, they resisted the attacks of close to 2,000 Yan Immortals and three Grand Yan Immortals, completely protecting the six heavens.","How was this possible?","A 1 v 20 situation? He could still protect the Six Heavens Realm?","In the end, the Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and Di Qing and said, “If it weren’t for their help, the Six Heavens Realm would have been destroyed long ago. Even I would have died in this chaotic battle.”","“So, he deserves to die!” He pointed at Prince Yu, who was kneeling in front of Zhen Wuyang, and shouted angrily.","Prince Yu immediately sat in the void and waved his hands. “No, no, it’s not just me. This has nothing to do with me.”","Zhen Wuyang took a deep breath, and the Emperor Light emitted from his body could not help but fluctuate.","This was too shocking. In just a short period of time after he left the Six Heavens Realm, such a tragic battle had erupted.","If this battle was not stopped in any direction in the Six Heavens Realm, it would be an extremely terrifying destruction.","Fortunately, this battle had already completely subsided.","Zhen Wuyang’s eyes were very dark, as if he wanted to swallow Prince Yu alive.","“No, no, Imperial Father, this has nothing to do with me. This matter has nothing to do with me.” He kept retreating, his eyes filled with fear.","However, Zhen Wuyang did not hit him again. Instead, he said in a deep voice, “You alone are definitely unable to gather so many Yan Immortals. Now, tell me, who else is there besides you!”","Prince Yu hesitated and struggled. He seemed to want to keep this secret.","However, the struggle and hesitation in his heart only lasted for a moment before he said, “Replying to Imperial Father, it’s Second Brother and Sixth Brother...”","Hearing this, Zhen Wuyang was furious. “Alright, alright!”The three of you have guts to mobilize so many Yan Immortals to kill your brother?!”","“If you kill your brother now, will you kill me, the Emperor, in the future?”","His expression was terrifyingly dark. Clearly, he was truly furious.","Prince Yu was shaking all over. “Imperial Father, it’s not what you think. There’s a reason for all of this.”","Zhen Wuyang suppressed the anger in his heart and looked at him in disappointment.","“From now on, you are grounded for a Hua Year.”","With the Emperor’s mantra, the Heavenly Dao was established. Countless Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao were born at this moment!","Mysterious engravings flowed in the void, each representing the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","The entire void was enveloped by the Emperor’s splendor as the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao descended.","Prince Yu was terrified.","To be grounded for a year was simply unimaginable.","One year meant that even the Heavenly Region Plane constructed by the Heavenly Dao would be destroyed, turning into star fragments and disappearing into the boundless void.","One year meant that a cultivator could grow to the terrifying level of the Yan Immortal stage.","A Hua Year represented an infinite amount of time. It was the transition point when the new Heavenly Dao replaced the old Heavenly Dao.","Prince Yu was grounded for one Hua Year, which was the most severe punishment.","“No, no, Imperial Father! Everything was because of Prince Jiu, Prince Jiu made me do this, I’m innocent!”","Prince Yu shouted in a daze, but the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao had already descended. It was like chains that instantly bound him.","Then, the void collapsed, revealing an unknown space. The Emperor’s Will dragged Prince Yu inside and sealed him.","The void was flattened, and the strange energy unique to the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao was slowly moving. In that unknown dimension, the Third Prince of the Emperor, Prince Yu, was sealed for a year!","The void was silent. All the Grand Elders shook their heads and sighed. Then, they looked at Jian Wushuang and Di Qing.","Soon, a Grand Yan Immortal recognized Di Qing who was beside Jian Wushuang.","“How, how could it be him?”","“That Ancestral Golden Crow? Didn’t he die at that time?”","The group of Grand Elders and Grand Yan Immortals began to whisper to each other.","At this moment, Emperor Zhen Wuyang also noticed Di Qing.","“Tell me, why are you here?”","Unknowingly, the Imperial Emperor’s prestige descended, suppressing all the Yan Immortals to the point that they were unable to hold on.","Di Qing gritted his teeth. He was using all his strength to resist the Emperor’s pressure.","At this moment, the Young Emperor stepped forward and stood in front of Jian Wushuang and Di Qing. He said loudly, “If it weren’t for their all-out resistance, I’m afraid that the Six Heavens Realm and I would have perished in the void. Father, you can ask me anything you want to ask. I will answer for them!”","Zhen Wuyang wanted to say something but stopped. He knew that this battle was too intense and involved too many forces. In this battle, the Six Heavens Realm was the victim."]},{"number":4928,"title":"Chapter 4928 Exiled to the Endless Sea","paragraphs":["4928 Exiled to the Endless Sea","Without Jian Wushuang, Di Qing, and the others, the Six Heavens Realm would have been destroyed by the Yan Immortal army.","Therefore, Zhen Wuyang did not make things difficult for Di Qing.","The destruction of the Six Heavens Realm was a premeditated war. If they did not investigate it thoroughly, it would probably leave behind a source of disaster.","After pondering for a moment, Zhen Wuyang spoke again, “Which one of you killed Prince Yu?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he heard this. Just as Di Qing had said, Zhen Wuyang would get to the bottom of it.","Just as the Young Emperor was about to speak, Jian Wushuang said calmly, “I killed him.”","All the Grand Elders and Grand Yan Immortals turned their gazes to him, as if their eyes were filled with pity.","Di Qing was slightly stunned. Then, he turned to look at Jian Wushuang with various emotions flashing in his eyes.","Then, Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice, “Then do you know what crime it is to kill a Prince?”","The Emperor’s Will pressured him. He gritted his teeth and held on, not letting himself fall. “I only know that if I don’t kill him, I will be in danger.”","The long sword was in the air and it broke through the Emperor’s pressure. The Young Emperor stood in front of Jian Wushuang and raised the long sword in his hand, pointing it at Zhen Wuyang.","“Young Emperor, put down your sword!”","All the Grand Elders and Grand Yan Immortals stepped forward to pressure the Young Emperor.","However, he was still unmoved. He raised the True Sword in his hand and pointed the tip of the sword at Zhen Wuyang without taking a step back.","“Do you dare to attack me?” Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice. At this moment, the Emperor’s splendor shone to the extreme.","Under the Emperor’s splendor, Chen Qing and the others all grunted, and a wisp of divine blood involuntarily seeped out from the corner of their mouths.","The already weak Young Emperor retreated a few steps, and divine blood flowed out of his ears and nose.","However, he instantly stood in front of Jian Wushuang and raised his Real Sword, aiming at Zhen Wuyang again.","Then, he said in a hoarse voice, “Why wouldn’t I dare!”","A hint of disappointment flashed in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes. Then, he casually raised his hand and the Heavenly Dao pressed down.","The True Sword in the Young Emperor’s hand shattered into a hundred pieces. His body was also suppressed by the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","“Let go of me, Zhen Wuyang!” He roared, but there was no way for him to break free from this restraint.","Zhen Wuyang did not mind the Young Emperor calling him by his name. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang, “Was it really you who killed the Prince”","At this moment, a lazy voice suddenly resounded in the void. Di Qing walked to the front of the group of Yan Immortals.","“Hey, hey, look at me. To be able to kill an Imperial Prince without any fear, in the entire Great Si Region, other than me, Di Qing, I’m afraid there’s no other Yan Immortal!”","After saying this, Di Qing resolutely spread out his ten wings!","In an instant, the magnificent Yan power belonging to a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal spread out in the void.","The magnificent ten-sided wings spread out, and Di Qing’s ancestral bloodline also extended for tens of thousands of miles at this moment!","Screech!","The cry of the Golden Crow was extremely sacred and majestic.","Di Qing was taking the initiative to fight the Zhen Wuyang!","Even though he was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he was not even worth mentioning when facing an Emperor.","Just a wisp of Emperor fate energy was enough to easily kill any Grand Yan Immortal, including Di Qing.","If one had to describe the distance between them, it would be like a speck of dust and the bright moon. It was even more incomparable.","However, even with such a majestic and proud Di Qing, Zhen Wuyang did not even have the slightest interest in fighting.","He looked at Di Qing with interest. “Golden Crow, you never seem to be afraid of me?”","Di Qing smiled and looked at Zhen Wuyang. “To be honest, even after you became the Emperor, I was never afraid. Even now, I’m not afraid. I was afraid that I wouldn’t be able to solve any problems, so I removed this unstable factor from my blood.”","“Are you really not afraid of me?” Zhen Wuyang narrowed his eyes.","Di Qing’s eyes narrowed slightly. “Of course.”","The atmosphere was deathly silent. This was the first time a Grand Yan Immortal dared to contradict an Emperor. To those Grand Yan Immortals, this was an extremely strange scene.","Zhen Wuyang had been fighting and killing all his life. He had killed several Emperors before developing the current Great Si Region.","However, he was not in a hurry to make a move against this guy who could be easily crushed.","“As expected, your temperament is still the same as before. As a member of the Golden Crow ancestral bloodline, it is rumored that you have nine True Lives. This is probably why you dare to confront me.”","“What if I destroy your nine True Lives right now?” Emperor Zhen Wuyang said slowly.","Di Qing’s heart tightened when he heard this. He did not expect Zhen Wuyang to know about his hidden trump card.","He only had seven True Lives left. If Zhen Wuyang was determined to punish him, he would probably die today.","Thinking of this, Di Qing gritted his teeth and did not say anything.","As for Zhen Wuyang, he did not seem to want to know Di Qing’s answer. He extended his index finger and pointed at the void.","In an instant, all of Di Qing’s plans were shattered like a mirage.","Di Qing’s mouth was dripping with divine blood, and his eyes were wide open.","Zhen Wuyang looked at him and said in a deep voice.","“Killing an Imperial Prince is a capital crime to you, but since you have other thoughts, I will spare your life.”","“But I will immediately banish you to the Endless Sea for a year!”","As soon as the Emperor’s mantra was spoken, the Heavenly Dao appeared.","Layers of chains bound Di Qing.","Di Qing’s expression changed drastically when he heard the punishment. “One Hua Year? Are you planning to let me get lost in it?! ”","However, he only left this sentence before his figure completely disappeared into the void.","Jian Wushuang stood up to chase after him, but he could not catch up with him in the end.","Exiled to the Endless Sea, these short words contained endless terror and coldness.","Back then, Chang Duoling, who had single-handedly killed the Nine Heavens, had been exiled to the Endless Sea.","However, he had used some unknown method to escape, so he was extremely cautious with his words toward the Endless Sea.","That unknown place was probably the true purgatory.","Prince Yu was grounded for a Hua Year, and Di Qing was exiled to the Endless Sea for a Hua Year.","Everything seemed to be just the beginning.","Zhen Wuyang slowly swept his gaze across the remaining Yan Immortals in the void battleground. Finally, his gaze stopped on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not avoid it either. Instead, he looked at him coldly.","For some reason, when he met that pair of eyes, Zhen Wuyang felt a very familiar and strange feeling.","At the same time, it felt like they were on equal footing.","This made Zhen Wuyang feel shocked. Why would a mere Yan Immortal give him such a feeling?","An existence that did not even belong to the same realm had already made Zhen Wuyang wary at this moment.","This kind of vigilance was unprecedented for Zhen Wuyang."]},{"number":4929,"title":"Chapter 4929 Unable to Break Through Again","paragraphs":["4929 Unable to Break Through Again","Even in that ancient era, when the Emperor had ruled over thousands of generations, there were very few existences that could make him feel threatened.","This was simply absurd.","Zhen Wuyang directly discarded the absurdity that rose in his heart and returned to normal.","At the same time, he was puzzled. What was the familiar feeling that Jian Wushuang gave off? Why did it feel so familiar?","After pondering for a moment, Zhen Wuyang did not intend to investigate further. He had just arrived at the Great Si Region and had already sensed the abnormal fluctuations here, which was why he had rushed over.","Now that the crisis in the Six Heavens Realm had been resolved, he had to return to Heavenly Court to deal with some hidden dangers.","Reaching out his hand to dispel the Imperial Emperor Heavenly Dao that was binding the Young Emperor, Zhen Wuyang wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he did not say anything and led a group of Grand Yan Immortals away.","The void that had shattered into chaos was repaired by the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao. All the injuries from the battle did not leave any traces. It was so clean that it was as if nothing had happened.","Even the destroyed Heavenly Regions were reconstructed, but the billions of living beings in them eventually disappeared.","Chen Qing and the others were a little dazed as they looked at the clean void with the flowing galaxy.","Here, there had been a tragic battle. Close to 2,000 Yan Immortals and three Grand Yan Immortals were buried here.","But at this moment, they had all disappeared without a trace.","He coughed lightly and slowly came to Jian Wushuang. His eyes were dim as he said, “I’m sorry.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “It’s not your fault. Now that things have come to this, you should think about how to make up for it.”","“Brother Jian, what are your plans? No matter what, I, Chen Qing, will be the first to follow you!” Chen Qing, who was covered in divine blood, walked out from behind him and said with determination in his eyes.","“I’ll have a share too. Feng Shan will never back down!” Feng Shan, who was even taller than Chen Qing, patted his chest and said.","Following that, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and Wei Liujia also took a step forward. They all had determined looks on their faces.","Hesitation flashed across Zhao Ting’s eyes. In the end, she did not take a step forward and stayed where she was.","Jian Wushuang forced a smile and turned to look at them. “What are you doing? The battle is over. There’s no more fighting. Go back and recuperate.”","“Brother Jian, is there really nothing else you need to do?” Chen Qing asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Of course not. Your top priority now is to recover from your injuries to avoid any hidden injuries.”","The battle finally ended, close to 2,000 Yan Immortals were buried in the void battlefield.","In the end, the Six Heavens Realm was preserved, but its foundation had been completely destroyed. Only 1,000 top cultivators were left.","Prince Qian who came to help was also heavily injured, only 3 out of the 100 Yan Immortals he brought were left.","However, not only did he not lament, he was extremely excited.","Using a mere 200 plus Yan Immortals to fight against 2,000 plus Yan Immortals, and finally defending the Six Heavens Realm, this was an impossible battle, but in the end, it really happened.","Prince Qian was excited because he saw the hidden power of the Six Heavens Realm.","His gamble this time was the right one!","If he made the right bet, it meant that from now on, he would no longer have to do things according to Prince Jiu’s wishes. His Ethereal Immortal Province would also be temporarily safe.","However, Prince Qian was still a little worried. The Six Heavens Realm had already declined and it was unknown whether it could take care of the Ethereal Immortal Province in the future.","Thinking of this, he still felt a little regretful. If he had come a few days later, he would not have been able to catch up with this war...","After the battle ended, the top cultivators who had been sent far away returned to the Six Heavens Realm.","After experiencing such a great battle, every top cultivator had completely transformed and matured.","If he wanted to survive in such a bloody battle, he had to become stronger to have a chance of survival.","The Yan Immortal stage was their ultimate goal.","The six days returned to silence, and it was still cold.","Sitting on the roof of the rebuilt Heavenly Palace, Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and meditated.","In this fierce battle, he had obtained his strongest Sword Intent, and his Sword Dao had also reached the stage of perfectionstage.","Once the Wushuang Sword Dao was perfected, Jian Wushuang would enter the Sword Immortal stage.","At that time, he would probably be able to fight a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang, who had obtained his strongest Sword Intent, was not happy at the moment. He even sat on the roof of the Heavenly Palace expressionlessly.","Countless terrifying Yan power surged around his body. At the same time, he quickly swallowed several Emperor-grade pills.","He was trying his best to recover to his peak and was even trying to break through!","All the Yan power that was born in Little Lonely Heaven was gathering towards him, and the world was changing.","After an unknown period of time, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and could not help but reveal a trace of disappointment.","“Could it be that there’s no way to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal realm?”","Jian Wushuang was indeed trying to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal realm, but he failed in the end.","The failure this time was far more terrifying than any previous failure to break through the realm.","Because the situation this time was completely different.","As a Perfect Life Form, it was extremely difficult for him to break through and advance. Similarly, once he succeeded in breaking through, he would completely crush his enemies at the same level.","Although the path to breakthrough was extremely difficult, it was not without a path.","If one were to describe each cultivation realm as an ethereal and unknown cloud, although it was within sight but not within reach, there was still a path that could be comprehended.","However, Jian Wushuang felt that he could not make any more breakthroughs in his cultivation realm!","This was because he had already reached the end of his path in cultivation.","After the Yan Immortal stage, there was no more stage to break through!","Cold sweat dripped down from Jian Wushuang’s temples.","He had never thought that his path of advancement would stop at the Yan Immortal stage. As for the Grand Yan Immortal stage, he had no sense of it at all.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with bitterness. He knew the reason.","He came from the Divine Power Universe and did not belong to the cultivation system of the Great Yan Domain at all. This was despite him cutting off his past in the mortal world and obtaining Yan power.","However, in the end, it was unable to produce an Immortal Source.","Without an Immortal Source, it meant that he would never be able to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","“There must be another way. This is definitely not my destination.”","Slowly exhaling a mouthful of turbid breath, Jian Wushuang’s gaze gradually became firm.","Since there was a mountain but no path in front of him, he would forcefully open up a path!","If he could not even open a path, then there was no harm in destroying the mountain in front of him!","However, he would probably be in an extremely passive position in his next plan.","Initially, Jian Wushuang had planned to break through to the Yan Immortal stage and ascend to the Grand Yan Immortal stage with all his might during this period of time. However, he had not been able to do so."]},{"number":4930,"title":"Chapter 4930 Entering the Endless Sea","paragraphs":["4930 Entering the Endless Sea","He was temporarily unable to reach the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","However, this concerned his decision to go to the Endless Sea.","Originally, he had planned to go to the Endless Sea to find Di Qing after breaking through to the Grand Yan Immortal stage to increase his chances of winning. However, everything was now filled with unknown.","However, even so, Jian Wushuang had already made the decision to go to the Endless Sea.","Di Qing had been exiled because of him, so bringing him out was something he had to do.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang threw all his worries to the back of his mind and left Little Lonely Heaven in a flash.","Jian Wushuang had already arrived in front of the Big Lonely Heaven’s Heavenly Palace. He stepped on the clouds and entered the palace quickly.","The thin purple-robed man seemed to have been waiting for a long time. When he saw Jian Wushuang, he went up to him and cupped his hands. “Master Jian, the Young Emperor is not feeling well. I’m afraid he can’t see you.”","Jian Wushuang frowned and said, “I only want to ask him one thing.”","“Lord Jian, the Young Emperor is not feeling well. I’m afraid he won’t be able to see you.” The thin and small purple-robed man was still blocking in front of him, obviously not planning to let him in.","“I’m afraid he’s not sick at all.” Jian Wushuang looked straight at the thin purple-robed man and said seriously, “He doesn’t want to see me?”","The thin and small purple-robed man’s gaze was slightly evasive. Then, he slowly said, “Lord Jian, actually, His Highness doesn’t want you to go there...”","Before he could finish his words, he was interrupted by the Young Emperor who walked out from the depths of the Heavenly Palace.","“Da Ban, you may leave.”","The thin purple-robed man nodded and left.","“Come in and sit. It’s not that I don’t want to see you,” the Young Emperor said faintly.","Jian Wushuang did not care. He urgently needed to know how to get to the Endless Sea.","“How do we go to the Endless Sea?” he quickly walked forward and asked directly.","The Young Emperor did not turn around. He seemed to be thinking about something and finally said, “I don’t want you to go there.”","“But you know I have to go,” Jian Wushuang countered.","The Young Emperor turned around and suddenly reached out to hold his arms tightly. He then said, “One Hua year is very fast. Can you not go?”","“He only needs to wait one Hua Year. With his ability, he will definitely be safe and sound.”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang pushed his palm away without hesitation. He shook his head and said firmly, “One Hua Year is too long. It’s long enough for even the Heavenly Dao to collapse.”","“Di Qing was exiled to the Endless Sea because of me. I must bring him out of there, or else I won’t be able to feel at ease.”","“If he didn’t help me, then the one being banished to the Endless Sea would be me.”","The Young Emperor said in a hoarse voice, “But do you know what is imprisoned in the Endless Sea? That was the source of the chaos in the realm in the past. Even my Imperial Father didn’t dare to relax when he entered the Endless Sea, do you understand?”","“I might as well tell you now that once you’re banished to the Endless Sea, you’re practically already sentenced to death.”","Jian Wushuang’s face remained calm and he said calmly, “Even so, I have to go.”","“Then let me tell you, once you go in, there’s a 99 percent chance that you’ll die inside,” the Young Emperor’s eyes revealed nervousness and solemnity.","“I have to go,” he said firmly.","Hearing this reply, the Young Emperor did not say anything else. It was as if he had lost most of his strength as he sat on the jade steps.","A moment later, he said, “The Endless Sea has a form but no substance. It’s a place that is separated from the void and reality. Even a Grand Yan Immortal would be lost in it.”","“The Endless Sea doesn’t have a real exit, or perhaps only my Imperial Father knows the exit. But now, the key to the Endless Sea is in your hands.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was moved. He reached out and took out the golden jade ring that contained Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s True Shadow.","This was given to him by the Young Emperor when he went to Great Mi Heaven. It had saved his life in the void battleground.","Jian Wushuang rubbed the golden jade ring in his hand and could not help but say, “Can I go to the Endless Sea with this?”","“Yes.” The Young Emperor nodded. “This ring contains my Imperial Father’s aura. It can open that passageway.”","“How do I use it?”","“Follow me.”","...","In the void, Jian Wushuang stood in a dark place, dressed as a ranger and wearing a loose black robe.","Beside him were the Young Emperor and the thin purple-robed man.","The three figures were like three ancient statues. The void wind could not affect them at all.","“Has it been decided?” The Young Emperor turned to look at him.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said no more.","Then, he slowly stretched out his palm. The golden jade ring emitted a unique and magnificent light in the chaotic void.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang threw the ring into the void.","In an instant, the void suddenly collapsed and tore apart.","Thousands of brilliant lights burst out from the golden jade ring, illuminating a large area of the void.","That flowing light was the Imperial Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","They directly tore through the void and constructed an endless passage.","The galaxy swirled, and mottled stars shone in the passage.","The passage to the Endless Sea was opened!","“Ahead is the Endless Sea,” the Young Emperor said weakly.","Jian Wushuang nodded and prepared to step in.","At the same time, the Young Emperor quietly reached out and grabbed his right arm, looking at him silently.","“Don’t worry. As long as I don’t want to die, I’ll definitely come back safely,” Jian Wushuang looked at him and said. Then, he reached out his hand and pushed his palm away.","Stepping into the passageway, the void trembled instantly, and then the huge galaxy passageway slowly closed.","The black robe finally disappeared into the passageway, never to be seen again.","The void was flattened by the astral winds, and it was as if nothing had happened.","“Da Ban, did I harm him?”","His voice was hoarse and slightly sorrowful.","The thin purple-robed figure also moved slightly. After a long while, he said, “Your Highness, you shouldn’t have let him in. Even if Lord Jian is a Heaven’s Favorite, he probably won’t be able to walk out of there alive.”","“After all, that place is a completely unknown territory.”","“I regret it. I don’t want him to leave...”","The Young Emperor looked at the passageway that had been smoothed out and slowly closed his eyes.","...","The galaxy surged and everything was like a river formed by stars. Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the tide and rushed to the end of the passage.","The star river passage was not as dangerous as Jian Wushuang had imagined. It could even be said to be very calm, like a quiet river.","However, the more this was the case, the more he could not be careless. The realm that could make Di Qing extremely afraid was far from being as calm as it appeared.","As they entered the passageway, everything was just the beginning."]},{"number":4931,"title":"Chapter 4931 Ranch of the Exiled (1)","paragraphs":["4931 Ranch of the Exiled (1)","The turbulent undercurrents were often hidden under the calm surface of the water.","Jian Wushuang had long known this sentence and soon encountered it.","He had never thought that everything would happen so quickly that he was caught off guard.","...","Above the dark and endless water, a giant beast with 10 fierce eyes was roaring furiously.","In front of this ugly beast, a figure with clear eyes and majestic divine patterns was confronting it from afar.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s face was cold and he had been complaining in his heart.","He never thought that he could memorize the location to such an extent.","As soon as he descended from the passage, the endless black sea suddenly split apart. Then, an ugly beast with ten heads opened its huge mouth and swallowed him.","If Jian Wushuang had not been on guard, he would have fallen into the giant beast’s mouth.","Jian Wushuang felt a headache when he saw the black halo on the head of the beast.","Because only Five Revolutions and above Grand Yan Immortals would condense their own Yan power halos, it was a symbol of a cultivation realm.","Jian Wushuang had never thought that he would provoke such a mighty beast as soon as he stepped into the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang was able to deal with a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, but the situation was not so optimistic for a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","He would probably have to fight with his life.","However, if he had to fight his life right after stepping into the Endless Sea, the road ahead would probably be even more impossible.","What Jian Wushuang needed to do now was to preserve his best physical strength.","Facing such a huge beast, he finally understood why the Young Emperor had stopped him from entering this place.","What exactly was imprisoned in this so-called Endless Sea?","On the dark and thick sea, the giant beast raised its ten heads and let out a deafening roar.","Jian Wushuang felt his body pause for a moment.","It was also at this moment that the giant beast suddenly spread its forelimbs and pounced over with a thick force.","The sky shook and Jian Wushuang hurriedly released his Ancestral Skill.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate reappeared, and a huge finger that reached the sky came down.","However, the giant beast only raised its head and allowed the Ancestral Skill to land on its body.","Rumble!","The sea area was violent, stirring up huge waves. The Ancestral Skill that grew along with Jian Wushuang’s growth did not stop the giant beast for even a moment!","Caught off guard, Jian Wushuang was suddenly knocked back a distance of 10,000 feet!","A deep ravine was plowed out of the clouds. He barely managed to stop after he had traveled a million feet.","Jian Wushuang held back the surging blood in his heart and became serious.","The strength of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal had already far exceeded his imagination, this huge beast would most likely have a hard time fighting it with all its might.","If this continued, it would definitely be detrimental to the situation.","Jian Wushuang felt a little frustrated at the thought of this. He took out an Emperor-grade pill from his bosom and stuffed it into his mouth to chew.","“We have no grudges against each other. There’s no need to fight to the death. You can’t do anything to me for a while, so why don’t you let me go?”","Jian Wushuang tried to communicate with the beast.","A total of 10 heads and 20 pairs of eyes stared at him.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to fight, the 10 heads of the giant beast spoke.","His voice was hoarse and deep.","“Exiled One, what did you eat just now?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned but he quickly understood what the beast meant. Then, he took out an Emperor-grade pill and waved it in the air.","Instantly, an extremely rich medicinal fragrance completely dissipated in the air.","Every single one of these Emperor-grade pills was a treasure that Emperor Liu Ya had collected in the past.","The medicinal fragrance was so dense that it could not be rejected. It filled almost every inch of the sky.","The beast’s eyes widened.","Gulp...","The earth-shattering sound of its stomach twitching resounded throughout the wilderness. It was clearly extremely greedy.","“Give, give it to me...”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Of course I can give it to you, but you have to let me go and don’t bother me anymore.”","“I, I promise you!” The giant beast’s eyes were bloodshot, and it was drooling.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang flicked his finger and shot the pill thousands of feet away.","In an instant, the giant beast also chased after it.","He took advantage of this opportunity to fly 30,000 meters away.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief when he felt the intimidating aura disappear. At the same time, he did not know whether to laugh or cry.","Just relying on a pill to trick a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal away was truly inconceivable.","However, before the smile on his face could freeze, an extremely fast sound of air being torn rang out from behind him.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly turned around and saw that the giant beast had appeared again!","“What do you want? Didn’t we already agree?” he said solemnly.","When the giant beast heard this, it smacked its lips in a human-like manner. Then, it stretched out its huge front paw and pointed at its head.","“Do you have more? I have ten heads. One pill is not enough.”","Jian Wushuang frowned and said, “Do you think I have a lot of pills of this level? The one I gave you was the last one.”","The giant beast smacked its lips and looked at him unwillingly, as if it was considering the truth of his words.","After a while, the giant beast said, “Then you can leave. Don’t let me see you again, and don’t appear in my territory again.””","Jian Wushuang flew away and disappeared in an instant.","This time, the giant beast did not chase after him.","It was lying on the surface of the sea that was as thick as ink, and its ten big heads seemed to be thinking about something.","“How strange. How could such a weak outcast be exiled here? Could it be that he has done too many evil things in the past?”","As the giant beast pondered, it quickly dove into the pitch-black sea, turning into a line in the water and swimming forward.","...","Jian Wushuang did not stop flying for hundreds of millions of miles until he felt that there was no longer any aura chasing him. He then let out a long sigh.","The aura of that Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was too terrifying, if he continued to fight, he would be heavily injured.","Fortunately, he had completely escaped the control of that aura.","However, Jian Wushuang did not let his guard down. He quickly found some elixirs that could conceal his aura from the Emperor-grade pills he brought. After swallowing them, he continued to observe everything in front of him.","The so-called Endless Sea meant that there was no boundary to the sea.","And that was the case right now. The sea which was as thick as ink was like a mirror that extended to an unknown place, and he had no reference at all.","It was desolate and deathly silent."]},{"number":4932,"title":"Chapter 4932 Ranch of the Exiled (2)","paragraphs":["4932 Ranch of the Exiled (2)","Jian Wushuang tried to release his Yan power to touch the Endless Sea below him.","He saw that the Yan power that entered the water was swallowed up immediately. At the same time, countless black chains emerged from the water and shot toward him.","Jian Wushuang turned pale with fright. He hurriedly leaped into the sky to avoid being dragged into the sea by the black chain.","Looking at the sea that had returned to silence, he heaved a sigh of relief and began to secretly rejoice that he had not carelessly stepped into the sea just now.","At the same time, it also made Jian Wushuang understand that the hidden dangers in the Endless Sea were definitely much more than what was revealed.","Most likely, those who could be trapped here were at least at the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","After dodging the ten-headed beast, Jian Wushuang did not dare to act rashly. He swallowed an Emperor-grade pill that could stabilize his aura and flew forward at a constant speed.","Previously, he had learned from the Young Emperor that the Endless Sea was formless, shapeless, and ethereal. It was hard to tell if it was a real existence or just an illusion.","This increased the difficulty for Jian Wushuang.","If it was really as the Young Emperor said, the Endless Sea had a form but no substance, and it could transform between shapeless and a state of no substance.","That meant that it was very likely to be infinitely large, and could even stuff a universe into it!","This was undoubtedly a difficult problem. It was basically impossible to find Di Qing in this seemingly endless ocean.","However, Jian Wushuang only pondered for a moment before he resolutely rushed forward.","He did not notice that there was an undulating water line following him in the sea below him...","“Damn it, is there no land in the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang, who had flown far away, was speechless.","With his current speed, he had probably flown over the distance of thousands of Heavenly Region Planes, but he still had not found a single piece of land.","This even made him suspect that he was not making any progress.","Not only was there no land here, but there wasn’t even a trace of Yan power, which made him a little solemn.","Just as Jian Wushuang was moving forward, an extremely abrupt cry for help came from below.","“Help... Help...”","He looked down and could not help but feel a chill in his heart.","On the surface of the water which was as thick as ink, an extremely weak figure was floating. The man used all his strength to push open the water surface, trying to escape from the sea while shouting for help.","Even Jian Wushuang felt an indescribable strangeness when such a strange scene appeared in the extremely silent Endless Sea.","Almost 99 percent of the people who were exiled in the Endless Sea were extremely evil. If Jian Wushuang was moved by compassion and saved them, he might fall into a great passive situation.","Thinking of this, he no longer hesitated and prepared to leave.","However, the figure that was floating in the sea shouted at this moment, “Help! The True Immortal in the sky, save me!”","Jian Wushuang could not help but look at the figure.","When their eyes met, he was completely shocked.","The figure floating in the sea was none other than Di Qing, who had been exiled by Zhen Wuyang!","“Di Qing?”","After Jian Wushuang confirmed that it was Di Qing in the Sea Area, he immediately descended from the clouds and prepared to help.","Di Qing, who was floating in the sea area, was overjoyed when he saw Jian Wushuang landing.","At this critical moment, the crystal-like surface of the sea suddenly surged with tens of thousands of waves!","Jian Wushuang, who was about to touch Di Qing, felt that the sky in front of him was covered by darkness.","The sea was split apart, and a giant beast that looked like a divine mountain leaped out high.","It had ten heads, and each of them was like a huge sun. It was extremely terrifying.","At this moment, the ten giant capitals opened their mouths and swallowed Di Qing.","The terrifying aura that belonged to a Six Revolutions Grand Immortal sent Jian Wushuang flying.","“You’re courting death!”","He was furious. He thought that he had completely escaped from the beast, but it was still following behind him. It had even swallowed Di Qing, whom he was looking for. How could he not be furious?","However, the giant beast that swallowed Di Qing did not know what was going on and even burped in satisfaction.","Jian Wushuang was completely enraged. He condensed an Invisible Sword and stabbed it at the giant beast.","This was a supreme sword strike, a sword strike that was completely detached from the Wushuang Sword Dao.","This was Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi’s ultimate sword move.","Indomitable!","Ding!","The clearest sword hum resounded through the wilderness, and an unimaginable explosion exploded.","Such a sword strike broke through the beast’s energy diffraction barrier and pierced into one of its heads.","Boom!","The Sword Intent swept through the air and directly shattered a sun-like head.","In pain, the giant beast was shocked and furious. It opened its mouth and spat out a wave of energy.","The full-strength attack of the Six Revolutions Grand Immortal hit Jian Wushuang and sent him flying a million feet away!","The Yan power protecting his Immortal body shattered. As he retreated, he spat out divine blood and finally stopped.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at his slightly caved-in chest. He could not help but become serious.","The full-strength attack of a Six Grand Yan Immortal was too terrifying, if he was not wearing the Nine Heavens Mystic Robe, his immortal body would have shattered!","Vast Yan power filled every inch of space and the giant beast’s divine mountain-like figure appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","There were originally ten heads, but now only nine were left.","It shook off the divine blood on its black mane and said in a low voice, “Junior, do you know that I’m saving you?”","“Save me? Do you know that you have swallowed the person I am looking for?”","Jian Wushuang wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth and said coldly, “Spit him out!”","“Spit him out? That guy turned into my nutrients the moment I swallowed him,” the giant beast said fiercely. “Now, you’ll also pay the price. Obediently fall into my stomach!”","After it finished speaking, the remaining nine heads roared at this moment.","The air stagnated and Jian Wushuang was trapped for a moment.","Then, the giant beast roared and rushed over. The clouds were torn apart by its huge claws.","Although he was extremely furious, Jian Wushuang did not lose his mind. He could not fight against a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","If he were to risk his life without caring about anything, the final outcome was very likely to be his death.","Di Qing had already been swallowed by the giant beast. What Jian Wushuang needed to do now was not to risk his life but to find a way to leave this place.","Jian Wushuang released his full strength and barely blocked the beast’s attack. He did not plan to continue fighting and immediately escaped!"]},{"number":4933,"title":"Chapter 4933 Ranch of the Exiled (3)","paragraphs":["4933 Ranch of the Exiled (3)","Even if Jian Wushuang could cross realms and fight, more than three Grand Evolution Immortals had fallen at his hands.","However, facing such a vicious Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he was still unable to fight him.","Above Grand Yan Immortal, every Three Revolutions was a complete transformation, from Three Revolutions to Six Revolutions was a huge change.","The giant beast could easily break Jian Wushuang’s Ancestral Skill or even Immortal Style, which made it extremely difficult for him.","If it was not for the fact that Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens had taken most of the damage, Jian Wushuang would not have been able to fight.","The thick and all-pervasive Yan power made him suffer greatly. It gave Jian Wushuang the illusion that the beast in front of him was not a beast but a Great Yan Immortal who had experienced hundreds of battles.","If they continued to fight, he would only be exhausted by the giant beast.","After Jian Wushuang figured out the problem, he used the Wushuang Sword Dao to force him to retreat and then fled quickly!","“You want to leave?”","The giant beast’s eyes narrowed. It was clear that it was also determined to kill. Its nine huge mouths spat out pitch-black pillars of light at the same time.","The nine pillars merged into one and shot up into the sky, directly hitting Jian Wushuang’s back.","Boom!","The unparalleled power exploded. He had no way to dodge and had completely taken the blow!","At this moment, the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens burst out with the most magnificent blue color and protected Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","But even so, the vast Yan power still knocked him out in an instant, and he fell headfirst into the sea that was as thick as ink.","“I seem to have used too much strength...”","The giant beast shook its head and said. Then, it looked at the figure that had fallen into the sea and pounced over.","When his Immortal body entered the water, an unimaginable coldness invaded his body and he fainted.","The giant beast flew over and was about to open its mouth to swallow Jian Wushuang. However, dark chains as thick as arms stretched out from the sea and quickly wrapped around Jian Wushuang’s limbs, dragging him away.","Seeing these chains, the giant beast seemed to be facing a great enemy. Fear flashed in its eyes.","However, this fear only lasted for a moment. Then, it opened its huge mouth and bit at Jian Wushuang, who had fainted.","However, the chains were so fast that the beast missed.","The chain wrapped around Jian Wushuang and he went directly to the bottom of the sea. Soon, he disappeared without a trace.","The giant beast roared in anger, but in the end, there was nothing it could do.","...","The coldness, deathly stillness, and all kinds of unpredictable negative effects invaded Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","He barely had some consciousness, but he could not use a trace of Yan power. He could only let the chains drag him into the endless abyss.","He forced his eyes open and soon fainted again.","Clank...","The sound of the iron chains rubbing against the rocks was so loud that it made one’s teeth ache. It was mixed with the whistling sound of the water and echoed in Jian Wushuang’s ears.","He only felt the seawater slapping against his back. Beneath him was solid land.","After an unknown period of time, Jian Wushuang finally woke up when there was a flow of Yan power in his meridians.","He used his hands to prop up his immortal body that was about to fall apart and barely sat on the ground.","At this moment, he realized that he was on solid land.","“So there’s actually and in this Endless Sea area.”","He was a little surprised, but he quickly regained his composure.","Under the last attack of the giant beast, even though Jian Wushuang had the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, he still received the most serious injury.","Even though his Immortal body was not broken, his meridians were almost broken. It was difficult for him to even circulate his Yan power.","Beneath him was a grayish-white land, and there were no abnormal fluctuations.","Jian Wushuang seized every second to sit up.","In this strange Endless Sea, he had to maintain his peak condition in order to leave this place alive.","It was only at this moment that Jian Wushuang realized that the one who was swallowed by the giant beast was not Di Qing.","That figure seemed to have used some kind of secret technique to change his face into Di Qing’s appearance to confuse him.","Moreover, the way the figure acted also confirmed Jian Wushuang’s thoughts.","Di Qing was so proud that he could even remain calm in front of Zhen Wuyang. How could he lose his composure in such a situation?","At the same time, it was impossible for him to be swallowed by the giant beast without any struggle.","After thinking it through, Jian Wushuang swallowed another Emperor-grade pill and recovered with all his might.","With the nourishment of the pills, the recovery speed of the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was extremely fast.","In less than half a day, Jian Wushuang had recovered more than 90 percent.","He slowly opened his eyes, and divine patterns flowed around his body. Then, he lowered his head to look at the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens that was emitting a faint blue light.","“What material is this thing made of? It’s actually so heaven-defying?” Jian Wushuang murmured.","The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens that could block a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s full-force attack did not even leave a mark, it might really be able to block an Emperor’s full-force attack.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and began to size up the continent.","Rather than calling this place a continent, it would be more appropriate to call it an isolated island.","The grayish-white rocks under their feet were full of potholes, and there was not a single weed growing. It was extremely desolate and lonely.","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang walked into the depths of the isolated island.","“Hehehe, another reckless fellow has come.”","An ethereal voice suddenly sounded in Jian Wushuang’s ears.","He was shocked and looked directly at a protruding boulder beside him.","Then, a short old man in a thick fur coat walked out from behind the boulder.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed as he saw the thick chain around the elder’s neck.","“That kid, you were also exiled here?” The elder in thick fur coat sized up Jian Wushuang as if he was looking at a treasure.","Even though he was trying to hold it in, Jian Wushuang could still tell that something was wrong with him.","“Yes, I was exiled here,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The old man nodded. “Then do you know where this is?”","“Where am I?”","A strange smile appeared on his face, revealing his blood-red gums. “Then let me tell you that this is a fallen paradise. Every guy who comes here only has two paths.”","“Be killed or survive!”","“This is a free-for-all, Ranch of the Exiled!”","The old man slowly raised his arms and said with a strange smile.","As his voice fell, a terrifying energy belonging to a Grand Yan Immortal spread out.","“Even though you’re just a puny little Yan Immortal, to me, it’s enough,” the old man said greedily.","In the next moment, he dashed toward Jian Wushuang and slapped down with his palm."]},{"number":4934,"title":"Chapter 4934 The Old Shepherd","paragraphs":["4934 The Old Shepherd","Faced with the attack of an early-stage Grand Evolution Immortal, Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and 30,000 Sword Intents surged out of his palm.","In the next moment, he directly faced the Grand Yan Immortal!","Boom!","A sudden explosion sounded in the air. The two Ancestral Skills were completely transformed into one punch, and the explosion produced was extremely powerful.","Then, there was a scream.","The old man, who was like a ferocious wolf, was sent flying by Jian Wushuang’s punch.","Jian Wushuang did not expect this. He was confused as he looked at the elder who flew thousands of feet away and then crashed heavily on the ground.","This old man who was clearly at the Grand Yan Immortal stage was a little too weak.","Jian Wushuang felt that if he had used more strength, he could have directly smashed the old man.","Puzzled, he flew over to the old man who was lying on the ground.","The old man panted heavily and his face was covered in divine blood. When he saw Jian Wushuang walking over, he hurriedly got up and retreated. There was only fear in his eyes.","“You, who exactly are you, how can a mere Yan Immortal have such strength?” he covered his face and said in a trembling voice.","“I’m the man who will kill you!” Jian Wushuang said coldly and raised his palm.","Jian Wushuang had never shown any mercy to his enemies.","When the old man heard this, his face turned ashen. Then, he directly knelt down with a thud. “I beg you to raise your hand and let me go. I’ve lived in this Endless Sea for countless years. I only want to be able to leave alive one day.”","“As long as Sir can spare my life, I’m willing to do anything.”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his palm and stopped killing.","“Tell me, where is this place? Have any unfamiliar faces come here these days?”","The old man looked as if he had been pardoned. “Sir, this place is called Ranch of the Exiled. I don’t know when it was created, but the one who created this place is still alive and is in charge of maintaining order here.”","“This place is called the Ranch of the Exiled because there are a large number of exiles gathered here. If we want to survive, we can only fight endlessly.”","“The dead Grand Yan Immortals were used to fill the ground beneath their feet to stabilize this place.”","As he said this, the old man pointed at the chain around his neck, “Only by killing a certain number of Grand Yan Immortals can the chain be unlocked and you can survive here.”","“How many have you killed?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and said.","“I’m ashamed. Not a single one,” the old man said with shame, “I just want to continue living.”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang asked again, “Have you seen any unfamiliar faces in the past few days? He was tall and looked very valiant. There were golden feathers in his hair.”","Listening to his description, the old man pondered for a moment, then shook his head and said, “Sir, this Endless Sea is almost a pool of stagnant water. In recent years, no one has been exiled to enter. The person you described definitely could not have come here.”","A flash of disappointment flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Then, he turned around and prepared to leave.","“Sir, this Ranch of the Exiled is dangerous. Please don’t stay here any longer and leave as soon as possible!” The old man quickly stepped forward and gritted his teeth. “The sooner, the better.”","Although Jian Wushuang was a little confused, he could tell that he was not lying.","He nodded and prepared to leave.","However, it was already too late.","Several black lights burst out from the surroundings and stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","A total of four figures with rich energy appeared. They locked onto this stranger in an instant.","Three short and one tall, three early-stage Grand Yan Immortals and one Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, each of them had extremely abundant derivation energy.","However, their eyes were all red, as if they had seen prey.","The old man’s expression changed drastically and he said in a low voice, “Sir, let’s leave quickly. If we don’t leave now, we really won’t be able to leave.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned grave. If he was facing a single Grand Yan Immortal, he would not be afraid at all. However, now that he was facing four Grand Yan Immortals, the situation was not optimistic.","At this moment, the tallest Grand Yan Immortal among the four saw the old man beside Jian Wushuang and sneered, “So you, the Old Shepherd, dare to attack? This is your prey? A new exiled person?”","The old man who was called Old Shepherd gritted his teeth and said nothing. Finally, he said, “That’s right. This is my prey. You can leave.”","The four Grand Yan Immortals laughed at the same time, “You, an Old Shepherd, dare to speak like this? Your prey?”","The tallest Grand Yan Immortal walked out and waved his hand across the air. Immediately, the unparalleled Yan energy sent him flying.","The old man flew a thousand feet away like a kite with a broken string, then fell to the ground.","Everything happened too quickly. By the time Jian Wushuang reacted, the four Grand Evolution Immortals had already rushed toward him.","Four unparalleled flows of energy exploded in a corner of the continent.","The air trembled, clearly unable to withstand the might of a Grand Yan Immortal.","In the next moment, a seven-star galaxy appeared between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River.","The current Little Mountain River was no longer the Little Mountain River from before. It had grown along with Jian Wushuang’s growth.","He suddenly opened his five fingers and burst out a huge torrent!","The Yan power turned into a torrent and gushed out. Caught off guard, it swept away the three Grand Yan Immortals who were at the front.","Rumble!","The torrent exploded, causing the four Grand Yan Immortals to be in a sorry state.","After stopping, the shortest Grand Yan Immortal was furious, “Damn it, I will definitely kill you today!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he suddenly condensed a long spear in his hand and threw it at Jian Wushuang.","The long spears expanded in the wind and split into thousands in an instant. They came at him like a rain of spears.","Jian Wushuang did not panic at all when he saw this scene. He quietly condensed an Invisible Sword in his hand.","He stood with his sword in hand, the wind blowing at the corner of his clothes, making him look desolate and lonely.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","The sword slashed out without any fancy moves.","In an instant, a million Sword Intents descended from the sky!","The rain of nearly a thousand spears that came at them were shattered when they came into contact with the Sword Intents. Not even a trace of their aura was left behind.","Moreover, that sword strike did not lose its momentum as it surged forward, tearing the land under its feet apart.","The short Grand Yan Immortal who was the first to bear the brunt was shocked. He had never thought that this sword strike would be so terrifying.","The Sword Intents were like a mountain or a sea, instantly wrapping him up.","The other three Grand Yan Immortals dodged in time and watched this scene with trepidation."]},{"number":4935,"title":"Chapter 4935 Four Grand Yan Immortals","paragraphs":["4935 Four Grand Yan Immortals","The entire Endless Sea was stirred up by this unbridled Sword Intent, and huge waves of a million feet were set off, almost bordering the sky.","The three Grand Yan Immortals who had dodged looked at the sword curtain that was surging crazily and then looked at Jian Wushuang with lingering fear.","How could this guy who could fight a Grand Yan Immortal be a Yan Immortal?!","Could it be that he was a powerful existence who had been banished for countless years and had deliberately disguised himself as a Yan Immortal to come here?","Thinking of this, they all put away their contempt and prepared for a battle.","The Sword Intent that blotted out the sky finally dissipated.","When the three Grand Yan Immortals saw this scene, they all sucked in a breath of cold air.","The clothes of that short Grand Yan Immortal were torn to shreds, his entire body was covered in blood and there was not a single piece of flesh on his immortal body.","He was on the verge of collapsing, and his body was about to lose its balance.","“You, who exactly are you?”","He suddenly spat out a large mouthful of divine blood. He was terrified to the extreme.","With just one sword, he had forced a Grand Yan Immortal to such an extent, and he was even able to do it so easily. This was something that even a rank three Grand Yan Immortal could not do.","The other three Grand Yan Immortals retreated without leaving a trace, their gazes solemn.","The old man wiped his nose and hurriedly sat up from the ground. His eyes widened as he watched this scene.","Putting away the Invisible Sword, Jian Wushuang put his hands behind his back and walked forward calmly.","Facing the four Grand Yan Immortals, although he appeared extremely calm, he was already sweating profusely internally.","After all, he was facing four Grand Yan Immortals. If he did not suppress them with his aura, it would probably be impossible for him to escape.","Regardless of whether he could win or not, he had to intimidate them first.","“You dare to block my way?” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, his voice filled with supreme authority.","The short Grand Yan Immortal who had almost died under that sword retreated. Although he wanted to take revenge, he did not dare to have any other thoughts. “If you don’t dare to block my path, you can leave immediately.”","When he heard this, he snorted coldly and looked straight ahead. He did not even look at the Grand Yan Immortals and directly moved forward.","None of the four Grand Yan Immortals dared to stop him. They could only watch Jian Wushuang leave.","Seeing that they were defeated, the elder grinned and rushed to Jian Wushuang.","“Sir, wait for me...”","The old man caught up with him, and a fawning smile appeared on his face. “You definitely don’t know how to leave this place. I guarantee that I’ll bring you out safely.”","Hearing his words, Jian Wushuang asked, “Why? Is it that we can only enter but not leave this mainland?”","The old man nodded. “Indeed, you can only enter but not leave. Once you leave, you’ll alert that person’s aura. At that time, if he makes a move, I’m afraid you won’t be able to leave.”","“The one you mentioned is very powerful?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Not only is he powerful, but he’s simply extremely powerful. He’s a supreme existence here. Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal can’t hurt him at all!” the old man said. There was fear in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything else. If what he said was true, the mysterious existence who created this continent had probably surpassed the level of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","“Could he be the Emperor?” He thought about it in his heart, but he quickly rejected this idea.","No matter how strong Zhen Wuyang was back then, he probably could not have sealed an Emperor.","Of course, it was just Jian Wushuang’s guess. He did not want to know the truth. The most important thing now was to leave this place as soon as possible.","...","“What about Big Brother? Did he really let that guy escape?!”","The few Grand Yan Immortals who were stunned by Jian Wushuang and did not dare to move began to discuss in low voices.","The Grand Yan Immortal who was almost sliced into a bloody gourd was indignant, “The four of us attacking together, I don’t believe that we can’t defeat him!”","“Idiot, do you know that you’re about to be beaten to death?” The tallest Grand Yan Immortal, who was also the only Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, said angrily. “If we rashly attack him, you will definitely be the first to die!”","“Then what do we do now? Are we really going to let him go?” Another short Grand Yan Immortal with two strands of beard said anxiously, “If we kill him, we can exchange it for merit.”","At this moment, a dark-faced and extremely calm Grand Yan Immortal said, “This little Grand Yan Immortal can’t even be exchanged for a single merit.”","“Second Brother, what did you say, is he really a Yan Immortal?” the tall Grand Yan Immortal hurriedly asked.","He nodded, “Although I don’t know what secret technique he used to beat Third Bro to this state, his aura can’t be changed. He’s undoubtedly a Yan Immortal.”","“Then what are we waiting for? Let’s just rush over and kill him to avenge me,” the Third Brother said fiercely.","The tall Grand Yan Immortal was thinking about something. He quickly gritted his teeth and said, “Damn it, no matter what, we can’t let go of this small merit. With just the four of us, I don’t believe that we can’t kill that guy. Even if we take a step back, he can’t do anything to us when the four of us are together!”","They looked at each other and directly rushed forward.","...","“Not good, Sir, those guys are catching up.”","The old man said hurriedly, but by the time Jian Wushuang reacted, it was already too late.","Four streaks of flowing light descended, blocking all his escape routes from four directions.","Seeing this, the old man’s legs trembled and he almost could not stand steadily.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. The thing he was most worried about had come.","The pressure released by the four Grand Yan Immortals was extremely terrifying, almost suppressing all auras.","Up until now, the lowest level of exiles he had encountered in this Endless Sea was the Grand Yan Immortal. This was something that was simply unimaginable in the outside world.","This also caused Jian Wushuang to be in a very passive situation.","With his arms crossed, the tall Grand Yan Immortal with a smile that was not a smile looked straight at him. “Brat, leave your life behind and I will spare your corpse.”","“Sir, you can’t listen to him. Once you lose, your Immortal body will be buried under the ground,” the old man reminded nervously.","“Old Shepherd, if you don’t go back to herding the sheep, I’ll bury you into the land as well,” the tall Grand Yan Immortal said angrily.","Jian Wushuang, who had been silent all this while, glanced at him and said calmly, “You need to take my life, but not everyone can take it. Try me.”","The tall Grand Yan Immortal smiled ferociously as his body’s energy surged out, instantly covering the sky and the sun.","“Then I will try today to see how much you can do!”","The calm Second Brother hurriedly reminded him, “Big Brother, don’t be rash.”","However, he waved his hand. “None of you are to participate in this battle!”"]},{"number":4936,"title":"Chapter 4936 Slash One, Slash Two","paragraphs":["4936 Slash One, Slash Two","Jian Wushuang was delighted.","As long as they did not attack together, he still had a chance of winning.","Jian Wushuang was confident that he could suppress a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal without using his strongest move.","Therefore, he was not afraid!","That tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal would definitely have to pay the price for his arrogance.","Waving his hand to keep his three brothers out of the battle, the tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal grinned hideously and looked at Jian Wushuang with greed in his eyes.","In the next moment, he took the initiative to make a move. The earth-shaking momentum of the Yan power was fully displayed at this moment.","Even Jian Wushuang held his breath.","The old man’s expression changed drastically. After taking a look at Jian Wushuang, he gritted his teeth and ran out of the battle.","Facing the extremely powerful energy, he did not move at all. He was like a statue, standing still.","This made the tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal extremely furious. He suddenly shook his arms and aimed them at Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, heaven and earth flourished, and layers of black ripples burst forth.","There were thousands of layers, and in the middle of each layer, mysterious runes flowed, surging with unimaginable power.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned solemn. He clenched his right fist and faced the black ripples that were enveloping him.","He punched out!","Boom!","An indescribable explosion spread out, and deep ravines appeared on the ground.","Time seemed to have stopped. Nearly a thousand black ripples stopped in front of Jian Wushuang, unable to move an inch further.","The three Grand Yan Immortals outside the battle circle watched this scene nervously.","Jian Wushuang did not retract his fist, but remained motionless.","The ground under his feet had already cracked into deep ravines, and like a spider web, they instantly spread out for thousands of feet.","In the next moment, the thousand-layer black ripples split open from the center of Jian Wushuang’s fist.","As if the dark clouds had dispersed, the great momentum of the Yan power shattered layer by layer!","The dark light dissipated and the tall Grand Yan Immortal looked at Jian Wushuang in horror.","This was his ultimate Immortal Style, even Grand Yan Immortals of the same realm had no choice but to avoid it.","But now, this was just a mere Yan Immortal and he actually blocked his Immortal Style?!","This was simply too unbelievable, so much so that the tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal did not dare to stop and released the second Immortal Style.","“Great Eye Wheel!”","He roared angrily, raising his arms above his head. At the same time, endless derivative energy gathered in his palms.","An eye wheel that was thousands of feet in size appeared at this moment!","Jian Wushuang retracted his fist and looked up at the void.","The black wheel that was completely formed by the Yan power was thousands of meters in size, and lightning snakes gathered inside.","As the energy gathered, the eye wheel looked like a demonic eye that could pierce through the sky and earth.","Under the cover of the eye wheel, everything became dim.","“Haha, ants, die for me!” The tall Grand Yan Immortal who was floating in the air laughed out loud.","As his voice rang out, the terrifying eye wheel between his arms slowly opened.","Countless strands of silk-like Yan power shot out from the eye wheel. The dark purple derivative energy swallowed the sky and covered the sun. It was extremely terrifying.","Under the light of the eye wheel, a layer of the ground was incinerated and it quickly approached Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was extremely solemn. In the next moment, a layer of blood traces suddenly condensed around his body.","The blood-red patterns were extremely demonic.","This was the Slaugher Dao, the Slaughter Dao that Sir Yuan had transformed from the blood essence hidden in his body.","It was an extreme killing intent.","Once the Slaughter Dao was activated, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness would fall into extreme thirst for blood. At the same time, his strength would far exceed the addition of the Selflss True Shadow.","Facing the demonic eye’s attack, he activated the Slaughter Dao.","At this moment, it was the battle between the scarlet and dark purple.","The ground that was covered by the dark purple intent suddenly condensed into a scarlet intent.","It was like a blazing red prairie, filled with an imposing aura. Even though the light beams cast by the eye wheel devoured the area, it still forcefully squeezed open a crack.","Jian Wushuang’s black robe had been completely torn, revealing his chest that was crisscrossed with scarlet divine patterns.","“Uhh-” he roared, and in the next moment, he flew into the sky with the endless dark purple Yan power!","Under his attack, all the energy beams were shattered.","Looking at the scarlet figure that tore a crack in the endless barrier and rushed towards him, the tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal was so frightened that he could not speak and even forgot to move.","Rumble!","Jian Wushuang threw a punch and the terrifying fist aura directly tore apart the last layer of the dark-purple energy diffraction barrier.","The fist aura expanded by a million feet in the wind, carrying endless killing intent. In the end, it bombarded the dark purple demonic eye without any obstruction.","This was a moment that made the sky dim as boundless killing intent pierced into the demonic eye like True Swords.","There was no magnificent explosion. In fact, this scene only existed for an instant.","Then, everything disappeared like a fleeting cloud.","The demonic eye that was millions of feet tall was smashed into pieces. The tall Grand Yan Immortal was stunned on the spot and didn’t even have time to react.","By the time he reacted, the figure that was surrounded by scarlet light had already disappeared.","Then, he felt a sharp pain in his chest. Something had broken.","The tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal could only feel the energy in his Immortal body flowing rapidly, unable to condense again.","He subconsciously looked down at his chest.","He saw a palm break open his chest from behind and pluck out an extremely dazzling star.","That was an Immortal Source, an Immortal Source belonging to a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","In the next moment, he clenched his fist and shattered the Immortal Source.","“No, don’t...”","After the tall and strong Grand Yan Immortal said this last sentence, he completely lost all signs of life. Like trash, he fell straight to the ground.","With a rumbling sound, dust and smoke rose up. The corpse of the dead Grand Yan Immortal was absorbed by some kind of energy and turned into a grayish-white stone.","The world was deathly silent.","The old man’s mouth was wide open. Clearly, he was completely shocked by the scene just now.","The other three Grand Yan Immortals had yet to recover from that scene.","Just like that, their big brother died in the hands of a Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang threw away the shattered Immortal Source in his palm and looked at the remaining three Grand Yan Immortals with his red eyes.","He smiled devilishly, and the bloodlust in his heart was completely released.","“After killing one, we’ll have to kill the second one. None of you will be able to escape today.”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his palm and pointed at them one by one, as if he had sentenced them to death in advance.","The three Grand Yan Immortals trembled. After exchanging a glance, they immediately scattered in all directions!"]},{"number":4937,"title":"Chapter 4937 All Fallen","paragraphs":["4937 All Fallen","Jian Wushuang smiled devilishly again. “You want to leave? It’s too late!”","His body was like a bloodthirsty sword as he rushed forward!","A scarlet crack was torn open in the sky.","“Split up and go to the center!” the short Grand Yan Immortal with a calm face shouted. Then, the three Grand Yan Immortals split up.","Three streaks of light flew in three different directions.","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and disappeared.","A million miles in an instant. The Grand Yan Immortal who was running wildly turned his head to look. When he realized that there was no one chasing him, he let out a long sigh.","The scene just now was too shocking. Killing a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal by himself was too unbelievable and terrifying.","Even their big brother had been killed. If they did not escape, they would probably end up in an extremely miserable state.","The old Grand Yan Immortal thought so, but he soon realized that his body could not move, as if he had fallen into a quagmire.","” H-how is this possible?! ”","In the next moment, a figure with a biting cold killing intent quietly appeared behind him. He looked at him with a smile that was not a smile and then stretched out his hand to touch his back.","Swish...","A soft sound rang out as divine blood gushed out from the chest of the Grand Yan Immortal elder, sprinkling down to the Nine Heavens.","“No, impossible, I’m a Grand Yan Immortal, how could I die? I’ve endured countless years. How can I die now?”","This was the last thought that echoed in his mind. As the Immortal Source shattered, he followed in the footsteps of the tall Grand Yan Immortal, turning into a pile of bones.","“Second Brother!”","Two voices rang out in shock. The two Grand Yan Immortals who had been frantically running away stopped in their tracks as they looked at this scene with their eyes wide open.","Jian Wushuang threw away the Immortal Corpse in his hand as if he was throwing trash and looked at them with bloodshot eyes.","After killing the two Grand Yan Immortals, he realized that the Grand Yan Immortals on this island were nearly twice as weak as the real Grand Yan Immortals.","A Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal only had the strength of a Grand Yan Immortal at the initial stage.","Jian Wushuang did not know why this was the case, but it undoubtedly increased his chances of winning. It allowed him to face any Grand Yan Immortal with ease.","After killing another Grand Yan Immortal, he did not intend to let the remaining two Grand Yan Immortals go.","Furthermore, the two Grand Yan Immortals did not escape. Instead, they charged at Jian Wushuang furiously.","Heaven and earth shook, and the entire grayish-white land beneath him was once again split apart by the impact.","Facing the attacks of the two Grand Yan Immortals, Jian Wushuang was still undefeated even though it was a little strenuous.","The Invisible Sword in his hand had already turned scarlet. Wherever the blade passed, it plowed a deep gully in the ground.","The two short Grand Yan Immortals were in a difficult position. They thought that they could kill Jian Wushuang with their strength, but they were unable to move him at all.","The destruction caused by the Invisible Sword that carried the intent of slaughter was terrifying. Every Sword Qi that was slashed out was enough to split the earth.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang swung his sword at an extremely fast speed. Every sword strike carried 36,000 Sword Intents.","“Ah!”","One of the Grand Yan Immortals cried out in shock. His entire left arm was chopped off by the sword intent and turned into fine powder.","“Retreat quickly!” the other Grand Yan Immortal with a mustache exclaimed before turning around to flee.","But what welcomed him was a merciless sword strike.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","A million Sword Intents suddenly descended, like a river in the sky, directly tearing through the void and surging out.","Jian Wushuang stood at the head of the Sword River tide and faced the two fleeing Grand Yan Immortals. He casually threw the sword in his hand.","The invisible sword fell into the air and instantly disintegrated into countless Sword Intents. Each Sword Intent carried endless killing intent.","The dim sky was dyed red.","Looking at the boundless Sword Intent that blotted out the sky and covered the earth, the two Grand Yan Immortals’ faces turned ashen. Then, they were trapped by the Sword Intents.","Clouds of blood mist exploded in the sky, and the millions of Sword Intents finally dissipated.","At this point, the four Grand Yan Immortals had all fallen at Jian Wushuang’s hands.","As the Slaughter Dao retreated, Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the air, lost his balance and almost fell down.","He forcefully supported his body and quickly took out a few Emperor-grade pills from his bosom before stuffing them into his mouth.","The Slaughter Dao was so overbearing that even Jian Wushuang’s body was almost completely exhausted.","If he did not carry nearly a thousand Emperor-grade pills with him, he would definitely not have released the Slaughter Dao so easily.","After swallowing the pill and recovering 90 percent of his body, Jian Wushuang was ready to leave.","The battle with the four Grand Yan Immortals was too earth-shattering. It was likely that other Grand Yan Immortals would come over soon after hearing the news.","If he did not leave in time, he would probably get himself burned.","As if to confirm Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, when he was about to leave, a series of swift air-breaking sounds flew over from all directions.","A stream of light like the sun and stars quickly appeared with endless power.","At this moment, the old man lying on the ground revealed his head and said in horror, “Sir, you should quickly escape. That guard is here. You can’t be caught!”","Jian Wushuang knew that things were not looking good. He suddenly stopped and rushed forward.","However, no matter how fast he was, he could not outrun the encirclement of over ten Grand Yan Immortals.","After dozens of breaths, ten figures appeared. Ten Grand Yan Immortals surrounded Jian Wushuang from every direction.","They were all wearing loose black robes, and even their faces were hidden under the black robes. They were extremely mysterious.","Even so, Jian Wushuang instantly sensed that the lowest realm of each black-robed man was a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","The black-robed leader waved his hand, and a pitch-black bone whip that was dozens of feet long appeared in his hand.","The dark bone whip was like the spine of a giant beast. It was full of barbs. With the support of the Yan power, it looked extremely ferocious.","Most likely, a normal Yan Immortal would die from a single strike of that whip.","“Those who destroy the Heavenly Continent will be destroyed immediately.”","A deep voice rang out from under the black robe.","In the next moment, the leader of the black-robed men did not say another word. He raised the black bone whip in his hand and lashed it at Jian Wushuang.","The bone whip expanded to a thousand feet in the wind, and it roared like a dragon.","His heart suddenly froze. If this whip was really lashed, he would probably lose more than half of his combat strength on the spot.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to be careless. He retreated a thousand feet and waved his hand to release the Immortal Style.","A divine mountain appeared in the void without any warning and blocked the bone whip.","However, it only blocked for a moment before the dark bone whip broke through the divine mountain and pounced at Jian Wushuang as if it had its own intelligence."]},{"number":4938,"title":"Chapter 4938 Fighting the Ten Great Yan Immortals","paragraphs":["4938 Fighting the Ten Great Yan Immortals","The black bone whip expanded in the wind, and every black bone spike on it protruded out ferociously, surrounded by an endless amount of energy.","Even Jian Wushuang’s Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body could not withstand such a whip.","Seeing the arrival of these black-robed men, the old man lying on the ground was almost scared out of his wits and hurriedly fled.","These black-robed men were the envoys of that person, the true law enforcers of this so-called Heavenly Continent. If any Yan Immortal dared to destroy a piece of Heavenly Continent, they would be punished.","The lighter ones would be killed on the spot, and their Immortal bodies would fill the continent. The more serious ones would have their souls extracted and endure endless years of lashing and punishment.","Therefore, the Grand Yan Immortals in this Heavenly Continent did not dare to destroy even a little bit of the Heavenly Continent, even if they fought and killed. This was because if they destroyed it, there would be the most severe punishment.","But now, Jian Wushuang had killed four Grand Yan Immortals, and the Sword Intent he released almost tore apart the entire land.","The destructive power he had caused was too terrifying. It was as if the land had been overturned by him.","The ravine that was like a natural moat split the land into pieces. The pitch-black water was surging, and it was a scene of doomsday.","The Immortal Style that Jian Wushuang released only lasted for a moment before it was dispersed. Ten black-robed Grand Yan Immortals surrounded him from all directions.","Each of them held a black bone whip in their hands. As they waved their arms, the bone whip whipped toward Jian Wushuang like a True Dragon.","The ten bone whips expanded with the wind, blocking all the paths in all directions and closing in on the center.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to take it head-on.","Crack...","A fine sound rang out at this moment. Ten bone whips intertwined and lashed heavily on his Immortal body.","Jian Wushuang’s vision went dark and he almost fainted. When the bone whip hit him, it was as if ten thousand divine mountains were crashing down on him.","Ten whips felt like a hundred thousand or even a million whips. Even a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal would not be able to survive under these bone whips!","At this moment, the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens emitted a blue light and protected Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body with all its strength.","But even so, the Immortal body under the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens cracked and divine blood gushed out.","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang roared in pain and his eyes turned red. He grabbed the bone whip around his neck and struggled hard!","In an instant, the whip spirit of the black bone whip shattered, and the bone fragments of the entire bone whip scattered to the ground.","However, this was only the beginning. Scarlet divine marks surrounded Jian Wushuang’s body and the Slaughter Dao strengthened his body again.","At the same time, the Selfless True Shadow with a hazy blue aura also augmented his body at this moment.","The sky blue and scarlet shen glyphs blended together, presenting an unprecedented terrifying power.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had merged Selfless True Shadow with Slaughter Dao. Billions of brilliant lights shot out from his body.","His black hair, which was wrapped in shen glyphs, broke free of his belt and danced wildly in the air.","His eyes were crimson red, and his pupils were indeed sky blue without any impurities. They were extremely beautiful and sacred.","The effect of adding Selfless True Shadow to Slaughter Dao was far more terrifying than Jian Wushuang had imagined.","This was far from being as simple as one plus one equals two. It was a geometric upward trend.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang felt that even his Immortal body could not contain the terrifying power.","In the next moment, he roared. With him as the center, the sky was torn apart, and the black water on the ground surged into huge waves.","The dark bone whips that were binding him were actually unable to withstand the great force at this moment and shattered one after another.","The black-robed leader’s gaze, hidden under his hood, froze. He felt a shiver in his heart.","“No, that’s impossible, how could I feel the trembling, he’s just a mere Yan Immortal!”","As he thought about this, he was soon shocked by the scene before him.","Jian Wushuang’s limbs were almost locked. Although he did not move, the bone whip that bound him was quickly covered with cracks and was about to break.","All the black-robed men were shocked. Looking at the cracked bone whip in their hands, they increased their strength again.","The leader of the black-robed men felt that something was wrong. He tried to retract the bone whip, but he was shocked to find that the bone whip seemed to be sucked in by some kind of suction force and could not break free.","A sense of foreboding rose in his heart, and he directly threw away the dark bone whip in his hand.","Just as he let go, Jian Wushuang moved.","A monstrous force surged from his body. The bone whips on his limbs could no longer withstand it at this moment and completely shattered!","Then, Jian Wushuang suddenly grabbed the two bone whips at his waist and twisted them hard. In an instant, the two bone whips spun and the ferocious bone spikes on them were crushed into powder by the huge force.","Both the Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals who were controlling the bone whips could not react in time, the bone whips in their hands were twisted into a fried dough twist by the terrifying force.","However, the immense force did not disappear into thin air. Instead, it passed through the bone whip and transferred to the arms of the two Grand Yan Immortals.","“Ah!”","Screams rang out as the unimaginable force broke the bone whips and directly twisted the arms of the Grand Yan Immortals!","Divine blood splattered, and the two arms fell into the void.","All the black-robed men were shocked and quickly retreated.","To be able to break free from this restraint, he definitely wasn’t as simple as a Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang broke free from the restraints on his body. He did not stop. His entire body was like a True Sword that had gathered the ultimate development power and shot forward.","In an instant, the surrounding formation was shattered by the impact. The two Grand Yan Immortals who had lost an arm could not withstand Jian Wushuang’s attack at all.","A punch that condensed the Selfless True Shadow and the Slaughter Dao blasted out. The violent scarlet fist directly smashed a huge hole in the Immortal body of one of the black-robed Grand Yan Immortals, and the Immortal Source shattered as a result.","For some unknown reason, the strength of all the Grand Yan Immortals bound in the Endless Sea had more or less dropped to a certain level.","This was also the reason why Jian Wushuang could easily crush an ordinary Grand Yan Immortal.","After killing a black-robed Grand Yan Immortal with a punch, Jian Wushuang’s momentum did not decrease. His entire body emitted a powerful aura that was difficult to look at directly.","Another heavy punch smashed out. The other Grand Yan Immortal who had lost an arm could not dodge in time and was blasted into dust on the spot.","He was like a demon god, even if there were ten Grand Yan Immortals surrounding him, he was not afraid.","Billions of scarlet light flowed around his body, blocking most of the attacks.","There were originally ten Grand Yan Immortals, but now only eight remained.","After recovering from their initial shock, the remaining eight Grand Yan Immortals quickly regained their composure. They released a thick and boundless Yan power and crushed Jian Wushuang again."]},{"number":4939,"title":"Chapter 4939 Heavily Injured and Dying","paragraphs":["4939 Heavily Injured and Dying","A Grand Yan Immortal was still a Grand Yan Immortal after all. Even if his strength was weakened for some reason, he was still terrifying to the extreme.","Under the combined attack of the eight Grand Yan Immortals, Jian Wushuang’s counterattack was stopped.","Even with the Selfless True Shadow and the support of the Slaughter Dao, he was still at a disadvantage.","To be able to survive in this Endless Sea until now, these Grand Yan Immortals were all terrifying characters who had experienced thousands of battles.","“Suppress!”","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal roared and a Sky-Covering Golden Seal pressed down on Jian Wushuang. At the same time, the other seven Grand Yan Immortals released their first attack.","Jian Wushuang was attacked from both sides and he had no way to dodge. He once again took the full-strength attack of the eight Grand Yan Immortals.","A heaven-shaking explosion exploded. The old man who was lying on the ground nervously watching this scene was frightened out of his wits. He did not even have time to escape before he was swept away by an indescribable force.","It was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse, and everything was like the end of the world.","In this so-called Heavenly Continent, nearly one-tenth of the plane had been turned into ashes under this fierce battle.","In the void, Jian Wushuang spat out a large mouthful of divine blood and his aura was extremely weak.","The Sky-Covering Golden Seal directly broke through his defense, the remaining seven Yan Immortal’s full strength attacks came over.","If it was not for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body would have disintegrated.","Seeing that he had only spat out a mouthful of divine blood, all the black-robed Grand Yan Immortals turned pale with fright and found it unbelievable.","One had to know that even a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could only die in regret when faced with the encirclement of eight Grand Yan Immortals, their Immortal bodies could not even survive.","However, this monster-like Yan Immortal had refreshed their understanding.","Facing the combined attack of eight Grand Yan Immortals, he only spat out a mouthful of divine blood? Even his Immortal body was not damaged at all?","What was this Immortal body made of?","It was the leading Grand Yan Immortal who noticed the problem first. He noticed the blue armor that flashed on Jian Wushuang’s body.","Then, he shouted in a low voice, “Retreat!”","The eight Grand Yan Immortals instantly retreated.","“Too late!” Jian Wushuang roared. The Slaughter Dao gave him not only violent power, but also thirst for blood and the desire to fight.","The desire to fight was beyond imagination, to the point of exchanging one’s life for another.","Facing the eight Grand Yan Immortals, he did not retreat and escape. Instead, he directly met them head-on.","Among them, the Grand Yan Immortal closest to Jian Wushuang had just released his Yan power barrier when it was broken by a punch.","By the time he reacted, the fist had already opened a big hole in his chest.","“No...”","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was terrified. He wanted to use his hand to cover his broken chest, but he realized that it was all in vain.","The Immortal Source was shattered and Jian Wushuang threw it into the void as if he was throwing trash. Then, he moved extremely fast and rushed into the Grand Yan Immortal’s camp.","Facing such a disorganized but extremely terrifying enemy, they were actually helpless!","In the chaotic sky, bloody mists exploded from time to time.","The seven figures were also continuously decreasing.","Six.","Five.","Four...","Jian Wushuang seemed to know no exhaustion as he fought back crazily, leaving cracks all over his Immortal body that was exposed outside the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens.","There were more than ten Emperor-grade pills in his mouth. It was as if he was eating candy. Once he could not hold on any longer, he would swallow one and continue fighting.","In the end, there were only three Grand Yan Immortals left in the chaotic sky.","There were originally ten black-robed Grand Yan Immortals, but only three were left. This was an unimaginable scene.","The eyes of the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal who was the leader were about to split open. At this moment, only vengeance was left in his divine thought.","This was a humiliating scene. In the next moment, he shook his arms and released a heaven-shaking power.","“Brat, I will definitely kill you here today!”","Jian Wushuang sneered, “That’s exactly what I wanted to say. Today, you’ll have to deal with me one by one. None of you can escape from me!”","“Then let’s see who’s right!” the leading Grand Yan Immortal shouted angrily.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang took the lead and crushed them with endless killing intent.","“Attack!” he shouted.","As his voice fell, the two Grand Yan Immortals behind him moved.","Streams of extremely thick derivative energy suddenly shot out and bound Jian Wushuang.","Caught off guard, he paused for a moment.","It was during this pause that the leading Grand Yan Immortal moved. Layers of Sky-Covering Golden Seals appeared above his head and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","The golden seal of this level had made Jian Wushuang suffer a little before. Now, it descended again and suppressed him.","“Suppress!”","The golden seal enveloped him, causing him to pause for a moment.","At this moment, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal broke the golden seal and released a thunderous attack.","Countless golden lights shot down like spears, completely enveloping Jian Wushuang.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s body emitted a unique glow, especially in his palm, where a deep glow flashed.","In the next moment, he quietly appeared in front of Jian Wushuang like a ghost. Then, his fingers, which were as sharp as knives, suddenly stabbed into Jian Wushuang’s chest.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale instantly. The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s palm pierced through the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens and pierced into his body.","Divine blood spurted out and sprinkled in the void.","Under the black hood, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal revealed a smug smile. He had seen through the flaws of the supreme treasure Jian Wushuang was wearing and had tried with a staking all his efforts. Unexpectedly, he had succeeded.","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and coughed out a mouthful of divine blood. His face was extremely pale.","He had not expected that the hidden danger left behind by his sword strike would actually be used by others.","In the last battle with Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Jian Wushuang had comprehended his most powerful sword move.","He had used his strongest sword move to tear apart Chang Duoling’s Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens and finally shattered his Immortal Source.","After Chang Duoling’s death, he gave the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens to Jian Wushuang.","However, the gap left on the Mystic Garb could no longer be mended. It was only an extremely tiny wound.","However, it was seen through by the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal and he gave him a thunderous blow.","Although Jian Wushuang did not have an Immortal Source, he was still severely injured.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal who had torn his palm apart was also puzzled. He realized that this strange Yan Immortal did not have an Immortal Source?!","“Are you done touching me?”","Although Jian Wushuang was extremely weak, he still looked at him coldly.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal suddenly became alert. Just as he was about to destroy it, Jian Wushuang attacked before him."]},{"number":4940,"title":"Chapter 4940 Bian Ziyuan","paragraphs":["4940 Bian Ziyuan","At this moment, 36,000 Sword Intents blasted out along with his palm.","As the distance was too close, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal could not dodge at all. All of the Sword Intent was absorbed by him.","Clang!","The incomparably clear Sword Intent sent him flying. The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was like a kite with a broken string, falling headfirst into the void.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t hold on any longer. His figure was like a flash of lightning as he fell into the void.","The old man, who had barely managed to stand straight on the ground, raised his head and saw this scene. His entire body instantly trembled.","Then, he pounced forward and caught Jian Wushuang who was falling.","Looking at him, who was covered in divine blood and heavily injured, the old man gritted his teeth and placed him behind his back.","“Don’t go, put him down!”","A furious roar resounded as the remaining three black-robed Grand Yan Immortals chased after him.","The old man did not stay any longer. He carried Jian Wushuang and fled frantically.","As a Grand Yan Immortal, his speed was extremely fast. Clearly, he had escaped quite a few times before.","However, the shattered land still restricted his movements. The old man seemed to be extremely afraid of the black water and kept flying to avoid it.","“Old Shepherd, you’re courting death!”","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was furious to the extreme as he stretched out his hand and unleashed an unparalleled divine punishment.","Caught off guard, the old man was sent flying, and his entire body fell into the black water.","Jian Wushuang cried out in pain and then fainted.","The old man desperately wanted to escape from the black water, but under the black water, a pair of hands quietly grabbed his legs and pulled him into the water.","“Save, ugh...”","After a few bubbles appeared on the black water, everything disappeared without a trace.","The three black-robed Grand Yan Immortals chased over. When they saw that there was no trace of them, they could not help but fly into a rage.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal, who was almost sliced into a bloody gourd by the 36,000 Sword Intents, was extremely furious. “Find him! Dig him out even if you have to dig three feet into the ground!”","...","“Arghh, gargle...”","Once he fell into the black water, it was as if all the Yan power had disappeared. The elder who was carrying Jian Wushuang struggled under the black water but could not rise at all.","Jian Wushuang, who had fainted, was also in a terrible state. He frowned as if he could die at any time.","If one looked carefully, they would discover that in the extremely dark water, the one holding the old man’s legs was a slender figure.","The figure seemed to be unafraid of the black water as it swam around like a water ghost.","He dragged the old man’s leg with his slender arm and swam to the bottom of the sea.","The depths of the Endless Sea was like a boundless black crystal, emitting an indescribable beauty and mystery.","Just as the old man felt that he was about to die, the figure that was holding him down suddenly threw him.","After a moment of dizziness, the old man was thrown onto a piece of land.","“Ah...”","He was thrown into a daze. At the same time, an extremely pure energy entered his meridians and nourished them.","The old man’s fragile divine thought was repaired. He propped himself up and sat up unsteadily.","“What is this place...”","Everything in front of him was like some kind of magical karst cave. All kinds of crystals condensed from the purest energy crystals were emitting magnificent light.","At this moment, the slender figure that had been standing outside the cave entrance walked into the cave.","The old man immediately went into a state of alert.","“Don’t worry, I don’t want to do anything to you. If I wanted to, you would have disappeared into the sea long ago.”","The figure’s voice was lazy and low, as if he had just woken up from a dream.","The cave was slightly lit, allowing the old man to barely see him clearly.","The figure had long arms and legs, and his body was well-proportioned. Although his face was not considered handsome, he was free and unrestrained. On his naked chest were some mysterious flowing clouds and water patterns, carrying the desolate aura of the ancient era.","He came before the old man and slowly squatted down.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was lying on the ground and no one knew if he was dead or alive. Then he looked at the old man and said playfully, “You want to carry him to that person to exchange for merits?”","The old man’s body trembled without a trace. Then, he said with some embarrassment and anger, “Stop bullsh*tting. Which eye of yours saw that I was going to do this?”","He smiled and did not care about the old man’s insults. Instead, he pointed at Jian Wushuang and said leisurely, “I watched the battle from beginning to end. He was very scary and powerful. He easily killed the group of law-enforcement officers until only three were left.”","“But he’s already unconscious. If we bring him to that person now, I think the merit we’ll accumulate will be enough to give us all freedom.”","“What do you mean?” the old man looked at him nervously and asked.","The long-legged young man then said, “The meaning is very simple. Bring him to that person and accumulate merit. Will you do it?”","When the old man heard this, he was not in a hurry to speak. In the end, he gritted his teeth and said, “I can’t make a decision. He didn’t kill me.”","Hearing this, he raised his eyebrows slightly. “That’s a good answer. If you had agreed with me just now, you would be a corpse now.”","The old man was startled and his face turned cold. “What do you mean?”","“Nothing much. We’re going to leave this place soon,” the long-legged young man shrugged and said. “We’ll leave when he gets better.”","...","Jian Wushuang felt a sharp pain in his head, as if it would explode at any time.","His divine thought, which had already reached perfection, was already in chaos.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had already recovered and the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s damage to Jian Wushuang was not fatal.","What was truly fatal was Jian Wushuang’s overdraft. The Slaughter Dao was too overbearing and the consumption of his Yan power was extremely terrifying.","However, Jian Wushuang had been consuming Emperor-grade pills to ensure the supply of Slaughter Dao, which caused his meridians to be exhausted.","Although he was recovering, the overdraft of his Divine Thoughts still made Jian Wushuang feel extremely painful.","His temples were covered in sweat, and even the Yan power in his Immortal body was flowing uncontrollably.","This terrifying feeling lasted for a long time. When he felt better, he immediately opened his eyes.","As far as the eye could see, it was a cave that contained profound mysteries.","There was also an unfamiliar face looking at him with a smile.","When Jian Wushuang woke up, the long-legged young man smiled and said, ” Congratulations on getting out of danger. You can call me Bian Ziyuan.”","“Bian Ziyuan... It’s a rather unique name.”","Jian Wushuang’s head was dizzy, but he still remembered this unique and catchy name."]},{"number":4941,"title":"Chapter 4941 An Unforeseen Change","paragraphs":["4941 An Unforeseen Change","The long-legged young man named Bian Ziyuan slowly stood up and pointed at the deepest part of the karst cave. “We’ll be able to leave this sea area if we keep walking along the road ahead.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer him and sat up. Although his face was still pale, his Immortal body had recovered more than half.","There was no kindness without reason. Although Jian Wushuang was still unclear about the current situation, he could vaguely guess that the reason why he was here was related to this young man named Bian Ziyuan.","However, since he was able to save him in front of those black-robed Grand Yan Immortals, he shouldn’t have any ill intentions.","Bian Ziyuan seemed to have noticed the coldness in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, but he did not care. Instead, he continued, “I found this underwater karst cave back then. It’s extremely secretive. I’m afraid I’m the only Yan Immortal who knows about it, so please rest assured.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. When he saw the old man squatting beside him, he was surprised. “You didn’t leave?”","The old man smiled bitterly. “I saw that you were in trouble earlier, so I gritted my teeth and took you away. Who knew that my skills were inferior to yours, and then I fell into the bottom of the sea.”","“Thank you for saving me.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands.","He hurriedly waved his hand. “No, no, I’m repaying my kindness. Didn’t you spare my life earlier, Sir?”","“That’s another matter. Thank you,” Jian Wushuang replied.","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan smiled slightly and said, “The two of you, hurry up and hurry. Before they can react, let’s leave this place first. That’s the best policy.”","Jian Wushuang was still on guard against Bian Ziyuan, but the situation was just as he had said. He needed to leave as soon as possible.","This cave had been formed at some point in time, and all the derived energy in it had crystallized, giving off a beautiful glow.","If it was not under the sea, it would probably be a very good heavenly abode.","Bian Ziyuan walked at the front, leading the way toward the deepest part of the karst cave.","Out of caution, Jian Wushuang walked at the back and was on guard against any possible changes.","The karst cave was long and there was nothing unusual about it. Just like Bian Ziyuan said, it seemed that other than him, no other Yan Immortals knew about this karst cave.","The further he advanced, the purer the Yan power began to flow.","Whether it was intentional or not, Bian Ziyuan started to get close to Jian Wushuang and walked side by side. His eyes were filled with curiosity.","Finally, he said, “I wonder if I can ask your name?”","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said, “Wushuang.”","“Wushuang? Not bad, a cool name,” Bian Ziyuan smiled and said. “It’s very similar to the name of an old friend of mine.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer. Jian Wushuang had already raised the highest vigilance in his heart towards these Grand Yan Immortals who were exiled in the Endless Sea.","They were not exiled for no reason. Even after countless years, it would be difficult to erase the resentment in their hearts.","“Brother Wushuang, you look very unfamiliar. Is this your first time in the Heavenly Continent?” Bian Ziyuan asked softly as he led the way.","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Yes, I’m looking for a companion. I won’t stay here for long.”","Bian Ziyuan pondered for a moment. “Companion? I think you’re the only outsider in the Heavenly Continent. I’m afraid you’ll have to return disappointed.”","Jian Wushuang said, “That’s fine. I can find him eventually.”","“That might not be the case.” Bian Ziyuan’s expression was somewhat subtle. “Brother Wushuang, you have to know that this Endless Sea has endless borders. Its contents are so vast that it can encompass the universe. Even us Grand Yan Immortals can easily get lost in it.”","“So I think that if you don’t have a foothold, it’s very likely that you’ll get lost in this Endless Sea.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and said, ” Thank you for telling me, but I don’t intend to stay here.”","“Then I wish you good luck.” Bian Ziyuan shrugged and continued to lead the way.","Due to their position, the old man gradually fell to the back of the group. At this moment, his expression was extremely anxious, as if he was waiting for something.","The karst cave under the Sky Continent was extremely deep and long. Even though it was rich in Yan power, it still made Jian Wushuang feel slightly uncomfortable.","He was already prepared to deal with any unforeseen circumstances and released his sword essence at any time.","However, nothing happened after that. The cave passage gradually went up without any changes.","When Bian Ziyuan opened the end of the passage, the misty light from the outside world shone in.","“Brother Wushuang, you’re safe now.” Bian Ziyuan laughed.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. He cupped his hands and walked out.","Stepping out of the karst cave tunnel, all he could see was the grayish-white land. There was not even the slightest bit of cover.","At this moment, the old man who had been silent all this while quickly walked up to him and said in a low voice, “Sir, quickly follow me. I’ll take you away from here.”","Jian Wushuang was a little confused, but he nodded in the end. “Alright.”","The old man was overjoyed and hurriedly led the way.","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan’s lazy voice rang out. “Brother Wushuang, where are you going?”","“Leaving this place,” Jian Wushuang replied and turned around to leave.","“If you want to leave with that old man, I can only say that you are stupid. Since you are so stupid, why don’t you let me control your fate?”","Bian Ziyuan’s voice turned from lazy to cold.","In the next moment, billions of berserk energy shot out, covering the entire sky.","Jian Wushuang’s heart tightened and he immediately released the Ancestral Skill, Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","However, the towering gate had just appeared when it was actually destroyed by a huge palm that covered the sky!","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan, who had a gentle gaze, was surrounded by a majestic force. The flowing clouds and water patterns on his naked chest were slowly flowing, filled with a force that could not be looked at directly.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was solemn. Who would have thought that this unremarkable fellow who did not even have much energy fluctuation was actually a Six Revolutions Grand Immortal?","An extremely mysterious light wheel appeared behind Bian Ziyuan’s back. His eyes had already become incomparably black, and the flowing clouds and water patterns on his body were fluctuating.","The old man who saw this scene was shocked and sat on the ground. He was extremely frightened.","“I originally planned to spare your life, but rather than being killed by some trash, you might as well die in my hands.”","Bian Ziyuan said as he stretched out his palm to press down on Jian Wushuang.","The boundless sky dimmed as a giant black palm that stretched for millions of feet descended.","Jian Wushuang could not avoid the full-powered attack of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and could only face it.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River!","A seven-star galaxy slowly flowed between his eyebrows."]},{"number":4942,"title":"Chapter 4942 Imperial City","paragraphs":["4942 Imperial City","If Jian Wushuang was confident that he could kill a Grand Immortal or even a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal, he had no chance of winning against a Six Revolutions.","Six Revolutions was a dividing line for the Grand Yan Immortal. Once one stepped into Six Revolutions, it would be a complete transformation, forming a light wheel of Yan power, one’s strength would increase by an unimaginable amount.","This was also why Jian Wushuang could already kill a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal, but when he faced a Six Revolutions Grand Immortal beast, he fled.","Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were nightmarish existences.","However, he could no longer dodge and could only meet the attack head-on!","The Immortal Style, Little Mountain River, was summoned. High mountains and divine peaks rose from the ground with Jian Wushuang as the center.","At the same time, a violent celestial river shot out from his palm, turning into a sky-splitting waterfall that slashed forward.","The world was vast, and the most powerful attack erupted.","The divine mountain stood tall, the celestial river surged, and the sea of stars flowed. Together, they constructed Jian Wushuang’s Immortal Style.","The most beautiful explosion completely exploded. Indescribable brilliance gathered at the center, like a million suns shining inside. It was extremely shocking.","Even a Yan Immortal would not be able to survive in the center of this explosion.","Bian Ziyuan, who was standing in the void, saw this scene. Although his expression was calm, his eyes were already replaced by shock.","He could feel the terrifying power that Jian Wushuang emitted. It was because of this that he was surprised.","“Is there really such a terrifying Yan Immortal?”","Bian Ziyuan had witnessed the battle between Jian Wushuang and the ten black-robed Grand Yan Immortals. Therefore, he did not think that he could defeat Jian Wushuang.","After releasing the sky-covering palm strike, he only stopped for a moment before his figure disappeared.","In the middle of the unparalleled explosion, Jian Wushuang’s body did not suffer too much of a blow. He quickly took out an Emperor-grade pill and stuffed it into his mouth, ready to risk his life.","Even though he had no chance of winning against a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he was confident that even if he could not defeat him, he could still escape.","The Immortal Style, Little Mountain River, at its peak offset Bian Ziyuan’s attack. Just as Jian Wushuang was about to make the first move, a great danger suddenly surged behind him.","Shocked, Jian Wushuang turned around and kicked him without thinking.","The old man with a sword in his hand did not even have time to react. He did not even have time to hide his ferocious expression before he was kicked away.","Divine blood spurted out, and the old man fell heavily to the ground. His chest had caved in.","The Immortal body of the Grand Yan Immortal was unable to withstand Jian Wushuang’s kick.","Jian Wushuang was furious. “Why did you do that?!”","Spitting out another mouthful of divine blood, the old man was already extremely frightened and retreated repeatedly.","Jian Wushuang was ready to kill him.","However, at this moment, Bian Ziyuan appeared behind him like a ghost. Then, he quietly put his palm on Jian Wushuang’s back.","In an instant, countless energy beams shot out and bombarded the area.","Jian Wushuang could not avoid it and his back took the hit.","This terrifying strike was even heavier than the previous one.","Caught off guard, Jian Wushuang spat out a mouthful of divine blood and his arm that was exposed outside the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens was shattered!","Bian Ziyuan’s attack was so terrifying that Jian Wushuang instantly lost the ability to fight.","If not for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, his Immortal body would have shattered.","“Hmm? Still not dead?”","Bian Ziyuan’s eyes trembled, but he did not attack again. Instead, he let Jian Wushuang fall to the ground.","Boom!","He landed heavily on the ground. Divine blood flowed out of his broken Immortal body. Drops of divine blood fell on the grayish-white ground and were swallowed directly.","At the same time, gray tentacles rose from the ground and clung to Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","These tentacles could devour the Immortal body of a Grand Yan Immortal and were one of the main components of the Heavenly Continent.","Then, Bian Ziyuan landed in front of Jian Wushuang with boundless power.","He stomped his feet and the tentacles that were about to swallow Jian Wushuang drilled into the ground.","Then, Bian Ziyuan slowly squatted down and looked at him with a regretful expression. “It’s a pity for such a good seedling. I originally took pity on you, but I had no choice but to kill you myself. What a pity.”","His eyes were filled with pride and regret.","Jian Wushuang’s arm, which was exposed outside the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, had been shattered. He could not move at all and could only glare at Bian Ziyuan.","Bian Ziyuan, who seemed to have lost his interest in killing, slowly stood up. He looked at the old man who was already in a daze and revealed a hint of disgust in his eyes.","“You piece of trash, I’ve long seen that your heart isn’t pure. So you hid your killing intent here.”","Bian Ziyuan said in disgust. He raised his palm and was about to hit the old man.","At the same time, the loud sound of the morning bell and evening drum broke the silence of the sky and spread throughout the wilderness.","Hearing the loud voice, Bian Ziyuan withdrew his palm and looked up at the center of the heavenly road. Then, he picked up Jian Wushuang and rushed forward.","As time passed, the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body began to repair itself quickly. Jian Wushuang’s limbs, which had been shattered, had already grown back.","Bian Ziyuan, who was using his Yan power to bind him, saw this scene and his eyelids twitched.","From the strength of this guy’s Immortal body and his ability to adapt, he was actually a Yan Immortal?","However, Bian Zi Yuan did not think that he was a Yan Immortal. After all, how could there be a Yan Immortal who could kill close to ten Grand Yan Immortals by himself?!","“You’d better not move. Otherwise, I guarantee that you won’t live to enter the Imperial City,” Bian Ziyuan warned with a solemn expression.","Jian Wushuang was still in a weak state, bound by the Yan power. He had no chance of winning against him, so he did not plan to fight.","Piercing through the sky, with Bian Ziyuan’s Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal strength, he reached the center of the entire Heavenly Continent Plane in a few breaths.","It was a huge city, a grand and strict city.","However, none of the giant cities could exude such an ethereal and majestic aura.","It could only be described as Imperial City.","In the entire Heavenly Continent, there was only one building that was extremely magnificent.","After seeing this Imperial City, Bian Ziyuan’s expression became solemn.","Then, he carried Jian Wushuang and entered the Imperial City in an instant.","“Great Heavenly Official!”","In front of the grand door, there were two Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals guarding, they cupped their hands and greeted Bian Ziyuan when they saw him.","Bian Ziyuan nodded slightly, then directly carried Jian Wushuang, stepped through the Imperial Gate, and entered the strict Imperial City.","A supreme might came toward them."]},{"number":4943,"title":"Chapter 4943 The Son of the Emperor","paragraphs":["4943 The Son of the Emperor","The supreme prestige was so cold that Jian Wushuang wondered what was living here.","Jian Wushuang was a little surprised, but he soon denied it.","Even if Zhen Wuyang was extremely strong, he shouldn’t be able to banish another Emperor into the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang was accompanied by the three Imperial Emperors’ True Shadows. They had fought with Zhen Wuyang until their Emperor Bodies were shattered, but they had not been captured.","It could be seen that an Emperor could be killed by another Emperor, but they could not be captured or exiled.","However, when the two Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals guarding outside the Emperor Gate called Bian Ziyuan the Great Heavenly Official, Jian Wushuang was still suspicious.","The so-called Heavenly Official was a title that existed under the Emperor’s lineage.","Only the Emperor’s lineage would have a Heavenly Official by his side.","For example, Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s faction, which controlled the entire Great Si Region.","There were Seven PPrinces under Zhen Wuyang, and each prince had one Great Heavenly Official and ten Lesser Heavenly Officials.","As for the Emperor, there was only one Great Heavenly Official, and there were no restrictions on the Lesser Heavenly Officials.","The importance of the position of Great Heavenly Official was even more important than the great companion who had accompanied the Emperor since he was young.","This was enough to prove that the appearance of a Great or Lesser Heavenly Official meant the appearance of the Emperor’s lineage.","This was because they only served the Emperor and his son.","Bian Ziyuan was known as the Great Heavenly Official, which meant that there was a possibility that the Imperial Emperor’s lineage existed in this Imperial City.","As Jian Wushuang thought about it, he could not help but feel a little solemn.","Soon, everything that entered his eyes made him even more solemn.","Countless Immortal bones piled up and formed a path that reached the sky, extending into the unknown fog.","At the end of the fog, the outline of a grand hall could be seen.","The scene was so shocking that Jian Wushuang began to believe that there must be some terrifying existence living in it.","Bian Ziyuan reminded Jian Wushuang coldly after he withdrew the Yan power chain from Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body. Then, he walked to the front of the group and headed to the giant hall.","The entire Imperial City seemed to be shrouded in a mysterious cloud of smoke, giving off an unreal feeling. It was as if there was nothing real except the white bone road under their feet.","After he calmed down, Jian Wushuang looked at the huge hall shrouded in smoke and walked forward slowly.","The white bone path was 99,900 feet long. Jian Wushuang only looked at the huge hall with a complicated expression after he took the last step.","The white bone path behind him was a total of 99,900 feet. Every foot was made of Immortal bones, and every Immortal bone was the corpse of a Yan Immortal, without exception.","In other words, just this white bone path was formed from countless corpses of the Yan Immortals.","Where did this Palace Master come from? Why would he do such a shocking thing?","There was also something strange that puzzled Jian Wushuang.","There was a huge horizontal board in front of the huge hall in front of him. There were three big words engraved on the board.","However, these three words were extremely strange, because no one could see the shape of the words from any direction. Since they could not distinguish the shape of the words, it was impossible to understand their meaning.","However, Jian Wushuang soon realized that the strange words on the board were not written like this on purpose. Instead, they seemed to be reflected in the mirror.","With this idea in mind, he quickly practiced it in his mind and then completely understood.","The three strange words on the horizontal board of this awe-inspiring hall were actually reflected by the mirror.","Jian Wushuang corrected the words in his mind and found the three words familiar.","‘Zi Yan Palace.’","Standing in front of the door, Bian Ziyuan turned around and glanced at Jian Wushuang, who was still in a daze. Then, he waved his hand and pushed the door open.","It was as if the doors of the palace that had been sealed for countless years were slowly opened. A unique, ethereal fragrance floated out of the palace.","Then Bian Ziyuan walked into the hall.","As he entered, low moans came from both sides of the dark hall.","“Greetings, Great Heavenly Official...”","Although Jian Wushuang did not want to step into the hall, he had no choice but to step in.","As he stepped in, the huge door behind him closed.","The originally dim hall also lit up.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was solemn. Each of the black-robed men who were walking towards him had at least the strength of a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","If he were to make a move, it would probably be extremely pessimistic.","Looking at the approaching black-robed Grand Yan Immortals, he was already secretly channeling his Yan power and preparing to fight.","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan stopped in his tracks and slowly turned around. He said in a low voice, “Retreat!”","As the voice fell, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortals who had surrounded Jian Wushuang retreated like a tide.","After taking another glance at him, Bian Ziyuan continued to walk into the depths of the giant hall.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. After looking around at the hidden danger, he did not stop and walked forward slowly.","“Your Highness, I’ve already brought him to you.”","Bian Ziyuan stopped and bowed slightly as he spoke to the dark depths of the hall.","“Ziyuan, you’re here?” A weak voice sounded.","Soon, a thin figure walked out from the depths of the hall in a hurry.","“Ziyuan, is that you?”","The thin figure was wearing a grey-white court robe. His face was like jade, but it was extremely pale.","When Bian Ziyuan saw who it was, he nodded again. “Your Highness, it’s me. I’ve brought him for you too.”","The young man who was addressed as His Highness looked at Jian Wushuang.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of familiarity when he looked at him.","“It’s him, a mere Yan Immortal killed seven Grand Yan Immortals that were under me?” The young man was in disbelief.","Bian Ziyuan then said, “Your Highness, that’s right. He was indeed the only one who crossed realms and killed Grand Yan Immortals. However, he did not just kill 7, but 11.”","“What is it? 11?” The young man was shocked, “But he’s clearly only a Yan Immortal!”","Bian Zi Yuan’s mouth twitched when he heard this. Indeed, such a battle record was too inconceivable for a Yan Immortal."]},{"number":4944,"title":"Chapter 4944 The Fight in the Giant Hall","paragraphs":["4944 The Fight in the Giant Hall","Since the beginning of the ancient age, there had never been a case of a Yan Immortal being able to kill a Grand Yan Immortal. The difference between the two was comparable to the difference between a firefly and the moon.","Facing the encirclement of 11 Grand Yan Immortals, even he himself would not be able to do it so easily.","But the truth had already happened, so he had no choice but to believe it.","Bian Ziyuan was already thinking about what would happen once Jian Wushuang broke through to the Yan Immortal stage and reached the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","Then, he nodded slightly and said, “Your Highness, that’s true. All 11 Grand Yan Immortals died in his hands. Among them, the 6 black-robed envoys under you also died in his hands.”","The young man who was addressed as ‘His Highness’ frowned and sized up Jian Wushuang with a serious look.","He was a little uncomfortable being sized up by this kind of dignified gaze.","The young man in front of him gave Jian Wushuang an inexplicable sense of familiarity, but he had no idea where this sense of familiarity came from.","A moment later, he said in a cold voice, “In that case, did the 7 black-robed envoys under me really die in your hands?”","Jian Wushuang did not hide anything and said calmly, “That’s right, but they deserved to die. If they didn’t come after me, I wouldn’t have made them my enemies.”","“Then do you know why they are your enemies?” Bian Ziyuan turned around, looked at him, and said coldly, “If you didn’t intend to destroy the continent, why would they capture and try to kill you?”","Jian Wushuang was speechless for a moment. In the bloody battle with the four Grand Yan Immortals, the land under his feet could not withstand the attacks and shattered.","Then, Bian Ziyuan’s voice softened. “You have to know how difficult it is to establish a land area in the Endless Sea.”","“Above the Endless Sea, nothing in the world can float. Even the Grand Yan Immortal can’t travel through the sea for a long time. This is enough to show the importance of the Heavenly Continent. Once the Heavenly Continent is shattered, all the Grand Yan Immortals here will have no chance of escaping.”","“Do you know how the Heavenly Continent was formed?” Bian Ziyuan came to Jian Wushuang and said softly, “Every inch of land here was accumulated with the corpses of the Yan Immortals.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and secretly activated his Yan power in his palm.","“Alright, Ziyuan, now I really want to see how he killed the 7 Grand Yan Immortals under me.”","The young man slowly walked out from the darkness and looked at him with a playful expression.","Then, he gently waved his hand.","Suddenly, 3 black-robed envoys walked out from behind the Mountain Sea Pillars on both sides of the huge hall and blocked Jian Wushuang’s path.","As soon as he finished speaking, the 3 black-robed men behind Jian Wushuang moved. At this moment, endless power was revealed.","In an instant, the Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was the first to move. Endless Yan power gathered in his palm and stabbed toward Jian Wushuang’s back like the sharpest blade.","At this moment, he also moved, but he did not turn around. Instead, he tilted his Immortal body slightly and dodged that terrifying attack.","While dodging, Jian Wushuang threw a punch to the side with all his strength.","With the support of the Selfless True Shadow, this punch displayed 100 percent of its strength.","The black-robed emissary, who had missed, was caught off guard and his entire body was hit by this punch.","Boom!","A huge force burst forth. How could the black-robed envoy withstand such a huge force? His entire Immortal body was like a kite with a broken string, flying sideways and heavily smashing into the Mountain Sea Pillar.","The Mountain Sea Pillars that supported each side of the hall were a thousand feet thick, normal Yan Immortals would not be able to destroy them.","Rumble!","The black-robed envoy smashed heavily into a Mountain Sea Pillar. Countless cracks instantly covered the entire pillar with him as the center. It was likely that it would break in the next moment.","Jian Wushuang did not stop after sending a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal flying. He turned around and smashed at the other two black-robed envoys.","The unparalleled energy exploded in the hall.","Waves of strong winds swept up, shaking the entire giant hall.","Looking at the figure that was fighting fiercely with the three Grand Yan Immortals without being at a disadvantage, the young man and Bian Ziyuan were completely shocked at this moment.","This scene was simply too shocking. One had to know that the Yan Immortal was merely a toy in the hands of the Grand Yan Immortal and could be killed with ease. There was simply no possibility of them fighting each other.","However, Jian Wushuang’s appearance had broken their inherent understanding.","So a Yan Immortal could actually cross realms to kill a Grand Yan Immortal?!","36,000 Sword Intents rushed out of his body and protected Jian Wushuang from being attacked.","With the support of Selfless True Shadow, he was not afraid of two early-stage Grand Yan Immortals at all. He did not even acknowledge Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","This was because the Grand Yan Immortals in the Endless Sea were more or less weakened. This was also the reason why Jian Wushuang dared to take a gamble.","With a heavy punch, a slightly shorter Grand Yan Immortal was unable to dodge and was hit head-on.","In an instant, his chest caved in, and his entire Immortal body strangely folded in half from the middle. Then, he flew out like a cannonball and smashed into the Mountain Sea Pillar.","The entire Mountain Sea Pillar seemed to be unable to withstand such a huge force and directly broke apart from the middle!","The huge hall shook, as if a corner of the hall was almost torn apart!","After severely injuring the black-robed envoy, the pressure on Jian Wushuang’s body was reduced and he was completely free to fight.","Although Jian Wushuang was now completely free, he did not kill him.","In this awe-inspiring giant hall, if he were to kill all the Grand Yan Immortals under him in front of the Palace Master, there would be no end to it.","The giant hall shook and the unparalleled power exploded. With Jian Wushuang as the center, fine cracks appeared under his feet and gradually spread.","The two black-robed envoys were sent flying. They got up from the ground and fought again.","The Mountain Sea Pillars were smashed into pieces, and the center of the hall was in a mess.","The corners of the young man’s eyes twitched when he saw this scene.","Bian Ziyuan’s initial shock turned into helplessness. He turned to look at the young man and said, “Your Highness, don’t let them continue fighting. Otherwise, your palace will collapse...”","“Quick, stop him.” The young man finally spoke.","Bian Ziyuan, who received the order, nodded his head. Then, he took a step forward and casually waved his hand.","In an instant, an endless amount of exquisite mist descended."]},{"number":4945,"title":"Chapter 4945 Countless Immortal Bones, the Blood River","paragraphs":["4945 Countless Immortal Bones, the Blood River","As the exquisite mist descended, frost followed, freezing the battlefield in the giant hall.","The two Grand Yan Immortals who were in the air were also frozen in the air at this moment.","Jian Wushuang could not withstand the force and punched out.","The two frozen Grand Yan Immortals were directly blasted into countless ice crystals that scattered all over the ground.","Ding, ding, ding-","The crisp ice crystals fell to the ground, and the giant hall fell into dead silence again.","Out of the three Grand Yan Immortals who had fought, only one was left and it was unknown whether he was still alive or not.","Jian Wushuang looked at Bian Ziyuan calmly as he threw the ice crystals off his palm.","Bian Ziyuan’s gaze was cold. He took a step forward and said in a deep voice, “Are you courting death?”","He did not say anything. As he closed his palms, an Invisible Sword condensed.","The originally silent hall was instantly filled with a murderous aura.","“Do you think you can defeat me?” Bian Ziyuan took a step forward, and endless flowing clouds and water ripples appeared. At the same time, a light wheel condensed behind him.","Just as the battle was about to begin, the young man spoke in a low voice.","“My Heavenly Palace is not a place for you to fight. So, all of you better restrain yourself. Otherwise, the foundation of this Heavenly Palace will be replaced by your Immortal bodies.”","When Bian Ziyuan heard this, he withdrew his unprecedentedly powerful Yan power and retreated behind him.","Jian Wushuang put away his sword and looked at the young man who was walking towards him. “I’m really sorry about what happened today. I’ll leave on my own and never step foot here again.”","“Leave? Leaving just like that? You killed nearly ten of my black-robed envoys. How are we going to settle this score?”","The young man looked at him with a faint smile and said, “Do you think I’ll let you go so easily?”","“What do you want to do?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and said.","He smiled. “What I want is very simple. It’s just a deal. Consider it as you paying me back.”","“You only have one choice.” The young man pointed a finger at him.","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang said seriously, “What deal?”","“This transaction is very simple, but you need to leave a place alive before I can tell you the terms of the transaction.”","The young man walked slowly to Jian Wushuang and said with a faint smile.","Jian Wushuang felt an inexplicable sense of danger, but it was too late!","A total of 40 black-robed envoys released their Yan powers at this moment, bombarding the floor in the hall.","In an instant, as if a sealed door had been opened, the entire floor was covered in blood-red ripples.","“Good luck,” the young man smiled strangely and pushed him down.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He wanted to resist, but the giant hall behind him had already turned into an endless sea of blood.","A bloody palm grabbed him and dragged him into the sea of blood, disappearing.","The blood waves surged, and everything returned to normal.","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan came to the young man’s side and asked, “Your Highness, are you planning to place all your hopes on him?”","“Do you have any other way?” He had his hands behind his back as if he was thinking about something. “He gives me a very different feeling. I have a feeling that whether we can leave this Endless Sea will have a lot to do with him.”","“I hope so. We’ve been trapped here for far too long.” Bian Ziyuan sighed softly as he looked at the churning sea of blood.","“What if he is unable to pass the test of this Blood Sea?”","“Then let him die inside. This Blood Sea is originally formed by the corpses of thousands of Immortals. If he dies there, it really doesn’t matter.”","...","Gush...","The sound of water flowing like a clear spring could be heard. Jian Wushuang woke up almost as soon as he fell into the Blood Sea.","He directly condensed an Invisible Sword and cut off all the Blood Qi arms that were wrapped around his Immortal body.","Everything was pure blood red.","Unlike the endless sea of blood in the Sand Demon Cave, this sea of blood did not have the cold aura of death or the vicious coldness. Instead, it was filled with a dense restriction aura.","This kind of restriction was very strange. It was filled with an ancient aura and gave people an unknown sense of security.","Jian Wushuang swung his sword to cut off the bloody hand that was wrapped around his body and allowed his Immortal body to fall slowly.","“What exactly is this place? Why does it give me the feeling that it’s a forbidden land?”Jian Wushuang recalled in his mind and sized up everything in front of him.","Soon, his figure sank into the deepest part of the Blood Sea. What surprised him was that the depths of the Blood Sea was actually land?!","It was indeed land, but it was made of white bones.","The broken Immortal bodies had already turned into piles of white bones. They piled up on top of each other and formed a boundless land of white bones.","Standing under the Blood Sea, Jian Wushuang looked at the scene in shock. Even though he had a firm mind, he was still shocked.","Just how many Yan Immortals would have to fall to form this bone land?","This was the confinement space under the Blood Sea. Above his head was the endless Blood Sea, and beneath his feet was the boundless land of white bones.","In this endless world, he was the only one left alive, and it was extremely lonely.","“Why did he throw me under this sea of blood?”","After he calmed down, Jian Wushuang began to think about this question.","This Blood Sea was boundless and filled with the aura of an ancient restriction. It was like an ancient battlefield left behind by an ancient battlefield, not an execution ground.","“Could it be that he wants me to obtain some kind of opportunity here?” He thought of all kinds of possibilities.","At this moment, along with the whimper of ice-cold wind, a cold and charming voice quietly sounded behind Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang, look back and see who I am.”","Jian Wushuang turned his head abruptly and saw a figure in a black-gold pleated skirt.","It was a woman.","Her black and gold pleated dress accentuated her figure, making her look luxurious and cold to the extreme.","The distance between them was only a few feet, and they could clearly see each other’s faces.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes unconsciously focused together and his heart beat faster.","Facing such an extremely mysterious woman, he always felt that there was some kind of shackle in his heart.","From the first time they met on the first voyage until now, they had only met a few times."]},{"number":4946,"title":"Chapter 4946 Kill a Path of Blood","paragraphs":["4946 Kill a Path of Blood","Although they had only met a few times, they would always meet in unimaginable places. It was as if they were destined to never leave each other.","She was the only one on this white bone land.","It’s dry and cold, but it’s fresh and gorgeous.","She was Zheng Ying.","Her long hair was blown away by the wind. Then, she took out a golden hairpin from her waist and tied her messy hair behind her.","Her pretty eyes were filled with charm as she stared at Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang could not help but avoid her gaze. But for some reason, he could not avoid it and could only look at her.","She was truly stunning, but she also carried an indescribable sense of danger.","After the two of them looked at each other for a moment, Zheng Ying slowly walked toward him.","Jian Wushuang wanted to retreat, but he found that his movements were a little unnatural.","“Tell me, why did you come here?”","Her tone was very unfriendly as she questioned him.","Hearing the familiar tone, Jian Wushuang began to feel puzzled, “You, are you really Zheng Ying? It’s not my imagination?”","“Answer my question first.” Zheng Ying’s tone was unquestionable, and her stunning face was faintly filled with anger.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to compromise. “Alright, I came here mainly because I want to find Di Qing. He has been exiled here.”","Then, he roughly told Zheng Ying everything that happened earlier.","After listening to all of this, Zheng Ying’s brows furrowed slightly. “Foolish. You risked your life here just for him? Do you know what this place is? Aren’t you afraid of dying here?”","Jian Wushuang then said, “I am 90 percent confident that I can find Di Qing and leave this place with him. However, if I really die here, I can only accept it.”","“Idiot, do you know that I am the calamity you are facing now?” Zheng Ying looked at him and said coldly. Then, she suddenly pulled out a sharp soft sword from the jade belt at her waist.","The tip of the sword was aimed at his throat.","“Are you the real Zheng Ying or a fake Zheng Ying?” He was completely confused and began to doubt.","“...”","Jian Wushuang did not expect her to answer so straightforwardly.","Taking back the flexible sword, Zheng Ying continued coldly, “Remember every word I say. In this place, don’t trust any of the Yan Immortals. Just kill your way out. Who told you not to believe in any logic?”","He pondered for a moment before asking with uncertainty, “Then should I believe what you said?”","Zheng Ying was silent. Finally, he said, ” Don’t make me slap you..”","After saying that, she turned around and left.","“Remember every word I say. This will support you to survive here.”","Zheng Ying’s figure finally disappeared in front of Jian Wushuang as if nothing had ever happened.","But Jian Wushuang knew that she had indeed been here.","“Strange, why does she always know where I am?”","Jian Wushuang stroked his chin and asked in confusion.","At this point, he was certain that it was indeed Zheng Ying herself, although her appearance was a little too unbelievable.","Jian Wushuang calmed himself down and thought about Zheng Ying’s message again. Then, he decided to set off.","The land of bones under the sea of blood stretched endlessly. He guessed that if he wanted to leave, he had to keep moving forward.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll kill my way out.”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze turned sharp at this moment. His entire Immortal body was like a True Sword that was waiting to be activated.","As if following his thoughts, the originally silent white bone ground began to shake.","As if it was boiling, the broken Immortal bones began to recover.","“Supreme Immortal aura...”","An extremely broken Immortal bone lifted its sword and seemed to be attracted by the aura emitted by Jian Wushuang.","Two balls of black light that were about to be extinguished surged in his eyes.","“I’m hungry!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly.","In the next moment, an Invisible Sword condensed in his hand.","Facing the skeleton army that was gradually gathering in front of him, he released his most powerful attack.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","An ordinary slash fell like a stone thrown into a lake.","Rumble!","The endless power completely exploded at this moment.","Millions of Sword Intents rose up from the sky, each one of them at the peak!","As millions of Sword Intents surged, thousands of light pillars exploded.","The white bone earth shook as if it was being destroyed.","The skeleton army that was running wildly was directly shattered into powder under this sword strike!","100,000 white bones, 1,000,000 Sword Intents!","The mountains and seas were about to collapse, and even the Heavenly Dao trembled under this sword strike!","Countless white bones shattered into dust and fell back to the ground.","A figure stepped on countless white bones and carried millions of Sword Intents as he moved forward firmly.","At the same time, in the huge hall of the Heavenly Continent, the young man and Bian Ziyuan who were standing in front of the Blood Sea twitched their eyes when they saw this shocking scene.","Especially when Jian Wushuang carried millions of Sword Intents and easily killed the skeleton army, it was a new scene.","After a long while, the young man took a deep breath and said, “Just where did this fellow come from? How could he be a Yan Immortal?”","Bian Ziyuan shook his head and said, “I know very little about him. I’m afraid no Yan Immortal knows his origins. He’s very mysterious.”","“I’m afraid he will be able to complete this test very soon.”","The young man shook his head and said, “Complete it? It’s probably impossible to complete it. There’s still an existence comparable to an Emperor under the Blood Sea.”","“You want him to obtain that person’s inheritance?” Bian Ziyuan’s gaze was somewhat solemn.","“This isn’t something he can obtain just because I want it. No one knows what that person means. My only hope now is that he can walk out of this alive.”","The young man said, “Perhaps when he comes out, we will know when we can leave this place.”","...","Swish!","After the last sound of the sword slashing, there was no Immortal bone left in front of Jian Wushuang.","These Immortal bones that had fallen for countless years had long been extremely fragile and were completely useless.","If an ordinary Grand Yan Immortal had entered this place, they might have died. However, Jian Wushuang was different. These Immortal bones could not even cause any effective harm to him."]},{"number":4947,"title":"Chapter 4947 Pot-Bellied Buddha","paragraphs":["4947 Pot-Bellied Buddha","Every Sword Intent he released was enough to easily destroy any Immortal bone.","Even after killing all the Immortal bones in front of him, he did not spend too much effort.","This was a path of Immortal bones, who knew how many Yan Immortals had fallen here to forge it?","Although he had already revived the army of 100,000 Immortal bones, Jian Wushuang knew that this was just the beginning.","This blood river and white bone road hidden under the Imperial City seemed to have not been opened for countless years. It was filled with an indescribable ancient restriction.","Jian Wushuang stepped on the broken Immortal bones under his feet and headed to the deepest part of the white bone path.","Everything had just begun.","In order to prevent any unexpected situations from happening, he directly let the Sword Intent flow around his body. Once danger approached, he could react immediately.","Apart from the Immortal bones that had lost their Immortal charm, there were only broken treasures and True Swords on the white bone path.","They had been broken for countless years and had long since fallen asleep with their respective masters.","The most well-preserved of these treasures were some True Swords.","They stabbed into the ground diagonally. Although their blades were no longer sharp, there was still a vast amount of power surging, as if they were waiting for a battle.","The further he went, the more Jian Wushuang felt that something was amiss.","The feeling of the ancient restriction became even stronger.","At the same time, the white bones under his feet were very different from before. They had turned grayish-white.","Jian Wushuang saw a strange scene after traveling another thousand feet.","In the middle of the path of bones, a pile of bones made of countless white bones blocked the road ahead.","There was no longer any Immortal aura flowing in the grayish-white broken Immortal bone, but it gave Jian Wushuang unprecedented pressure.","He had a feeling that there was something dangerous hidden in this pile of bones.","With his personality, he would not have moved forward, but the current situation forced him to.","In the next moment, the pile of white bones that was hundreds of thousands of feet tall shattered with a loud bang. A pitch-black arm that looked like a True Dragon stretched out from it and smashed heavily toward Jian Wushuang.","Boom!","He grunted and his Immortal body flew back a thousand feet!","Two deep ravines were dug into the ground of white bones by his legs before he stopped.","Jian Wushuang held back the boiling blood in his Immortal body and looked ahead solemnly.","The pile of white bones that was tens of thousands of feet tall had already collapsed like a mountain. Two pitch-black arms that looked like True Dragons pushed away the countless white bones, gradually revealing their true appearance.","Even Jian Wushuang was moved by the scene.","Beneath the pile of bones sat a pitch-black figure that was as tall as a mountain!","This pitch-black figure sat cross-legged in the middle of the white bone road. His entire body was pitch-black, and his chest was exposed. His stomach was big, and his face was round.","His belly was especially huge, almost taking up two-thirds of his entire body, making it look like a fat Maitreya.","His zen clothes were already in tatters, and his fat face was glowing with a strange oily light.","Two rays of red light shot out from his narrowed eyes. He looked at Jian Wushuang with greed.","Then, something that made Jian Wushuang uncomfortable happened.","Saliva dripped down from the pot-bellied Buddha’s mouth like a waterfall, almost converging into a river.","Then, he opened his palm and grabbed the Immortal bones scattered on both sides, stuffing them into his mouth and chewing.","A strange creaking sound echoed on the white bone path.","Jian Wushuang frowned and quietly condensed an Invisible Sword.","“Hehe, I haven’t smelled the scent of a True Immortal for a long time..”","The pot-bellied Buddha let out a strange laugh, and his saliva almost turned into a river.","“Let me take a small bite, just a small bite. I won’t eat all of you, okay?”","“...”","Jian Wushuang did not want to waste his breath on him. He pointed the Invisible Sword forward.","“You can’t kill me. Just let me have a small bite and I’ll let you go, okay?” the pot-bellied Buddha said greedily.","The reason why Jian Wushuang had not abandoned the Ancestral Skills was because they needed time to fully develop and bloom. They were not online yet.","The current two Ancestral Skills were enough to match the Immortal techniques.","The Ancestral Skills, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate, and the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate, were both released at this moment.","Two magnificent Heavenly Gates stretched across the top of pot-bellied Buddha’s head. Then, a huge finger and a huge palm that reached the sky smashed down on his head with endless power.","In the next moment, a wail rang out.","The brilliant light emitted by the two Ancestral Skills directly enveloped him.","Endless energy erupted on this white bone path.","The pot-bellied Buddha’s wails resounded in the surroundings.","When the remnant power of the Ancestral Skills dissipated, a part of the pot-bellied Buddha’s round and huge head had already collapsed.","An unknown black liquid flowed out of his broken head.","“I want you dead!”","He was furious to the extreme, and a powerful suction force suddenly shot out from his huge mouth.","Even Jian Wushuang, who was standing thousands of feet away, felt the suction force. He hurriedly waved his sword to cut off the terrible suction force.","Seeing that he was not being sucked over, pot-bellied Buddha extended his tens of thousands of feet long arm and smashed it over.","Every time he waved his arm, it was enough to shatter space.","The ground of white bones continued to collapse as the huge arm smashed down. Jian Wushuang quickly dodged it.","Such a powerful attack was enough to make ordinary Yan Immortals die on the spot.","With the Invisible Sword in hand, Jian Wushuang leaped thousands of feet in one step and landed on one of pot-bellied Buddha’s arms.","“Hehe, come into my mouth!”","The pot-bellied Buddha opened his huge mouth and swallowed him whole.","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at the giant mouth. Then, he stabbed the True Sword into the giant mouth’s arm.","“Break!” Jian Wushuang roared in a low voice. At this moment, millions of Sword Intents rushed into the arm of the pot-bellied Buddha along the sword blade.","The Sword Intent was like a mountain and sea, exploding with a loud bang.","In the next moment, the huge arm exploded from the middle, and endless Sword Intent poured out.","With just one sword strike, one of the pot-bellied Buddha’s arms was severed!","The arm that was like a divine mountain fell and smashed heavily on the white bone road, stirring up dust.","Jian Wushuang landed on the ground again and looked at the wailing pot-bellied Buddha. He was thinking about how to kill him quickly.","Through this short exchange, Jian Wushuang vaguely guessed that he was most likely a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. It would not be easy to kill him completely.","“Bastard, I want you to die right here!”"]},{"number":4948,"title":"Chapter 4948 Sword Dao Emperor","paragraphs":["4948 Sword Dao Emperor","The pot-bellied Buddha roared in rage. Having lost an arm, he was extremely furious.","Space was torn apart, and he quickly dodged.","Looking at the pot-bellied Buddha who had lost his mind, Jian Wushuang thought of something and immediately raised his realm to the peak.","Endless majestic divine patterns flowed around his body. The unknown power that surpassed the immortal evolution was extremely powerful.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was like a supreme True Immortal, and all the Heavenly Dao laws prostrated at his feet.","Seeing this scene, even the arm of the pot-bellied Buddha hesitated for a moment.","Jian Wushuang did not dodge. He just pointed at the front.","Rumble!","The two collided, and the arm that was like a True Dragon was actually sealed in the air, unable to advance even an inch.","A look of bewilderment flashed in the eyes of the pot-bellied Buddha. He realized that he really could not make a move.","Then, Jian Wushuang said, “Let me go and I will spare your life. Otherwise, I can cut off one of your arms and destroy your Immortal Source.”","“Destroy my Immortal Source, hehe, with your puny body?” the the pot-bellied Buddha cackled and shot a greedy gaze. “It’s not impossible to let you leave. As long as you let me bite you, I’ll let you leave.”","Jian Wushuang snorted angrily and Selfless True Shadow appeared behind him.","Jian Wushuang had already released the Selfless True Shadow in the void battleground in the Six Heaven Realm. It was extremely mysterious.","In an instant, the Selfless True Shadow, which was hundreds of thousands of feet tall, completely materialized. It was even three thousand feet taller than the pot-bellied Buddha.","Seeing this terrifying scene, the pot-bellied Buddha, who was still laughing strangely, was stunned. He even forgot what to do next.","“If you don’t make way, I won’t be polite.”","Jian Wushuang and the huge Selfless True Shadow behind him spoke at the same time. Boundless power spread out and it was extremely terrifying.","Looking at the stunned pot-bellied Buddha, he secretly heaved a sigh of relief. He thought to himself that he had already intimidated him.","However, in the next moment, the originally stunned Buddha suddenly laughed wildly. His remaining arm suddenly stopped the confronting Selfless True Shadow.","His entire stomach was actually a mouth!","“I, I want to swallow you all!”","After finishing his last sentence, the pot-bellied Buddha’s huge belly suddenly opened up, revealing his big mouth and sucking at Jian Wushuang.","Under this terrifying suction force, the 30,000-meter-tall Selfless True Shadow was completely unable to move at this moment.","Cold sweat poured out of Jian Wushuang’s temples. He had never thought that the pot-bellied Buddha would have such a trump card.","Under this terrifying suction force, his Immortal body was shaken.","The 10,000-meter-tall Selfless True Shadow shattered, turning into countless stars that surged into the pot-bellied Buddha’s incomparably huge belly.","Not only did the Selfless Shadow disappear, but all the Yan power in Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body was also disappearing rapidly.","He turned pale with fright and instantly released his Sword Intent without holding back.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The majestic celestial river descended from the sky. This was a magnificent sword formed by billions of Sword Intents, carrying an intimidating force that could not be looked at directly.","This sword was enough to suppress 100 Yan Immortals, causing the Heavenly Dao to tremble.","However, this magnificent sword move, which had always been successful, disappeared in the next moment!","Rather than saying that it had disappeared, it would be more appropriate to say that it had been devoured.","The majestic Sword River was also swallowed by the terrifying suction force.","Jian Wushuang was completely shocked. As his strongest Sword Principle, it had been disintegrated and absorbed. Who was this the pot-bellied Buddha?!","As the Selfless True Shadow and the energy of the River-style Sword Intent were swallowed into his stomach, the pot-bellied Buddha’s body expanded by tens of thousands of feet again. His entire stomach was about to explode, and it was extremely huge.","“You even want to swallow me? Aren’t you afraid of bursting to death?” Jian Wushuang struggled to stabilize his body and shouted angrily.","“Bursting? Hehe, no one can fill me to death. I can swallow the heavens and the earth!” he said with a strange smile, his face full of madness.","“Then I’ll stuff you to death today!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and said coldly. In the next moment, his Immortal body suddenly emitted billions of Yan powers.","This hundred million energy almost instantly swept through the white bone road behind him.","At this moment, the True Sword that was originally stabbed into the ground seemed to have received some kind of call. The silent sword edge suddenly appeared with a cold light.","A cold light flashed.","Thousands of cold lights.","...","Ten thousand cold lights!","At this moment, all the dormant swords on the bone path were completely awakened. Each sword emitted a clear sword hum, as if they had been summoned by their master.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and raised his arms.","As he raised his arms, tens of thousands of cold lights burst out, and tens of thousands of True Swords rose into the sky.","They hung high behind Jian Wushuang and emitted endless power.","At this moment, he was like the ruler of the sword, the sovereign of all swords.","Where the sword pointed was the journey!","“Go!”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and tens of thousands of swords exploded with their own magnificent power.","They seemed to be able to sense that this was the last moment they could unleash, so the endless Sword Intent was simply magnificent to the extreme at this moment.","It was as if they had returned to the day before they fought alongside their master, and they let out excited sword cries.","Then, they charged at the pot-bellied Buddha together.","Dominating Sword Intent lit up the entire white bone road.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang became serious.","Swords had souls. They were connected to their masters and could even resonate with their souls.","At this moment, they were all willing to release their peak sword moves to show Jian Wushuang.","After the peak, it was the end.","When the Sword Intent reached its peak, all the True Swords shattered.","They were all shattered into powder, and there was no way to repair them.","“No, don’t...”","The Sword Intent was like the mountains and seas that were about to collapse, directly engulfing and concealing the pot-bellied Buddha.","10,000 Sword Intents finally bloomed without reservation.","The white bone path stirred up dust, and even the blood river above their heads fluctuated, as if it could pour down at any time.","Jian Wushuang remained rooted to the ground. His eyes were fluctuating, but he finally calmed down.","He looked at the place where the tens of thousands of Sword Intents were blooming and knew in his heart that there was no chance of the pot-bellied Buddha surviving.","When all the Sword Intents dissipated into dust, falling onto the white bone path, Jian Wushuang saw a miserable scene."]},{"number":4949,"title":"Chapter 4949 I Come From the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm","paragraphs":["4949 I Come From the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm","The divine mountain-like Immortal body of the pot-bellied Buddha had already been shattered by the tens of thousands of Sword Intents.","The endless divine blood almost formed a river on the bone road. Everything in sight was filled with sorrow.","Jian Wushuang borrowed the strength to fight back and awakened all the Sword Intents on the white bone path. That was why he could defeat the Six Revolutions Great Immortal so easily.","Otherwise, it would be almost impossible to defeat him.","Looking at the Immortal corpses on the ground, Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and prepared to leave.","However, at this moment, he felt a weak aura.","Although the aura was weak, it was real and extremely familiar.","Jian Wushuang was slightly shocked and looked in that direction. He saw a miserable figure struggling among the countless huge Immortal corpses.","“Impossible, why isn’t he dead yet?”As he thought of this, he hurried back to the remains of the pot-bellied Buddha.","He waved his palm to blow away the huge Immortal corpse, and an extremely skinny figure covered in blood entered his eyes.","“Cough cough... I’m finally free...”","The extremely skinny figure lay on the white bone path soaked in divine blood. A voice that sounded like a heavy burden came from his mouth.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. From the clothes on the figure, he could see that it was a tattered Zen robe. Moreover, there was a string of huge Zen pearls hanging around his neck.","Jian Wushuang had seen this kind of attire once in the Great Yan Domain.","Even the group of monks who destroyed the Heavenly Region where the Sand Demon Cave was located were dressed like this.","He knew very little about the origin of those monks. He only knew that they came from beyond the Great Si Region and were extremely terrifying existences.","Many monks had entered the Sand Demon Cave, but only Kong Lun had left the deepest impression on Jian Wushuang.","This skinny figure seemed to be related to the group of monks from a long time ago.","‘Could it be that he also came from the so-called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm?’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself and formed an Invisible Sword in his hand.","“Cough cough...”","The emaciated figure opened his mouth and spat out a large mouthful of divine blood, then collapsed on the ground.","It was only then that Jian Wushuang saw his face clearly. He was thin and skinny like an ascetic monk.","Their eyes met. The monk, who was already on the verge of death, suddenly used all his strength to get up and kneel down in front of him.","“Thank you... You’re a good man for giving me freedom, and Xing Ge could not repay you...”","Jian Wushuang did not reply. He stared at him without relaxing. Finally, he said slowly, “Where did you come from? Why are you here?”","The monk who called himself Xing Ge coughed lightly and sat cross-legged on the white bone path. He put his palms together and said, “Since you asked, Xing Ge will tell you the reason.”","“I’m a monk from the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm. I’m an ascetic monk who travels in the myriad worlds and experience all kinds of suffering.”","Jian Wushuang’s divine thoughts were shaken when he heard this. Just as he had expected, the monk was from the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm.","The monk named Xing Ge continued to talk to himself, “And the reason why I’m here is purely because of that battle.”","“That was the battle to destroy the old era and build the new Heavenly Court. All the living beings died in that battle, and the Heavenly Regions that were subordinate to the old Heavenly Court also died.”","“Not only did the Heavenly Regions fall, even the experts within died. However, the experts died, but the supreme experts were not killed.”","“Those utmost powerful beings were all exiled to a place that has no form or form. As for that place, it’s here.”","Xing Ge said as he pointed at the ground with his skinny hand.","“I traveled to that place, which is the Great Si Region. I was unintentionally dragged into that war, and was eventually exiled here for various reasons.”","When Jian Wushuang heard this, he asked again, “Then why did you become like that?”","When Xing Ge heard this, two lines of tears flowed out of his dry eyes. Finally, he said, “Greed. I relied on myself to get rid of the six desires, but I couldn’t escape the control of greed in the end!”","“After I was exiled here, my mind was injured and then I was invaded by the Yan Immortals. It aroused the final greed in my heart and turned me into an evil Buddha. If it wasn’t for the good people who came here and destroyed my evil body, I’m afraid I would be trapped here forever.”","The short conversation came to an end and Jian Wushuang learned some secrets from Xing Ge’s words.","These Grand Yan Immortals who were exiled to the Endless Sea were all supreme experts of the old Heavenly Court before Zhen Wuyang established his own Heavenly Court.","This was somewhat different from what Jian Wushuang had guessed. He thought that those who were exiled here were some extremely evil Grand Yan Immortals.","Xing Ge put his palms together, his dead eyes filled with relief.","“Thank you, Samaritan. Xing Ge has been freed, but before he is freed, I would like to give you something.”","As he spoke, his skinny palm touched the string of ring beads around his neck, and then he took off the fist-sized ring bead in the middle.","In an instant, all the ring beads around his neck turned into nothingness. Only the one in his hand emitted a mysterious color.","Seeing such a ring bead, Jian Wushuang thought of something else.","In the Blood Sea of the Sand Demon Cave, he had visited Kong Lun, and Kong Lun had given him a Bead of Life.","“Samaritan, Xing Ge has nothing to repay you with, so I’ll give this ring bead to you.”","Jian Wushuang did not refuse. After pondering for a while, he reached out and took the bead from his hand.","The ring bead was warm and cool in his hand, and had a unique texture.","Then, Jian Wushuang said, “Do you know of an ascetic monk called Kong Lun?”","Xing Ge, who was about to die, opened his eyes wide when he heard this name. “K-Kong Lun?”","“My junior brother, his name is Kong Lun. Have you seen him before? Is he doing well?”","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart and then said slowly, “We met once before. We sat together for a few days and hit it off. He was also an ascetic monk who measured the earth with his feet. However, I’m afraid he has passed away.”","Xing Ge’s entire body trembled, and two streams of tears flowed down his eyes again. He did not make any excessive moves.","A moment later, he said in a low voice, “Forget it, forget it. It’s time for me to do so.”","As the sound of his voice faded, the withered Immortal body disappeared into nothingness. Stars flowed out and eventually scattered on the white bone path.","A Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal died just like that.","Jian Wushuang was silent. He looked at the dark ring bead in his hand and threw it into the Boyang Bottle.","Xing Ge’s death did not affect him too much. What he was thinking about now was how to quickly leave this white bone path.","This place was not as quiet as he had imagined, a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal might just be the beginning.","The most mysterious existence of the white bone path was probably up ahead."]},{"number":4950,"title":"Chapter 4950 Army of Death Immortals","paragraphs":["4950 Army of Death Immortals","With the death of pot-bellied Buddha and Xing Ge’s passing, the white bone path became unobstructed again and Jian Wushuang could see the road ahead.","He collected his thoughts and continued to walk forward with determination.","The path of bones was endless, but the path under his feet had an end.","Jian Wushuang’s feet stepped on the Sword Intent and traversed millions of miles. Under the Blood Sea and on the white bone path, no Yan Immortal could stop him.","After leaving the original pot-bellied Buddha’s domain, the evil and greedy feeling on the white bone path ahead disappeared. Instead, the aura of the ancient restriction surged, filled with the unknown.","At the same time, the white bone path under their feet began to turn grayish black, and most of the scattered Immortal bones were intact, as if they were asleep and could wake up at any time.","Jian Wushuang became alert. At the same time, he restrained the overflowing Yan power and moved forward with the Sword Intent around him.","A cold aura quietly surged from his body. It was very unfamiliar and somewhat familiar.","In the next moment, an extremely cold light suddenly bloomed from the white bone path and shot straight at Jian Wushuang!","He was already on guard. He opened his fingers and shot out a beam of energy.","Boom!","The light of the Yan power destroyed the extremely cold light and blasted towards the white bone path, directly raising a huge wave of dust.","It was a pitch-black Immortal bone holding a True Sword.","As Jian Wushuang destroyed him, he did not stop and shot forward.","However, everything changed. As he moved forward, the ten thousand feet long dust wave slowly came to an end, and then countless dark red death rays burst out.","The Immortal bones lying on the white bone path were all revived at this moment. Their empty eyes were now replaced by dark red death rays.","“Kill!”","At the forefront of the skeleton army, there was a white skeleton that looked like a divine mountain. It was hundreds of feet tall.","He held a broken True Sword and pointed it at Jian Wushuang.","In the next moment, the skeleton army swarmed forward, looking extremely terrifying.","Jian Wushuang knew that something was wrong. Looking at the skeleton army behind him, he realized something.","This new round of bones brought with it an extremely thick death aura, which was exactly the same as the Death Immortal in the Death Immortal Heavenly Region where You Yun was.","They barely retained some of their consciousness, they were extremely eager for the power of the Yan Immortal. Their bodies still had the Immortal source that was about to shatter, their strength could not be underestimated, and it was extremely troublesome.","At present, the army of Death Immortals was endless. If Jian Wushuang didn’t escape as soon as possible, he would be surrounded.","However, the energy released by these Death Immortals was still far beyond his imagination.","Almost at the same time, the army of Death Immortals, which still had their own Immortal Sources, surrounded Jian Wushuang from all directions.","“Damn it, what are these things?” He was shocked, and at the same time, he released a million Sword Intents without hesitation.","But what surprised him was yet to come.","These Death Immortals who were chasing after him would actually dodge the Sword Intent instead of being slaughtered.","For a moment, the million Sword Intents had little effect. They could barely stop the attack for a while. After killing thousands of Death Immortals, he could no longer stop the attack.","Buzz...","Along with a strange sound, dark red light beams rushed out from the bone palms of each Death Immortal and formed a spider web-like net that pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Space seemed to have frozen. He could not escape and was instantly suppressed by the inescapable net.","At the same time, the army of Death Immortals surrounded Jian Wushuang.","Clack...","Accompanied by the sound of stiff bones twisting, the army of Death Immortals automatically made way for him.","Then, a huge Immortal bone that was hundreds of feet tall walked toward Jian Wushuang. It was filled with boundless power and was extremely terrifying.","Their eyes met, and the huge skeleton of the Death Immortal raised the broken sword in its hand, pointing the tip of the sword at him.","“I want to fight you!” A hoarse and ethereal voice rang out from the mouth of the huge Death Immortal skeleton.","Jian Wushuang looked at him and formed an Invisible Sword without saying a word.","“If you lose, your Immortal Source will be mine, and your soul will become my slave,” the Death Immortal skeleton said in a deep voice. Then, he stretched out his palm, tore open the inescapable net, and walked in.","Jian Wushuang was not careless when facing the Death Immortal who was hundreds of feet tall and looked like a divine mountain.","Even though a Death Immortal was half a level weaker than a Yan Immortal, this huge corpse of a Death Immortal did not look like an ordinary Yan Immortal.","Although he was also a skeleton, outside of the skeleton, there were billions of energy threads. He did not look much different from an ordinary Immortal body.","When another dark red Yan power wheel appeared behind him, Jian Wushuang knew that something was wrong.","The light wheel formed, it was at the Six Revolutions stage!","Once he stepped into Six Revolutions, the Grand Yan Immortal would reach the peak!","Even though Jian Wushuang could fight a Grand Yan Immortal, he could only flee when facing a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","As the Death Immortal’s skeleton revealed its strength, Jian Wushuang could not avoid it. The invisible sword in his hand pointed forward.","“Little Yan Immortal, you overestimate yourself!” the corpse of the Death Immortal roared angrily. Then, he directly attacked!","The broken sword in his hand suddenly stabbed into the white bone path on the ground.","Then, the extremely violent Sword Intent tore the white bone path apart and rushed toward Jian Wushuang like several dormant dragons!","The white bone path was broken into pieces, and a huge wave of dust rose.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang suddenly jumped into the air, raised the Invisible Sword in his hand, and pressed down heavily.","Ten Sword Intents that carried thousands of Immortal bones surged up and met the attack!","When the two collided, the entire white bone path shook!","The giant corpse of the Death Immortal wielding the True Sword was forced back a few steps by the tremendous force.","An unparalleled light shattered the Sword Intent that was carrying the Immortal bone from head to toe.","Then, Jian Wushuang landed on the ground. His robe was not stained by any dust.","The light in the Death Immortal skeleton’s eye sockets flickered twice. Then, he raised his True Sword and dashed toward Jian Wushuang.","The white bone path shook. Shi Yan’s heart skipped a beat. In the fight just now, he could feel that although the skeleton of the Death Immortal could still form the Yan power wheel, its strength had already declined to the extreme.","The current Death Immortal skeleton only had Three Revolutions strength at most.","After sensing the change, Jian Wushuang decided to end the battle quickly!","With a wave of his hand, the Ancestral Skill, Transcendence Heavenly Gate condensed.","Then, a giant finger reached straight for the Death Immortal’s skeleton.","Seeing the brilliant light blooming above his head, the Death Immortal skeleton raised the sword in its hand and stabbed it.","Boom...","The giant finger was directly smashed into pieces. As countless tassels fell, they blocked all vision.","“Now!” Jian Wushuang shouted and his body turned into a blue sword light, stabbing forward!"]},{"number":4951,"title":"Chapter 4951 Swordsman","paragraphs":["1 Swordsman","Everything happened too quickly. When the huge Death Immortal skeleton came back to its senses, Jian Wushuang, who had transformed into a sword light, had already arrived in front of it quietly.","With a cold glint in his eyes, the Invisible Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand released its power and the tip of the sword stabbed forward.","In the center was the Immortal source of the dead Immortal skeleton.","As long as the Invisible Sword could pierce through, Jian Wushuang would be able to release millions of Sword Intents in an instant and completely shatter it!","But in the next moment, something unexpected happened!","When the tip of the sword was only an inch away from the Immortal Source of the Death Immortal skeleton, two huge white bone fingers grabbed the blade of his sword and sent him flying.","Jian Wushuang was surprised when he retreated a few hundred feet. He did not expect the Death Immortal skeleton to react so quickly.","After forcing him to retreat, the skeleton of the Death Immortal let out a low groan and slashed forward again.","Facing the huge broken sword blade, Jian Wushuang also raised his sword to deal with it!","Clang! Clang-","The Sword Intent surged, and millions of Sword Intents surged!","The white bone road shook and once again stirred up a huge wave of dust.","The sound of metal clashing resounded throughout the entire Bone Road. The army of Death Immortals surrounding the inescapable net all waved their swords and let out earth-shaking roars.","“K-Kill-”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, who was fighting with the Death Immortal’s skeleton, was even more shocked.","Faced with the Sword Intent that was faster than the previous one, the skeleton of the dead Immortal, which was as huge as a divine mountain, did not feel heavy at all. Instead, it became lighter and lighter.","He was able to withstand Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent with ease.","This was not a reaction that a Yan Immortal who had never come into contact with Sword Dao would have!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Could it be that this Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal also cultivated Sword Dao when he was alive?!”","The battle continued. If he did not release his Wushuang Sword Dao, Jian Wushuang would not be able to do anything to him.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to release the Wushuang Sword Dao, the Death Immortal skeleton suddenly opened its mouth.","“Are you a swordsman?”","The hoarse voice was like a big palm that plucked the string in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","“Are you a swordsman too?” he asked.","There was no answer, but the face of the Death Immortal skeleton put on an unknown expression.","“I didn’t expect to meet a living swordsman in this sealed land.”","“Before I was exiled, in my long life, there were less than ten Yan Immortals who could be called swordsmen. Now that I have seen a True Swordsman, the Heavenly Dao has treated me well.”","He forced Jian Wushuang to retreat and stood still.","“I’m also a swordsman, but that was a long time ago. You’re one of the few people I call a swordsman.”","Jian Wushuang did not comment on it, but the Invisible Sword in his hand was still ready.","“Now, let’s use the swordsmen’s method to solve this. Perhaps the opportunity for me to break through to the Sword Immortal realm will appear by fighting you.”","As the Death Immortal Skeleton spoke, it pressed down the broken True Sword in its hand and pointed the blade at Jian Wushuang.","Hearing his last sentence, Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up and he said loudly, “You still have a long way to go to become a Sword Immortal. It’s like a natural moat.”","“Then there are only two paths for me to take today. I will break through to become a Sword Immortal, or I will be killed by you.”","The skeleton of the Death Immortal said in a deep voice. The True Sword in its hand slashed down heavily at this moment.","The white bone road beneath his feet was also plowed open by this attack!","“Sword of the Great Celestial River!”","He said in a deep and angry voice. At this moment, the broken blade exploded with the most dazzling sword. A magnificent light surged out of his True Sword.","The space was suppressed, and the inescapable net was shattered by this sword move.","Jian Wushuang felt the pressure, like a divine mountain was pressing on him.","This sword move was enough proof of a True Swordsman!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn and the Invisible Sword in his hand was shining.","The second move of the Unparalleled Sword Dao’s Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","River.","The majestic celestial river came from the sky, breaking through the void and arriving.","Billions of Sword Intents formed the celestial river, and it was extremely magnificent.","At this moment, the two celestial rivers collided, creating the most magnificent scene on the white bone path.","When the army of Death Immortals who had been surrounding the area saw this scene, they all retreated crazily with tacit understanding.","However, it was too late. The two celestial rivers collided, and the terrifying power that erupted swept everything away.","Some of the Death Immortals who were slower were turned into dust on the spot.","Under the illumination of this sword light, the Death Immortal skeleton subconsciously covered its eyes, and then its body was swallowed by the sword light.","At this moment, the boundless Sword Intent replaced the Yan power and devoured everything.","The clash of Sword Intents lasted for a long time. It was not until the white bone road was reduced to dust that the Sword of the Great Celestial River came to an end.","The waves of dust returned to silence, and all things returned to dust.","Jian Wushuang appeared on the path of broken bones that was covered in Immortal bone dust.","Under the white dust that filled the sky, only his black clothes were not stained by any dust.","In front of him, a hundred feet away, stood the corpse of a Death Immortal that was hundreds of feet tall.","The broken True Sword in his hand finally shattered completely. Not even the hilt was left behind, and his pupils were dim and silent.","“You shattered my Sword Dao.”","“Yes, but that’s all I can do,” Jian Wushuang said slowly, his eyes flickering.","“Was that the True Sword Dao just now?” The Death Immortal’s skeleton stared at him, trying to find an answer.","Jian Wushuang did not hide anything and said, “That’s my Sword Dao, the Sword Principle that I comprehended.”","“I didn’t expect that I could fight a True Swordsman in this state. I’m already satisfied,” the skeleton said. “You’re not a swordsman.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He did not need others to judge whether he was a swordsman or not.","“You’ve already surpassed the realm of swordsmen. You’re a Sword Immortal.”","“I have no regrets to be able to watch a Sword Immortal’s sword moves.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly. This did not sound like something an extremely proud Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal would say.","After the skeleton finished speaking, it seemed to be satisfied. The flowing Immortal Source in its Immortal body also quietly shattered at this moment.","He did not want his Immortal Source to break. In the previous fight, Jian Wushuang’s sword strike was aimed at the Immortal Source of the Death Immortal’s skeleton.","Once the Immortal Source was broken, even a Grand Yan Immortal could only die, and the skeleton of a Death Immortal who had died once was no exception."]},{"number":4952,"title":"Chapter 4952 Jiang Li and Yan Fan (1)","paragraphs":["2 Jiang Li and Yan Fan (1)","As the Immortal Source shattered, the skeleton of the Death Immortal kneeled heavily on the broken white bone path. Its huge bone palm waved in the air, as if it wanted to keep the disappearing Immortal Source.","“I am going to die...” the Death Immortal skeleton murmured softly. However, when the death light in its eyes was about to die out, it suddenly lit up again, as if it was the last ray of light.","“Although you are a Sword Immortal, there are more Sword Immortals on this path. I look forward to your battle, but I can’t watch it anymore.”","“Their Sword Dao is even stronger than yours. You won’t win so easily.”","After saying that, the skeleton of the Death Immortal completely fell like a broken divine mountain. His Immortal bones were completely shattered into powder and could no longer be revived.","Standing on the slowly healing white bone path, Jian Wushuang was silent. Although his expression was calm, his heart was already trembling.","There were actually Sword Immortals on the path of bones?!","This news shocked Jian Wushuang more than any other news.","To be fair, a Sword Immortal was an existence that was simply unimaginable.","To Jian Wushuang’s knowledge, only Ding Baiyi could be called a real Sword Immortal!","Even Jian Wushuang himself did not recognize himself as a Sword Immortal. He had a feeling that he could only fight Ding Baiyi after he had integrated the last move of the Wushuang Sword Dao.","At that time, he could be called a Sword Immortal.","And right now, a Grand Yan Immortal who could be called a Sword Immortal by the corpse of a Death Immortal was definitely a terrifying existence.","Jian Wushuang felt a headache coming on. What kind of terrifying existence was trapped on this white bone path?","Just as he was deep in thought, the Death Immortals who had disappeared quietly revived at this moment.","Dark red beams of death shot out from their eyes.","“Damn it, haven’t these things been dispersed?” Jian Wushuang was shocked and then he ran away without thinking.","Although he was not afraid of the army of Death Immortals, it was still a mistake to waste his energy.","Therefore, in the following time, a figure could be seen running wildly, and behind him was an endless army of Death Immortals.","The white bone path was endless, and as they continued forward, it became wider and more vast.","There were broken Immortal bones everywhere, treasures without spirituality, and broken True Swords. It was extremely miserable.","Just as he was about to destroy everything, the white bone path beneath him trembled as if something was awakening.","“Disturbing my long slumber, I think you little bugs are really tired of living.”","A lazy and slightly angry voice seemed to resound from the heavens.","The next moment, the clear sound of a long sword being unsheathed echoed across the battlefield of bones.","Along with the clear sound of the long sword being unsheathed, the Death Immortal army that was chasing after Jian Wushuang frantically fled.","However, it was too late.","The sword curtain rose silently like a million meteors falling, causing the entire dark red void to tremble.","The endless void and the hundreds of millions of miles of white bone path were all covered by the sword curtain!","Every Sword Intent that formed the sword screen was filled with a calm and endless will. Although it seemed peaceful, it made everything lose its color.","Under the cover of the meteor-like sword curtain, none of the Death Immortals survived!","They died so easily that Jian Wushuang could not believe it.","The final desolation of the endless Sword Intent shattered all the Death Immortals!","On the ancient battlefield, dust filled the air.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the center of the sword curtain, did not feel any fluctuation. This ability to control the Sword Intent was extremely terrifying.","Jian Wushuang stood rooted to the ground, ready to condense Sword Intent in his palm.","However, at the same time, a cold aura appeared behind him. “Hey, Junior, don’t try to draw your sword. Your speed will never be faster than mine. If you don’t believe me, you can try.”","Cold sweat flowed down from Jian Wushuang’s temples. The fact that this person could sneak behind him without a sound was enough to explain the problem.","Immediately after, a layer of ripples appeared in the originally silent void, and then a figure walked out of the ripples.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes wide.","It was a woman, a woman with an extremely heroic spirit.","Her long and narrow willow-like eyebrows slanted into her temples, and her handsome eyes were extremely attractive. The embroidered red belt that tied her long hair behind her back also fluttered in the wind.","She was wearing a black and gold dress, and at her waist were six long swords!","This was a swordsman!","Looking at the six long swords hanging at her waist, Jian Wushuang could not help but swallow.","There was a tiger in front and a wolf behind. He was in danger today!","As time passed, Jian Wushuang did not dare to move.","After a long while, the heroic woman with six swords on her back suddenly said, “This junior is not bad.”","Immediately after, the mysterious figure behind him also spoke, “Indeed, not bad. His willpower is extremely stable. He’s a great talent.”","When the heroic woman heard this, her eyes twitched and she said coldly, “Since he’s a big shot, why are you still squatting behind him? Are you going to kill him?”","As soon as she finished speaking, the dense aura behind Jian Wushuang disappeared. Then, a figure appeared in front of the heroic woman in an instant.","“No, I’m just used to it. I can’t bear to kill a junior with such talent. There’s great use in keeping him!”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang saw the figure.","It was also a handsome middle-aged man. He had a clean face and no beard. His eyes were bright like stars, but there was a hint of laziness in them.","On his waist, there were also six long swords.","The middle-aged man could not hide the smile on his face as he faced the heroic-looking woman.","‘It can’t be. These two swordsmen can’t be Sword Companions, right?’","Jian Wushuang felt a headache coming on. It seemed that the two swordsmen were indeed Sword Companions.","He was afraid that it would not be so easy for him to escape from this place...","“This Junior is indeed not bad, I saw his Sword Dao earlier, it was very shocking, he could destroy a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source,” the heroic-looking woman said slowly.","After the middle-aged man heard her description, the smile on his face gradually disappeared and he became extremely solemn."]},{"number":4953,"title":"Chapter 4953 Jiang Li and Yan Fan (2)","paragraphs":["3 Jiang Li and Yan Fan (2)","How strong was a Sword Dao that could destroy the Immortal Source of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal?","“In other words, the one who caused the commotion on the White Bone Path was this junior?” the middle-aged man asked slowly.","The heroic-looking woman nodded. “That’s right. I happened to witness that battle. It was exciting enough.”","“If it really is him, it seems that I woke up at the right time.” The middle-aged man looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled.","Jian Wushuang felt a chill down his spine. He could feel that although the two Sword Companions did not reveal any strength, they were definitely more terrifying than a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Thinking of this, he suddenly realized something.","The Death Immortal’s skeleton said that there were Sword Immortals on the White Bone Path before he died. Could these two swordsmen be Sword Immortals?!","“That big guy had barely enough strength when he was alive. Now that he’s dead, his strength is at most Three Revolutions. It’s not impossible for him to be killed by a powerful swordsman. However, what makes me curious is...”","The heroic-looking woman paused and looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. “Young Man, did you create that Sword Principle?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and nodded. “Yes.”","“If you really created it yourself, your future achievements will be immeasurable,” the heroic-looking woman said, then stretched out her palm and waved it in the air.","In an instant, a painting scroll appeared in the originally chaotic void.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted when he saw this.","The painting was actually the battle between him and the skeleton of the Death Immortal!","In the painting, the celestial river was flowing. The Death Immortal’s skeleton was finally penetrated by the celestial river and knelt on the White Bone Path.","Jian Wushuang had never expected that the scene of their fight would be completely copied.","This heroic woman was no ordinary swordsman!","When the scroll finally dissipated, the middle-aged man looked at Jian Wushuang with a bright light in his eyes.","“He’s indeed very strong. I’ve taken a fancy to this junior!”","“Come, come, come. Junior, fight with me for three rounds. I haven’t seen such a good candidate in a long time.”","When the middle-aged man heard this, he raised his eyebrows and said, “So you’re in a hurry. That’s even easier. If you can last three rounds under my hands, we’ll let you leave in one piece. If you avoid fighting, I’m afraid it’ll be hard to say.”","Jian Wushuang felt a headache coming on. He could feel that the two hidden Sword Companions were definitely more terrifying than they appeared.","It was not an easy task to last three rounds.","“What do you think?” The middle-aged man raised his eyebrows and revealed a meaningful smile.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang replied, “Come on then. I’ll make it clear that you’ll let me go as long as I can last three rounds.”","“Delightful!” The middle-aged man laughed and flew to Jian Wushuang.","The hem of his black and gold robe fluttered in the wind. His right hand was pressed on the hilts of the six long swords at his waist, and he was indescribably wanton.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and formed an Invisible Sword in his palm.","The middle-aged man’s eyes lit up when he saw this. “Shapeless and intangible, using the Sword Dao as a sword. Junior, you’re very bold.”","He continued, “I don’t dare to claim such praise. My sword was destroyed, so I have no choice but to do this.”","The Tarot Divine Sword was destroyed by Ding Beichun, which was the fundamental reason why Jian Wushuang had condensed the Invisible Sword.","The middle-aged man smiled and nodded. “My name is Yan Fan. That woman is my wife, Jiang Li.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands. “Jian Wushuang.”","“Wushuang Sword Dao. It sounds good, and has a meaning behind it. Let’s begin.”","The entire Battlefield of Bones fell silent.","The middle-aged man named Yan Fan did not seem to want to make the first move. He just looked at him with a smile.","Jian Wushuang calmed himself down. He was not afraid of a pure competition of Sword Principles. What he was thinking about was how to draw the three moves in the next fight.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang moved like a thunderbolt. He swung his sword at an extremely fast speed and slashed at Yan Fan with his sharp blade.","Even Grand Yan Immortals did not dare to underestimate this ordinary sword strike.","But then, a shocking scene appeared.","Facing this sword, Yan Fan did not dodge or dodge. He stood still on the spot and raised his index and middle fingers of his right hand to catch the Invisible Sword that was slashing down.","The Invisible Sword that was formed by the Wushuang Sword Dao was caught by two fingers!","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted. He realized that the Invisible Sword could not advance any further!","Jian Wushuang retreated a few feet. He was completely solemn. Yan Fan, who did not reveal anything at all, was like a towering divine mountain. No one could guess what he was going to do next.","Yan Fan was still smiling. He put his right hand on the hilt of his sword and walked slowly to Jian Wushuang.","“Again.”","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and prepared to fight again.","However, this time, he had just raised the Invisible Sword in his hand when he was hit head-on.","Yan Fan’s right hand, which was pressing on the hilt of his sword, suddenly raised and a long sword was unsheathed. With the hilt as the head, it carried an endless force and instantly smashed into Jian Wushuang’s chest.","Bang!","Everything happened so fast that it was over before Jian Wushuang could react.","He only felt that his chest was about to shatter, and his body retreated a few dozen feet before he could digest that huge force.","The unsheathed sword returned to its sheath as if nothing had happened.","Yan Fan still looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile. He was always calm.","Rubbing his aching chest, Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth. He had been in a passive position during the two fights and was almost suppressed by Yan Fan.","This made him depressed, but at the same time, he had a certain understanding of Yan Fan.","“From the day I started practicing the sword, I spent a whole Hua Year just to unsheathe the sword. During that one Hua Year, I only tried my best to unsheathe the sword as fast as possible so that I could have a slight advantage.”","“Up until now, there hasn’t been a single Yan Immortal who could block my unsheathing.”","Yan Fan blinked. “How about it? Are you interested in learning swordsmanship from me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked."]},{"number":4954,"title":"Chapter 4954 A Battle With a Sword Immortal","paragraphs":["4 A Battle With a Sword Immortal","It was simply unimaginable that he had practiced for an entire Hua Year just to unsheathe the sword!","After ten universe cycles, he had only repeated something that even a three-year-old child could do. This kind of perseverance could not be described with any words.","Even Jian Wushuang could not imagine how stubborn he was about the Dao of the sword.","He had only cultivated for ten million years, so he was sincerely impressed by this old monster who could cultivate for a Hua Year.","Facing Yan Fan’s question, Jian Wushuang could only shake his head with a bitter smile.","Then, he asked, “You are a Sword Immortal?”","Hearing this, Yan Fan raised his eyebrows and smiled. “Of course. Not only am I a Sword Immortal, but my wife is also a Sword Immortal.”","A pair of Sword Companions, two Sword Immortals.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. When he learned that these two were real Sword Immortals, he knew why Yan Fan had made the Pact of Three Swords Moves.","This was the meaning of stopping at a certain point.","Once one stepped into the realm of Sword Immortals, one would basically be an existence at the peak.","Ding Baiyi was the first Sword Immortal that Jian Wushuang knew. Jiang Li and Yan Fan were the other two Sword Immortals that he had met.","There was a fundamental difference between a Sword Immortal and a Swordsman. Jian Wushuang, who had not mastered the Wushuang Sword Doctrine, was not a Sword Immortal.","“Junior, show me your true ability. Let me take a good look and see if the younger generation is formidable,” Yan Fan patted the hilt of his sword and said loudly.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang restrained his aura and his entire body was like a True Sword that was ready to be used.","The northern wind blew gently, causing a ripple to appear in the void.","In the next moment, he opened his eyes and a cold light shot out from them!","Selfless True Shadow, integration.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","The sword slashed out without any fancy moves, causing the entire void to tremble.","The incomparably violent Star-style Sword Intent shattered the void and devoured everything in front of it. The void along the way exploded into pillars of light!","Faced with this move, Yan Fan quietly drew a Snowflake longsword from the six longswords at his waist.","Then, he held the sword with both hands and cut a cross in front of his eyes.","The void was shattered.","In the next moment, the violent Star-style Sword Intent was cut into a cross, turning into four raging rivers that exploded in the void.","Yan Fan, who was in the middle, was completely unharmed. Even the corner of his clothes was not torn.","The violent Sword Intent wind blew his hair. Other than that, there was no other fluctuation.","When the Sword Intent completely dissipated, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly when he saw Yan Fan unharmed.","Could it be that even the Wushuang Sword Dao could not affect him at all?","Yan Fan drew his sword and sheathed it again. He smiled at Jian Wushuang.","“If my guess is correct, this sword move is the beginning of the previous sword move.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He was terrifying enough to be able to guess the connection between the Sword Intents.","Yan Fan continued, “Not bad. It’s the first time I’ve seen such power as the beginning of a Sword Principle.”","“You passed the first move. The next two moves will depend on your luck,” he said. At this moment, the aura that was overflowing from his body was completely restrained!","The Snowflake Sword that he had sheathed was pulled out again and the tip of the sword that emitted a cold light was pointed at Jian Wushuang!","A sense of great danger surged from the bottom of his heart. He did not think and directly raised his Invisible Sword to deal with it.","At this moment, the originally somewhat broken void silently reflected an endless cold light.","The ripple-like sword screen covered the entire void.","This was the True Sword of a Sword Immortal!","This sword had killed the army of 100,000 Death Immortals.","Countless swords formed an endless sword screen.","If this move was completely executed, Jian Wushuang would definitely be severely injured.","Jian Wushuang’s divine thoughts spun rapidly in the face of the sword screen.","The heroic woman who was watching from afar, Jiang Li, had a serious look on her face. Her hand was on the hilt of her sword as if she was ready to help.","Although she admired Jian Wushuang’s amazing performance, Jiang Li did not think that Jian Wushuang could take the attack alone.","As a Sword Companion, she was absolutely convinced of how terrifying Yan Fan’s sword strike was.","Therefore, Jiang Li was ready to help Jian Wushuang at any time.","The void was bright, and the sword curtain fell. The boundless Sword Intent was enough to easily destroy the Heavenly Dao.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the center, suddenly opened his eyes as he faced the endless sword curtain.","A green Sword Intent that was completely different from the previous Wushuang Sword Dao rose from under his feet.","If the Wushuang Sword Dao represented magnificence and peerless will, then the green Sword Intent represented vitality, rebirth, and tenacity.","Even Yan Fan was confused. He could feel that this Sword Intent was completely different from Jian Wushuang’s Sword Principle. It was a brand new Sword Intent.","“Could it be that this junior has comprehended another type of Sword Dao?!”","No one answered him. At this moment, Jian Wushuang was completely enveloped by the green Sword Intent.","The grass and leaves also rotated along with it, soft and tough.","Even his pupils had a lush green color.","Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","The eighth move.","Cutting the Four Seasons.","When the Sword Principle reached its peak, anything could be used as a sword. A straw grass or a willow branch was enough to release Sword Intent.","Boundless Sword Intent turned into green leaves and leaves that rose up into the sky, as if spring was coming.","The entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style, the first six moves were called Simple, and the last three forms were called Complex. It was in line with the principle of the Great Dao becoming Simple and from Simple to Complex.","The Cutting the Four Seasons was also the most terrifying sword move of the entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","You can see the great path in the small world.","Boundless verdant grass transformed into a 30,000-meter-long sword, standing tall in the sword curtain that was pressing down.","The two collided, creating the most terrifying scene.","The Grass Sword formed by the green Sword Intent began to shatter under the pressure of the sword curtain!","The sword curtain collapsed and the Grass Sword shattered, causing the entire battlefield of bones to tremble.","Looking at the Grass Sword that was about to shatter, Jian Wushuang’s calm face did not change at all. It was as if he was not worried at all.","Jiang Li also rushed over at this moment. She looked anxious and was ready to stop the tragedy.","At the same time, she looked angry. She looked at Yan Fan and could not help but reprimand him, “You brat, don’t you know how to restrain yourself?”"]},{"number":4955,"title":"Chapter 4955 Do You Want to Become a Disciple?","paragraphs":["5 Do You Want to Become a Disciple?","At this moment, Yan Fan ignored Jiang Li’s reproach and looked at what was happening in the sword screen.","After a long while, he said with uncertainty, “This Junior seems to have broken my sword strike.”","“What?” Jiang Li was about to stop the tragedy when he heard that. He stopped in the air and turned around. “What did you say?”","“This Junior seems to be able to break my sword strike...”","As if to confirm his thoughts, the Grass Sword that was originally shattered and about to collapse actually stopped shattering and began to rapidly condense.","In the next moment, the Grass Sword that had almost collapsed reappeared. Its Sword Intent was even more vigorous, and it was filled with a tenacious and majestic force. At the same time, it stabbed at the sword screen that filled the sky again.","Rumble!","It was as if the Heavenly Dao had collapsed, the earth had collapsed, and everything had fallen into destruction.","This was the final collision of the two powerful Sword Intents, so much so that even the Yan power was overshadowed at this moment.","The explosion that was so intense that it could destroy the White Bone Path lasted for a long time.","When the endless sword screen was completely shattered and the incomparably green Sword Intent dissipated, a black-robed figure slowly walked out on the broken path.","Jian Wushuang’s face was still calm, but there was a hint of redness at the corner of his mouth.","Although he had calculated everything that could happen, he was still injured. Fortunately, he had made the right bet.","The Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style was not as exquisite, magnificent, and unparalleled as the Wushuang Sword Dao. However, at this moment, he had successfully helped Jian Wushuang win this move.","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up slightly. The injuries he suffered in this competition were almost negligible.","And all of this was because he had used the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","If Jian Wushuang had used the Wushuang Sword Dao, he would have been able to take Yan Fan’s full-powered sword attack head-on, but he would have to pay a heavy price.","This was because this was the sword of a Sword Immortal.","Jian Wushuang did not want to suffer a heavy price because he would be doomed if he suffered any losses in the following White Bone Path.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang did not choose to take it head-on. Instead, he used the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style to deal with it.","The sword style of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword, from simple to complex, meant tenacity and rebirth. This was enough for him to face it with the least amount of loss.","Fortunately, he succeeded.","Walking out of the center of the explosion, Jian Wushuang, who was unscathed and his robe was not even stained with dust, came to Jiang Li and Yan Fan calmly.","The Sword Companions, the Sword Immortals, they finally recovered from their shock.","They looked at each other and then at Jian Wushuang.","To be able to take a Sword Immortal’s attack head-on with the strength of a swordsman was something that would not be convincing to the Yan Immortals in any Heavenly Region.","But this scene actually happened.","Taking a deep breath, Yan Fan said, “Young Man, your performance has exceeded our expectations. I’m afraid that in less than a Hua Year, even if your Sword Principle stagnates, you will be able to reach the realm of Sword Immortal.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said, “Senior, you flatter me. To cultivate the sword, one must focus on one’s own luck.”","“There’s still one last sword move. If I win, can you two Seniors let me go?”","Jiang Li and Yan Fan looked at each other and then said, “Are we that scary that you don’t want to stay?”","“Uh, you guys are still considered approachable...” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “But I really have something important to do. I need to leave this place as soon as possible.”","“If that’s the case, if I continue to obstruct you, it will seem like I’m not free and easy,” Yan Fan smiled. “This last sword fight is meaningless. You’ve already proved it to me.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was secretly delighted. It was undoubtedly the best situation for him to walk out of the Sword Immortal’s hands almost unscathed.","“Then this Junior will thank you here.”","Yan Fan nodded with a smile. He glanced at Jiang Li, then quickly walked to Jian Wushuang and put his arm around his shoulder.","This action made Jian Wushuang a little confused.","Looking at Yan Fan’s malicious face, he felt a chill run down his spine.","“Senior, this is...”","“Cough cough, Junior... No, Little Brother Jian, do you want to take me as your master?”","Yan Fan cleared his throat and looked at him with anticipation and enthusiasm.","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry. He said, “Senior, I already have a master. I’m afraid I can’t.”","Yan Fan did not expect this answer. He was a little anxious. “Little Brother, you have to know that you can’t just recognize your master randomly. You have to find the one who matches you the most. That’s the best.”","As he said this, he patted his chest. “Little Brother, as long as you acknowledge me as your master, your master’s wife and I will pass on our lifetime’s worth of Comprehension to you. Think about it.”","The two Sword Immortals had offered such a tempting condition, which was enough to make any swordsman in the Heavenly Region go crazy.","However, Jian Wushuang still shook his head, “Senior, I have a master. I really can’t.”","Yan Fan was speechless. He had never expected that he would not be able to become someone’s master even if he wanted to...","At this moment, Jiang Li appeared behind him and slapped him away.","“Old Man, how many years have passed, but you’re still so generous. Go away, Kid,” Jiang Li shouted angrily and then looked at Jian Wushuang. “We’ll meet again if we’re fated to.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said, “Thank you.”","Just as he was about to turn around and leave, Yan Fan’s voice rang out again. “Wait a minute!”","Jian Wushuang stopped and looked helplessly at Yan Fan who had caught up with him.","Before he could react, Yan Fan held his right hand and quickly tapped his wrist with his index and middle fingers.","Then, a True Sword imprint the size of an index finger was imprinted on his wrist.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly withdrew his wrist and tried to force out the mark with his Yan power.","“There’s no need to waste your effort, Little Brother. This mark doesn’t harm you in any way. It’s my Sword Intent that can sense where you are. If you’re in danger, your master’s wife and I will save you at the first moment..”","Before he finished, he was slapped again. Jiang Li put one hand on her waist and was furious.","“What a disrespectful fellow. He’s simply a Sword Immortal in vain.”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. It was unbelievable that he could get two masters for free even though he had refused to obey.","After silently sympathizing with Yan Fan, who had been beaten up, he solemnly bid farewell to the two Sword Immortals and continued to head toward the end of the White Bone Path.","Yan Fan, who had been dejected, was instantly energized after Jian Wushuang left. He ran to Jiang Li excitedly and said, “How is it? How is our disciple?”"]},{"number":4956,"title":"Chapter 4956 Ruins of the Ancient Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["6 Ruins of the Ancient Heavenly Court","Jiang Li rolled her eyes and said nothing. After Jian Wushuang left, she started to talk.","“I can’t see through his future either, but I can be sure of one thing now. The realm of Sword Immortal won’t be his end, but his starting point.”","Yan Fan took a deep breath when he heard that. “Then it seems like we didn’t take this disciple in vain.”","“What do you mean your disciple? Didn’t you see that he had already decisively rejected you?” Jiang Li rolled her eyes at him again.","He smiled embarrassedly and scratched his head. “So what? If you want to be a master, you have to be thick-skinned. It’s very necessary to pester him. I’ve already left a mark on him. Do you think he can escape from us?”","Jiang Li looked at Yan Fan and then at the endless void. “I’m afraid this is the limit of our lives. Instead of sleeping in this Blood Sea, why don’t we leave and pass on our swordsmanship to that little guy so that we can be relieved of the burden our master gave us?”","Yan Fan nodded and stretched. “Indeed. After staying under this sea of blood for too long, my bones are about to rust. It’s time to do some serious business.”","“Our Sword Dao will not be buried if we pass it on to that Kid. Perhaps he will reach another realm.”","“So, we can’t let this little guy go!”","...","Jian Wushuang let out a long sigh after he left the two Sword Immortals and traveled for another thousand miles.","The pressure that the Sword Immortals gave him was too great. If those two Sword Immortals were determined not to let him leave, then there was no way he could escape.","Raising his right hand and looking at the sword-shaped mark on his wrist, Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly.","He collected his thoughts and continued forward.","The path of bones under his feet seemed to be endless. Although he had experienced many hardships, he still could not see the end.","This made Jian Wushuang feel a little depressed. If he continued to waste time like this, he was afraid that he would sink into the Endless Sea before Di Qing could be found.","No matter what happened next, he had to leave this place as soon as possible, leave the so-called Heavenly Continent, and find Di Qing.","With his Sword Intent protecting his body, Jian Wushuang dashed forward and traveled a million miles in an instant!","As he continued to move forward, he began to notice that the further he went, the less restless the aura became. All the Immortal aura had dissipated, and even the Immortal bones could not become dead Immortals. It was extremely quiet.","At the same time, a pure and dense energy was flowing.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He had never expected that such a dense Yan power would be formed under the Blood River.","At the same time, this made him raise his guard.","The following changes on the White Bone Path also made him wary.","The originally flat White Bone Path paved by the remains of the Yan Immortals began to curve as they continued forward, like a staircase going up.","Jian Wushuang stopped and looked at the White Bone Path in front of him with a serious expression.","The White Bone Path leading to the heavens was covered with a layer of faint energy that extended into the endless void. At the end of the dark clouds, there was a very vague outline.","He muttered in his heart. The scene before him seemed to be somewhat similar to the Heavenly Palace on the Heavenly Continent.","If there were other branches on the White Bone Path, Jian Wushuang would not have bothered to continue. But now, there was only one White Bone Path, so he had to continue.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stepped on the Stairway to Heaven.","When his feet landed on the first step, an invisible pressure pressed down on him.","The pressure was formless and substantial, as if it was some kind of law that directly pressed down.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He flew forward and in an instant, he had crossed 10,000 steps!","After 10,000 steps, Jian Wushuang stopped. There were beads of sweat on his temples.","The pressure on the Stairway to Heaven was far more terrifying than he had imagined. Moreover, after reaching a certain level, the pressure would multiply!",",000 steps forced Jian Wushuang to stop. It was as if there were millions of divine mountains pressing down on him.","Looking at the endless road ahead, he gritted his teeth and continued forward.","This time, his speed was much slower.",",000 steps.",",000 steps.",",000 steps.","...",",000 steps!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was struggling to move forward. The Yan power in his meridians had been circulated to the extreme.","Every pore on his body was evaporating a large amount of sweat.",",000 steps!","Selfless True Shadow was forced out.","With the help of the Selfless True Shadow, Jian Wushuang felt relaxed and could move forward quickly again.","When he reached the 90,000 steps, the huge palace that was originally wrapped in black smoke finally appeared.","It was a majestic Heavenly Palace built in the sky, filled with an endless cold aura.","Jian Wushuang had an inexplicable intuition that this palace was most likely an imperial palace that had been left behind since the ancient era.","A Heavenly Court!","Could this be the ruins of the former Heavenly Court?!","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang thought of the former Heavenly Court of Emperor Liu Ya.","In the past, the Heavenly Court meant that opportunities and great dangers coexisted.","However, he had no interest in exploring this Heavenly Court. After all, even if the Emperor was angry, it was a pressure that he could not withstand.","However, Jian Wushuang had no way to escape. He could only brace himself and go to the former Heavenly Court.","The last 10,000 steps were almost a combination of the first 90,000 steps. All the pressure was unprecedented.","Jian Wushuang almost could not hold on even with the Selfless True Shadow. He did not even dare to take a breath for fear that he would be crushed into powder by the terrifying pressure.",",000 steps.",",000 thousand steps.","...",",000 thousand steps!","At this point, Jian Wushuang’s three Great Daos were all suppressed!","The Wushuang Sword Dao.","The Dao of Protection.","The Slaughter Dao.","Only with the addition of three Great Daos could he move forward!",",900 steps.","When he reached the last step, he was already an arrow at the end of its flight.","At this moment, sweat no longer flowed out of every pore, but dark red divine blood!","The divine blood dripped down his robe in front of the celestial heavens and was quickly absorbed.","Jian Wushuang’s hands trembled as he took out an Emperor-grade pill and stuffed it into his mouth. Only then did his injuries stop.","Some of the shattered parts of the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body quickly recovered.","Jian Wushuang slowly exhaled a mouthful of turbid breath. He felt relaxed and the fatigue from before disappeared.","He subconsciously looked behind him and was surprised to find that the White Bone Path had completely disappeared!","It was as if it had never existed. There was only an endless void behind it.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang turned around and walked into the boundless and majestic Heavenly Court.","“Who dares to trespass into the Heavenly Court?!”","Outside the Heavenly Coourt, a voice echoed in the void in front of the silent giant door."]},{"number":4957,"title":"Chapter 4957 Emperor Zhen Wu","paragraphs":["7 Emperor Zhen Wu","As this majestic voice resounded, two Grand Yan Immortals holding Heavenly Halberds tore through the void and walked out.","Both of them were Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals!","Jian Wushuang became alert and formed an Invisible Sword in his palm.","“Those who trespass the Heavenly Court with swords will die!”","The two Grand Yan Immortals holding the Heavenly Halberd shouted out, their eyes emitting a cold light!","In fact, Jian Wushuang was still helpless against both Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals. However, he could not avoid them now. He could only fight!","The two halberds crossed and instantly shot out an unparalleled light!","These two gatekeepers of the Heavenly Courts did not even ask for the reason and directly attacked.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to respond.","With a slash of his sword, 36,000 Sword Intents rose up and all of them slashed forward.","Having comprehended his strongest Sword Intent, Jian Wushuang’s control of Sword Principle and Sword Intent had reached an unprecedented level.","It was not just the Sword Dao, but the Ancestral Skills and Immortal Styles were also one step closer.","If it was not for the lack of Immortal Source, Jian Wushuang was confident that he would have reached the Grand Yan Immortal Realm after the battle with the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens Chang Duoling!","However, there were no ifs. The current him was still at the peak of the Yan Immortal Stage.","However, this Yan Immortal had the terrifying strength to kill a Grand Yan Immortal.","Faced with the cold light that shot over, the 36,000 Sword Intents attacked from all directions.","Rumble!","In front of Heavenly Court, the most magnificent explosion occurred.","The two gatekeepers of the Heavenly Courts retreated in unison, their eyes becoming cautious and solemn.","Jian Wushuang raised his long sword and stood still. He did not pursue the victory. “I have no intention of entering the Heavenly Court, but this is the only way out. If you can tell me the other way out, I will definitely leave.”","Hearing this, the two gatekeepers looked at each other, and the killing intent in their eyes disappeared.","In the end, an elderly Grand Yan Immortal stepped forward and said in a deep voice, “Go back first. Don’t disturb the Emperor’s sleep. Once he wakes up, no one can save you.”","“I don’t mean to disturb you, but I’m afraid this is the only way I can leave, so I can’t retreat.”","Jian Wushuang did not retreat and said in a serious voice.","“How dare you, a mere Yan Immortal like you dare to be so arrogant? Aren’t you afraid that I’ll kill you on the spot?” The gatekeeper took another step forward, and the hand holding the Heavenly Halberd seemed to be about to kill in the next moment.","He remained standing at the same spot and said calmly, “You can’t kill me.”","“How arrogant!” The gatekeeper was so angry that he laughed. The halberd in his hand was about to hit Jian Wushuang.","However, at this moment, something unexpected happened.","The Heavenly Halberd that was lifted up high was placed horizontally above Jian Wushuang’s head. It was unable to advance any further as if it was bound by some invisible Heavenly Dao.","Even if his face was flushed red, he could not take another step forward.","Jian Wushuang felt strange. He did not release any Yan power or Sword Intent to block the gatekeeper. However, the gatekeeper did not seem to be faking it. He was really being restrained.","In the next moment, the huge gate of the Heavenly Courts that seemed to have been silent for countless years slowly opened, reflecting endless light.","The expressions of the two gatekeepers changed drastically. Without thinking, they knelt heavily in front of the Heavenly Court on the spot, not even daring to raise their heads.","The light dissipated in an instant, and everything returned to normal.","“Come in...”","A deep and ethereal voice that was above the Heavenly Dao resounded from the Heavenly Court.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat.","“A living Emperor?!”","He was in disbelief. Could it be that an Emperor had really been sealed in the Endless Sea?!","Suppressing his restless divine thoughts, Jian Wushuang finally decided to enter the Heavenly Court.","He had already made up his mind. If the Emperor did not intend to let him go, he would at most die. At least he could be reborn in the future.","Stepping into the Heavenly Courts, the warm jade ground beneath his feet lit up quietly, illuminating the entire Heavenly Court.","The Heavenly Court was vast and vast, there were no pillars of mountains and seas, no tables to sit on, only emptiness.","Jian Wushuang felt a chill down his spine as he stood in the Heavenly Court.","“You’re here...”","The ethereal voice resounded in the Heavenly Courts, and he was unable to tell where it came from.","“You are the first guest I have seen since I fell into a deep slumber, and I had long predicted this day to come a few years ago.”","As the voice fell, a figure in an emperor’s robe slowly walked out from the depths of the Heavenly Courts.","An indescribable Heavenly Dao aura circulated around his body, making people dare not look at him directly.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted as if he had seen something unbelievable.","The figure of the Imperial Emperor in the imperial robe looked exactly the same as Zhen Wuyang!","Whether it was his appearance, figure, or the aura flowing around his body, he was exactly the same as Zhen Wuyang. It was as if he was carved from the same mold!","“Do you find me very familiar, exactly like the Emperor in your heart?” the Emperor came to Jian Wushuang slowly and said calmly.","Jian Wushuang was shocked and said solemnly, “Do you know what I’m thinking?”","“Of course, you can’t hide anything I want to know,” he continued to speak. His pair of True Eyes seemed to be able to see through Jian Wushuang completely.","Jian Wushuang could not help but panic. If what he said was true, it would be too terrifying.","The Emperor continued, “I predicted this many years ago. What I didn’t expect was that it would be an insignificant Yan Immortal.”","“You’ve been to the Heavenly Court?”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and finally nodded. “Yes.”","“Have you seen Zhen Wuyang?”","“Yes, I have.”","“Do you think that I’m a little similar to him?”","Jian Wushuang nodded again and muttered in his heart, ‘It’s not just a little similar. It’s exactly the same.’","“I also know that I look exactly like Zhen Wuyang. Do you want to know why?”","The Emperor smiled. Although his face was no longer young, one could still see his endless heroism.","He seemed to be lost in his memories as he looked into the distance with his True Eyes.","“His name is Zhen Wuyang, and my name is Zhen Wu.”","“However, in the Myriad Heavenly Regions, only Emperor Zhen Wuyang is known, not Emperor Zhen Wu.”","“In other words, I am him, and he is me.”","Jian Wushuang was completely shocked when he heard that. An Emperor could actually separate into two different individuals?","Then which one of them was real and which one was fake?","“There’s no truth between us. We’re just two different images.” His name was Emperor Zhen Wu, and he spoke slowly to answer Jian Wushuang’s doubts."]},{"number":4958,"title":"Chapter 4958 Leaving the White Bone Path","paragraphs":["8 Leaving the White Bone Path","Emperor Zhen Wu looked at him. “Zhen Wuyang is one side, and I am the other.”","Jian Wushuang did not know how to describe this relationship. As the supreme Emperor of the entire Great Si Region, Zhen Wuyang had actually sealed another self in the Endless Sea?","This was truly inconceivable.","And why did Zhen Wuyang seal him in the Endless Sea?","As if he could read Jian Wushuang’s mind, Emperor Zhen Wu said slowly, “The only reason why he sealed me here is that he can’t control me or destroy me. He can only seal me here forever.”","“I am his other side, and I possess a power that is even deeper than his. Faced with a version of him that he cannot control and cannot destroy, he made this move.”","“I, who was sleeping here, wanted to leave at all times. I had already deduced your appearance before I was sealed, so you should know what to do.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang took a few steps back and his eyes flashed with vigilance.","“Take me out of here, and in exchange, I’ll let you go. How about it?”","Emperor Zhen Wu slowly approached him.","Jian Wushuang thought quickly and said, “I’m afraid not. I can’t even protect myself now. It’s unrealistic to leave this place completely.”","Emperor Zhen Wu seemed to be able to easily see through his soul. He then said with a faint smile, “You were not banished here by Zhen Wuyang. You came here voluntarily. A Yan Immortal who came here voluntarily and survived until now will definitely have a way to get out.”","Jian Wushuang felt a headache coming on. “I’m afraid it’ll depend on the will of the heavens whether I can get out.”","Emperor Zhen Wu smiled and pointed at Jian Wushuang’s chest. “You have Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s aura.”","Stunned, he reached into his pocket and took out a ring that was made of gold and jade.","“Why do you have Zhen Wuyang’s ring? Did he give it to you?” Emperor Zhen Wu said seriously.","Jian Wushuang said, “Well, he didn’t give it to me. Someone else gave it to me.”","Emperor Zhen Wu did not probe further. His eyes were solemn. “Open the ring.”","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to do as he was told. When he opened the ring, it did not cause any abnormal movements.","He let out a sigh of relief and said, “I’ll be sleeping in this ring later. When I leave the Endless Sea, you can release me. At that time, your mission will be completed.”","Jian Wushuang felt helpless but he could only do as he was told. After all, if he did not agree, the consequences would be obvious.","He could only blame himself for being too weak. He could not even escape from an Emperor.","After saying that, Emperor Zhen Wu’s True Body turned into a wisp of smoke and entered Jian Wushuang’s ring.","After seeing the ring in his hand emit a strange color, Jian Wushuang did not relax. Instead, his mood became heavier.","In his opinion, Emperor Zhen Wu was not as harmless as he appeared to be. Instead, what he did not say was the most important thing.","If he were to explain and take him away from the Endless Sea, the entire Great Si Region would probably fall into an unpredictable situation.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang hurriedly stopped his thoughts because he suddenly remembered that Emperor Zhen Wu could guess what he was thinking.","At this moment, Emperor Zhen Wu’s faint voice sounded from the ring again.","“Right, after you leave this place, remember not to return to the Heavenly Continent. Leave this place directly and don’t be discovered by them.”","After saying this, Emperor Zhen Wu’s voice disappeared completely.","As the Emperor’s aura was concealed, the entire Heavenly Court supported by the Imperial Emperor’s aura began to enter an irreversible collapse.","“Emperor, Emperor!”","Heavenly Court’s door opened, and the two Grand Yan Immortals who were guarding the door rushed into Heavenly Court in panic.","Their Emperor had long disappeared, so how could they find him?","Jian Wushuang stood rooted to the ground and watched as the Immortal bodies of the two guarding Grand Evolution Immortals shattered continuously. In the end, they were destroyed in the endless dust along with the entire Heavenly Court.","With the fall of the Heavenly Court, the White Bone Path had long disappeared. Even the Blood River hanging above his head began to fluctuate violently at this moment.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and looked ahead.","In front of the shattered Heavenly Court, a huge door that seemed to have been sealed for countless years appeared at this moment.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang leaped forward.","He had already stayed in the Myriad Immortal Blood River for a while, and he could not stay any longer.","A majestic energy shot out from his palm and smashed heavily on the giant door.","Rumble!","At this moment, the entire domain of the Myriad Immortal Blood River fell into chaos. The giant gate slowly opened, and countless lights shone out from behind the gate.","Jian Wushuang entered the giant door without hesitation.","As the radiance dissipated, the hazy and ethereal aura under the blood river disappeared, replaced by the desolate aura of the Endless Sea.","“I’m out.”","Looking at the greyish-white land around him, Jian Wushuang let out a long sigh.","At this moment, he should still be in the Heavenly Continent, but he had completely left the Heaven Palace in the center.","He recalled the last words of Emperor Zhen Wu. After thinking for a while, he decided to leave the Heavenly Region.","However, Jian Wushuang did not expect to hear dozens of air-breaking sounds behind him.","In the next moment, dozens of black-robed envoys completely surrounded him from all directions.","At a rough glance, there were no less than 50 black-robed envoys, and each of them was at least at the Three Revolutions stage.","This undoubtedly gave Jian Wushuang great pressure.","The two sides were in a state of confrontation. Finally, a black-robed envoy slowly stepped forward and cupped his hands. “Your Highness has invited you. Please move to the Heavenly Palace.”","“What if I say no?” He raised his eyebrows and said coldly.","The black-robed emissary was stunned. Apparently, he did not expect Jian Wushuang to say that.","“Since that’s the case, don’t blame us for being rude,” the black-robed envoy said coldly.","In an instant, the 50-odd black-robed envoys attacked without holding back.","Streams of Yan power interweaved and formed an inescapable net that surrounded Jian Wushuang.","Looking at the layers of the Yan power net around him, Jian Wushuang was furious.","He had no contact with the Princes of this continent, but he was dragged into this mess for no reason. He was dragged into the Blood River, where he had almost died. He had gone through many hardships before he was able to get out.","How could he not be angry?"]},{"number":4959,"title":"Chapter 4959 Caught in a Bloody Battle","paragraphs":["9 Caught in a Bloody Battle","With the combined might of 50 Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, the inescapable net released was unprecedentedly powerful!","At this moment, the Heavenly Continent Plane below him began to tremble as if it could shatter at any time.","Jian Wushuang was trapped in this inescapable net and there was no possibility of escaping.","He had no intention of escaping, and a bloodthirsty scarlet appeared in the depths of his deep pupils.","A thick chain of inescapable nets instantly wrapped around him, and a terrifying power spread out.","The arm-thick lightning snakes surged and quickly consumed the Yan power of Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","The leader of the black-robed envoys saw that he had been bound and hurriedly shouted, “Take him away!”","In an instant, more than 50 black-robed envoys moved. Each of them had a derivation chain in their hands, ready to dash forward.","However, something unexpected happened.","The combined power of 50 Grand Yan Immortals failed to drag Jian Wushuang!","He stood still, like a terrifying divine mountain that covered the sky and earth. Even if dozens of energy chains left deep marks on his Immortal body, they could not drag him away.","The black-robed emissaries who saw this scene were shocked. One had to know that this was the power of more than 50 Grand Yan Immortals!","They could not even control a puny little Yan Immortal?!","“Rise for me!”","The leader of the black-robed envoys shouted angrily. The energy chain in his hand was almost tightened into a straight line.","The rest of the black-robed envoys followed suit and tightened the chains.","If this strange scene was seen by outsiders, they would definitely be incomparably shocked.","The situation that was originally without suspense had actually fallen into a contest of strength.","Jian Wushuang did not move an inch, even though the chains on his immortal body were stretched to the limit.","Strands of scarlet light came out of his body. The Slaughter Dao had already covered his body.","At this moment, the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens also emitted a sky-blue light, protecting his Immortal body from any damage.","With the Selfless Shadow and the Slaughter Dao on him, Jian Wushuang was completely enraged. He raised his arms and smashed down fiercely at the chains around him.","Boom!","An extremely dull sound rang out as nearly 20 chains were shattered by this attack.","More than 20 black-robed envoys quickly retreated a thousand feet.","Jian Wushuang’s body became lighter. He continued to swing his arms like this and smashed all the remaining Yan power chains that were wrapped around his Immortal body!","All the black-robed envoys retreated a thousand feet and then attacked again.","Jian Wushuang, whose eyes were stained with Blood Qi, directly met the attack. While taking into account his strength, his figure was like a ghost, making it impossible for the black-robed envoys to figure him out.","The black-robed envoys who rushed forward first felt a bloody shadow flash in front of them. Then, without any warning, they all spat out a mouthful of sticky divine blood!","Their chests had all caved in at this moment, almost shattering!","Jian Wushuang threw dozens of punches at an unimaginable speed. Each of the black-robed envoys who rushed forward suffered at least two punches and their Immortal bodies were almost shattered.","After repelling several black-robed envoys in an instant, Jian Wushuang suddenly condensed an invisible sword and slashed down heavily.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","Clang!","An incomparably clear sword hum erupted with a huge brilliance at this moment.","The entire sky within a radius of 100,000 miles trembled under this sword strike.","A sword slashed out, causing the momentum emitted by the Grand Yan Immortal to dim down.","Bang!","Millions of Sword Intents exploded, tearing apart a large part of the sky along the way. Then, thousands of light pillars exploded in the middle of the black-robed emissary.","With the Selfless True Shadow and the Slaughter Dao, Jian Wushuang rarely used Sword Principle because the uncontrollable factors were too much of a burden.","The Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent almost instantly consumed more than half of the Yan power that supported his Immortal body.","At the same time, cracks appeared on the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body.","Jian Wushuang’s right arm, which was holding the sword, had started to crack and was dripping with divine blood.","The Selfless Ture Shadow and the Slaughter Dao consumed too much Yan power. As a result, Jian Wushuang had to rely on the power of the Emperor-grade pill after releasing the first Sword Intent.","He quickly stuffed several pills into his mouth and quickly recovered.","Under this sword, a hole was forcefully cut open in the encirclement. Several black-robed envoys could not dodge in time and their Immortal Sources were destroyed, resulting in tragic deaths!","The power of a single sword strike was so terrifying!","However, this sword did not destroy the faith of these black-robed envoys. After a moment, they charged forward again like crazy.","At this moment, all kinds of magnificent and dazzling Immortal Styles and supreme treasures were thrown at Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, the world was filled with magnificence.","Even if Jian Wushuang could fight ten people alone, he could only choose to fight against the various immortal moves and supreme treasures.","Different sizes of explosions exploded at this moment.","The full-strength attack of more than 40 Grand Yan Immortals was too terrifying. As Jian Wushuang’s figure dissipated, the continent plate was shattered for a million miles!","What was certain was that if they went all out, the Heavenly Continent Plane formed by the remains of the Yan Immortal would definitely collapse!","Looking at the center of the huge explosion that had turned the sky into dust and ashes, all the black-robed envoys unconsciously heaved a sigh of relief.","This guy was merely a Yan Immortal, the pressure he gave them was too terrifying.","With a wave of his hand, he could severely injure or even kill a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, what kind of terrifying strength was this?","Fortunately, he had fallen.","All the black-robed envoys were certain that no Yan Immortal could survive this attack.","As the sky fell, the leader of the black-robed envoys did not relax. His gaze was still solemn.","He had an unimaginable premonition that Jian Wushuang would not die!","As if to confirm his thoughts, when the unparalleled explosion dissipated and all the black-robed envoys withdrew their treasures, a figure that was still standing in the void appeared.","At this moment, all the black-robed envoys subconsciously took a step back in horror.","“Cough cough...”","A large mouthful of divine blood spurted out of his mouth and then scattered into the sky.","At this moment, his aura was extremely dispirited. The Selfless True Shadow and the Slaughter Dao were all shattered!","Even though it was Jian Wushuang’s strongest trump card, it could not hold on and was shattered by the attacks of more than 40 black-robed envoys.","If it wasn’t for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, even the Undying Immortal Body would have shattered and died on the spot.","The Mystic Garb was as thin as a cicada’s wing and was still emitting a brilliant blue light. It was not injured at all under this terrifying impact and was still intact.","Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body was on the verge of destruction. If he used his Yan power forcefully, his meridians would be damaged unpredictably."]},{"number":4960,"title":"Chapter 4960 Battling in the Heavenly Hall","paragraphs":["0 Battling in the Heavenly Hall","Fortunately, there were still a few Emperor-grade pills in his mouth. He directly chewed and swallowed them.","However, Jian Wushuang was no longer able to fight when his Immortal body was on the verge of destruction.","The black-robed envoys, who were originally extremely shocked, heaved a sigh of relief again after vaguely sensing that he did not have the strength to fight.","The black-robed emissary’s ashen face finally eased up. However, he still did not dare to relax. He released a Yan power chain and bound Jian Wushuang.","The rest of the black-robed envoys also released their own energy chains, directly wrapping up his entire body before giving up.","From this, it could be seen how much they feared Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang, whose entire body was tied up and only his head was exposed, panted slightly and allowed himself to be dragged forward.","His eyes were tightly shut. Clearly, he was quickly repairing his broken Immortal body.","In this battle, they lost more than ten black-robed envoys before they managed to take him down. The black-robed envoy at the front was ashen.","If he didn’t have to take Jian Wushuang back to the Heavenly Palace of the Imperial City, he would have crushed Jian Wushuang into powder on the spot.","At the same time, he was also shocked in his heart. What was the background of this puny little Yan Immortal? He could actually cross realms and kill a Grand Yan Immortal.","Not only that, he even walked out of the Myriad Immortal Blood River. This was the extent that made him feel deeply terrified!","One had to know that under that blood river, even if a Grand Yan Immortal entered, they would lose their minds and would not be able to walk out.","As the personal follower of the Emperor, no one knew better than him what kind of terrifying existence was under the Blood River.","Just the endless army of Death Immortals alone was enough to devour any Grand Yan Immortal, let alone those mysterious and unapproachable ancient almighties.","One had to know that even Bian Ziyuan did not dare to easily step into the Heavenly Official of the Prince.","However, Jian Wushuang came out alive.","Retracting the meaning in their hearts, more than 40 black-robed envoys tied Jian Wushuang up and rushed to the center of the entire Heavenly Continent, the Imperial City’s Heavenly Palace.","When the Imperial City shrouded in clouds appeared before their eyes, all the black-robed envoys heaved a sigh of relief.","Their mission was completed.","The Imperial City’s Heavenly Gate slowly opened. Then, they quickly entered as if nothing had happened.","In the distant Sky Continent, where no one was paying attention, an old man looked at this scene in horror. He had an inexplicable intuition.","It seemed like the Heavens were about to change.","After entering the Imperial City and stepping onto the White Bone Road, the group of black-robed envoys sped forward.","The huge door of the Heaven Palace had long been opened. Bian Ziyuan stood in front of the Heaven Palace with his arms crossed, as if he had been waiting for a long time.","“Great Heavenly Official, we lost another 12.” the leading black-robed envoy took a step forward and said in a low voice.","Bian Ziyuan nodded. “I understand. You’ve done well. You may leave.”","The black-robed envoy agreed and left Jian Wushuang, who was tied up like a dumpling, in front of him.","Bian Ziyuan immediately revealed a meaningful smile. “You did well too. Congratulations, you survived.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him coldly without saying a word.","“Don’t try to resist. You’re just an arrow at the end of its flight. I can easily destroy you.”","After saying this last sentence, Bian Ziyuan stretched out his hand and beckoned. Then, he carried him into the h all.","The cold and withered hall was still the same as when they first met. However, the damaged Mountain Sea Pillar had been repaired.","A young man with a gloomy aura walked out slowly from the depths of the hall and came to Jian Wushuang with interest.","“I’m very curious about how you managed to walk out of there alive. Tell me what you saw and what you obtained under the Blood River.”","Looking at the young man and the group of black-robed envoys, Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale and he said weakly, “First.... Untie me, I’m out of strength...”","When the young man heard this, he pondered for a moment. Then, he looked at Bian Ziyuan and said, “Untie him.”","“Your Highness...” Bian Ziyuan was a little unwilling, but seeing his persistence, he could only reach out and untie it.","Layers of chains fell off and Jian Wushuang was free.","“Can you say it now?” The young man took another step forward, seemingly very eager.","All the joints in his body creaked slightly at this moment, as if he had woken up from a deep sleep.","Bian Ziyuan, who was standing at the side, was shocked when he saw this scene. He realized something and hurriedly released the exquisite water mist.","However, it was too late!","Jian Wushuang, who had escaped, was no longer weak. An unimaginable power surged around him!","An Invisible Sword formed in his right hand and stabbed at the young man in front of him at a speed that none of the black-robed envoys could react in time!","As the distance was too close, he could only watch helplessly as a long sword surging with millions of Sword Intents pierced into his body.","Time seemed to stop as a soft sound rang out.","Then, 36,000 Sword Intents also surged into his body, directly causing unimaginable injuries.","The Sword Intent tore apart the Immortal body and completely exploded.","After that, Bian Ziyuan released the exquisite mist toward Jian Wushuang.","However, it was already too late. He had successfully escaped and retreated a thousand feet in an instant!","“You’re courting death!”","Bian Ziyuan was furious. He had never thought that Jian Wushuang would be so arrogant that he would kill a Prince in front of him.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing with his sword, smiled wantonly. He did not put all the black-robed envoys and Bian Ziyuan in his eyes at all.","After taking one last look at Bian Ziyuan, Jian Wushuang flew away.","“Kill him on the spot. Anyone who kills this child will be given a position as a Minor Heavenly Official!” Bian Ziyuan was already furious to the extreme.","All the black-robed envoys in the Heaven Palace rushed out when they heard this.","Just the position of a Minor Heavenly Official was enough to drive them crazy.","The position of Heavenly Official that was attached to the aura of the Emperor meant that they could enjoy the nourishment of the Emperor’s fate energy. This was an unimaginable fate that was enough to make them all go crazy!","At this moment, the young man’s Immortal body was completely shattered, but he used a mysterious sell and condensed everything. He said hoarsely with a pale face, “Don’t kill him. Leave him alive. Whether we can leave this place or not depends on him!”","Bian Ziyuan’s expression was uncertain. In the end, he said fiercely, “Even if I let him live, I’ll make him pay a price!”","Rumble!","The huge door of Heaven Palace was opened by Jian Wushuang’s sword. He stepped on the clouds and mist and cut off the White Bone path for thousands of feet.","Then, he stood proudly in the void like a true Sword Immortal, unrestrained to the extreme.","He did not seem to realize that he was running for his life. Instead, he was wandering around the universe.","Jian Wushuang wanted to fight, not escape!"]},{"number":4961,"title":"Chapter 4961 Three Great Daos, Transcending Self","paragraphs":["1 Three Great Daos, Transcending Self","Hundreds of figures flew out of the Heavenly Palace like flowing lights, and they were still endless!","Hundreds of figures were hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals!","They were Grand Yan Immortals who had transcended the Yan Immortal stage!","Their appearance filled the entire void with a supreme aura!","It was not that Jian Wushuang could not escape, but he could not.","He knew that it was impossible for him to escape from the hands of so many Grand Yan Immortals, so he simply stood where he was and prepared to fight to the death!","Jian Wushuang was alone in the Endless Sea and could only rely on himself.","Although there were three Emperor True Souls in the Boyang Bottle, he did not plan to use them this time. After all, if their True Souls dissipated, it meant that they could no longer be revived.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang could only rely on himself. He could even imagine where he would revive after his death.","Looking at the black-robed envoys surrounding him, there were roughly no less than a hundred of them.","One had to know that these were all Grand Yan Immortals, and none of them were below Three Revolutions.","Even though they had already been weakened to a certain extent in this Endless Sea, Grand Yan Immortals were still Grand Yan Immortals. Their strength was still terrifying to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang stood in the middle of the void. Beneath his feet was the broken White Bone Path.","A steady stream of black-robed envoys walked out of the Heavenly Palace and came to him.","Jian Wushuang slowly exhaled a mouthful of turbid breath and raised the True Sword in his hand, pointing it forward arrogantly.","The black-robed emissary who was pointed at by his sword subconsciously took a few steps back, as if no one wanted to make the first move.","Jian Wushuang smiled disdainfully. He had taken the initiative to attack when faced with so many Grand Yan Immortals.","The Selfless True Shadow, the Slaughter Dao, the Dao of Protection, and the Wushuang Sword Dao were unleashed at the same time!","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had unleashed three attacks at the same time!","The Dao of Protection was the first Great Dao he had cultivated to become an Ancestor. Its power was the most vigorous Great Dao, and it was the Great Dao that encompassed the entire Divine Power Universe.","His long hair broke through the band and danced wildly in the air. The blue Selfless True Shadow surged behind him.","Thousands of scarlet lights representing the Dao of Slaughter flowed slowly.","The invisible Heavenly Dao laws that represented the Dao of Protection protected his Immortal body, and the secret patterns slowly rotated.","The majestic scarlet-gold divine patterns that represented the Wushuang Sword Dao flowed out from the tip of his hair.","The three rays of light shone on him, making him look so bad that he could not look straight at him.","The black robe shattered, revealing the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body.","The Fire Phoenix Totem that belonged to the Undying Blood of the Matriarch of the Phoenix Clan was humming in front of his chest.","At this moment, all the black-robed envoys retreated, their faces filled with extreme shock.","Was this the might that a Yan Immortal could display?","What kind of super power is this?","Isn’t it just inconceivable?","The three questions in their minds made all the black-robed envoys retreat continuously, and even their breathing became a little hurried.","The might emitted by a Yan Immortal was so oppressive that they could not even raise their heads. This was too terrifying.","With three Great Daos in his body, an unimaginably dense fate flowed.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was the real existence that suppressed the Heaven’s Will!","He became completely emotionless. He just casually raised his hand and pointed. Immediately, a celestial river roared and swallowed the void!","A seven-star galaxy completely bloomed between his brows!","Wherever his divine thought went, it was his domain. In his domain, he was the true Emperor!","Using an Immortal Style to fight against an Immortal Style.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s control over the Immortal Style had reached an unimaginable level.","With just this finger, more than ten black-robed envoys died on the spot, and a crack was forcefully torn open in the encirclement.","All the black-robed envoys were shocked. They could feel a terrifying flow of fate from this finger.","All of a sudden, all the black-robed envoys were certain that Jian Wushuang was not a Yan Immortal.","His existence seemed to have surpassed even the Grand Yan Immortal and reached some unknown realm.","There was no other reason. The luck surging around Jian Wushuang was so thick that it even affected their judgment.","With three streaks of light, Jian Wushuang seemed to have an ethereal fate descending upon them. He crushed them with an unknown power.","The Invisible Sword in his hand was already extremely dazzling.","Behind him, the Selfless True Shadow, which was more than a million feet tall, also held a huge Invisible Sword in its hand.","It was as if he was splitting open the sky!","At this moment, the Wushuang Sword Dao was activated.","Unparalleled Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The majestic celestial river descended from the sky, shattering the void.","The celestial river formed by billions of sword essences flowed around Jian Wushuang and then roared as it charged forward.","This was the pinnacle of the Wushuang Sword Dao.","The River Sword Intent dealt a hundred times more damage than before!","The Selfless True Shadow, which was over a million feet tall, also released the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent at this moment!","The sky collapsed and the White Bone path shattered. At this moment, none of the black-robed envoys dared to stay any longer. They all retreated rapidly in horror.","However, this vigorous and resplendent sword essence was too fast. As it shattered the White Bone path, it directly swallowed dozens of black-robed envoys!","At this moment, a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was killed without any resistance!","The brilliant Sword Dao celestial river devoured everything.","Billions of Sword Intents were incomparably dazzling.","It attacked everything that could be destroyed.","The entire Imperial City began to shake violently, and then gullies split open on the walls.","When the Sword Dao celestial river descended above the Heavenly Hall, all the black-robed envoys who had escaped looked extremely miserable.","They knew very well that the Heavenly Palace would never be able to withstand this attack!","A thought was shattered, and it was only a matter of time.","Just as this unparalleled river of Sword Dao was about to topple the Heavenly Palace, a figure quietly walked out of the Heavenly Palace and met it.","At this moment, thousands of hazy mist dispersed from the figure and enveloped the Sword Dao celestial river.","This was a powerful attack, an attack that could not be blocked.","However, Bian Ziyuan could no longer dodge. His raised arms were pressed into a strange bending posture at this moment. The robe on his body was directly crushed, revealing his flowing cloud and watery chest!","“Ah...”","The veins on Bian Ziyuan’s forehead bulged. He had never thought that this sword strike would be so terrifying that even he was actually unable to block it.","“Damned fellow, I... I will definitely crush your head with my own hands!”","The divine blood began to be squeezed out of every pore of his. Bian Ziyuan felt that his Immortal body could not hold on any longer and began to show signs of shattering.","His eyes turned extremely red, as if they could explode in the next moment.","At this moment, thousands of flowing clouds and water ripples began to slowly flow around his body, emitting an extremely unique aura."]},{"number":4962,"title":"Chapter 4962 Defeating Bian Ziyuan","paragraphs":["2 Defeating Bian Ziyuan","Bian Ziyuan didn’t dare to be arrogant anymore. The Jian Wushuang in front of him was a completely different person from when they first met.","At this moment, the unknown fate on his body was so thick that it almost caused the entire Heavenly Continent to crack. It was extremely terrifying.","The flowing clouds and water patterns on his body increased in speed. At the same time, endless exquisite water mist condensed from his back and transformed into a huge treasure that shook the heavens and the earth.","The huge treasure image behind Bian Ziyuan also brazenly crashed into the Sword Dao River at this moment.","The two were competing!","He roared, and his body was covered in a thin layer of blood mist.","The originally unstoppable Sword Dao River was actually shaken at this moment, unable to advance even an inch.","“Ah! Hahaha-”","Bian Ziyuan laughed maniacally and looked at Jian Wushuang with a pair of bloody eyes, as if he was going to tear Jian Wushuang into pieces right there and then!","As for the river of Sword Dao that tore through the sky and pointed at the Heavenly Palace, fine cracks began to appear at this moment, as if it could collapse at any time.","Standing in the center of the void, Jian Wushuang, who had three Great Path providence flowing on his Immortal body, was still calm as if he had no emotions.","Seeing this scene, he only stretched out his finger and pointed casually. Immediately, the Selfless True Shadow behind him released an unparalleled Yan power that covered the Sword Dao River.","The celestial river of the Sword Dao that could collapse at any time recovered and pressed down with unimaginable power.","Bian Ziyuan’s expression changed drastically. He almost had no time to react before he was pressed under the celestial river.","The huge water mist behind him could not hold on any longer and was completely shattered.","Facing the Heavenly Palace that had stood in the Heavenly Continent for countless years, the unspeakable celestial river of Sword Intents slashed down heavily!","Bian Ziyuan’s figure, which was covered in blood, was also finally destroyed in the Sword Dao River.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Heaven Continent that was formed by the corpses of the Yan Immortals was split into two by this sword strike. The Heavenly Palace was also shattered!","With the shattered hall as the center, the shattered plane plates quickly sank into the Endless Sea.","Endless black water gushed out from every crack, devouring every piece of land.","Under this sword, even a Six Revolutions Great Yan Immortal had no chance of surviving. He was too ruthless, so much so that even the black-robed envoy who was watching from afar was more or less affected, his expression extremely miserable.","They had never thought that a puny little Yan Immortal would reach such a shocking level.","First, the Prince was stabbed, his Immortal Source was almost destroyed, and his soul was destroyed. Then, Great Heaven Official Bian Ziyuan was cut down by Sword Dao celestial river, and his life and death were unknown.","At this moment, under the broken sky, only the 200 black-robed envoys were left.","However, none of them dared to go up against Jian Wushuang. They were scared out of their wits.","With the destruction of the Heavenly Palace, the Heaven Continent was split into two, and everything was on the verge of destruction.","Jian Wushuang’s True Eyes slowly swept across. All the black-robed envoys that he was looking at retreated again and again, as if they could escape at any time.","Although his divine thoughts were affected by the Slaughter Dao, he did not lose control. He knew that he could not stay in the Heavenly Continent for long. Once the 200 black-robed envoys gathered together, it would be difficult for Jian Wushuang to deal with them.","One had to know that there was a huge difference between a Grand Yan Immortal and an ordinary Yan Immortal. Even if Jian Wushuang could kill a Grand Evolution Immortal, what if he could kill 10 or 100? What about 200? It was already something unimaginable.","Even though he had three Great Daos on his back, he was still a Yan Immortal, this was an unchangeable fact.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang turned around and prepared to leave after destroying the Heavenly Palace.","However, in the next moment, an extremely fast streak of light shot over.","He quickly turned around and stretched out his hand to shoot out a streak of light.","The two collided, shaking the void.","Then, a figure covered in blood rushed out from the center of the explosion and panted heavily.","At this moment, his Immortal body was already shattered to the extreme. His chest was almost torn apart, and divine blood kept spurting out.","Jian Wushuang recognized that the figure was Bian Ziyuan, and he could not help but feel a killing intent in his heart.","“All of you... What are you waiting for? Even if you have to use your life to pile him up, you have to keep him here for me. Those who dare to disobey orders will die!”","Bian Ziyuan roared crazily, crazy to the extreme.","All the black-robed envoys looked at each other nervously. No one dared to rush forward first.","They knew very well that whoever went up first would die. There was no chance of survival.","Bian Ziyuan turned his head fiercely and swept his blood-red eyes across the black-robed envoys behind him. Then, he actually dragged his broken Immortal body and rushed toward Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and the seven-star galaxy between his eyebrows started to circulate.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River!","Along with the Selfless True Shadow and the three Great Daos, everything about him was unprecedentedly terrifying.","Almost at the same time Bian Ziyuan moved, a huge divine mountain rose from the void without any warning and smashed forward.","Bian Ziyuan roared in a low voice. He actually used his Immortal body to smash the divine mountain and charged forward without slowing down.","At this moment, there was only hatred in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as dark as water. He simply stretched out his palm to Bian Ziyuan, who was about to stake everything.","In the next moment, five celestial rivers surged out of his palm and crushed forward.","Bian Ziyuan had gone completely crazy. Facing the five celestial rivers, he chose to fight.","However, he soon discovered that the Immortal Style he had released was directly devoured. He did not even have the ability to resist at all.","Facing the roaring celestial rivers, he was left with only helplessness.","“Ah...”","The five celestial rivers bound his limbs and shattered his Immortal body in an instant.","As long as Jian Wushuang wanted to, he could kill him in an instant.","However, he did not do so. Instead, he retracted his palm and pulled Bian Ziyuan in front of him.","At this moment, Bian Ziyuan was on the verge of death. His bloodshot eyes had completely dimmed, but he still stared at Jian Wushuang crazily, as if he wanted to skin him alive.","Jian Wushuang did not kill him because Bian Ziyuan saved his life when he was being chased.","“Don’t come looking for trouble again. I’ll let you go.”","Jian Wushuang spoke in a deep voice, his words filled with supreme authority.","Bian Ziyuan, who was already on the verge of death, grinned. “You dare to speak to me like this?! You’re just a puny little Yan Immortal, who gave you the courage to speak to me like this?!”","“Do you think you have me? I am a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, while you are just an ant.”","The celestial river tightened, directly turning his limbs into dust!","“Hmph!” Bian Ziyuan groaned in pain. His eyes were about to bleed. “If you don’t kill me today, you will definitely regret it!”"]},{"number":4963,"title":"Chapter 4963 Sword Immortal Appears","paragraphs":["3 Sword Immortal Appears","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. He felt a bone-deep threat from Bian Ziyuan’s words.","As for threats, his method was to completely eliminate them.","However, Jian Wushuang had no intention of attacking at this moment.","Looking at Bian Ziyuan whose Immortal body had completely shattered and no longer had the strength to fight, he felt compassion.","“I’ll spare your life. You can leave,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice and was about to throw him away.","When Bian Ziyuan heard this, he gave a strange smile. “Do you really think that you’ll be able to beat me? I’m afraid you still don’t understand the difference between a Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang suddenly felt a sense of crisis.","As if to confirm what he was thinking, Bian Ziyuan, who was originally on the verge of death, suddenly surged with a terrifying suction force.","The five celestial rivers that had been restraining him suddenly weakened and began to crazily transfer the Yan power into Bian Ziyuan’s body!","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically. He could feel the extremely abundant Yan power in his body flowing away crazily!","And the source of the loss was actually on Bian Ziyuan!","Bian Ziyuan, who was originally on the verge of death and had his Immortal body shattered, began to rapidly fill up his Immortal body at this moment.","His shattered Immortal body was filled again, and even his realm was recovering at an unbelievable rate.","In just a few seconds, more than half of the Yan power in Jian Wushuang’s body had been devoured and he could not control it at all.","He had never expected Bian Ziyuan to be able to devour without any conditions!","Bian Ziyuan, who had regrown his arms, was filled with madness. His new arms grabbed Jian Wushuang and began to devour him even more crazily.","“I’ve already warned you. If you don’t kill me, you will definitely regret it.”","Bian Ziyuan smiled sinisterly. Because of the vast and boundless Yan power in Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body, his newly born Immortal body was cracked.","“After I devour you completely, I’ll see how a puny little Yan Immortal like you has the power to shake a Grand Yan Immortal!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. In the next moment, the Selfless Real Shadow behind him suddenly opened its eyes and faced Bian Ziyuan. It smashed down heavily!","Boom!!!","The sky shattered. Bian Ziyuan was too engrossed in devouring, so he did not notice the blow above his head.","By the time he reacted, it was already too late. His entire body was sent flying a thousand feet away, and his Immortal body, which had just recovered, was almost shattered.","Jian Wushuang took a few steps back and his face turned pale. If he had not stopped Bian Ziyuan in time, he would have been swallowed by Bian Ziyuan.","As a large amount of the power was drained, the Selfless True Shadow, the Slaughter Dao, and the other Daos that relied heavily on the power began to fall into a deep sleep.","This put him in a very passive position.","Bian Ziyuan, who had completely recovered, wiped off the divine blood at the corner of his mouth and looked at Jian Wushuang with a sinister smile.","“I really didn’t expect that a puny little Yan Immortal would actually have such terrifying energy in his body. I only absorbed it for a few dozen breaths and it actually allowed me to recover completely. I have to say that you are truly a terrifying existence.”","“Now I can’t wait to swallow you completely. You must be the opportunity for me to break through to Nine Revolutions.”","Hearing his voice, Jian Wushuang felt disgusted and the last bit of pity disappeared.","He took a step forward and said coldly, “You want to swallow me? It depends on whether you can do it!”","“Oh? I want to see how you’re going to kill me!” Bian Ziyuan laughed loudly.","In the next moment, he suddenly raised his arms and grabbed more than ten black-robed envoys with his supreme and terrifying power, throwing them at Jian Wushuang.","The black-robed envoys that were grabbed exploded into a bloody mist in the air and pressed forward.","The boundless blood mist engulfed him. Jian Wushuang’s face was cold. He condensed an Invisible Sword in his palm and slashed the blood mist apart!","Bian Ziyuan turned to look at the 200-odd black-robed envoys behind him coldly. “If you don’t move, I don’t mind devouring all of you or turning you into a bloody mist!”","All the black-robed envoys revealed a look of panic in their eyes. They had already witnessed Bian Ziyuan’s thunderous and cold-blooded methods. If they did not do as he said, they would definitely end up in an extremely miserable state.","In short, he would die anyway. It was better to fight!","A black-robed emissary gritted his teeth and charged at Jian Wushuang.","If there was a first, there would be a second and a third!","A moment later, all the black-robed envoys pounced on Jian Wushuang like a swarm of locusts.","Looking at the sky full of black-robed envoys, Jian Wushuang quickly took out two Emperor-grade pills and stuffed them into his mouth, ready to release his strongest sword move!","However, when the two pills completely transformed into medicinal strength and flowed into his limbs and bones, he suddenly coughed out a large mouthful of divine blood. Then, his aura became dispirited.","Originally, the Selfless True Shadow and the Slaughter Dao were dormant. Now, the remaining Dao of Protection and the Wushuang Sword Dao were completely withered!","He thought that the Emperor-grade pills could stabilize the situation. He did not expect that his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body would not be able to withstand such consumption.","At this moment, he could not even use the Wushuang Sword Dao, let alone the strongest sword strike.","The black-robed envoy, who was the first to rush over, pushed Jian Wushuang back hundreds of feet with a palm strike. Then, he seemed to have discovered something and shouted excitedly, “He’s already at the end of his rope. Everyone, let’s work together. We can definitely kill him completely! ”","All the black-robed envoys went crazy when they heard this.","Anyone who could kill Jian Wushuang would be able to become a Minor Heavenly Official.","As long as one could become a Minor Heavenly Official, they would be able to share a trace of the Emperor’s fate energy. This was enough to drive every black-robed envoy crazy.","Jian Wushuang, who was already at the end of his rope, was helpless against the full-strength attack of more than 200 black-robed envoys.","All kinds of Immortal Styles and treasures pressed down on him. He could not withstand it and spat out large mouthfuls of divine blood!","Bian Ziyuan, who was watching this scene from afar, revealed a ferocious smile to vent his hatred.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang’s complete destruction was already settled.","In this Heavenly Continent, or even in the entire Endless Sea, who could block so many Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s moves?","Just as Bian Ziyuan was about to devour Jian Wushuang, he felt a great fear of life and death, forcing him to stop and look around in horror.","In the next moment.","An inexplicable and boundless force began to surge in the originally shattered void. Under this inexplicable force, a unique diamond-shaped radiance was quietly refracted, like a screen of light.","“Good Disciple, I’m late!”","A mighty and furious voice that sounded like it was above the Nine Heavens completely resounded throughout the wilderness at this moment."]},{"number":4964,"title":"Chapter 4964 The Change of the Black Bead","paragraphs":["4 The Change of the Black Bead","Under this majestic and furious roar, all the black-robed envoys stopped their movements for a moment.","Time seemed to slow down.","Bian Ziyuan only felt the divine blood flowing in his Immortal body freeze.","The air dropped to freezing point, and everything was filled with dead silence and coldness.","Then, layers of ripples appeared in the void.","Immediately after, thousands of white Sword Intents spread out like a blooming lotus.","At the center of the Sword Intent, two figures stood.","There was a man and a woman. The middle-aged man had a clean face and no beard. He was extraordinary and his long hair danced in the wind.","The heroic spirit that the woman exuded was enough to overshadow her beauty. Her black-gold long robe perfectly accentuated her figure, making her look extremely mysterious.","Each of them had six long swords at their waists, and they were filled with an imposing manner that could not be looked at directly.","What flowed around them was not Yan power, but extremely pure Sword Intent.","The entire shattered void seemed to have fallen silent at this moment. All the black-robed envoys subconsciously looked at the two uninvited guests.","Cold sweat flowed down Bian Ziyuan’s temples. The terror of life and death that surged out of his heart was brought about by these two.","Jian Wushuang, who was trapped in the center by the black-robed envoy, was already at the end of his rope and his Immortal body could be destroyed at any time. After looking at the two figures, he finally revealed a bitter smile.","Yan Fan raised his eyebrows and smiled, then he was completely furious.","“You dare to hurt my disciple? Are you tired of living?”","Sensing that the coldness around him had completely disappeared, a black-robed emissary was dissatisfied with his arrogant words and actually directly suppressed him!","“Clown.” Yan Fan sneered and looked at the black-robed envoy who was about to rush over. He did not even bother to draw his sword.","In the next moment, a subtle Sword Intent burst out from the lotus throne under Yan Fan’s feet and slashed forward diagonally.","A shocking scene appeared. The Immortal body of the black-robed envoy, who was running at high speed, instantly shattered and scattered miserably in the void.","It was as if nothing had happened. It was deathly silent.","“Good Disciple, leave the rest to me!”","With a step forward, thousands of Sword Intents swept across the wilderness.","Yan Fan laughed and flew toward Jian Wushuang with Jiang Li.","Bian Ziyuan shouted in disbelief, “Stop them! Kill them all! Leave no one alive!”","As the order was issued, more than 200 black-robed envoys surrounded Jiang Li and Yan Fan crazily.","Faced with this terrifying power that blotted out the sky and covered the earth, the two true Sword Immortals smiled quietly as if they were looking down on him.","In the next moment, the void was completely replaced by a diamond-shaped light screen.","The endless sword curtain slashed down.","The sword curtain was a sword move that could easily kill 100,000 Death Immortals under the Blood Sea. It was a sword move that Jian Wushuang had to deal with with with all his strength.","As for the fate of these black-robed envoys, it was completely confirmed when the two Sword Immortals appeared.","The sword curtain fell silently. Everything was set in stone.","All the black-robed envoys, who were ready to fight with all their might, felt their eyes suddenly light up, and then their heads spun.","All of them, without exception!","More than 200 black-robed envoys were directly killed!","It was only an instant. Even the Immortal body’s bones turned into debris and scattered in the void, turning into stars.","“Disciple, we aren’t too late, right?” Yan Fan and Jiang Li landed in front of Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale. He cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for coming to help, Seniors. I am very grateful.”","Yan Fan reached out and put his hand down.","“There’s no need for thanks between us,” he said in a serious tone.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “Actually, you didn’t have to take the risk.”","Hearing that, Yan Fan immediately patted his chest and said, “If a master can’t even protect his disciple, he might as well die. Besides, Disciple is trapped by this group of salted fish.”","“...”","Only these two Sword Immortals would dare to call hundreds of Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals salted fish.","“Disciple,” Jiang Li, who rarely spoke, said in an extremely domineering manner. “If anyone else wants to kill you, let us take care of them. We don’t want any trouble.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Instead, he looked ahead subconsciously.","Bian Ziyuan, who was not affected by the sword curtain, saw Jian Wushuang looking at him. He almost lost his balance and fell into the void.","Bian Ziyuan was still in a daze from the terrifying scene just now. More than 200 black-robed envoys, which was more than 200 Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, had all died strangely. Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal would not be able to do such a thing!","But now, it all happened.","All of them died in an instant. All of the Heavenly Palace’s resources had disappeared completely.","Without anything to rely on, his face turned pale.","“Eh, I actually let a guy go. Then I’ll take care of him,” Yan Fan said in a low voice. His palm had already quietly placed on the hilt of his sword at his waist.","A Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal did not seem to be worthy of him drawing his sword, but in order to end the battle quickly, Yan Fan drew a Snowflake Sword.","The void directly plummeted to the freezing point. Even though he was thousands of feet away, Bian Ziyuan still felt his blood freeze.","He was absolutely certain that he would not be able to block this sword strike!","Therefore, he made a prompt decision. Almost at the same time as Yan Fan drew his sword, he tore open a bloody wound on his chest with his fingers!","Divine blood gushed out from the bloody wound on his chest and dripped into the void.","In the next moment, the originally dead and broken Heavenly Continent suddenly surged with all kinds of extremely powerful Yan power.","Then, figures rose from the Heavenly Continent Plane like flowing lights and came to Bian Ziyuan’s side.","In just a few dozen breaths, hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals had gathered. Moreover, there was an endless stream of Grand Yan Immortals flying up from the Heavenly Continent Plane.","They were all extremely thirsty for blood, and they surrounded Bian Ziyuan with bloodshot eyes.","Bian Ziyuan took a few steps back and pointed in Jian Wushuang’s direction. He said fiercely, “As long as you capture the three of them, I can supply you with my blood, including the blood of the Prince. What are you waiting for? Let’s attack together.”","All the bloodthirsty Grand Yan Immortals went crazy and rushed toward Jian Wushuang without any hesitation.","Yan Fan smiled with pity. All living beings were equal under his sword.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang, who was fully focused, felt a burning sensation in his chest.","Then, before he could react, a pitch-black bead seemed to have sensed something and flew out of his arms into the void.","Jian Wushuang saw the Black Bead clearly. It was the Black Bead he found in the Black Abyss Prison in the First Heaven of the Lower Three Heavens."]},{"number":4965,"title":"Chapter 4965 The Might of the Black Bead","paragraphs":["5 The Might of the Black Bead","Ever since he had found this Black Bead, it had been lying peacefully in his arms without any abnormal phenomenon.","Other than the three Emperors’ True Shadows being extremely wary of it, the Black Bead no longer had any sense of existence.","However, the Black Bead, which had no sense of existence, flew out of Jian Wushuang’s arms and into the void.","Its speed was so fast that it was even faster than Yan Fan.","“What the hell is this?”","Yan Fan was puzzled, and he loosened his grip on the sword hilt.","However, under this chaotic and broken sky and on the broken Heavenly Continent Plane, no Grand Yan Immortal would care about such a small Black Bead.","Bewitched by Bian Ziyuan’s divine blood, the Grand Yan Immortals all rushed toward Jian Wushuang from all directions.","As the Heavenly Continent Plane fell into an irreversible split, all the Grand Yan Immortals trapped in the Heavenly Continent regained their freedom at this moment.","The strange barrier above the Heavenly Continent disappeared. Nearly half of the Grand Yan Immortals, regardless of how terrifying the Endless Sea was, flew or swam out of the Heavenly Continent.","Nearly half of the Grand Yan Immortals also rushed into the void at this moment, incomparably crazy.","These Grand Yan Immortals who had sunk into the Endless Sea were once supreme experts who controlled the battlefield. However, after countless years, they had already fallen and become bloodthirsty monsters.","Almost at the same time, a giant beast suddenly walked out of the Endless Sea, which was not far away from the two halves of the Heavenly Continent.","He seemed to have just woken up from a deep sleep. Nine huge heads that were like suns looked at the Heavenly Continent that was about to collapse at the same time.","After a brief moment of contemplation, the giant beast dived into the sea and headed towards the shattered continent.","At this moment, hundreds of Grand Evolution Immortals charged at Jian Wushuang crazily.","Jiang Li raised her eyebrows and blocked Jian Wushuang behind her. Then she said to Yan Fan, “What are you waiting for? Let’s end this quickly!”","Yan Fan nodded. Facing the overwhelming Grand Yan Immortals, he prepared to slash out.","Only Jian Wushuang stared at the Black Bead spinning in the void. He could feel that something terrible was about to happen.","As if to confirm his thoughts, the Black Bead that was spinning in the void emitted billions of dark rays in the next moment.","This dark light was a strange blackish-purple color, and it instantly covered the entire void sky like a wave.","Almost at the moment when the dark purple light descended, Jian Wushuang felt a shiver.","He could noot help but tremble.","This kind of trembling was like a true feeling of powerlessness, even surpassing the feeling of powerlessness when facing an Emperor.","Jian Wushuang felt that the Yan power in his body was trembling and he felt a little dizzy.","The two Sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan, also had the same symptoms. Their expressions changed drastically as they looked at the spinning Black Bead.","At this moment, all the crazed Grand Yan Immortals began to release all kinds of terrifying Immortal Styles, and violent Yan power spread out.","However, a terrifying scene appeared. Almost at the instant the energy spread out, it was disintegrated and devoured by the billions of dark rays cast by the Black Bead!","Hundreds of Immortal Styles and energy that could destroy any Heavenly Region were all shattered.","Then, the Grand Yan Immortal, whose body was wrapped in Yan power, spurted out divine blood rapidly. In a short moment, he became a dried corpse.","Nearly 300 Grand Yan Immortals had their Immortal Sources explode and their Immortal bodies turned into dried corpses.","The endless black and purple light was still penetrating the earth. Wherever it could cover, the Yan power was all disintegrated and devoured. The Immortal Sources of the Grand Yan Immortals were also sucked dry, turning into dry corpses.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale. He seemed to have realized something and said to Jiang Li and Yan Fan, “Don’t release your Yan power, not even a little bit!”","“Yes.” Jiang Li nodded. She and Yan Fan were not killed by the dark light because they did not release any Yan power.","Yan Fan’s face was also pale. Even though he had seen too many tragic battles, this was the first time he had seen such a strange scene.","What exactly was that Black Bead? The dark light it emitted was actually able to instantly devour the approaching Grand Yan Immortal.","At the same time, Yan Fan had an inexplicable intuition that if he had released the Yan power instead of the Sword Intent, he would not have ended up much better than those Grand Divination Immortals.","Under the dome of the sky that was enveloped by billions of dark lights, all the Grand Yan Immortals who released their Yan power were directly sucked into dried corpses, not even leaving behind any Immortal aura.","Bian Ziyuan had long been scared out of his wits. Almost at the same time as all the Grand Yan Immortals died, he turned around and fled.","However, he was still a step too late. He subconsciously released his Yan power.","Those dark purple lights were like maggots in his bones, directly enveloping his entire Immortal body.","“Ah!” he screamed in shock.","His Immortal body withered rapidly, and his Immortal Source shattered instantly!","Faced with the shattered Heavenly Palace, Bian Ziyuan finally turned into a handful of ashes and disappeared completely.","Jian Wushuang saw everything. He did not expect Bian Ziyuan to die so quickly.","It was supposed to be an unexpected bloody battle, but after the appearance of this Black Bead, it ended immediately.","Jian Wushuang, Jiang Li, and Yan Fan stood quietly in the dark light. No one dared to make a move.","That unknown dark light had the power to kill any Grand Yan Immortal.","As the Grand Yan Immortal was completely dead, the billions of rays of light came and went quickly, returning to the Black Bead in an instant.","Then, the Black Bead turned into a dark meteor and entered Jian Wushuang’s arms at an unimaginable speed.","...","Jian Wushuang’s hands and feet were cold and he almost fell into the void.","Ever since he came to the Great Yan Domain, he had never felt such a terrifying feeling of being on the verge of death.","The Black Bead with unknown power was too terrifying. It could easily kill any Grand Yan Immortal, so it would be easy for it to kill Jian Wushuang.","He finally understood why the three Emperors’ True Souls had been so nervous back then.","Jian Wushuang was very regretful now.","This Black Bead was simply an extremely unstable factor. If he were to release even a little of his Yan power, would he be killed immediately?","“What was that thing that flew here? Where’s that Black Bead?” Yan Fan raised his head and looked around.","The Black Bead disappeared so quickly, that Jiang Li and Yan Fan did not see where it disappeared.","Jian Wushuang, who was carrying the Black Bead, wanted to cry but had no tears. He did not even dare to breathe loudly."]},{"number":4966,"title":"Chapter 4966 New Masters Accompanying","paragraphs":["4966 New Masters Accompanying","The strange and mysterious light disappeared. After a while, Yan Fan dared to move.","“Darling, do you know who made the move just now? I think that in this Endless Sea, there are no more than a handful of people who can trigger that terrifying power just now.”","“No.” Jiang Li shook her head. “We’ve been sleeping in the Blood Sea for too long. We don’t know who else will come here.”","“That’s really strange. Fortunately, us husband and wife have always been cutting the weeds and removing the roots. There’s no Immortal under the sword, so there won’t be any opponents who will make things difficult for us.”","Yan Fan scratched his head and sighed in relief when he saw that Jian Wushuang was safe and sound. “It’s good that Disciple is fine. Otherwise, I’ll lose my life.”","Jiang Li rolled his eyes at him. “Idiot, if you had finished the battle quickly, you wouldn’t have caused so much trouble. In the future, you better get rid of your long-winded habit.”","“That’s not long-winded. It’s called attacking the heart, okay? The best way to kill an enemy is to attack the heart...” Yan Fan spoke with assurance.","Jian Wushuang slowly recovered from his shock as he watched them bicker. Then, he put his hand into his pocket as if he was ready to die.","When his finger touched the Black Bead, there was no terrifying suction force as he had imagined. There was only a warm and cool feeling, as if it had never been awakened.","“How strange. How did this Black Bead wake up?” Jian Wushuang pondered.","But soon, Yan Fan, who was walking over, interrupted his train of thought. “Disciple, what are you going to do next? I want to hear your thoughts.”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his thoughts and smiled bitterly in his heart when he heard Yan Fan’s words. He did not stop him.","“I came here to find a friend. Next, I’ll continue my search.”","Yan Fan continued to smile when he heard that. “Then, we’ll protect you on the way.”","“Yes.” Jiang Li nodded. “With us by your side, there won’t be any Yan Immortals threatening you in the Endless Sea.”","“Uh, this is not very good...” Jian Wushuang scratched his head and did not know how to refuse.","“It’s only right and proper for a Master to protect his Disciple. What’s there to be good about?” Yan Fan laughed and flew forward with Jian Wushuang in his arms.","Jiang Li raised her eyebrows and smiled as if she was satisfied with her husband’s domineering attitude. Then, she followed them.","From this, a magical scene could be seen.","Two Sword Immortals were crossing the Endless Sea, one in front and one behind. In the middle was a trembling little Yan Immortal.","Almost at the same time as they left the Heavenly Continent, a figure slowly walked out of the shattered Heavenly Palace.","This figure was the young man who was killed by Jian Wushuang with a single strike. He was also the Prince who was trapped in the Heavenly Continent.","He slowly walked on the Heavenly Continent that had already become ruins. His expression was neither sad nor happy, as if everything here did not belong to him.","In the end, he walked to the center of the battlefield and spread his arms.","Suddenly, a unique energy fluctuation began to gather in the void.","As the energy fluctuations continued to gather, the originally shattered void began to change.","One after another, brilliant rays of light that looked like tiny stars began to appear, and then quickly interweaved and linked together.","As the starlight interweaved, an Immortal Source which was shattered appeared again!","That was Bian Ziyuan!","Thousands of flowing clouds and water ripples flowed slowly. Bian Ziyuan, who was completely naked, suddenly opened his eyes at this moment.","“Ah!”","An indescribable force filled the entire void, and lightning snakes shuttled through the clouds.","In the end, when his figure was completely condensed, the young man retracted his arms. His face was so pale that it was devoid of blood.","The boundless power finally dissipated, and Bian Ziyuan’s figure landed heavily on the ground.","“Wu Shuang, I want your life!” At the same time, he punched the surrounding plane into a deep pit.","The young man slowly walked in front of him and squatted down. “He can’t die now. Whether we can leave this place or not depends on him.”","...","Jian Wushuang, who had left the broken Heavenly Continent Plane and crossed the Endless Sea, felt as if everything was a dream.","The treacherous Heavenly Continent Plane and the dangerous and terrifying Blood River had all become a thing of the past.","Now, he had left safely and suddenly had two Masters.","From the brief conversation, Jian Wushuang knew that Jiang Li and Yan Fan had probably reached the terrifying height of Sword Immortal before Zhen Wuyang became an Emperor.","And from their control of Sword Intent and the Yan power that they inadvertently revealed, they were probably at least at the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal level.","With the protection of these two terrifying fierce gods, Jian Wushuang would have been able to do whatever he wanted in the Endless Sea if he had not met a real Emperor.","Moreover, he had not forgotten that there was an Emperor with a complete True Body in the ring in his hand.","Yan Fan, who was walking at the front, spoke while they were traveling at high speed.","“Disciple, do you know where the old friend you are looking for is?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “I don’t know. I don’t have any clues.”","Jiang Li frowned and said, “That’s troublesome. The Endless Sea is called the Endless Sea because it has no end.”","“Moreover, once you cross the sea surface for too long, you will get lost, if your friend did not have Six Revolutions strength, he would have already gotten lost.”","Jian Wushuang was worried. Although Di Qing was a Nine Revolution Grand Yan Immortal, he was already at the end of his rope after that battle. Even though he was exiled, his Immortal body was far from recovering.","However, Di Qing still had seven True Lives. Even if he was stranded in the Endless Sea, he would not die directly.","Then, Yan Fan continued, “My dear Disciple, may I ask how long your old friend has been exiled? If it’s less than a Hua Year, it might still be possible to find him.”","Jian Wushuang replied, “Less than a year.”","“W-what? Only a Year?” Yan Fan and Jiang Li were both shocked.","To the endless lifespan of a Yan Immortal, a year’s time was not even enough for a breath’s time.","“That’s right, it’s not more than a year,” he confirmed again.","Yan Fan seemed to be thinking about something. Finally, he said, “If it’s less than a year, it’s possible to find him.”","“You mean, to that place?” Jiang Li frowned.","He nodded. “In this situation, we can only go there and try our luck.”"]},{"number":4967,"title":"Chapter 4967 Your Vision Is Too Narrow","paragraphs":["4967 Your Vision Is Too Narrow","Jian Wushuang heard some clues and asked, “Is that place very dangerous?”","“My Disciple, no matter how dangerous the Endless Sea is, as long as we are by your side, no one can do anything to you.” Yan Fan patted his shoulder. “It’s just that that place is not dangerous, but a little strange...”","Jiang Li sneered, and her handsome eyes almost tore Yan Fan into pieces.","“It’s strange, but I’m afraid it’s an unforgettable old relationship.”","“...” The corners of Yan Fan’s mouth twitched, and then he said righteously, “Darling, what are you saying? Don’t bring up the past. I’ve already ended it with her.”","“Humph!” Jiang Li snorted, and the six swords on her waist rang. “It doesn’t matter if you can’t forget it. I’ll kill you with my swords.”","“Disciple, hurry up and leave. There’s no time to lose.” Yan Fan left this sentence and flew out first.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. It seemed that his cheap master was still carrying a lot of old love debts.","No matter what, his heart that was originally hanging in the air calmed down a little.","It was much better to search with a goal than to search aimlessly.","The Endless Sea was boundless and borderless, it was difficult for anything to float above it, only the skeleton of a Yan Immortal could.","And the vast Heavenly Continent Plane was completely formed by the remains of the Yan Immortal.","As he continued to move forward, all kinds of dimensions of different sizes appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","A plane was not much different from the Heavenly Region of the Endless Sea. This place was simply a miniature universe!","Furthermore, as they moved forward, there were all kinds of vicious and ignorant Grand Yan Immortals who wanted to kill them.","Regrettably, if Jian Wushuang was alone, he would naturally retreat. After all, a Six Revolutions Great Yan Immortal was enough to make him suffer.","But now, there were two Sword Immortals protecting him.","Yan Fan, who was walking at the front, did not even bother to draw his sword. He only needed to point his finger, and the unparalleled Sword Intent could easily tear apart any Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source.","After traveling for billions of miles, there were already dozens of Six Revolutions Great Yan Immortals who had died at Yan Fan’s hands, and close to a hundred Three Revolutions Great Yan Immortals.","On one hand, Jian Wushuang was shocked by Yan Fan’s unfathomable strength. On the other hand, he was shocked by how many Grand Yan Immortals were exiled by Emperor Zhen Wuyang in the Endless Sea.","No wonder there were so few Grand Yan Immortals in the current Great Si Region that it made one’s hair stand on end. They had all been exiled to the Endless Sea several years ago...","Up until now, the lowest stage in the Endless Sea was the Grand Yan Immortal. Jian Wushuang guessed that countless Yan Immortals had been exiled here.","However, the outcome of the Yan Immortal would not be too good.","As they continued forward, the planes on the Endless Sea gradually disappeared, and what replaced them was endless coldness and deathly stillness.","Jian Wushuang tried his best to sense Di Qing’s aura, hoping to find him as soon as possible.","Yan Fan, who looked calm and collected, gradually became more serious as he continued to move forward. His handsome eyes began to look around.","“Hmm? Trees? How could trees grow in the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang was surprised to see such a strange scene.","Because in front of him, trees that were almost as tall as the sky had grown on the black sea that was originally boundless.","The tree was tall, and it only had branches that stretched out, without a single leaf. It did not look like some kind of Immortal tree.","While Jian Wushuang was lost in his thoughts, everything around him changed. Jiang Li and Yan Fan disappeared.","“Oh, another illusion?”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Almost immediately, he realized that he was in an illusion.","“Is it because I saw those trees?”","To be able to make him fall into an illusion in such a short time, the Yan Immortal who set up this illusion did have some ability.","However, it met Jian Wushuang, who could see through it with a single glance.","Just as he was about to use the Invisible Sword to cut open the illusion, a Snowflake Longsword was one step ahead of him and directly tore open a crack in the illusion.","Then, a big palm pulled Jian Wushuang out of the illusion.","“Good fellow, you actually dare to cast an illusion in front of me. I think you’re tired of living.”","Yan Fan was furious. When he was about to attack, Jiang Li reached out his hand.","In an instant, the entire illusion shattered, and then a huge furball was caught in Jiang Li’s hand.","It was a huge rabbit.","Jiang Li raised her hand and was about to chop off the rabbit’s head.","“Madam, please hold back!”","Yan Fan shouted and rushed over, grabbing the rabbit from Jiang Li’s hand.","“What are you doing? Do you want to die?” Jiang Li was furious.","The corner of Yan Fan’s mouth twitched. He hugged the big rabbit and smiled awkwardly. “You can’t kill this rabbit. It’s a friend of an old friend.”","After saying that, the big rabbit suddenly broke free from his embrace and turned into an extremely agile girl in the void.","“Humph!” The quick-witted girl pretended to be angry, then turned around and ran, quickly disappearing.","“This wretched girl,” Yan Fan muttered to himself and smiled apologetically. “We can’t kill her...”","Jiang Li put on an expression as if she did not want to talk to him and pulled Jian Wushuang to leave.","However, at this moment, an ethereal and extremely intelligent voice sounded. It was as if it came from the Nine Heavens, and it was indescribably beautiful.","“Since you’re already here, why don’t you come over to my place and have a chat?”","Yan Fan’s expression changed drastically, and his lips turned pale. “Darling, leave quickly...”","Jiang Li was furious when he heard Yan Fan’s charming voice. She glared at Yan Fan as if she wanted to swallow him alive, then she flew into the sky.","“I didn’t find trouble with you, but you actually dare to find trouble with me. Today, I will smash your Gui Yue Immortal Palace!”","This was the first time Jian Wushuang saw Jiang Li draw her sword. With endless Sword Intent, she broke the sky and flew up to the sky.","Yan Fan’s face was pale as he shouted at the top of his lungs, “Darling, you must look past this. Your vision is too narrow–”","Swish!!!","100,000 Sword Intents fell from the sky, almost slicing him into pieces.","Jian Wushuang’s heart jumped. He had never expected that the two Sword Companions would fight with True Swords and True Sabers.","After dodging the 100,000 Sword Intents, Yan Fan looked at Jian Wushuang nervously. “Quick, quick, she’s going crazy. Let’s go and stop her. Otherwise, we won’t be able to live in peace.”","Jian Wushuang was helpless. Something that could make Jiang Li so angry must have something to do with Yan Fan.","It must be a love debt again."]},{"number":4968,"title":"Chapter 4968 Gui Yue Immortal Palace","paragraphs":["4968 Gui Yue Immortal Palace","The illusion was torn apart by the furious Jiang Li. Jian Wushuang was able to see the real picture of the Endless Sea.","He saw a giant tree that could no longer be called a tree. It was rooted at the bottom of the sea and connected to the sky. Its indescribable crown was almost wider than a Heavenly Region.","An extremely strange fragrance entered his nose.","This was an Immortal Osmanthus Tree, bigger than a Heavenly Region.","In Jian Wushuang’s memory, even the World Tree in the Little Emperor’s Big Lonely Heaven was not as big as this Immortal Osmanthus Tree.","He could clearly see that on the crown of the Immortal Osmanthus Tree, there was an ancient Immortal Palace hidden in the clouds.","Jiang Li was furious. He broke through the illusion and went straight to the Immortal Palace.","Yan Fan was scared out of his wits and hurriedly chased after him.","This ancient Immortal Palace seemed to run through the Nine Heavens and was extremely lonely.","Jian Wushuang then stepped into the Immortal Palace.","On the vast and boundless Immortal Palace square, there were many huge Immortal Osmanthus Trees.","On each tree, there was a moon that gave off a hazy light.","Roughly counting, there are no less than thousands of moons.","The entire ancient Immortal Palace was shrouded in the moonlight, giving it an indescribable strangeness.","At this moment, Jiang Li, who was furious, walked forward with a long and narrow real sword.","The square seemed to be rumbling under her feet.","In the next moment, the tightly shut doors suddenly opened, and dozens of white-robed figures flew out.","Every single one of them was at least Three Revolutions, they lined up in front of the square and looked ahead as if they were facing a great enemy.","Jiang Li did not even look at them and walked straight ahead.","An old man dressed in white standing at the front hurriedly shouted, “Hold on! Without the order of our Immortal Lord, no one is allowed to barge into the Immortal Palace.”","“Get lost if you don’t want to die! You’re courting death! ” Jiang Li said in a low voice. Her violent Sword Intent was revealed at this moment.","The old man in white was stunned when he heard this. He clearly did not expect this heroic woman in front of him to be so domineering.","When he saw the terrifying aura emanating from her body, the old man in white gritted his teeth and took a few steps back. He shouted in a low voice, “Set up the array formation!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the dozens of white-robed men all released their first attack.","Their Yan powers were connected to each other, forming an indescribably beautiful Ancient Moon Immortal Formation!","The boundless power was fully displayed at this moment, and the vast ancient moon in the immortal array burst out with brilliant light.","Boundless moonlight-colored energy surged out from every white-robed figure, providing pure energy for the Immortal formation.","This was an Immortal formation that gathered the full strength of more than ten Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, even a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal did not dare to underestimate it.","However, their biggest mistake was to use the wrong target.","Not only was she a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, but she was also a Sword Immortal. She could easily let them know what a miserable outcome was.","“Young Lady, if you take another step forward, don’t blame us for being impolite,” the elder Grand Yan Immortal in the lead said in a deep voice.","He seemed to be so confident in the Ancient Moon Immortal Formation that he reminded Jiang Li.","However, Jiang Li’s expression was cold as she raised her sword and slashed forward.","A Sword Intent that was as vast as the sea slashed out!","The green jade square was plowed open by the Sword Intent, leaving a mark that was tens of thousands of feet wide. The floor tiles were shattered into powder.","Looking at this earth-shaking scene, all the white-robed men sucked in a breath of cold air and then desperately injected their derived energy into the Immortal formation.","However, in the next moment, the earth-shattering Sword Intent actually slashed open the Ancient Moon Immortal Formation!","It was too easy, as easy as tearing a piece of white paper. The Immortal formation that combined the full strength of 15 Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals did not even last for a breath.","The Sword Intent was as destructive as dried weeds and rotten wood. It only broke the Immortal formation and did not hurt a single person in white. Instead, it sent them flying.","The ultimate target of this Sword Intent was the ancient Immortal Palace!","At this moment, a black-haired man in white walked out of the immortal palace quietly. He held a True Sword in his hand and looked extremely heroic and carefree.","Facing the True Sword that came from the sky, the black-robed white-haired man pulled out the True Sword from his sheath and brazenly met it.","Countless Sword Intents shot out from his back, shaking the heavens and earth!","When the two collided, the entire shattered square shook.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened at this moment!","Another Sword Immortal?","In the vast and boundless Grand Secretary Domain, even Grand Yan Immortals were considered as an index, while Sword Immortals were only legendary existences.","However, in the Endless Sea, Jian Wushuang saw three Sword Immortals in succession. He was so shocked that he could not speak.","The difficulty of becoming a Sword Immortal had even transcended the concept of cultivation.","One had to know that there was no mature system to become a Sword Immortal. Every swordsman could only slowly explore and then create their own sword path.","However, nearly 99 percent of swordsmen died on the road to creating their own Sword Dao.","Only the remaining swordsmen, who were far less than 10 percent, were qualified to pursue the path of Sword Immortals.","As a result, there was no concept of cultivation in the path of sword cultivation.","Yan Fan was an example. In order to become a Sword Immortal, he had wielded his sword for a whole Hua Year!","A Hua Year was enough for a cultivator to reach the Yan Immortal stage!","However, Yan Fan only used this one Hua Year to wield his sword. It was evident how difficult it was to become a Sword Immortal!","He used his Sword Intent to block the incoming Sword Intent. When the two completely canceled each other out, the black-haired and white-robed man stood on the shattered square again. His right foot took half a step back without leaving a trace.","It was this subtle scene that Jian Wushuang saw. Then, he was sure that the black-haired and white-robed man was definitely not a Sword Immortal.","Taking half a step back meant that he was not strong enough in the previous confrontation.","A true Sword Immortal would never retreat half a step under that Sword Intent.","However, although he was not a Sword Immortal, he was definitely only a hair’s breadth away from a Sword Immortal. He was infinitely close to a Sword Immortal.","The world was silent, and there was no more fighting.","The True Sword was sheathed, and a smile slowly appeared on the ice-cold face of the black-haired and white-robed man.","Jiang Li, who was angry, changed her expression and looked away.","“Good heavens, why is this old thing here?!” Yan Fan, who looked like he was watching the show, was shocked. He quickly walked to Jiang Li and blocked her eyes.","“Cough cough, I say, we shouldn’t stay here for long. We should leave,” Yan Fan said with a face full of jealousy.","“You’re leaving?” Jiang Li glared at him. Alright, I’ll flatten this Immortal Palace first.”","After she finished speaking, she slapped Yan Fan and sent him flying. Then, she strode forward.","“Long time no see.”","At this moment, the black-haired man and the white-robed man spoke. His words contained the joy of reunion after a long time, as well as a hint of vicissitudes.","Jiang Li’s expression became even more unnatural, but he soon recovered."]},{"number":4969,"title":"Chapter 4969 Old Friend","paragraphs":["4969 Old Friend","Then, she said, “Why are you here?”","The black-haired and white-robed man continued, “It’s been too long. I don’t want to continue sleeping, so I came here with an old friend.”","Jiang Li sneered. “You’re really free and elegant!”","“How have you been?” the black-haired and white-robed man immediately asked.","“Not much, move aside, I’m going to flatten this place!” Jiang Li said in a deep voice.","At this moment, Yan Fan also ran over hurriedly. He coughed on purpose and then said in a low voice, “Darling, you won’t be angry. Let’s go quickly.”","The black-haired man and the white-robed man laughed and said to him, “Brother Yan, since you’re already here, come in and have a seat. It’s been many years since we last had a good chat together.”","Yan Fan quickly refused. “That’s not necessary. We’ll go back and sleep. We won’t disturb you.”","Then, he pulled Jiang Li away.","At this moment, a light and charming voice came from the Immortal Palace. “You’re leaving in such a hurry. You haven’t done anything wrong. Why don’t you dare to come to my place?”","Jiang Li glanced at Yan Fan who was about to run away.","Yan Fan’s body trembled. Then, he turned around slowly and said righteously, “I’ve never done anything wrong. It’s just that I’m tired today, so I won’t bother you.”","Jiang Li did noot want to listen to his nonsense, so she dragged him into the palace.","Yan Fan’s face was ashen. He shouted at Jian Wushuang, “Disciple, come and save me.”","...","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly and walked into the Immortal Palace.","The Immortal Palace was vast and vast. A faint fragrance assaulted their senses, giving them an indescribable sense of comfort.","Moreover, under this fragrance, the energy in his meridians was recovering at an extremely slow speed.","Walking at the back, Jian Wushuang saw everything in the Immortal Palace.","The Immortal Palace was simple and elegant. Everything piled up and had little decoration, but it did not seem empty.","Tiny stars and palm-sized moons decorated every corner of the space, making the entire Immortal Palace look like a flowing galaxy.","Under the guidance of the black-haired man and the white-clothed man, Jiang Li walked up angrily.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang heard whispers coming from behind him.","“How strange, there’s actually a puny little Yan Immortal here, should we chase him out?”","“What are you talking about? Don’t you see that they have a special relationship with us Immortal Lords?”","“Shut up, all of you. Don’t you think what happened just now was embarrassing enough? If anyone dares to talk, don’t blame me for being rude!”","After being scolded by the man in white, the people who were killed by Jiang Li stayed aside and did not dare to say anything.","Jian Wushuang smiled and did not take their words to heart. In the Endless Sea, one’s strength was far more important than words.","As they entered, clouds began to float in the depths of the Immortal Palace.","An extremely beautiful woman appeared along with the misty clouds.","Unlike Jiang Li’s domineering aura, this extremely beautiful woman had gentle eyes and was indescribably gentle and charming.","Even Jian Wushuang had rarely seen such a beautiful and gentle woman. She was like a full moon that was hazy.","Moreover, she was hugging a long-haired rabbit in her arms, which added a little softness and charm to her.","Seeing this scene, Yan Fan’s expression was extremely unnatural, but he still forced a smile.","Then, all the white-robed people in the Immortal palace cupped their hands and bowed. “Greetings, Vast Moon Immortal Lord.”","The beautiful woman called Vast Moon Immortal Lord smiled and stretched out her hand to conjure thousands of clouds to lift them up.","Then, she looked around and finally landed on Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","“It’s been a long time since we last met.”","Jiang Li did not buy it. She stepped forward and said coldly, “Why are you blocking our way? If you don’t explain yourself today, I’ll flatten your palace.”","Facing her threat, Vast Moon Immortal Lord could not help but chuckle. “Sister Jiang Li, you’re still as irritable as before.”","Creak...","Jiang Li clenched the sword hilt on her waist as if she could draw it at any moment.","“Darling, please calm down...” Yan Fan said in a low voice, his body trembling slightly.","Vast Moon Immortal Lord smiled again. “However, in my opinion, only you can win over Big Brother Yan’s heart.”","Hearing that, Jiang Li’s expression softened and she let go of her sword.","At this moment, Yan Fan hurriedly said, “Well, this is all a misunderstanding. Now that the misunderstanding has been resolved, we won’t stay here for too long.”","“What’s the hurry? It’s been so long since we last met. Don’t you want to sit down and catch up? Sit down!” Jiang Li sneered.","Then, no matter how much Yan Fan resisted, Jiang Li pressed him down in front of the desk.","Jian Wushuang sat down as well and Jiang Li forced him to sit between them.","The handsome middle-aged man with black hair and white clothes sat next to Jiang Li.","When they were all seated, Vast Moon Immortal Lord sat down as well, unable to conceal the joy in her eyes.","“The last time we parted, we were still nameless cultivators. Now that we’ve met again, we’ve been separated for many years, and everything has changed.”","Vast Moon Immortal Lord sighed with emotion. Although his expression was extremely calm, a faint blush had already appeared on his face.","She let go of the little bunny in her arms and clapped her hands lightly. Then, two rows of fairies holding exquisite silver flasks walked over on the clouds and placed them down in front of them.","“This is the moon dew that I left behind after we parted. Now, it’s finally time for us to meet again.”","Jian Wushuang looked over and the silver pot automatically poured out a cup of wine. Immediately, a strong fragrance spread out.","Even though he was not good at drinking, he could not help but swallow.","There was no other reason than that the moon dew was too fragrant.","When Yan Fan saw the moon dew in front of him, he almost spat out his saliva uncontrollably.","Then, ignoring Jiang Li’s burning eyes, he picked up his glass and drank.","“Let’s drink together. You know the moon dew of the Vast Moon Brew.” The black-haired man in white smiled and poured a cup for Jiang Li.","“Humph!” Jiang Li snorted. She did not touch the glass but picked up the wine pot and started drinking.","The wine line emitted a strange fragrance in the air. Jian Wushuang, the black-haired man, and the white-robed man did not know whether to laugh or cry when they saw Jiang Li’s bold and unrestrained manner. Then, they picked up their wine glasses and took a sip."]},{"number":4970,"title":"Chapter 4970 Disciple Against Disciple","paragraphs":["4970 Disciple Against Disciple","When the moon dew entered his throat, it turned into the sweetest wine thread that flowed through his internal organs. It was indescribably pleasant and comfortable.","Jian Wushuang put down the wine cup and looked at the black-haired man and the white-robed man. He found that he had been watching him.","Their eyes met, and the black-haired and white-robed man gave him a friendly smile.","Jian Wushuang returned the greeting and continued to look straight ahead.","“Good fellow, you’re really strong.” Yan Fan was not satisfied. He put down his glass and drank like Jiang Li.","The black-haired man and the white-robed man did not want to fall behind either. They also picked up the wine pot and drank heartily.","To Jian Wushuang’s surprise, the gentle and charming Vast Moon Immortal Lord also changed her previous weak appearance. She lifted the wine pot and started to chant.","Just like that, the originally tense situation turned into a drinking contest.","Out of curiosity, Jian Wushuang tested the weight of the wine pot and could not help but click his tongue.","There were thousands of things inside this jug, and the amount of wine stored in it was no less than 100,000 catties!","If these 100,000 catties were to fall into his stomach, even a Grand Yan Immortal would be completely drunk.","As time passed, Jiang Li threw down the wine pot first, but it was empty.","“How satisfying!” Jiang Li did not look drunk at all. Satisfied, she sat back down.","A moment later, Yan Fan, the black-haired and white-robed man, and the Vast Moon Immortal Lord all finished the wine in the jug one after another, and their faces were more or less tipsy.","“How have you been all these years?” The black-haired man and the white-clothed man looked at Jiang Li and finally made up their minds.","“Who can be happy after being exiled here? Yan Fan and I have been in a deep sleep and rarely woke up until today,” Jiang Li said slowly.","The black-haired man and the white-robed man were silent. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Who is this?”","Before Jiang Li could say anything, Yan Fan said excitedly, “This is my disciple. He’s a rare genius.”","As soon as he said that, Vast Moon Immortal Lord looked at Jian Wushuang with her beautiful eyes.","She knew Yan Fan’s pride very well. As an ultimate existence who had suppressed thousands of Heavenly Regions with a single sword in the Ancient Era, even the Emperor wanted to recruit him.","At that time, many Heaven’s Favorites were eager to become his disciples, but he had never taken one in.","When the black-haired and white-robed man heard this, he could not help but smile, “Oh, it seems like Brother Yan’s taste is not bad. He is indeed a good seedling. However, it would be a little too much to call him a Heaven’s Favorite. How can a Heaven’s Favorite be a mere Yan Immortal?”","“Cang Ting, what do you mean?” Jiang Li was displeased.","“Nothing. I’m just correcting some problems,” the black-haired and white-robed man said with a faint smile.","Yan Fan, who was originally excited, also changed his expression. He looked at him and said meaningfully, “From what you said, it seems that you have accepted a true prodigy as your disciple?”","The black-haired and white-robed man named Cang Ting said calmly, “More or less. He has already comprehended his own Sword Dao. It’s only a matter of time before he becomes a Sword Immortal in the future.”","Yan Fan could not help but chuckle. “You’re still like to joke as you were back then. Your disciple has become a Sword Immortal? Don’t joke around. Only my disciple can become a Sword Immortal, okay?”","The Immortal Palace was silent. Cang Ting looked at him and continued, “How about a competition?”","“If you dare, then come. Who’s afraid of who?!” Yan Fan said disdainfully. “Hurry up and ask your disciple to come out. We are in a hurry.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a black-robed figure walked out from the depths of the Immortal Palace.","In this Immortal Palace that was all dressed in white, he seemed extremely out of place.","The black-robed young man’s expression was extremely calm. It was like a True Sword that completely hid its edge, making it impossible for others to see through it.","As he appeared, his originally calm gaze instantly locked onto Jian Wushuang!","Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","Jiang Li and Yan Fan finally understood why Cang Ting was so confident. His disciple had already reached Three Revolutions!","Three Revolutions was already a qualitative change, not to mention that he had comprehended his own Sword Dao. Even if he faced a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he had the strength to fight!","“This is really a little troublesome...” Yan Fan murmured in a low voice. Then, he quickly approached Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice, “Good Disciple, the fate of my face is on you this time. It’s all up to you. ”","“Uh... I’m afraid that’s not a good idea. I don’t really want to make a move,” Jian Wushuang said with a bitter smile.","“Good Disciple, you must save me and ruthlessly slap this old thing in the face,” Yan Fan said in a low voice, almost kneeling in front of Jian Wushuang.","In the end, Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I’ll give it a try.”","“Alright!” Yan Fan was so delighted that he almost jumped onto the table. “My disciple has already agreed. Let’s get ready to start!”","Cang Ting was stunned. He did not expect Yan Fan to accept the challenge instead of retreating.","“Are you crazy? Look clearly, my disciple is a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, just the pressure of the Yan power is enough to make your disciple unable to stand up!”","Yan Fan snorted. “Cut the crap. Today, I’ll show you what a real Heaven’s Favorite is!”","“Don’t worry, it won’t be a big problem.” He smiled and stood in the center of the palace.","Vast Moon Immortal Lord, who had intended to stop him, had no choice but to give up after seeing this. At the same time, she was also worried for Yan Fan.","There had never been any suspense in the outcome of a Yan Immortal facing a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal since ancient times, there had never been a single Yan Immortal who had counterattacked.","Even the most talented prodigies could not do it.","Could it be that all the fixed thoughts of the past would be overturned today?","Cang Ting secretly gritted his teeth. This was an extremely unfair battle. Even if his disciple won, it would not be too glorious.","After all, the gap between a Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal was something that could not be made up for.","Their eyes met, and the black-robed young man, who seemed to be hiding his sword, suddenly said, “You are very powerful. You are different from all the swordsmen I have seen. Your Sword Intent is too pure, as if it has been tempered by real blood and fire.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s calm state of mind could not help but ripple.","To be able to guess Jian Wushuang’s hidden characteristics in such a short period of time, he was definitely a terrifying existence."]},{"number":4971,"title":"Chapter 4971 The Bet Between Sword Immortals","paragraphs":["4971 The Bet Between Sword Immortals","The Wushuang Sword Dao originated from the Divine Power Universe.","Until today, it was still Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword move!","When the entire Sword Dao was completely integrated, he would immediately become a Sword Immortal!","All of Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent came from the Wushuang Sword Dao.","The Wushuang Sword Dao had indeed been tempered by blood and fire to reach its current state.","The black-robed young man had guessed all of this at this moment, which made Jian Wushuang feel shocked and vigilant.","After saying that, the black-robed young man gripped the hilt of his sword tightly, and his entire body’s aura was completely restrained.","He said in a deep voice, “Therefore, I will go all out. Don’t think that I will lower my strength to fight you. I will not lower my strength in the slightest, including my strength Yan power realm.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said calmly, “Of course, I won’t hide my strength.”","The black-robed youth said, “Then let’s begin.”","As he finished his last word, thousands of Sword Intents burst out from under his feet.","The Sword Intent was like a rainbow, piercing through the heavens and the earth, causing the entire Immortal Palace to tremble.","Immediately after, the Vast Moon Immortal Lord, who was sitting on the jade throne, waved her hand and sent down endless moonlight. It directly turned into a barrier that enveloped the two.","With this barrier as the center, a martial arts field was formed, allowing them to fight freely without destroying the Immortal Palace.","Cang Ting, who had black hair and white clothes, could not help but reveal a satisfied expression when he saw this scene.","His disciple was truly stunning. Just the Sword Intent he released formed a suppressive force, and he almost controlled the entire aura at the first moment.","In a competition between swordsmen, the first moment of the sword attack was extremely important. The so-called momentum could already determine the outcome of the battle.","Cang Ting then looked at Yan Fan. Seeing that not only was he not worried, but he was also smiling at this scene, he could not help but feel angry.","Even if they won this battle, it would be extremely disgraceful.","Thinking of this, Cang Ting could not help but sneer. “You know that you’re going to lose, but you still want to fight. As a master, you really don’t care about your disciple’s life and death. If my disciple had been more ruthless, I’m afraid there wouldn’t have been a winner.”","Yan Fan’s face turned cold instantly upon hearing that, but then he returned to normal. “With your disciple’s mediocre Sword Dao, it’s simply wishful thinking to think that you can injure my disciple severely!”","“When have I ever been unconfident?” When Yan Fan said this, he directly stepped on the document and said a shocking sentence arrogantly.","...","Vulgar, too vulgar.","The Immortal Palace was deathly silent. The corners of all the white-robed people’s mouths twitched, including the eyes of the Vast Moon Immortal Lord who was sitting on the jade throne.","“Yan Fan, how dare you!”","Cang Ting slammed the table made of the Osmanthus Tree into pieces. He straightened his body and his face was as dark as water.","This was a blatant humiliation. If they were not in the Immortal Palace, he would have drawn his sword long ago!","Yan Fan pursed his lips and said, “I’m not being presumptuous. Why? Can’t I tell the truth now?”","“Are you that confident that your disciple will win?”","“What? Don’t tell me you think your disciple will win?”","“Then how about we add some conditions?” Cang Ting tried his best to suppress his anger.","“What condition?” Yan Fan raised his eyebrows and said.","Cang Ting said coldly, “If my disciple wins, your Sword Dao will belong to me. If your disciple wins, my Sword Dao will belong to you. How about it?”","Before Yan Fan could say anything, the Vast Moon Immortal Lord, who was sitting on the jade throne, had already stopped him with a solemn expression. “No, this condition is absolutely not allowed!”","“I think this condition is not bad, but I have to add one more thing to this condition.” Yan Fan smiled quietly. “If my disciple wins, tell me the secret of how your disciple reached the Grand Yan Immortal realm.”","Cang Ting was startled and his expression was slightly unnatural, but he eventually agreed.","Once this condition was set, it could not be changed. Even if Vast Moon Immortal Lord was worried or angry, it was useless.","The reason why she was worried and angry was because these two arch-enemies had actually gambled their respective Sword Daos for this competition between their disciples.","This was truly fatal.","One had to know that after reaching the level of Sword Immortals or even Quasi-Sword Immortals, the battle between them would determine the outcome of life and death in a hair’s breadth.","Often, just one attack was enough to determine life and death.","As a Sword Immortal, once the Origin Sword Dao was completely known by an opponent who was evenly matched, there was only death waiting for him.","These two seemingly ordinary conditions were betting on the life of a Sword Immortal and a Quasi-Sword Immortal!","She had already made a decision in her heart. No matter what the final outcome was, she would not let the two of them reveal their Sword Dao!","...","Jian Wushuang and the black-robed young man, who were completely enveloped by the moonlight, did not hear the conversation outside at all.","In their eyes and ears, there was only each other.","At this moment, the aura that the black-robed young man revealed was completely different from the one he released earlier. It was thick and strong.","It was as if Jian Wushuang was not facing a swordsman, but a sword, a broadsword without a blade or sheath!","Next, he was even more certain of his thoughts.","The black-robed youth drew a sword from his back. It was a pitch-black heavy sword.","It could no longer be described as a sword. It could be described as a heavy ruler or even an iron plate.","Without a blade, it was like a heavy ruler.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn. Those who could use such a heavy sword were all swordsmen who had practiced their Sword Principle to the peak.","The heavy sword has no edge, and the skill is not good.","Without the sword, the sword edge had more destructive power. Jian Wushuang was even sure that ordinary Yan Immortal experts could not even withstand this attack!","At this moment, the black-robed youth seemed to have completely fused with the heavy sword in his hand. His eyes had turned completely black.","“The greatest respect for you is to let you completely kneel before my sword strike.”","Jian Wushuang shrugged and an Invisible Sword appeared in his right hand.","This was the materialization of the Wushuang Sword Dao. Streaks of sword patterns were slowly circulating.","Cang Ting, who was watching this scene from afar, had a solemn look on his face.","A formless Invisible Sword. This kid was not simple!","On the other hand, Yan Fan was extremely smug, his chin almost reaching the sky.","He had once had a brief sword duel with Jian Wushuang. Although it was only two moves, he had felt the aura of the True Sword Principle.","‘My disciple might be able to beat you, old thing, let alone your disciple who is not even as good as you...’"]},{"number":4972,"title":"Chapter 4972 The Sword Strike Shook the Immortal Palace","paragraphs":["4972 The Sword Strike Shook the Immortal Palace","Yan Fan was proud of himself. In his current understanding, he had already placed Jian Wushuang and Cang Ting on the same level.","In the moonlight barrier, the black-robed young man took the lead to move at this moment!","He held the heavy sword with both hands and his entire body was like a dim light, crushing toward Jian Wushuang.","Clang!","The battle of power!","Jian Wushuang brazenly met the attack and the Invisible Sword in his hand directly blocked his heavy sword.","The black-robed young man used every inch of meridians in his Immortal body to twist the huge sword in his hand and smash it down again.","Sparks were everywhere!","Endless Sword Intent swept out and engulfed Jian Wushuang from all directions.","At this moment, the black-robed young man seemed to be tempering his sword embryo. His sword hit Jian Wushuang’s Invisible Sword again and again.","The entire moonlight enchantment was covered by the overflowing sparks.","Cang Ting’s lips curled into a satisfied smile. It seemed that everything was set in stone.","However, Yan Fan was not nervous because of this. Instead, he was still smiling as if he was not worried.","On the contrary, the Vast Moon Immortal Lord was the most nervous, as if she was ready to stop the two at any time.","Whispers began to spread from the originally quiet Immortal Palace.","“Who do you think will win?”","“Is there a need to say? It’s not like you haven’t seen his Sword Dao. Good heavens, even a few Grand Yan Immortals of the same realm could not get close to him.”","“That’s right, that Yan Immortal definitely can’t do it. It’s already not easy for him to hold on until now, if he continues, he’ll probably vomit blood.”","...","In the moonlight barrier, under the surging Sword Intent that filled the sky, the black-robed young man had completely entered the battle state. In just a few dozen breaths, he had swung out 90,000 sword strikes!","However, what surprised him was that Jian Wushuang had withstood all 90,000 sword strikes.","“Have you swung enough?” A voice rang out.","What responded to him was a powerful flying kick.","Bang!","With this kick, he flew back a thousand feet and only managed to stop himself after a crack appeared in the moonlight barrier.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his right foot and shook his wrist. “If all you’re gonna do is tickle me, I think we can finish this battle soon.”","“What?” The black-robed young man’s body trembled. The 90,000 swords that he swung out with all his strength were actually just tickles in his eyes?","“You’re courting death!” he shouted and millions of Sword Intents burst out from his Immortal body.","Then, these million Sword Intents condensed into a huge treasure form behind him, almost bursting the entire moonlight barrier.","“Duan Gu Sword Dao-”","As the black-robed young man shouted, the huge treasure form behind him also moved. It held a huge heavy sword in both hands and slashed down.","Jian Wushuang, who stood rooted to the ground, felt that his head was covered. He had no way to dodge and could only meet the Duan Gu sword strike.","At this moment, the Selfless True Shadow supported him. Jian Wushuang did not release the Wushuang Sword Dao but used the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style.","As another Sword Principle, the entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style represented exuberance and exuberance. It could protect Jian Wushuang from any serious injuries to the greatest extent.","Flowing Cloud Grass Sword Style, the seventh form.","Folding Grass and Leaves.","Boundless green Sword Intent rushed into the sky and turned into leaves that brazenly met the Duan Gu sword strike!","At this moment, even the moonlight barrier began to crack.","“Good boy, you actually split this sword attack and didn’t choose to fight it head-on.” Yan Fan muttered in a low voice, his admiration apparent in his words.","Cang Ting was also shocked. As a Quasi-Sword Immortal, how could he not notice Jian Wushuang’s intention?","This was completely using the smallest price to break that lightning strike!","The black-robed young man was defeated by this sword move!","Tens of thousands of leaves brazenly met the attack. Then, under the gazes of all the Grand Yan Immortals, they calmly split apart the black-robed youth’s Duan Gu Sword Strike!","This scene was too dull, yet too shocking.","The green Sword Intent also dissipated and was replaced by another Sword Intent, the Wushuang Sword Intent.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back. His sleeves fluttered in the wind and countless Sword Intents burst out from his feet.","At this moment, he took the lead and slashed out with his sword.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, second move.","River!","The majestic celestial river swept across the sky and tore apart the moonlight barrier set up by the Vast Moon Immortal Lord!","Then, countless Sword Intents surged up and gathered together to form the most vast Sword Dao river!","At this moment, the entire Immortal Palace was completely shaken. All the white-robed men were extremely frightened and began to retreat subconsciously.","They all felt an extremely strong threat!","Cang Ting and Vast Moon Immortal Lord both stood up, their eyes completely solemn.","This kind of power actually made them feel uneasy!","“Haha!” Yan Fan laughed and said loudly, “Awesome! Awesome! I get to see that sword move again!”","Jiang Li, who did not talk much, blushed. She was obviously eager to fight!","This was Jian Wushuang’s sword strike.","The sword strike shook the Immortal Palace!","At this moment, his body had completely disappeared, leaving only the vast river of swordsmanship flowing forward.","There was only disbelief left in the black-robed young man’s eyes. Facing such a powerful Sword Intent, he was actually unable to raise the will to resist!","However, as the Sword Dao celestial river got closer and closer, he finally gritted his teeth and raised the heavy sword in his hand to meet it.","The clothes on the upper body of the black-robed young man instantly exploded, and his Immortal body expanded several times. The heavy sword in his hand easily tore through the space and slashed at the Sword Dao celestial river.","Boom!","An indescribable explosion exploded in the Immortal Palace, causing all the stars and the full moon to pale in comparison.","The 100,000 swords of the heavy sword all slashed forward, but they only shattered the celestial river a little bit. Then, both the man and the sword were swallowed into the celestial river.","It was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse, leaving only the celestial river surging wildly!","The Immortal Palace was like a lonely boat in the wild sea, swaying on the verge of collapse.","The Vast Moon Immortal Lord released her Yan power in succession to stabilize the Immortal Palace. Then, he looked at Yan Fan and said angrily, “Look at what your disciple has done!”","Yan Fan shrugged, then looked at Cang Ting, whose face was ashen, and said smugly, “What do you think, Cang Ting? Are you convinced?”","Cang Ting was still in shock and turned a deaf ear to Yan Fan’s mockery. Jian Wushuang’s sword attack was completely beyond his imagination.","How could such a terrifying and unimaginable sword move be released by a puny swordsman?","Even though he was a Quasi-Sword Immortal, he wanted to go all out after seeing this sword moove.","And this sword naturally could not be unleashed by a swordsman, a puny little Yan Immortal!"]},{"number":4973,"title":"Chapter 4973 Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit","paragraphs":["4973 Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit","When the Sword Dao celestial river completely hung above the entire celestial palace, it stopped flowing as if it had solidified.","In the next moment, the Sword Dao celestial river shattered with a loud bang, and endless streams of light scattered across the entire Immortal Palace!","All the white-robed men looked at the ceiling of the Immortal Palace and were shocked again.","Under the dome, as the Sword Dao celestial river dissipated, two figures appeared.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as if nothing had happened. However, his right arm was pressed against the black-robed young man’s chest.","The black-robed young man’s exposed Immortal body was covered in wounds. Drops of divine blood gushed out from the wounds, and it was difficult to stop them.","He looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief, his face ashen.","If the finger pressing against his heart was a True Sword, he would have died and his Immortal body would have shattered.","Time seemed to stop. Jian Wushuang withdrew his palm and landed on the ground of the Immortal Palace without saying a word.","At this moment, all the people in white, Cang Ting, and Vast Moon Immortal Lord looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","With the strength of a Yan Immortal, he easily defeated a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who went all out. This was beyond their imagination.","Yan Fan hugged Jian Wushuang and laughed, “Amazing!”","Cang Ting sat back in his original spot, looking dejected.","Then, the black-robed young man landed from the sky and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression.","He seemed to be still immersed in that scene and had yet to recover from the lingering fear. He never thought that he would lose, and that he would lose without any leeway.","“How is it, Cangting? Who won?” Yan Fan turned to look at Cang Ting, who was in a daze, and asked with a smile.","Cang Ting slowly raised his head and stared at him. After a while, he said, “I lost. I’ll give you what you want now.”","After he finished speaking, he reached out and flipped his hand. Immediately, ancient and abstruse sword patterns came out of his palm.","This was Cang Ting’s Sword Dao!","However, the Sword Dao he released only appeared for a moment before it was immediately dispersed by a stream of Yan power.","Cang Ting raised his head and looked at Yan Fan, who was smiling evilly, and was puzzled.","“Alright, alright. No matter what, we’re still old friends who can live with our reputation. I don’t want to copy your past. Besides, do you think I’m coveting your Sword Dao? No matter what, I’m still a Sword Immortal!”","“I just wanted to show off my disciple to you today.”","Yan Fan could not help but burst into laughter.","Cang Ting’s expression changed several times, and in the end, there was only helplessness left.","The Vast Moon Immortal Lord, who had rushed over, shook her head helplessly. The carefree middle-aged man in front of her seemed to have not changed at all.","“Alright, alright. We’ve drunk the wine, talked, and fought. We should go.” Yan Fan waved his hand and said, “We still have important matters to attend to, so we won’t chat with you.”","“Wait, are we leaving just like that?” Cang Ting said coldly, causing the entire Immortal Palace to fall into silence again.","Then, he cleared his throat and said, “Vast Moon, don’t keep the wine. Take out all the remaining moon dew. If you don’t drink it today, don’t even think about leaving!”","...","“Alright, don’t send me off. We don’t know when we’ll meet again. It’s as if we have a good relationship.”","Yan Fan waved his hand and said while standing on the square of the Immortal Palace. In order to avoid Vast Moon Immortal Lord’s resentful and passionate gaze, he almost shrank behind Jian Wushuang.","The Vast Moon Immortal Lord retracted her gaze and then came to Jian Wushuang, looking at him with the gaze of an elder.","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up unnaturally.","Then, the Vast Moon Immortal Lord reached out and pulled his right arm, placing something in his palm.","“You are his disciple, so this is my gift to you. In the future, when you are in a life or death situation, open it.”","In his palm, there was a full moon that was emitting a hazy moonlight. It was extremely beautiful.","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry, but he did not refuse the goodwill of Vast Moon Immortal Lord. After thanking her, he solemnly put it into his arms.","Cang Ting and Yan Fan walked side by side at the front.","“You’ve taken in a good disciple whose future achievements will not be inferior to yours. It’s only a matter of time before he becomes a Sword Immortal.”","Yan Fan smiled when he heard that. “My goal isn’t just to let him become a Sword Immortal. Perhaps he might advance to an even more unpredictable realm.”","“You’re that confident?” Cang Ting looked at him.","Yan Fan sighed slightly and said, “It’s not that I’m confident, but he made me believe that his future will not settle at just a Sword Immortal.”","“Do you know why I was so calm after he defeated your disciple?”","“Why?”","“Because I know that he can easily defeat your disciple and even kill him in an instant.”","“It’s also because I didn’t set the bar for him as your disciple, but you.”","Even with Cang Ting’s composure, he was shocked after hearing such shocking words.","“Do you know what you’re saying? I’m a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, only a hair’s breadth away from becoming a Sword Immortal. Even if I’m not your match, I’m definitely not that far off!”","Yan Fan sighed again. “I know, but I still won’t change my mind because I’ve already discussed Sword Principle with him before this.”","“He blocked my sword strike, and he did it effortlessly.”","Cang Ting took a deep breath. “Is what you said true?”","“Although I don’t tell the truth much, this sentence is absolutely true.”","Cang Ting sighed faintly. “If that’s the case, I can’t guess where his future will be.”","“We can’t see that far. The only thing we can do is to act as guides.” Yan Fan looked into the distance with a myriad of thoughts.","“Oh right, you old brat, you still haven’t told me what’s going on with your disciple’s realm. At that time, I could tell at a glance that he consumed something to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal.”","Cang Ting smiled. “As expected, nothing can escape your eyes. That’s right, I did feed him a fruit that contains great fate energy.”","“What?” Yan Fan was completely shocked. “Damn, what kind of fruit is so heaven-defying that it can help you break through cultivation realms?!”","He looked proud. ” I’ll call it the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit for now.”","“Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit?","What a weird name. It sounds so cheap.”","“Cough, watch your words. I came up with that name myself.”","“I knew it was you, you old scoundrel. You clearly have no sense of style, yet you insist on pretending to be profound and mysterious, giving it such a bizarre name that lowers the overall standard.”","...","“Damn it, I’m done talking!”","“No, no, go on. Let me see if you can get a few hundred of those fruits for my disciple to taste.”","“Do you think they’re clay pills? You want a few hundred to taste? Those fruits that contain unparalleled luck and fate energy, even if you reach the heavens, you might only get one.”"]},{"number":4974,"title":"Chapter 4974 Chaotic Origin Sealess Domain","paragraphs":["4974 Chaotic Origin Sealess Domain","After learning that the so-called Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit was born in a place called Sealess Domain, Yan Fan became very interested.","After getting the real address of the Sealess Domain, he hurriedly took Jian Wushuang and prepared to go to the Sealess Domain.","“Remember, the Sealess Domain is a little strange. When I brought my disciple in, I was almost trapped. However, with the two of you Sword Immortals as my guarantor, there should be no major problems.”","Cang Ting’s gaze was solemn as he instructed.","Yan Fan waved his hand. “Got it. I’ll definitely be careful.”","Just as he was about to leave this Gui Yue Immortal Palace, a figure suddenly ran out of the palace, his expression nervous and determined.","Looking at the figure that was about to leave, the young man in black said in a clear voice, “May I ask your name? I want to remember it and fight you again in the future!”","Jian Wushuang stopped where he was and the corners of his mouth curled up. “Jian Wushuang.”","The three figures were like stars flowing in the sky. They came and left in a hurry, and in the blink of an eye, they disappeared into the boundless Endless Sea.","“Jian Wushuang... I’ll remember it,” the black-robed youth murmured. His gaze was firm.","Cang Ting put away his disappointed expression and looked at his disciple, his pride revealed without any concealment.","“My disciples aren’t any worse. I really want to see how far they’ll grow!’","At this moment, the hazy moonlight that could not be looked at directly on the body of the Vast Moon Immortal Lord was gone, and there was a sense of loneliness. Her thoughts seemed to have returned to the ancient times.","Sometimes, endless lifespan was not necessarily a good thing for the Yan Immortal. After experiencing countless ancient wars and the void, they began to think about the ultimate meaning of their existence.","...","There had been no news about Di Qing since he left the Gui Yue Immortal Palace. Although it had only been a short time, Jian Wushuang became even more worried.","One had to know that the longer the timeline was, the greater the possibility of finding Di Qing.","This was because the entire Boundless Ocean had no boundaries and was almost equivalent to a universe. The difficulty of finding a Grand Yan Immortal in such a universe filled with fatal dangers could be imagined.","Originally, Jian Wushuang wanted to continue searching for Di Qing aimlessly, but Yan Fan led him directly to the Sealess Domain.","“Good disciple, just follow us. I spent a lot of money to get this information from that old brat Cang Ting. I guarantee that you will become a Grand Yan Immortal after eating that Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit!”","Jian Wushuang felt helpless as he looked at Yan Fan, who was beaming with joy and excitement.","From the Yan Immortal stage to the Grand Yan Immortal stage, it was an extremely difficult and almost impossible task.","How could there be some kind of fruit that contained great fate energy that could have such an unimaginable heaven-defying effect?","One had to know that even Emperor Liu Ya’s imperial treasures did not have such a supreme treasure.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang did not have much hope and confidence.","“Sealess Domain, there’s actually a place in the Endless Sea that isn’t a sea area. Could it be that this old brat is fooling me again?”","As he continued to move forward, Yan Fan began to doubt the true location that Cang Ting had given him.","“Of course,” Jiang Li said. “You have to know that there is something in the Endless Sea that won’t sink into the sea and won’t be devoured by any Yan power.”","“You mean the corpse of the Yan Immortal?” Yan Fan touched his chin. “If that’s the case, then the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit might really be born in that place. ”","“What kind of name is that?” Jiang Li pouted. “What a weird name!”","Yan Fan touched his nose. “I think it’s quite weird too, but as long as I can advance to the Grand Yan Immortal stage, it’ll be a good outcome!”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly when he heard that. He knew his own situation the best. He had long realized that without the Immortal Source, it was almost impossible for him to reach the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","This was also the reason why he was unable to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal stage even though he was extremely proficient in using the Immortal Style and had comprehended the strongest sword technique.","Without the Immortal Source, Jian Wushuang’s path of advancement was completely blocked.","However, he still held onto the last glimmer of hope. If the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit could really allow him to ascend to the Grand Yan Immortal stage, he would be able to easily crush a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","Therefore, he was looking forward to it.","With two true sword immortals following them, they traveled 10,000 miles in an instant. They traveled at a speed that could cross an entire Heavenly Region in a few breaths.","Even so, it still took a long time to reach the Sealess Domain.","When the endless black sea area was replaced by a gray-white land plane, even Jian Wushuang could not help but be surprised.","What formed the grayish-white land plane was a mess of bones!","The endless skeletons were shrouded in a unique desolate and deathly aura that made one’s heart palpitate involuntarily.","This was simply a scene that could only be left behind after a great battle. The land plane formed by the endless skeletons of the Yan Immortals was even vaster than the Heavenly Continent plane that Bian Ziyuan was in.","When Yan Fan saw this scene, he could not help but click his tongue. “Good heavens, how many Yan Immortals died to form this place? It’s really magnificent.”","“Be careful. I’m afraid there are living things here.” Jiang Li frowned. “Are you sure the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit is here?”","Yan Fan nodded affirmatively and pointed ahead. “It’s definitely here. Look here, there’s no longer any restraint of the Order Heavenly Dao. The Yan power is in a chaotic and unknown state, which is quite in line with the meaning of the Origin. That old boy Cang Ting’s summary is not bad.”","Looking around, Jian Wushuang soon felt that what Yan Fan said was reasonable. The land formed by the bones of countless Yan Immortals was a land of chaos without the order of Heavenly Dao.","“Let’s go. Let’s find that fruit first. This small corpse ground is nothing.” Yan Fan said and flew toward the Sealess Domain.","“Walk behind me. No matter what danger you encounter, don’t make a move.” Let’s go, ” Jiang Li said and walked ahead.","Jian Wushuang nodded and covered his body with his Yan power before stepping into the Sealess Domain.","As soon as he stepped into it, an unknown and chaotic Yan power came over.","The saber-like Yan power kept cutting the derivative energy on the surface of his Immortal body, making Jian Wushuang feel slightly uncomfortable.","Jiang Li noticed his discomfort, so she dispelled the chaotic Yan power around Jian Wushuang and formed a barrier around him with his Sword Intent.","“Thank you,” Jian Wushuang thanked him solemnly.","Jiang Li raised his eyebrows and smiled. “Remember to call me Mistress from today onwards.”"]},{"number":4975,"title":"Chapter 4975 Immortal Remains Land","paragraphs":["4975 Immortal Remains Land","Then, before he could react, Jiang Li turned around and walked forward.","Rubbing his nose, Jian Wushuang followed suit.","The endless remains of the Yan Immortal under his feet had disappeared for an unknown period of time. There was no longer any Immortal aura, it was filled with silence and desolation.","As far as the eye could see, there were only the remains of the Yan Immortal, other than that, there was no other living aura.","But the more so, the more vigilant he had to be. This was an irrefutable principle.","Yan Fan walked at the forefront, carefree as always, seemingly unconcerned about any danger.","However, there was one detail that caught Jian Wushuang’s attention.","Even the remains of the Yan Immortal under his feet did not suffer any external injuries and were preserved perfectly.","One had to know that this was practically an impossible thing in the Endless Sea.","If he wanted to build a continent in the Endless Sea, he would have to kill the Yan Immortals and use their bones to form the land for the continent.","This naturally could not avoid conflict, as long as there was conflict, the skeleton would be incomplete.","However, from the looks of it, these skeletons were too complete, as if they had died voluntarily.","Jian Wushuang felt that something was wrong, but he did not know what it was.","“Strange, why don’t I feel the aura of that fruit?” Yan Fan asked doubtfully with a dark chin. They had been in this Sealess Domain for a long time.","If there were fruits with such extraordinary effects, it would be impossible to hide their aura. That was the reason behind Yan Fan’s perplexity.","However, not long after he said this, an unimaginably dense aura followed.","The rich aura contained an unimaginable amount of fate energy, which made Jian Wushuang unable to remain calm.","“Good heavens, it’s right ahead!” Yan Fan was overjoyed. “That old fellow Cang Ting didn’t lie to me. Disciple, hurry up and take the fruit as soon as possible!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and sped forward without any hesitation.","Regardless of the outcome, he had to grasp this opportunity. After all, he had no way to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal realm. He could not give up any chance.","When they arrived at the center of the entire Sealess Domain, they finally saw the object that contained the supreme aura of great fate energy.","It was an unimaginably huge tree that towered into the sky.","Its brown branches and emerald green canopy were even larger than the Immortal Osmanthus Tree that had supported the entire Gui Yue Immortal Palace.","The supreme great fate energy that was so dense that it almost could not be dispersed flowed out from the towering giant tree.","“Good heavens, it seems that there is more than one fruit on this Immortal tree,” Yan Fan said with a smile. He seemed to be extremely satisfied.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and raised his eyebrows. “Disciple, I’ll pick a few hundred for you to try.”","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang’s reply, Yan Fan’s body flashed and he flew forward.","Jian Wushuang felt even more uneasy.","As if to confirm his thoughts, when Yan Fan rushed to the front of the Immortal Tree, the Yan Immortal remains under his feet suddenly shook!","Then, the Immortal Remains Land split open instantly, and thousands of extremely huge tree roots drilled out from the earth’s core.","Each root was so huge that even a True Dragon could not compare to it!","These tree roots immediately surrounded Yan Fan.","However, Jiang Li seemed to have predicted it and suddenly drew her sword!","This was the first time Jian Wushuang saw Jiang Li attack in front of the Gui Yue Immortal Palace. Although it was only one attack, it shocked all the Grand Yan Immortals.","This time, Jiang Li drew a sword from her waist and slashed forward!","Although it was only one attack, it instantly split into thousands of Sword Intents!","Each of them was a powerful Sword Intent!","Nearly a thousand Sword Intents slashed forward, instantly cutting the giant tree root into pieces.","Yan Fan had already reacted. He reached out and crushed the remaining tree roots with a finger.","But then, an even more majestic force burst out from the Immortal Tree, forcing Yan Fan to retreat.","“Those who covet my Dao Fruit shall die!”","A heaven-shaking sound came from the Immortal Tree. Then, the branches split open, revealing a huge mouth.","Jian Wushuang was slightly shocked when he saw this. The Immortal Tree that was nourished by countless Yan Immortal skeletons had produced an unimaginable power.","This kind of power even surpassed the might of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, it had the might of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","Yan Fan smacked his lips. “Good lord, I was wondering why Cang Ting advised me to be vigilant. It turns out that this strange tree has already reached Nine Revolutions.”","“You’re scared?” Jiang Li pouted.","“Would I be scared? I’m a Sword Immortal, alright?” Yan Fan was furious. “How dare you look down on me?”","Jiang Li raised her head and pointed at the Immortal Giant Tree in front of her. “Go chop it down and prove yourself in front of me and my disciple.”","“Alright, Jiang Li, just you wait.” Yan Fan was filled with hatred, and then he rushed forward angrily.","“Those who covet my Dao Fruit shall die!”","The Immortal Giant Tree made another earth-shaking sound, then twisted its roots that were even bigger than a True Dragon and smashed them at Yan Fan.","Yan Fan, who was furious, did not draw his sword. Instead, he pointed out with his finger.","In an instant, thousands of Sword Intents shot out, easily crushing the tree roots into powder.","“Are you planning to hand it over yourself, or do you want to find it yourself after I cut you in half?” Yan Fan said coldly.","The Giant Immortal Tree that had its roots cut off seemed to have tasted the pain. The crown that was so huge that it connected to the sky began to tremble.","However, it also seemed to be extremely angry. The huge mouth on the branch said crazily, “Today, even if I die, I will not hand over a single Dao Fruit. I will turn all of you into nourishment!!”","“How noisy!” Yan Fan pricked his ears and then rushed forward.","What followed was an extremely shocking scene.","A battle that was almost one-sided and without any suspense began.","Facing a true Sword Immortal, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, this Immortal Giant Tree was destined to be a huge sandbag.","Broken tree roots, broken tree crowns, and almost non-stop wails spread in the center of the entire Immortal Remains Land.","Jian Wushuang could not bear to watch the fight until the end.","The Immortal Giant Tree’s fate was truly tragic, but it was indeed tough. Other than wailing, it did not even beg for mercy.","Just as Yan Fan was about to chop off the Giant Immortal Tree’s waist, a feeble but extremely terrified voice rang out.","“Don’t, don’t fight anymore... I’ll give it to you, I’ll give it all to you...”","“Why didn’t you say so earlier? You insisted that I tear you apart before handing them over.”"]},{"number":4976,"title":"Chapter 4976 Di Qing’s Whereabouts","paragraphs":["4976 Di Qing’s Whereabouts","Yan Fan muttered in dissatisfaction and then withdrew his palm.","“Hurry up and take out as many as you have. Give me 180 of them. If you dare to give me one, I’ll definitely tear you apart today.”","The Giant Immortal Tree was on the verge of death. When it heard this, it immediately wailed, “180 fruits? Do you think they are clay balls?! This is a Dao Fruit that I bear. I can only produce one every one Hua Year!”","He scratched his head when he heard that. “Then hand over all of it. My disciple is going to advance today. If he succeeds, you’ll get a lot of benefits.”","“I, I only have two left. Even if you destroy me today, I only have two left...” the Immortal Giant Tree said with its last breath.","Yan Fan could not be bothered to listen to its nonsense and kept waving his hands.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang and Jiang Li looked at each other and then jumped over.","Then, under Yan Fan’s miraculous strength, the Immortal Giant Tree was forced to spit out two palm-sized fruits.","The moment the jade-green fruit appeared, the space within a radius of hundreds of millions of miles was filled with an unimaginable fate energy.","This kind of fate energy actually began to slowly construct the laws of the Heavenly Dao when it scattered in the air!","Strands of ancient shen glyphs quietly flowed in the air, causing the desolate and deathly aura to dissipate without a trace.","“Swallow it!” Yan Fan and Jiang Li said at the same time.","Jian Wushuang, who had wanted to decline, could only be thick-skinned and take a Fate Energy Fruit and swallow it.","In the next moment, the Fate Energy Fruit transformed into thousands of rays of light that flowed down his throat and into his limbs!","“Nghh!”","An extremely tyrannical fate energy suddenly broke through all the obstacles in his meridians and began to circulate repeatedly.","At the same time, wisps of divine blood burst out from every pore of his Immortal body. In an instant, a bloody mist spread out.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly sat cross-legged to digest and absorb the fate energy in his body.","Seeing this scene, Yan Fan could not help but smile. “Not bad. It seems that advancing to the Grand Yan Immortal stage is already a sure thing.”","Jiang Li nodded. They thought highly of Jian Wushuang’s talent. It did not matter whether he had the Fate Energy Fruit or not.","They believed that Jian Wushuang would definitely reach the Grand Yan Immortal stage in less than a Hua Year.","This Fate Energy Fruit was just a matter of bringing forward the established facts.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s aura circulating and all kinds of Great Dao aura circulating, Jiang Li and Yan Fan did not stay idle either.","Together, they set up a barrier to guide the fate energy in the other fruit to him.","The fate energy in this fruit was too abundant, so much so that even the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was struggling.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s divine thoughts merged into one and guided the fate energy in his limbs and bones to attack the non-existent obstacle together.","Time passed bit by bit, and the fate energy that shook the Nine Heavens began to return to his body. Then, all the phenomena disappeared.","Yan Fan, who was nervously watching this scene, was slightly stunned. “Are you done?”","Jiang Li frowned. She did not understand.","A moment later, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a hint of disappointment flashed across his eyes.","Yan Fan asked nervously, “How, how is it?”","He shook his head with a bitter smile. “It still failed.”","“Motherf*cker, I knew that old bastard Cang Ting couldn’t be relied on. I’m going to uproot this tree right now!”","Yan Fan said angrily. Then, he turned around and was about to uproot the tree.","“What, what does it have to do with me? I can only provide him with fruits, but I can’t guarantee that he will be able to steadily improve.” The Immortal Giant Tree trembled, almost turning into a ball.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang stopped Yan Fan, “It’s indeed not related to the tree. That fruit does contain great fate energy that can improve almost anyone, but it’s because of me.”","“But...” He wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he said, “It’s fine. Perhaps I’ll break through after eating a few more fruits.”","When the Immortal Giant Tree heard this, it hurriedly said in a low voice, “I’ve already given my last two to you. I don’t have any more.”","Yan Fan snorted coldly. “It’s not up to you to decide whether or not there’s anything. It’s up to me!”","“...”","The Giant Immortal Tree sighed and then said angrily, “I live in a corner and only want to comprehend the Dao in peace and bear the Dao Fruit. Why do you always want to snatch my Dao Fruit?!”","“You’re just a tree. Why are you so emotional?” Yan Fan pursed his lips. “Give me five more fruits and we’ll leave.”","“How can I have so many fruits? Other than you, another supreme expert came not long ago and injured me. He took a Dao Fruit from me. Including the two fruits in your hands, this is all I have,” the Giant Immortal Tree said sadly. After letting out a long sigh, it did not say anything else.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the side, suddenly realized something and looked up at the Immortal Giant Tree.","“What did you just say? Not long ago, other Grand Yan Immortals came to your place? What did he look like? Was it because his eyes were golden and there were nine colorful feathers on his hair?!”","After a moment of silence, the Immortal Giant Tree spoke again, “How did you know? Could it be that you are his accomplices?”","The divine thoughts in Jian Wushuang’s mind sounded like thunder and his heart beat like a drum.","What he had just described was Di Qing’s appearance.","Now that he had accidentally found out about Di Qing’s whereabouts, how could he not be excited?","“Then quickly tell me, where is he now?!” Jian Wushuang asked anxiously.","“I don’t know, but I can sense that he hasn’t gone far. Other than that, I don’t know anything else,” the Immortal Giant Tree said and then kept silent.","He stopped asking and started to think quickly. The information he got from the Immortal Giant Tree proved that Di Qing had been here not long ago. At that time, Jian Wushuang and the others were probably still in the Heavenly Continent Plane.","There was no less than half a year between them, but with Di Qing’s strength as a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he would definitely be able to walk a considerable distance.","However, the Giant Immortal Tree could sense that Di Qing had not gone far away. This meant that Di Qing must have been severely injured and had found a safe place to hide.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He turned around and prepared to look for Di Qing’s whereabouts.","“How is it? Do you know where your friend is?” Yan Fan asked solemnly.","He nodded. “It’s very likely that he’s nearby and hasn’t left yet. I have to find him as soon as possible to prevent any more trouble.”","Yan Fan nodded. “Alright, we’ll follow you and ensure your safety.”"]},{"number":4977,"title":"Chapter 4977 Jiang Youxing","paragraphs":["4977 Jiang Youxing","After leaving the land of Immortal bones in the Sealess Domain, Jian Wushuang sighed in disappointment.","After consuming a Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit, he did not have any breakthrough in his realm at all.","The supreme fate energy contained in the Dao Fruit was only divided and absorbed by the three Great Dao. It could not break through the realm at all.","In other words, Jian Wushuang could no longer break through. The Yan Immortal realm was his final destiny.","Without an Immortal source, he had no chance of advancing. The highest level he could reach in the future would be the Yan Immortal.","This was undoubtedly fatal. Even if Jian Wushuang could kill a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal or even a Six Revolutions Grand Immortal with his three Great Daos, it did not change the problem of his upper limit.","The highest limit was the Yan Immortal, in the future when facing a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he would only be easily killed.","“Could it be that there is really no way to change this?”","The Dao Fruit that the Immortal Giant Tree bore contained a terrifying amount of fate energy, enough to allow a Yan Immortal to reach the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","It was precisely because of this that Jian Wushuang became even more worried.","He could not believe that he was stuck at the Yan Immortal Stage and could not break through. The Grand Yan Immortal Stage was already within his reach.","Perhaps he saw the disappointment in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, Yan Fan patted his shoulder and said, “This must be the problem with the stupid fruit. I still think highly of you. You will definitely become a Grand Yan Immortal in less than a Hua Year!”","“Back then, it took Jiang Li and I a long time to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal Realm. After all, it’s not that easy.”","Jiang Li raised her eyebrows and smiled. “Yan Fan is right. You’ll reach the Grand Yan Immortal Realm in at most one Hua Year because you’re much better than us.”","Immediately after, Yan Fan stuffed the last Fate Energy Dao Fruit to him. “Today was indeed too rushed. In the future, if there are signs of a breakthrough, eat this fruit. You will definitely be able to break through in one go.”","Looking at the Dao Fruit in his hand that was completely wrapped by the Yan power and did not have any fate energy overflowing, Jian Wushuang felt extremely warm in his heart. Then, he cupped his hands and thanked him solemnly.","“Alright, alright. From now on, you can’t be so polite to us anymore. These are all your duties as a master.” Yan Fan was still smiling as he said, “The most important thing now is to find your friend.”","He nodded, and then the three of them flew towards the Endless Sea.","The so-called Endless Sea was said to be endless. Even Grand Yan Immortals could get lost in it, and the difficulty of finding a Grand Yan Immortal in it could be imagined.","With the perception of the Immortal Giant Tree, it would probably take a long time to find Di Qing.","However, Jian Wushuang still decided to find Di Qing no matter how long it would take. After all, Di Qing was exiled to the Endless Sea because of him.","As they continued forward, the Endless Sea returned to its dead silence and coldness.","Jian Wushuang was thinking about some problems as he moved forward. It had been a long time since he entered the Endless Sea.","Although he had experienced several bloody battles, he still felt that not all Grand Yan Immortals who were trapped in the Endless Sea did not seem to be as evil as he had imagined. It could even be said that it was impossible for him to be exiled.","This was especially true for the two sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan, as well as the Vast Moon Immortal Lord and Cang Ting Immortal Lord of the Gui Yue Immortal Palace, as well as a white-robed Great Yan Immortal. They did not have bloodthirsty ruthlessness on them, only purity.","These supreme experts who had transcended the true shackles and could even compete for the fate of the Emperors were now exiled to the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang guessed that it was highly possible that Zhen Wuyang had led the exiles after he ascended to the position of Emperor.","Just as he could not help but want to ask some questions, a murderous intent suddenly swept across the Endless Sea in the distance.","Yan Fan frowned. “They’re really a bunch of damn fellows. Has the Endless Sea become so chaotic while I’m asleep?”","“You’ve slept for so many years. This place is more chaotic than you think.”","“Then we might as well kill them all. Out of sight, out of mind,” he said again, his hand already quietly grasping the hilt of his sword at his waist.","In just a short moment, the murderous aura swept over.","A total of 20 figures were like pitch-black flowing lights.","These figures were all chasing after the figure at the front.","A moment later, a voice that was almost scared out of his wits came from afar. “Hero in front, save me!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly and he had already gathered a majestic Yan power in his palm.","As the voice rang out, a skinny figure wearing a sloppy Taoist robe appeared behind Jian Wushuang in an instant and then disappeared mysteriously.","The remaining 20-plus figures surrounded by terrifying Yan power stopped in front of them. Each of them was a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","“Hand over the evil thief!” The leader of the Grand Yan Immortals said coldly. He released his Yan power and surrounded Jian Wushuang and the other two. “If you don’t hand him over, don’t blame us for being rude.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and sighed. He did not say anything else.","If these Grand Yan Immortals had asked nicely in the beginning, they might really know the whereabouts of that fellow. But now, what awaited them was only death.","Yan Fan did not even bother to pull out his sword. He waved his hand casually, and hundreds of powerful Sword Intents surged out and shredded them into pieces.","From the moment he opened his mouth to the moment he was crushed into minced meat, it only took a few breaths.","After the Sword Intent returned to one, Yan Fan said coldly, “So noisy.”","His decisiveness in dealing with enemies or potential disadvantages was far beyond Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","However, the strongest person who could survive until now in that ancient era probably no longer had a soft heart.","He waved his hand and crushed more than 20 Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals into powder. Yan Fan then looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang said coldly, “If you continue to hide, you won’t end up better than them.”","After a moment of silence, a voice that could not suppress its fear suddenly sounded.","“Please spare my life, Immortal Lords. I, Jiang Youxing, would like to thank you for your kindness...”","The space rippled and the figure that had disappeared knelt in front of Jian Wushuang. He prostrated himself and trembled.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang, who had already had the intention to kill, did not flare up. Instead, he said coldly, “Why did you lure trouble to us? Aren’t you afraid that we will kill you as well?”"]},{"number":4978,"title":"Chapter 4978 All-Encompassing Illusionary Realm","paragraphs":["4978 All-Encompassing Illusionary Realm","The sloppy Daoist, who called himself Old Daoist Jiang Youxing, trembled and wailed.","“The three Immortal Lords may not know this, but I was forced into a corner. I had no choice but to seek protection from you. If the three Immortal Lords are still extremely angry, you can kill me at any time.”","Jian Wushuang, Jiang Li and Yan Fan looked at each other and said coldly, “Leave.”","“Thank you, three Immortal lords.” The sloppy Daoist bowed deeply, then crawled up from the void, his face filled with gratitude.","It was not until then that Jian Wushuang saw the old Daoist’s face clearly.","His disheveled and withered hair was casually tied behind his head by a bone hairpin, revealing a sunken and dry yellow face. His two mustaches made him look even more wretched.","Under the open robe, Jian Wushuang could see a pair of skinny bones. He wondered how this guy had survived until now.","Yan Fan pursed his lips and turned around to leave.","Just as they were about to leave, Old Daoist Jiang Youxing, who had no intention of leaving, suddenly said, “Three Immortal Lords, do you have something to do?”","“If you don’t want to die, leave on your own.” Jian Wushuang left without turning his head.","Old Daoist Jiang Youxing seemed to be hesitating about something. After a moment, he gritted his teeth and said, “Three Immortal Lords, I have been traveling here for several years and am familiar with any place. If there is a need, I am willing to follow you.”","Jian Wushuang stopped quietly.","In the next moment, 36,000 Sword Intents burst out from his body and directly attacked Jiang Youxing.","Looking at the terrifying Sword Intents that were coming at him from all directions, Old Daoist Jiang Xuansheng didn’t flee in a panic. Instead, he closed his eyes and remained motionless.","Heaven and earth shook, and waves rose in the Endless Sea.","Time seemed to stop. The 36,000 Sword Intents did not slash at Jiang Youxing at this moment. Instead, they hovered in front of him.","Then, the thousands of Sword Intents merged into one.","Jian Wushuang came in front of him, grabbed the collar of his robe, and lifted him up.","“What is your motive?”","“I... I don’t have a motive. I just want to repay the three Immortal Lords for saving my life.”","“There’s no need. If you say another word of nonsense, the sword will cut you,” Jian Wushuang said coldly and threw him away.","Jiang Xuan was speechless. In the end, he muttered, “But I...”","Jian Wushuang, who was about to turn around and leave, stopped and said in a low voice, “How confident are you in finding a Grand Yan Immortal in the Endless Sea?”","He was startled and quickly reacted, “Immortal Lord, it’s very difficult, but if the conditions are set in this area, it shouldn’t be a particularly difficult thing. Because there aren’t many places for Yan Immortals to stay here, and I happen to know all of them.”","“Who are you looking for?”","Jian Wushuang ignored him. “Don’t ask about things you shouldn’t know about. Come with us.”","...","Above the boundless sea, the sloppy old man, Jiang Youxing, followed closely behind Jian Wushuang and the other two.","At the same time, he took out something from his tattered Daoist robe and threw it on the surface of the sea. In an instant, it expanded by 300 meters in the wind and formed a True Treasure Ship.","“Three Immortal Lords, board the True Ship first. In order to avoid some blind Grand Yan Immortals disturbing the journey, traveling by ship is the best choice.”","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and boarded the ship with Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","In the blink of an eye, the True Ship traveled a million miles at an extremely fast speed.","Jiang Youxing sat at the bow of the ship and focused on controlling the direction. Jian Wushuang walked forward and asked.","“Have you ever seen a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who was injured in this Heavenly Region and had nine colorful feathers in his hair?”","“I’ve never seen him before, but the next sea area we reach should have the person the Immortal Lord wants to find,” Jiang Youxing said straightforwardly.","Jian Wushuang was not too disappointed. After all, the news about Di Qing was too sparse in this Endless Sea.","“There’s no need to be anxious. If your friend is injured, he shouldn’t be too far away from here. Maybe he can be found in the next place, “Yan Fan patted his shoulder and comforted him.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Since things had come to this, he could only follow Jiang Youxing’s lead and go search.","However, after traveling out of the vast sea realm, Jiang Youxing, who was concentrating on controlling the real ship, suddenly changed his expression.","“Not good, there’s a change ahead.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the extremely vast sea plane suddenly shook, as if a terrifying existence under the sea had awakened!","Billions of feet of dust surged up, like a heavenly gate rising from the sea. It was terrifying to the extreme.","An unimaginable pressure pressed down on the ship, and the sea gate formed by billions of feet of dust completely surrounded the True Ship.","At this moment, even the sky dimmed.","Standing at the bow of the ship, Jiang Li and Yan Fan looked solemn. Their hands had already gripped the hilts of their swords.","“How could such a strange phenomenon appear, could there be a Yan Immortal controlling this sea area?” Yan Fan muttered to himself as he looked at Jiang Youxing, who was sitting at the bow of the boat.","However, he quickly denied that it was Jiang Youxing who was causing trouble, after all, a mere Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not cause such a huge commotion.","At this moment, Jiang Youxing also said in a trembling voice, “Immortals, what should we do next?”","Yan Fan ignored him and looked at Jian Wushuang. “Follow behind us later. Remember not to get into the sea.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and an invisible force quietly gathered around him.","At this moment, Jiang Li and Yan Fan were all ready to slash through the sea curtain.","There was almost no way to dodge the trillion-meter-tall Heavenly Gate Sea Curtain. He could only choose to take it head-on.","While they were all extremely solemn, only Old Daoist Jiang Youxing, who was lying on the bow of the ship, showed an unusually calm expression.","From all directions, the Heavenly Gate Sea Curtain which was hundreds of millions of feet tall smashed down at this moment.","It was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse. The extremely terrifying force was like facing the siege of thousands of Grand Yan Immortals. Jian Wushuang did not dare to slack off at all.","However, the next moment, something unexpected happened. Jiang Youxing, who was lying on the boat, suddenly pounced on him and shouted, “Something has happened in the Endless Sea. None of us can escape!”","It was not until this moment that Jian Wushuang suddenly realized that this terrifying and strange scene was not real, but an illusion!","Such an all-encompassing illusionary realm actually deceived all of them!","“You old dog, I won’t forgive you!” Jian Wushuang was extremely furious."]},{"number":4979,"title":"Chapter 4979 Stealing the Dao Fruit","paragraphs":["4979 Stealing the Dao Fruit","However, no matter how furious his voice sounded, it was still swallowed by the thunderous roar!","Rumble!","Amidst the billions of feet of dust, the Heaven Gate Sea Curtain crashed down.","In the next moment, the terrifying scene that he had expected did not appear.","The moment the Heaven Gate Sea Curtain that was hundreds of millions of feet tall smashed down, it disappeared.","Everything was like a mirage, like a dream, as if nothing had happened.","Only the mist that was formed by the dust waves gushed over, filled with the aura of death and desolation.","Jian Wushuang put down his palm and looked ahead.","The sea was calm and dead silent. The terrifying scene from before was no longer there.","“Damn it, it’s actually an illusion?” Yan Fan said in a deep voice, his eyes cold.","“What?” Jiang Li’s face was solemn. The two Sword Immortals were also confused by the illusion.","Jian Wushuang looked back at the ship.","However, other than the three of them, there was no one else on the ship.","The sloppy old man, Jiang Youxing, had disappeared without a trace. It was as if he had never appeared.","“Damned old thing, he triggered this illusion!” Yan Fan said hatefully. “I’ve long sensed that something was wrong with him.”","Jian Wushuang was puzzled. “But why did he do that? Why was he willing to take the risk?”","“What’s wrong?” Jiang Li seemed to remember something, and his face changed. “Look at your stuff. Is there anything missing?!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. Then, he subconsciously touched his waist. The Boyang Bottle, which contained the three Emperor’s True Shadows, was still there.","Not only was the Boyang Bototle still there, but the golden jade ring and the other treasures were also there. They were all lying quietly in his arms.","“Everything is still here. What is this guy planning?” Jian Wushuang murmured in a low voice. Suddenly, he thought of something and hurriedly touched his chest again.","A moment later, he smiled bitterly and shook his head. “The Fate Energy Dao Fruit is gone. It must have been taken away by that old fellow.”","“W-what? The Dao Fruit was stolen?” Yan Fan’s eyes widened. “I want this old thing’s life!”","Jian Wushuang stopped him, “This guy’s whereabouts are strange. Obviously, he had already set his eyes on the Dao Fruit on me. That’s why he set up such an illusion to lure us into the trap.”","“If we chase after him and get confused by the illusion again, we’ll lose a lot. It’s fine if a mere Fate Energy Dao Fruit is gone. I have other ways.”","Yan Fan gritted his teeth secretly. “That may be the case, but I’ve been tricked by this old thing. It’s really damaging to my dignity as a Sword Immortal. If I find him, I’ll grind his bones into ashes!”","As he spoke, he punched the edge of the True Treasure Ship again.","With a ripping sound, the hull of the ship was torn apart.","“Damn it, this boat is actually made of paper?!”","Yan Fan left the paper boat in a somewhat disheveled manner. He was so embarrassed and angry that he almost wanted to turn the entire sea upside down and capture the sloppy old man.","Jian Wushuang, who was tricked by the sloppy old man’s illusion, was extremely depressed. It was a great loss to have a Fate Energy Dao Fruit stolen.","Everything that had happened was ultimately because he had trusted the Grand Yan Immortal in the Endless Sea too much.","No matter what, Jiang Youxing had taught him a lesson.","After calming down, the three of them once again rushed forward.","Not long after, a Heavenly Continent Plane that was also constructed from the remains of the Yan Immortals appeared.","This Heavenly Continent was much smaller than the previous Heavenly Continent, but it was different from the other barren Heavenly Continent Planes. There was an Immortal Tree growing on the land here.","The Immortal Trees that were as dense as a forest emitted a strange and calm aura.","“How is it? Do you want to go in and take a look?” Yan Fan asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded without any hesitation, “There aren’t many land planes in the Endless Sea. It’s very likely that my friend is here.”","Jiang Li and Yan Fan nodded at the same time, and then they flew into the sky.","Screech-","A crisp cry rang out from the dense forest of Immortal Trees. Then, an Immortal Bird that was thousands of feet tall rushed out of the dense forest and opened its huge beak to swallow Jian Wushuang.","The result was obvious. The huge bird’s head was almost torn in half by Yan Fan.","“Have you ever seen a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal with scarlet-golden eyes and nine colorful feathers in his hair?”","Jian Wushuang lay in front of the dying Immortal Bird and asked carefully.","However, what he received was an extremely terrified shake of its head.","“Let’s go. We’ll continue to move forward and take a look. Perhaps we can find some clues,” he said helplessly.","Then, in the following period of time, this Heavenly Continent plane was almost turned upside down.","All the Grand Yan Immortals, as well as all kinds of Immortal Birds and Immortal Beasts were beaten up. After that, they were questioned before they were allowed to leave.","Jian Wushuang and the others did not feel tired at all. Instead, they were enjoying themselves.","It was not until a magnificent light enveloped the entire sky above the Heavenly Continent that they finally stopped.","Immediately after, a voice that could not suppress its anger resounded throughout the wilderness.","“Enough, all of you stop! I’ve already tolerated you for a long time. You’ve injured my subordinates time and time again. Do you really think I’m made of mud?!”","As the voice filled with resentment fell, the huge and dense Immortal Trees were all suddenly swept away, and then a figure with wings on his back arrived.","Behind this figure, there were dozens of figures. Each of them emitted a terrifying energy fluctuation.","They were all Grand Yan Immortals!","The figure with the huge wings on her back was a woman with a beautiful and exquisite face.","Their eyes met and Jian Wushuang and Yan Fan looked away awkwardly.","There was no other reason than that this woman’s figure was too explosive. Moreover, only the important parts were covered by feathers, and her beautiful figure was enough to be seen at a glance.","“Hmph!” Jiang Li snorted and looked straight into her eyes. “Get out of the way.”","The woman was stunned and immediately said angrily, “You actually want me to move aside? Do you know who developed this domain? I am the supreme ruler here. Not only did you hurt my subordinates, but you actually dare to speak rudely now? Are you courting death?”","Jiang Li’s face turned cold. She grabbed the hilt of her sword and prepared to strike.","Yan Fan hurriedly stopped her and looked at Jian Wushuang. “Disciple, ask quickly.”","Jian Wushuang understood and immediately asked, “No offense. We came here to find a friend. Have you seen a Grand Yan Immortal with golden eyes and nine colorful feathers in his hair?”","“Why should I tell you?” the woman with the wings on her back said coldly. “As for you guys, you have to give me an explanation first. Otherwise, there will be no peace!”"]},{"number":4980,"title":"Chapter 4980 Fu Yao","paragraphs":["4980 Fu Yao","Yan Fan put his hands on his hips and put on a look of pain as he said, “An explanation? What explanation? Weren’t these all obvious problems?”","“These subordinates of yours, whenever they have something to do, they come up to join in the fun. Of course, I casually taught them a lesson.”","“Moreover, I didn’t kill them all. I only taught them a lesson or two. That’s enough to give you face, right?”","“You!” The beautiful woman with wings on her back was speechless for a moment. She glared at them with her teeth about to shatter.","Her large chest heaved up and down as if she was enduring extreme anger, but she did not make the next move.","She had a strong and clear intuition that the three figures before her were not easy to deal with. Even if all the experts in the entire Heavenly Continent tried to suppress them, they might not get the desired result.","A moment later, the beautiful woman with wings on her back said in a deep voice, “You can leave. I’ll let bygones be bygones for what happened just now. I just hope that you won’t step into my Heavenly Region again.”","Yan Fan did not speak but looked at Jian Wushuang.","He then said slowly, “We came here to find a friend. We were indeed in the wrong, but if we didn’t do that, we would have been surrounded.”","“There’s no need to say anything else. You guys can leave.” The pretty woman said coldly. Right now, she just wanted to ask these three fierce gods to leave.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. After nodding his head, he finally said, “If you have seen my friend, please let me know.”","After saying this, they turned around and prepared to leave.","At this moment, the beautiful woman with wings on her back suddenly said, “What’s the relationship between you and the guy you just described? Why are you looking for him?”","Jian Wushuang stopped and turned to look at her. “You know about him?!”","“Answer my question first,” she said in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang said, “He is an old friend of mine. He was exiled to the Endless Sea for some reason. I came here to look for him.”","The pretty woman asked again, “Then how do you prove that you are his friend?”","He thought for a moment, then shook his head. “I can’t prove it, but if you have any news about him, you must let me know. He’s injured, and I’m afraid his movements will be hindered in this Endless Sea.”","The beautiful woman’s eyes were rippling as if she was considering the authenticity of Jian Wushuang’s words.","After a moment, she seemed to have made up her mind. “I know the guy you’re talking about. He stayed with me for a while a while ago.”","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He had never expected to receive news about Di Qing again!","“Where is he now?”","“I don’t know. I asked him to stay, but he refused.” The pretty woman’s eyes flashed with disappointment as she continued, “He might not be too far away. He said that he won’t be found soon.”","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed. As long as Di Qing had not walked out of this sea area, he would definitely be able to find him in a very short time.","Thinking of this, he no longer hesitated and turned to leave.","“Wait!”","At this moment, the pretty woman hurriedly descended from the sky, then folded her wings and came to Jian Wushuang.","“Are you really his friend?”","“What else?” Jian Wushuang said helplessly.","The pretty woman’s face suddenly turned red. “If you are his friends, I will go with you to find him.”","As soon as she finished speaking, all the Grand Yan Immortals said anxiously, “Immortal Lord Fu Yao, you can’t! The Heavenly Continent can’t be without a master!”","The pretty lady called Fu Yao curled her lips imperceptibly and said coldly, “Don’t interrupt. I have my own arrangements!”","All the Grand Yan Immortals were silent out of fear, but they still looked at her nervously.","Jian Wushuang was also puzzled. ” Why are you coming with us?”","The pretty woman was flustered, and her cheeks turned even redder. She stuttered, “Why, why are there so many whys? I-if I go with you, won’t it increase the possibility of finding him?”","Jian Wushuang did not stop her. He shrugged and said, “Let’s go.”","When she heard this, her eyes lit up with joy. “Alright, wait for me for a moment. I’ll leave with you immediately.”","In the following period of time, all the Grand Yan Immortals who disagreed were beaten up by Immortal Lord Fu Yao. The strength of her attacks was not inferior to Yan Fan’s.","When the Grand Yan Immortals no longer dared to refute, Immortal Lord Fu Yao nodded in satisfaction. Then, she followed behind Jian Wushuang and flew towards the Endless Sea.","As they traveled across the sea area, Fu Yao, who was following behind Jian Wushuang, seemed to be thinking about something. Soon, she walked side by side with him and asked in embarrassment, “Erm, may I ask what that guy’s name is?”","“Why are you asking this?” Jian Wushuang did not understand what she meant and was even more confused about her intentions.","“I, I just want to know. You won’t even tell me this, right?” Fuy Yo said in a panic.","He was helpless. “Di Qing.”","“Di, Di Qing... What a domineering name,” her face turned slightly red again as she muttered to herself.","Jian Wushuang was confused by her abnormal behavior, but he did not pay too much attention to it. After all, finding Di Qing was the most important thing at the moment.","Then, Immortal Lord Fu Yao said, “Then can you tell me about his past?”","This time, the one who answered her was Yan Fan. “I say, little girl, you’re asking in such detail. Isn’t it because you have feelings for my disciple’s friend? Your bashful attitude isn’t likable.”","Immortal Lord Fu Yao’s face instantly turned red. ” Wh-what? I don’t like him.. I was just casually asking...”","Yan Fan smiled maliciously and was slapped away by Jiang Li.","It was only then that Jian Wushuang, who had a long emotional reflex, finally realized why Immortal Fu Yao was so concerned about Di Qing.","It turned out that she had already developed that hazy feeling in her heart.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile. It seemed that Di Qing, who had been single for countless years, was going to have his luck turned very soon.","..","After leaving Immortal Lord Fuy Yo’s Heavenly Continent, four figures were like a beautiful stream of light, traveling hundreds of millions of miles in an instant.","The Endless Sea began to truly enter the stage of desolation and death.","As he continued to venture deeper, there were no longer any more Heavenly Continent planes formed by the remains of the Yan Immortal above the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang started to worry. Would Di Qing get lost in the sea area? That would make it more difficult for him to find him?","As they continued to move forward, a line of water followed closely in the dark and boundless sea..."]},{"number":4981,"title":"Chapter 4981 Prisoner","paragraphs":["4981 Prisoner","Jian Wushuang, who was at the front, looked at Immortal Lord Fu Yao after a while and asked, “Are there any other Heavenly Continents near your Heavenly Continent?”","She then shook her head. “To create a Heavenly Heavenly Continent Plane in the Endless Sea is something that is simply unimaginable. Therefore, the Heavenly Continent is extremely rare. Other than the Heavenly Continent that I control, I have no way of knowing if there are other Heavenly Continents here.”","“However, I have also heard that there is a vast Heavenly Continent Plane in the extreme north.”","“The extreme north...” Jian Wushuang murmured, “Is Di Qing there?”","Just as he was thinking, Yan Fan’s solemn voice sounded, “Be careful. There’s an aura coming towards us.”","Apart from Jiang Li and Yan Fan, both Jian Wushuang and Immortal Lord Fu Yao were omnipotent experts, so they instantly became alert.","Then, extremely powerful auras appeared from the sea behind him.","Jian Wushuang looked back and realized that the strong aura was formed by a team of nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals!","This team could be considered a powerful force.","When Jian Wushuang discovered them, the team also noticed their existence.","Every Grand Yan Immortal in the team was wearing a wide black robe that completely enveloped their bodies, making them look extremely mysterious.","And in the middle of this group, there were 20 to 30 Grand Yan Immortals who were on the verge of death. Their limbs were bound by the chains of the Yan power and they were unable to move at all.","When they saw Jian Wushuang and the other three, the team stopped and stood opposite them quietly.","“We are in danger...” Immortal Lord Fu Yao said in a low voice. Her expression was extremely ugly.","Even though she was a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, she had no chance of winning against this group of nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals, she could not even escape.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was extremely calm, as if this team was not enough to be feared.","As for Jiang Li and Yan Fan, they treated them as a joke.","Apart from ascending to the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, they had also become terrifying existences like Sword Immortals.","They could even kill experts of the same cultivation realm easily, let alone these Grand Yan Immortals.","Jian Wushuang did not want any trouble. He did not plan to fight. Instead, he prepared to leave.","However, almost at the same time, the black-robed team suddenly attacked!","Numerous powerful energy chains shot out from their hands and surrounded them.","Immortal Lord Fu Yao’s expression changed drastically. Her mood had already fallen to the bottom of the valley, and she did not even have the intention to resist.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and his Yan power shot into the sky!","Facing the layers of energy chains that were pressing down on him, he completely released his Sword Intent.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","A million Sword Intents swept out and met the attack.","The two collided, and the incomparable Sword Intent completely exploded at this moment.","The sky changed color, and the huge wave of dust stirred up on the Dead Sea.","The nearly 100 chains only lasted for a moment before they shattered!","The purest flowing light of Yan power turned into endless fragments of light and scattered on the Endless Sea.","The chains released by nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals did not even last for ten breaths of time from the moment they appeared to the moment they completely dissipated.","This could no longer be described as shock.","Immortal Lord Fu Yao, who had witnessed this scene, was already stunned on the spot. She was shocked to the extreme.","She had never thought that this guy who was only a mere Yan Immortal would be able to unleash such a terrifying strike.","Facing such an extremely violent aura, Immortal Lord Fu Yao felt that she could not resist.","The sword strike cut through the chains and all the Grand Yan Immortals took a step back. Then, they blocked the terrifying Sword Intent.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan also attacked.","They attacked at the same time, and the six swords at their waists all rang out.","The two sword strikes slashed out, and the sky directly collapsed. The Endless Sea also split apart, and billions of dust waves swept up, causing everything to be chaotic.","Nearly a hundred Grand Yan Immortals looked up at this scene and were swallowed by the endless chaos.","The sky and the sea were connected, and chaos devoured everything.","Even Jian Wushuang felt his heart palpitate in the chaos.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan’s Sword Intents were too terrifying, so much so that the Endless Sea could not withstand their Sword Intents at all and became fragmented.","The chaotic sky was completely torn apart, and a natural moat was cut out in the sea. Seawater poured into it crazily.","This was the full-strength strike of two Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, two Sword Immortals, causing everything to lose its color.","Yan Fan sheathed his long swords at the same time. He shook his head. “What a bunch of reckless fellows.”","Everything had been settled. Not a single Grand Yan Immortal could survive a full-powered strike from two Sword Immortals.","However, there was always an exception. Just as the Sword Intent dissipated, a dim light took advantage of the chaos and prepared to escape.","“You want to leave?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and clenched his fist.","In an instant, the chaotic sky collapsed as a black-robed figure was captured. It was a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","“No, don’t, let me go...”","At this moment, this Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was on the verge of death, under that sword strike, his Immortal body was completely shattered, even his Immortal Source could be destroyed at any moment.","“Why did you attack us?” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","The remaining Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal said in horror, “No, no, we only want to capture some lone Grand Yan Immortals, we are not targeting the few Immortal Lords.”","Jian Wushuang thought of something and said in a low voice, “Why did you capture a lone Grand Yan Immortal?”","“Th-throw them all into the City of Exile and kill each other to accumulate fate energy for the other Immortal Lords...” the Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal said in fear.","He frowned when he heard this, and the bad feeling in his heart became even stronger.","“Tell me where the City of Exile is.”","“Immortal Lord, I can tell you, but can you let me go?”","“Sure.”","“The City of Exile is in the extreme north. You only need to keep going and you will reach it.”","As soon as he finished speaking, his Immortal body was directly crushed into powder, and even his Immortal Source turned into nothingness.","Jian Wushuang retracted his palm, his eyes unmoved.","In the far north, the City of Exile.","Di Qing might be there...","“Gulp.” Immortal Lord Fu Yao could not help but swallow. Looking at the three fierce gods beside her, for the first time, she felt powerless and afraid.","Now, she began to secretly rejoice. Fortunately, there was no conflict earlier. Otherwise, with the performance of these three fierce gods just now, her small Heavenly Heavenly Continent Plane would probably be reduced to ashes..."]},{"number":4982,"title":"Chapter 4982 The City of Exile","paragraphs":["4982 The City of Exile","The grayish-black remains of the Yan Immortal had accumulated to an unimaginable degree, and it was unknown how many years they had been soaked in the Endless Sea.","On this continent, there was a magnificent and treacherous giant city.","“Should I use a supreme treasure to exchange for it, or should I leave behind some fate energy?”","A short black-robed old man spoke in a low voice in a deep corridor in a giant city made of unknown materials.","Standing in front of him was a skinny Grand Yan Immortal.","“Leave behind some fate energy,” He said in a low voice, then stretched out his palm and condensed a drop of relatively pure fate energy from his palm.","The black-robed old man did not say much. After reaching out to take the drop of luck, he allowed it to enter the giant city.","As the group continued to move forward, the black-robed old man tirelessly collected drops of fate energy.","When a figure covered in a wide black robe appeared, the originally somewhat dirty air was cleared.","The short black-robed old man raised his head and looked at the black-robed figure in front of him. He could sense that this was a very young figure based on his intuition.","“Should I use a supreme treasure to exchange for it, or should I leave behind some fate energy?”","The black-robed figure did not say anything. He waved his hand and flicked out a drop of fate energy.","The appearance of this drop of Fate caused all the filth to begin to dissipate. Then, it landed in front of the black-robed old man.","Looking at this drop of fate energy, the black-robed old man could not hide his amazement as he said, ” It’s really not bad. It’s been a long time since I’ve seen such pure fate energy.”","Leaving behind this drop of fate energy, the black-robed figure flashed into the giant city. The three figures behind him also entered.","...","This was a giant city, and also a city of killings.","Hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals were thrown here. They killed each other in order to leave alive.","As for the Grand Yan Immortal who had paid a drop of fate energy to enter this place, he did not participate in the battle. He was completely a spectator, enjoying this extremely tragic bloody battle.","In such a City of Exile, all the Grand Yan Immortals had gone crazy.","The Grand Yan Immortal who had sacrificed his fate acted as a spectator, sitting leisurely in the void, looking down at the Grand Yan Immortals who were engaged in battle under the light screen.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A robust Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal whose Immortal body was covered in wounds shouted excitedly after killing two early-stage Grand Yan Immortals.","However, before he could be excited for long, his Immortal Source was shattered by a skinny Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal from behind, and his body was destroyed.","Under this chaotic slaughter, these supreme Grand Yan Immortals became the lowliest of existences.","They fought each other crazily, all for the sake of leaving this place alive.","There were constantly Grand Evolution Immortals dying, but they were soon replaced by other Grand Evolution Immortals.","The City of Exile was a city of killings!","...","After killing many Grand Evolution Immortals, the skinny Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal did not roar, he left quietly like a ghost.","He specialized in killing lone and weak Grand Yan Immortals and was always successful. The number of Grand Yan Immortals who had fallen at his hands had already reached more than ten.","Then, this ghost-like Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal saw a Grand Evolution Immortal sitting in a corner with his eyes closed.","This was a lone and extremely weak Grand Yan Immortal. He seemed to have suffered severe injuries. There was still some seven-colored divine blood scattered on the ground, and the luxurious clothes on his body were somewhat torn.","Seeing this scene, greed flashed in the eyes of the skinny Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal.","He slowly walked forward. The battle behind him seemed to have nothing to do with him. At this moment, he tunnel visioned on this mysterious Grand Yan Immortal.","However, when he was about to approach, the extremely mysterious Grand Yan Immortal quietly opened his eyes.","Deep, pure gold!","It carried an incomparable supreme prestige!","With just one glance, the skinny Six Revolutions Grand Evolution Immortal felt despair.","He could clearly feel that it was an existence that he could not compare to.","Nine Revolutions Great Evolution Immortal!","A peak existence at the Grand Yan Immortal realm was simply unable to resist.","The difference between a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and an Emperor was that the Emperor controlled the Emperor’s fate energy while they did not.","Escape was the only thought in his mind, but there were always ideas that could not be realized.","Then, the Grand Yan Immortal who was sitting on the ground slowly stood up. His heroic and pure face was covered in frost.","A total of nine magnificent colorful feathers surged in his hair, emitting a kind of power that could not be looked at directly.","“Let, let me go. I have no intention of becoming your enemy..”","The Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was extremely terrified, but these were only his last words.","At this moment, huge and magnificent wings spread out from his back, dispelling all the filth and blood mist!","The brilliant light emitted from his body illuminated the entire City of Exile.","All the Grand Yan Immortals who were in the midst of battle, as well as the Grand Yan Immortals who were sitting in the void and looking down at this scene, held their breaths as they looked at that figure.","The dirty Yan power retreated, and not a single drop of blood mist could taint his Immortal body.","Facing the hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals in front of him, there was no fear in his eyes. There was even some disdain.","Then, he reached out and took out something from his bosom.","It was an Emperor grade pill.","The last pill could allow him to recover to his peak in an instant.","He paused for a moment before putting the pill into his mouth.","A vast and magnificent light shot out from him at this moment, illuminating the entire City of Exile.","Ever since he walked out of the Ancient Era, he had grown to an unimaginable level.","He would destroy this extremely filthy City of Exile.","The ten-sided wings shook violently, and a feather screen formed by countless scarlet-gold true feathers shot out, causing all the Grand Yan Immortals in front of him to be irreparably destroyed!","A Grand Yan Immortal with a weak Immortal body died on the spot. He did not even have time to cry out and disappeared without a trace.","As for the Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he could not escape the fate of being destroyed, only the Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal barely managed to dodge, looking at him in fear.","The ten wings were rhythmically moving, and with each movement, they could reap the lives of several Grand Yan Immortals.","At this moment, even the Grand Yan Immortals who were sitting in the void and acting as spectators felt their limbs turn cold. It was as if they were in the scene as they felt that ice-cold killing intent.","The City of Exile, which had been fighting crazily, was now in a one-sided situation.","Under the strangulation of the scarlet-gold True Feathers, no Grand Yan Immortal could withstand it."]},{"number":4983,"title":"Chapter 4983 Pursuit","paragraphs":["4983 Pursuit","At this moment, all the Grand Yan Immortals who were hunting in the City of Exile gave up on killing and fled in fear.","Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were the rulers here. None of the Grand Yan Immortals dared to confront them and could only flee for their lives.","However, there was no exit to this City of Exile. They could only kill or be killed. Only those who survived could leave.","Right now, the most tragic one-sided killing was taking place in the City of Exile.","Some Grand Yan Immortals in the early stage could not even make a sound before turning into a cloud of blood mist.","In just an instant, more than 20 Grand Yan Immortals had died!","Everything was shrouded in chaos and terrifying Yan power.","The Grand Yan Immortals who were sitting in the void and looking down at the City of Exile also turned from their initial fear to hysterical excitement.","It was equivalent to being imprisoned in this Heavenly Continent Plane. The Grand Yan Immortals who had been imprisoned for countless years could only be considered to be struggling to survive.","They were like shells without a soul. Only a tragic battle could awaken their memories.","Especially when they saw the Grand Yan Immortals dying one after another, they became hysterical and excited.","“Kill, kill, kill!”","Shouts that almost caused the giant city to collapse resounded.","The ten wings were fully spread out, and the unimaginable power almost swallowed half of the City of Exile.","His expression was cold, as if he was above the Heavenly Dao and was sending down punishment.","He was Di Qing.","Di Qing at his peak.","Under his rage, the Black Crow Treasure Form, the White Crow Treasure Form, and the Golden Crow Treasure Form appeared at the same time, completely causing all the Grand Yan Immortals who were chasing to despair.","Black Crow let out a wild cry. With a flap of its wings, it devoured several Grand Yan Immortals.","The White Crow’s Treasured Form let out a clear cry. Its gigantic treasured form directly transformed into countless white rays of light, imprisoning all the fleeing Grand Yan Immortals within its domain.","Under this feather curtain, the Grand Yan Immortals that were fleeing were all incinerated.","This was an unimaginable scene. Even the Grand Yan Immortals that were thrown into the City of Exile were slaughtered.","The scarlet golden radiance surrounded Di Qing’s body, dispelling all the foul blood mist.","He seemed to have walked out of the ancient era, carrying some unknown fate.","When the City of Exile was completely silent, there was only one figure standing in the center.","The three ravens disappeared, and Di Qing returned to calmness.","In the City of Exile, other than him, there was no other Grand Yan Immortal standing.","All the Grand Yan Immortals who participated in the pursuit seemed to have evaporated, and there was no trace of them at all.","Di Qingning stood rooted to the ground and looked at the hazy light screen above his head. He knew that the exit to leave this place was up there.","Just as he was about to make his move, the light screen suddenly opened, and powerful figures entered the City of Exile!","Nearly 100 figures, nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals!","Every Grand Yan Immortal was at least Three Revolutions.","The moment they entered, they all locked onto Di Qing.","The terrifying power that could shatter the Heavenly Dao was released at this moment.","Di Qing’s eyes flashed as he looked at the Grand Yan Immortal who was approaching him.","The Emperor-grade pill had indeed restored him to his peak state, but it was not enough for him to continue fighting.","As a Golden Crow of the ancestral bloodline, he had already given birth to nine True Lives and was known as the Immortal Golden Crow.","Every time the Immortal Golden Crow lost a life, it would have to enter a long slumber to stabilize its Immortal Source.","However, Di Qing had already lost two of his True Lives. He should have entered a long slumber to stabilize his Immortal Source, but he did not fall asleep. This inadvertently hid a hidden danger.","Once his third True Life was destroyed, he would no longer be able to maintain his Nine Revolutions realm and would fall into a long slumber.","Facing these 100 Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, Di Qing’s third True Life would definitely fall!","However, he had nowhere to hide and could only accept the challenge.","The violent derivative energy erupted again. The intensity even made the entire City of Exile shake even more violently, as if it could shatter at any time.","This battle was even more terrifying than the first battle.","The brilliant light of the Yan ppower covered everything.","...","Above the City of Exile, in the endless void, a thick black cloud that could not be melted was slowly burning, as if it was overlooking this scene.","Behind the black cloud, more than ten figures in loose black robes stood quietly, surging with terrifying power.","A moment later, a low and hoarse voice came from the black cloud.","“Force out all of his fate energy. I can feel that there’s a supreme luck in his body that doesn’t belong to him.”","The group of black-robed figures nodded and then turned into a cloud of smoke and disappeared.","At the same time, the light screen that enveloped the City of Exile suddenly opened, and black-robed figures quietly entered.","The Golden Crow Treasure Form was torn into pieces by the terrifying Yan power. This combined attack of nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals was too terrifying.","While tearing apart the Golden Crow, it also pushed Di Qing back by 30,000 meters!","His luxurious clothes were torn apart, and divine blood gushed out of his wounds.","Nearly 100 Grand Yan Immortals also pressed down at this moment. Powerful chains of Yan Force descended from the sky and bound Di Qing’s body.","Di Qing exerted his strength and shattered the chains around him. However, more chains fell and bound his limbs tightly.","In the next moment, nearly twenty ghost-like black-robed figures quietly appeared. The leader of the black-robed figures arrived in front of Di Qing.","He raised a sharp awl that was covered in dark light patterns and stabbed it into Di Qing’s chest.","In an instant, the great momentum of the Yan power dissipated, and the Nine Transformations realm completely disappeared. His pupils instantly dimmed.","“Hand over the fate energy in your Immortal body and I’ll let you leave this place.”","The black-robed figure said in a low voice as he released the sharp awl.","Di Qing’s life was on the verge of dying, but his expression was still calm and his dull eyes were still filled with disdain.","In the next moment, the entire City of Exile suddenly shook violently without any warning.","Then, an endless majestic celestial river suddenly tore through the void, as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse, and descended!","The endless celestial river covered all the great momentum of the derivative energy.","The stars and the moon were all there.","At this moment, all the Grand Yan Immortals turned around in horror and fled frantically.","Di Qing, who had already closed his eyes, suddenly opened them. His pupils revealed a look of disbelief."]},{"number":4984,"title":"Chapter 4984 Wushuang Sword Strike","paragraphs":["4984 Wushuang Sword Strike","He felt an extremely familiar aura.","The celestial river was majestic and boundless.","The Sword Dao celestial river formed by the millions of Sword Intents descended and swallowed dozens of Grand Yan Immortals almost instantly.","Cracks began to appear on the walls of the entire City of Exile.","Di Qing laughed loudly as he watched the celestial river of swordsmanship that brought the mountains and seas crashing down on him. Then, he closed his eyes.","“Damn it!” The black-robed figure was unable to withstand the Sword Intent head-on and hurriedly fled.","Rumble...","Everything was destroyed.","This explosion that covered almost the entire territory lasted for a long time. It was only when all the light disappeared that the river of Sword Dao completely dissipated.","Under this sword, more than 20 Grand Yan Immortals who could not dodge in time perished. The rest of the Grand Yan Immortals who dodged all hid in the corners and looked around in horror.","The ground was plowed open, turning everything into scorched earth.","Di Qing slowly opened his eyes as he felt the river of Sword Intent around him dissipate. Then, his pupils constricted.","In front of him stood a figure completely wrapped in a black robe, flowing with endless Sword Intent.","Then, the figure reached out and slowly pulled open his black hood, revealing a handsome face that he had not seen in a long time.","“Wu-Wushuang...!”","Di Qing’s emotions had already reached an extreme level. He had never thought that he would meet an old friend in the Endless Sea.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang smiled as if he had been relieved of a heavy burden. He said, “I’ve finally found you.”","Di Qing did not say anything. He felt a different emotion rising from the bottom of his heart. This emotion had never appeared before. Finally, he said, “You shouldn’t have entered the Endless Sea. It’s too dangerous here.”","“I still have to come even if it’s dangerous, because you’re still here.” He slightly raised his eyebrows and the sword in his hand directly shattered all the Yan power chains.","Then, Jian Wushuang quickly stepped forward and stuffed several Emperor-grade pills into Di Qing’s mouth.","When the pills entered his mouth, they directly saved his true life that was about to die!","“No need to thank me. The most important thing now is to leave this place,” Jian Wushuang said and turned around.","“Wushuang, you go first, I will stop them.”","Di Qing, who had recovered from his weakness, regained his previous cold demeanor. An invisible force quietly spread out again.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “We don’t need to move. They can’t hurt us. ”","Di Qing was startled, not quite understanding what he meant.","Although Jian Wushuang was extremely strong, he was still not strong enough to deal with 100 Grand Yan Immortals.","“Stay!”","The black-robed figure said in a muffled voice. At the same time, he waved his hand and dozens of Grand Yan Immortals rushed forward.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of Di Qing and did not even take a step back. He looked ahead calmly.","He seemed to be waiting for something until a strange ripple appeared in the void.","Three large black robes appeared quietly and stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","The leader, a thin man in a black robe, raised his hand and pointed.","In an instant, it was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse. Endless energy poured out from his fingertips.","Under this special fluctuation, the space was directly torn apart. Even the dozens of Grand Yan Immortals who were about to rush forward were turned into ashes.","Di Qing’s eyes widened to the maximum!","Killing dozens of Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals with one finger so easily, how was this possible?!","What shocked him even more was that the endless energy released by the black-robed figure was Sword Intent!","He destroyed the enemy with a single finger, and he was utterly defeated!","The remaining 30 Grand Yan Immortals had never seen such a scene before. After surviving, they did not even have the mood to fight. All of them were fleeing frantically.","The black-robed figure standing in front of Jian Wushuang did not seem to have any intention of killing these Grand Yan Immortals. He turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang and Di Qing.","“Is this the friend you’ve been looking for?”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile, “Yes.”","After being stared at by that pure gaze for a moment, Di Qing felt that the divine blood flowing in his Immortal body was starting to turn cold.","Yan Fan, who was under the black robe, smiled when he heard this. “That’s right, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. Judging from his performance just now, he’s a powerful character.”","Di Qing was stunned. With just a glance, he could see the realm that he had deliberately hidden. This was enough to show that the black-robed figure was unfathomable.","“Don’t just stand there. Leave quickly to avoid any trouble.” Jiang Li reminded him in a low voice.","Yan Fan nodded and released a Sword Intent barrier to cover their bodies before preparing to leave.","Then, another black-robed figure pushed Jian Wushuang aside and came to Di Qing’s side.","Di Qing was very puzzled. It was only when the black-robed figure pulled off his hood that he was shocked.","“Why, why is it you?!”","Immortal Lord Fu Yao’s face turned slightly red when she heard this. Then, she said, “W-why? Can’t it be me? I came to save you, but you don’t appreciate it. If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have come...”","He quickly looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang shrugged his shoulders with a subtle smile in his eyes.","Di Qing was helpless. He had always kept a respectful distance from this passionate Immortal Lord Fu Yao, who wanted to merge their ancestral veins on their first meeting.","As a result, he quickly left as soon as his injuries recovered.","He never thought that they would meet again here.","“Many, many thanks.” Di Qing forced a smile and said with an unnatural expression.","When Immortal Lord Fu Yao heard this, she immediately smiled. “At least you’re tactful. I’ll take you away.”","As she spoke, she hugged Di Qing’s arm and prepared to leave together.","The only exit of this magnificent City of Exile was above their heads. They could only leave by tearing open the light barrier.","All the surviving Grand Yan Immortals gathered together and flew towards the exit.","Jian Wushuang and the others followed closely behind, wanting to leave as soon as possible.","However, in the next moment, the light curtain barrier that was torn apart by Jian Wushuang’s sword suddenly closed!","As the light barrier closed, countless threads of dark blue light radiated on the light barrier like a spider web, gradually constructing a large array!","As the four array cores of the array landed, a suction force that was like maggots in the bones descended and enveloped the entire City of Exile.","The first to feel the change was the Grand Yan Immortal closest to the exit.","Almost in an instant, their Immortal bodies began to wither and age, and strands of pure white light rose from their bodies."]},{"number":4985,"title":"Chapter 4985 The Black Cloud Controlling the Fate of an Emperor","paragraphs":["4985 The Black Cloud Controlling the Fate of an Emperor","As the pure white light rose into the sky, it was all swallowed and absorbed by the treacherous array.","Their flesh and blood peeled off, and even their Immortal bones quickly lost their charm and turned into ashes.","In a short span of several dozen breaths, they were completely annihilated!","Jian Wushuang and the others retreated quickly and looked at the array formation vigilantly.","The entire City of Exile was wrapped up by the grand array. After absorbing the fate of dozens of Grand Yan Immortals, it became even more terrifying.","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang felt the luck in his Immortal body begin to drain slowly.","“This array formation can actually absorb fate energy?” Yan Fan frowned. “Looks like the owner of this Heavenly Continent isn’t simple.”","To be called extraordinary by Yan Fan, the master behind this Heavenly Continent was definitely not as simple as a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn and he was ready to fight with all his might.","At this moment, Yan Fan and Jiang Li looked at each other and walked forward.","With every step they took, the void trembled.","Facing the huge treacherous array formation above their heads, they pressed their swords at the same time and slashed out in an instant!","The sword strike was so fast that Jian Wushuang did not even see it clearly.","In an instant, the void shattered. Boundless Sword Intent was like a blooming Immortal flower, each of which reflected an unparalleled power.","Billions of Sword Intents crashed into the Immortal formation, bursting with unparalleled brilliance.","Di Qing was completely shocked by the sword move and hurriedly released his Yan power to protect Jian Wushuang and Immortal Lord Fu Yao.","When the two collided, the entire City of Exile began to shatter!","The city wall turned into dust and finally shattered.","Along with it was the treacherous formation above them.","When the boundless Sword Intent completely dissipated, everything was settled.","The huge and magnificent City of Exile had been shattered, leaving only some ruins. Even the void had been cut into pieces.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He immediately flew up and prepared to leave.","The five of them were trapped in the center.","“He came out hiding.” Yan Fan’s gaze was unusually solemn. His palm was also placed on the hilt of the sword at his waist, ready to draw the sword at any time.","At this moment, Jiang Li stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","At this point, the entire City of Exile, along with more than half of the Heavenly Continent, had been destroyed. Everything was shrouded in chaos.","Along with the chaos, a thick and extremely strange black cloud floated in front of them.","“What a good Sword Intent. You are one of the few people who can break my array so easily.”","An old, hoarse, and deep voice rang out from the black cloud. Then, the drifting black cloud began to change.","It continued to transform and gradually transformed into a tall figure. Moreover, that blurry face finally turned into Yan Fan’s appearance.","“I admire you guys very much.”","Yan Fan’s gaze focused, and then he said disdainfully, “Hmph, another guy who’s pretending to be mysterious.”","The Black Cloud, who looked exactly like Yan Fan, grinned. “No, no, I don’t like to play tricks. What I’m showing is my uncontrollable strength.”","“Furthermore, I’ve personally killed a Sword Immortal like you before.”","“You think you can kill me?”Yan Fan was even more disdainful. “There has never been anyone who can kill me.”","Black Cloud chuckled softly, “Everyone who can become a Sword Immortal is unprecedentedly powerful. The Yan power and the fate energy in their Immortal bodies are also purer. That’s why I like to absorb the fate energy of Sword Immortals. It’s very helpful to me.”","“You think you can swallow my fate energy? Aren’t you afraid that I’ll chop your head off?” Yan Fan said in a deep voice.","He regained his composure. “You can’t kill me. Even if I don’t make a move, you won’t be able to kill me.”","Yan Fan’s gaze turned cold. “Why? Do you want to try?”","“Of course I want to try. It’s been countless years since I last killed a Sword Immortal. Now, I want to taste it again.”","Black Cloud slowly raised his arms, his deep eyes filled with excitement. “Use your strongest sword strike. If I’m satisfied, I might let you live.”","“Haha!” Yan Fan laughed loudly when he heard that. His gaze suddenly turned cold at this moment. “Old thing, you have to know that no Grand Yan Immortal is worthy of my strongest strike, including you!”","“I like your arrogance. If you weren’t my food, I would really want you to be my friend.”","Black Cloud took a step forward after he finished speaking.","At this moment, the terrifying and treacherous black clouds actually transformed into a robe with black and gold patterns around his body.","When the black-gold robe appeared, the chaotic sky began to enter a state of submission.","Therefore, the scattered ownerless Yan power also submitted.","A strange Heavenly Dao order was built in this chaos.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fu Yao were all shocked when they saw the black cloud in the black and gold robe.","That was the Emperor’s robe that represented the fate energy of the Emperor!","Those who could wear this divine apparel had grasped the fate energy of the Emperor!","Emperor’s fate energy. These words were too terrifying. It was so terrifying that even Grand Yan Immortals who could create Heavenly Dao with a wave of their hands were unable to resist against Emperor’s fate energy.","The fate energy of an Emperor represented absolute control!","Under the Emperor’s will, the Grand Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source was just a toy.","Jian Wushuang, who had interacted with six Emperors, knew what the fate energy of an Emperor represented.","Even if Emperor Liu Ya only had a wisp of his soul left in Heavenly Court, it was enough to kill Di Qing, who was a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal.","The three Emperors in the Boyang Bottle were in a different situation. Their Emperor bodies and Emperor fate energy had disappeared, leaving behind only three weak True Souls.","However, even if the True Souls of the three Emperors were extremely weak, they would be able to recover to their peak state as long as they reconstructed their Emperor bodies in the future.","Once he controlled the Emperor’s fate energy, the Grand Yan Immortal would have already transcended the restrictions of the realm and reached a mysterious state.","The fate energy of an Emperor represented absolute control. No Grand Yan Immortal could harm an Emperor.","This also meant that when Black Cloud revealed the fate energy of an Emperor, everything was already set in stone.","At this moment, Yan Fan’s gaze changed, as if he had already made a decision in his heart."]},{"number":4986,"title":"Chapter 4986 All Things Are Suffering","paragraphs":["4986 All Things Are Suffering","Looking at Black Cloud who was wearing the emperor’s robe, Yan Fan called out Jiang Li’s name calmly.","“I’m here.”","“Take them away, I’ll stay.”","Jiang Li trembled and said in a low voice, “I should be the one who stays.”","“You can’t stay. One of us has to leave,” Yan Fan said with a firm gaze.","They had been Sword Partners for so many years, so Jiang Li knew what he was thinking. That was why she was at a loss.","“Leave? Where can we leave to?” she murmured.","Yan Fan smiled when he heard that. “Remember, go as far as you can. Regardless of whether it’s true or not, it’s your duty to pass Master’s Sword Dao to Wushuang.”","Jiang Li could not speak anymore as if she had aged in an instant.","Yan Fan did not say anything else. He looked past Jiang Li to Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Go.”","Tens of millions of pure Sword Intents surged out from Yan Fan’s fingertips, turning into a gust of wind that lifted them up and sent them out of the chaotic sky.","After the Sword Intent shattered the chaotic sky and disappeared, he let out a long breath and looked at Black Cloud.","“You’re the one I’m most interested in in this chaos. Do you know what you’re going to face?”","Yan Fan smiled, his gaze cold. “You can hide it from others, but you can’t hide it from me. Even if you have grasped the Emperor’s fate energy, you won’t become an Emperor. If I’m not wrong, the Emperor’s fate energy you possess was obtained by devouring the fate energy of other Grand Yan Immortals, right?”","Black Cloud’s expression turned cold before he regained his composure. “So what? When I leave this place, I’ll be able to achieve the True Dao of the Imperial Emperor. Who can stop me?”","“The future is the future. Do you really think you can leave this place?” Yan Fan smiled coldly. His palm then gently pulled the hilt of his sword, and an incomparably sharp cold light burst out.","“Do you really think you can trap me?” Black Cloud opened his arms and laughed. “I just need to devour your fate energy and those fellows’ fate energy. Then, I will break through this place.”","Yan Fan’s face trembled slightly. He felt that something was wrong.","Black Cloud smiled sinisterly. “You don’t really think that they can leave this place, do you? I’m only letting them leave temporarily. I’ll kill you first before I find them.”","“You think you can kill me?” he said coldly. Then, a long sword with silver patterns and cold light was pulled out.","At this moment, Yan Fan’s body was surging with unparalleled majestic Sword Intent, which seemed to be resisting the chaotic aura!","“I can kill you in a flash, but I want to know how strong you are now. If I’m satisfied, I might use your Immortal body.”","Black Cloud gave a strange smile. Then, he raised his arms and released a chaotic aura from his body. It condensed into a magnificent Emperor’s Throne behind him!","Chaos was enough to cover everything!","However, Yan Fan was extremely calm at this moment. His long black hair broke free from his belt and danced in the air like a Sword Immortal.","He held the hilt of the sword with one hand and pointed the snowflake blade forward.","Facing Black Cloud that had the Emperor’s fate energy, a cold and lonely aura burst out from Yan Fan’s body.","Boundless Sword Intent was like the mountains and seas that were about to topple as they brazenly faced each other.","The Heavenly Continent shattered, and the Endless Sea stirred up a supreme wave of dust.","At this moment, everything was in complete chaos.","At the same time, Jiang Li who was running in the void stopped and looked at the endless void as if something had left her.","Jian Wushuang also stopped in his tracks. He also felt the palpitating tremors.","Di Qing and Immortal Lord Fu Yao’s expressions darkened. They knew what it meant to control the fate energy of an Emperor.","If Yan Fan stayed, even if he was extremely terrifying, there was only one path waiting for him.","Even though he knew, he still stayed behind to face death.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang turned around and rushed toward the broken Heavenly Continent.","Di Qing followed him without hesitation.","However, Jiang Li appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and blocked his way.","“You can’t go.”","Jian Wushuang said seriously, “I can’t just let him die while we all leave together.”","“If he doesn’t stay, none of us can leave,” Jiang Li said.","After pondering for a moment, he said, “I’ll be back soon. Don’t worry.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang left without any hesitation.","“Don’t go and die for nothing. If you go, his death will be in vain. I’ll go,” Jiang Li said softly. Her voice was calm as if she was talking about something that had nothing to do with her.","“Remember, there is no paradise here or in the myriad realms. Everyone has their own sufferings.”","After saying that, Jiang Li released Sword Intents to bind Jian Wushuang so that he could not do anything else.","Heaven, earth, and void, everything dimmed.","Jian Wushuang gave up resisting. Perhaps it was as Jiang Li said, everyone had their own difficulties.","However, it was always a little tragic for an Immortal to use his suffering to help the person he wanted to help.","...","The Heavenly Continent had completely shattered, sinking into the boundless Endless Sea.","Everything had been devoured by the chaotic aura.","However, there was still a figure that was not affected by the chaos.","The majestic Sword Intent still flowed around him. Facing the black clouds, he did not take a step back.","Black Cloud, who was standing in the air, looked at him with a faint smile. “Use your strongest sword move. Let me see how strong you are. Then, I’ll consider swallowing your Immortal body.”","Yan Fan’s expression was still arrogant. “I said before that no one could see my sword move, not even you.”","“Ridiculous to the extreme. You should know that I can kill you with a casual finger and consign you to eternal damnation,” Black Cloud said coldly.","“Is that so?” He sneered. “If you could kill me with a single finger, you would have done it long ago, right?”","“Oh, you don’t believe me?”","“It’s not that I don’t believe you, but I know you can’t!”","Yan Fan laughed loudly. The six long swords on his waist hummed at the same time and exploded with unparalleled power.","Black Cloud’s expression darkened completely, and the chaotic aura around him burst out."]},{"number":4987,"title":"Chapter 4987 Battle","paragraphs":["4987 Battle","The huge Emperor’s Throne behind him was even more majestic and overwhelming!","Yan Fan, who had been severely injured in the previous confrontation, did not retreat in the face of the endless chaotic aura.","He raised his sword and faced the attack.","At this moment, a magnificent sword screen was reflected in the sky.","Every space exuded a pure and majestic Sword Intent.","The two collided, erupting with the most terrifying destructive aura. Under this aura, even a Six Revolutions Great Yan Immortal would not be able to survive!","At this moment, Yan Fan was forced back thousands of feet. A trace of divine blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth, but it disappeared completely.","His powerful sword strike was enough to kill an army of over 10,000 Yan Immortals, even easily suppressing Nine Revolutions grand Yan Immortals who were at the same cultivation realm.","But now, he was facing Black Cloud, who had already controlled the fate of the Emperor. Everything was different.","The Heaven Shrouding Sword Screen was easily torn apart, and the chaotic aura devoured and destroyed everything in its path.","Faced with the chaotic aura that was pressing down on him, Yan Fan drew his second sword.","It was a strange longsword with only one blade. Rather than calling it a longsword, it would be more appropriate to call it a straight saber.","The moment this strange sword appeared, his aura completely changed. His sharpness was completely retracted, as if he had fallen into a deep sleep.","Just as the chaotic aura approached, Yan Fan suddenly opened his eyes, emitting a terrifying aura.","The next moment, he raised the sword in his hand and slashed down!","As if the world had just been separated, the turbid air sank and the clear air rose, creating an unimaginable crack.","Under this crack, even this terrifying chaotic aura had no choice but to be cut open.","Yan Fan shouted angrily in a low voice. His hand that was holding the hilt of his sword was also drenched in divine blood under this huge force.","The robe on his upper body was torn at this moment, revealing his solid chest.","Then, divine blood seeped out of every pore on his Immortal body and sprinkled into the void.","However, Yan Fan did not retreat. He only held the long sword in his hand and slashed away the chaotic aura.","Boundless Sword Intent surged, and the chaotic aura that had been split into two dissipated.","Black Cloud’s strange face was revealed. He looked at Yan Fan with a half-smile as if he was very satisfied.","His chest heaved up and down violently. Yan Fan wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth and looked at him solemnly.","“That’s right. You’re several times stronger than the Sword Immortal I eliminated a long time ago. You were actually able to break through my aura by yourself. I’m starting to hope that you’ll become even stronger.”","“Only when you become stronger can you arouse my desire.”","Black Cloud raised his arms slowly. The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne behind him, which could suppress all Heavenly Daos, flew up.","It broke through the void and smashed toward Yan Fan with a chaotic aura.","Heaven and earth became distorted under the chaotic throne, and a strange Heavenly Dao quietly devoured everything.","A bitter smile appeared on Yan Fan’s face, but he was still aloof and cold, like a sword that was waiting to be activated.","Facing the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, he drew his sword!","Six long swords and six boundless Sword Intents wrapped around Yan Fan.","They hovered quietly behind him. Their Sword Intents turned into a long rainbow and condensed into an Invisible Sword in Yan Fan’s hand.","The seven-colored sword also reflected the power of the Heavenly Dao!","Yan Fan’s eyes were indifferent. Even if he was facing the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne with the fate energy of an Emperor, he would not care.","In the next moment, he drew his sword and the six Sword Intents turned into a rainbow that pierced through the world!","Under this sword strike, the treacherous Heavenly Dao constructed by the Black Clouds was torn apart, and even the chaotic aura that was spreading out was completely obliterated.","This was a graceful sword move, and also the final sword move!","Beneath this supreme sword was a Sword Dao that had been silent for countless years.","This was the rage of a Sword Immortal, and it carried the determination to destroy both jade and stone.","Seeing this sword, even Black Cloud could not hide his surprise, but it was followed by greed!","He was almost certain that if he could take Yan Fan’s Immortal body for his own use, he would be able to tear open the Endless Sea and successfully escape!","The brilliant Emperor’s Throne descended, making all the derivative energies submit.","This was a battle that had surpassed the realm of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not imagine how terrifying this battle would be.","This was the pinnacle battle between the strongest Sword Immortal and a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who controlled the fate energy of an Emperor!","If this place was not the Endless Sea, then just this terrifying aura alone would be enough to easily tear apart any Heavenly Region or Immortal Domain.","Heavenly Dao was like child’s play in this battle. Even a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal could not stop the brilliant radiance.","The Sword Immortal’s sword collided with the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, but there was no terrifying explosion. There was not even a sound.","However, the void collapsed into a black hole, becoming an eternal void. In this void, even the derivative energy could not escape.","The void became a vacuum zone of eternal nothingness. Everything lost its color. Large areas of the void were destroyed and collapsed.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne that contained the fate energy of the Emperor was stopped at this moment. It could not advance any further.","And what stopped it was a Sword Immortal’s sword strike that emitted a rainbow halo!","At this moment, Yan Fan was covered in blood, but his Immortal body was not damaged or even distorted!","He had actually forcefully withstood the Emperor’s fate energy!","This was simply unimaginable. With the power of a Nine Revolutions Great Immortal, he could withstand the impact of an Emperor’s fate energy. This was impossible.","But now, it really happened, even though Yan Fan was already at the end of his rope.","Black Cloud laughed wildly at this moment, his eyes filled with greed.","He waved his arms, and the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne that was blocked by Yan Fan’s sword pressed down heavily!","The fate energy of the Emperor was even stronger. Yan Fan, who was exhausted from one strike, could no longer resist and was swallowed by the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne.","Everything returned to the eternal nothingness. Only under the nothingness remained chaos.","As the source of the chaos, the Black Cloud that controlled the fate of the Emperor had already quietly moved forward.","He waved his hand to disperse the chaotic aura and looked at Yan Fan who was lying in the eternal void. There was only ecstasy and greed in his eyes.","“Give me your Immortal body. Only under my guidance can he break through that shackle.”","Yan Fan’s Immortal body had been shattered to the extreme. He could not even move a finger. He could only lie quietly in the void.","The last wisp of divine blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth."]},{"number":4988,"title":"Chapter 4988 I’m Here","paragraphs":["4988 I’m Here","The six swords were scattered in the void, floating without a trace of harm.","And Yan Fan was also in an irreparable decline.","“I don’t want to snatch it. I just want you to personally hand over the Immortal body to me. That way, the compatibility will be the highest.”","After a moment of silence, Yan Fan said slowly, “Sure... But you have to agree to two conditions. As long as you can do it, I’ll give you the Immortal body.”","Black Cloud asked, “What condition?”","“Let them go.”","Black Cloud was silent for a moment before he said, “As long as you completely give up your Immortal body, I can promise you that I will let them go and not kill them.”","“Sure.”","“There’s another condition?”","Yan Fan slowly closed his eyes. “Put my swords back into their sheaths.”","Black Cloud raised his eyes slightly, but he did not say anything. He waved his hand and sent the six longswords that had lost their charm into the scabbard at Yan Fan’s waist.","“Give me the Immortal body. I’ll bring him out of here.”","Yan Fan stopped talking. His Immortal body began to emit wisps of multicolored light.","Black Cloud smiled, and the illusory figure began to approach.","Once it fused, tearing the Endless Sea apart would be just around the corner.","Just as he was about to devour the Immortal body, a voice filled with true anger rang out!","“How dare you!”","Accompanied by this furious roar, Black Cloud suddenly raised his head. He saw a rapid light shooting towards him.","As the speed was too fast, it was already too late for him to react.","The light suddenly penetrated his chest and exploded.","Immediately after, a crisp cry shook the heavens and earth. The Golden Crow Treasure Form that was enough to cover the sky also rushed over and descended with endless golden feathers.","Another cry sounded, and a relatively small golden phoenix covered the sky, disrupting all the auras.","Caught off guard, the Black Cloud’s originally illusory figure was directly obliterated into nothingness.","“Quick, take him and leave. I’ll stay!”","“Let’s go!” Jiang Li said in the chaotic void.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing behind her, nodded. Then, he quickly took out more than ten Emperor-grade pills and stuffed them into Yan Fan’s mouth.","“Wu-Wushuang...Why are you here?” Yan Fan’s divine sense was already a little chaotic. Even with the help of the Emperor-grade pills, he was unable to recover for a while.","“Don’t say so much. Have a good sleep,” Jian Wushuang said quickly and then put Yan Fan into Di Qing’s arms.","“Let’s go!”","Di Qing, Immortal Lord Fu Yao, and Jian Wushuang disappeared quietly after holding Yan Fan’s broken Immortal body, as if they had never appeared.","In the eternal void, only Jiang Li stood with her sword.","But then, the chaotic aura gathered again and condensed into Black Cloud’s figure again.","At this moment, he could no longer suppress his anger.","The overwhelming power that came from all directions did not cause him any harm at all. Only the sword that pierced through his chest forced him to stop and dissolve the terrifying power of that sword.","“I want your life. Today, I will make sure that none of you can escape from my hands alive!”","Black Cloud was furious. Boundless chaotic aura surged out from his body, terrifying to the extreme.","However, Jiang Li just looked at him scornfully as if he was trash.","“It’s shameful to devour the Grand Yan Immortal’s fate energy to strengthen yourself. Even if I use my sword to kill you, it will dirty my sword!”","Black Cloud’s face was gloomy. “You’ve exhausted my patience. You’ll all become my nourishment.”","Jiang Li smiled disdainfully and waved her hand. A long sword came out of its sheath and slashed forward with a terrifying force.","“You’re courting death!” the Black Cloud roared, and the chaotic aura sped forward.","It was another terrifying collision. As Yan Fan’s Sword Companions, Jiang Li, who was even more mysterious, did not seem to be afraid of Black Cloud at all.","The surging Sword Intent was actually able to resist him!","However, Black Cloud had clearly lost his patience. The Immortal body in his hands had disappeared in vain. How could he not be furious?","He waved his arm and a giant palm pressed down on Jiang Li.","Jiang Li, who was standing in the eternal void, was not afraid. Facing the endless palm above her head, she just patted the sword hilt on her waist.","In an instant, another three swords shot out and resolutely slashed forward.","If Yan Fan’s Sword Dao was endless, then Jiang Li’s Sword Dao was the ultimate embodiment of its magnificence.","It was only three swords, but they had exploded with unparalleled power. Even the chaotic aura released by the Black Clouds could not compare.","However, even such an unparalleled power showed signs of decline when faced with the chaotic aura that was mixed with the fate energy of the Imperial Emperor.","Three long swords rose into the sky, blocking the endless palm’s downward pressure.","“Die!” Black Cloud was furious, and he waved his hand down heavily.","As he swung, the endless palm shattered the Sword Intent and hit Jiang Li.","At this moment, he swung the remaining two swords. A total of six swords rose into the sky at the same time and protected Jiang Li’s Immortal body.","The explosion once again erupted in the Eternal Void.","Jiang Li retreated a million feet. Her Immortal body was almost broken. The divine blood soaked her clothes and dripped into the void.","The six swords had used all of their power to block an attack with the Emperor’s fate energy. This was an unprecedented event.","When the boundless Sword Intent and chaotic aura disappeared, Black Cloud’s strange figure appeared again.","His face was gloomy and filled with disbelief.","He had never thought that two Sword Immortals would break through his Emperor’s fate energy one after another.","While he was furious, he also felt a lingering fear.","Jiang Li wiped the divine blood off her mouth and sneered. The disdain in her eyes grew.","“If I’m not wrong, you don’t have much fate energy left, right? Moreover, you can’t derive any more fate energy now, right?”","Black Cloud’s eyes flickered when he heard that. “So what? I can kill you in an instant.”","Jiang Li smiled. “Tell me, how much of your Emperor’s fate energy can I take from you?”","“You’re delusional. Go to hell!” Black Cloud shouted angrily and swung his palm at her.","In the next moment, the green Sword Intents quietly clung to Jiang Li’s waist like leaves and lifted her up.","“Wushuang?” Jiang Li was shocked. When she saw the figure next to her, she was even more shocked!","Jian Wushuang slightly lowered his eyebrows and nodded with a smile. “I’m here.”","She snapped back to her senses and said angrily, “Why did you come back? Don’t you know that all we did was to make you leave?!”","“I know, but if I leave just like this, I’ll really leave behind some regrets in this bitter world.”","Jiang Li was silent. She knew that Jian Wushuang was someone who would bring about great change."]},{"number":4989,"title":"Chapter 4989 The Battle of Emperor-To-Be","paragraphs":["4989 The Battle of Emperor-To-Be","He was determined. Even if he was facing Black Cloud who controlled the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao, he would still move forward resolutely.","An Invisible Sword condensed in his hand. The tip of the sword pointed diagonally at the eternal void.","Jiang Li stood up behind him. Although she was injured by the Emperor’s fate energy, she was not seriously hurt at all.","She quickly took out half an Emperor-grade pill from her bosom and stuffed it into her mouth. In an instant, she recovered more than half of her injuries.","The domineering effect of the Emperor-grade pill benefited Jiang Li, who was a Nine Revolutions Grand Immortal and a Sword Immortal.","One had to know that these Emperor-grade pills were hidden by Emperor Liu Ya when he was alive. They were supreme treasures that could only be seen but could not be reached. The medicinal effects of each pill were extremely terrifying.","Therefore, Jiang Li did not want to eat the whole Emperor-grade pill, so she just divided one into two and ate it.","This was despite Jian Wushuang giving her a few just now.","Only Jian Wushuang could be so extravagant and eat more than ten pills at once.","Looking at the figure standing in front of him without backing down, Black Cloud only felt that it was funny, and then he was completely furious.","Since when did a Yan Immortal dare to go against him?!","“A dust-like fellow dares to confront me?” Black Cloud roared angrily, and a monstrous chaotic aura surged up like a huge river.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn.","He was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, even if he could kill rank three or even Six Revolutions grand evolution Immortals.","However, it was different now, his opponent was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who could control the Emperor’s fate energy.","This was almost an entire major cultivation realm, and it was against the fate energy of an Emperor.","This was something unimaginable and impossible.","Even if Jian Wushuang carried the three Daos, there was no way he could fight against Black Cloud.","Only Sword Immortal Jiang Li could fight Black Cloud!","Under the powerful effects of the Emperor-grade Pill, she had already recovered 90 percent and she quietly stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","The six swords flew out together and turned into a long rainbow that swept out. It enveloped the chaotic aura that was crazily devouring the rainbow Sword Intent and continuously strangled it.","“Hurry up and leave!” Jiang Li turned around and said in a deep voice, “Don’t do anything useless. Remember, you can’t die no matter what because you haven’t learned our Sword Principle yet.”","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. Jiang Li had completely taken him as her disciple by teaching him the Origin Sword Principle.","“I’m afraid I can’t help you comprehend my Sword Principle anymore, but Yan Fan will know what to do. You must study it well.”","She smiled slightly, as heroic and arrogant as when they first met.","The next moment, Jiang Li turned around and rushed into the chaotic aura.","There was no chance of survival.","The fate energy of the Emperor represented absolute control. Under that control, even Sword Immortals of the same cultivation realm could only die.","Jiang Li’s departure gave Jian Wushuang a chance to leave alive.","He stood where he was, and there was only loneliness in his eyes.","Majestic divine patterns rose from the tips of his hair and then scattered into the void.","The belt that tied her long hair fell off, and her long hair with a faint dark gold aura fluttered in the air.","At this moment, the Selfless True Shadow appeared.","The Dao of Protection that represented the Cosmos God, the Dao of Slaughter that represented the Karma of Slaughter, and the Wushuang Sword Dao that contained the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent were all activated to him.","Three Daos in one body!","This was a magnificent scene. In the pale eternal void, the fate energy of the Great Dao bloomed.","The Selfless True Shadow, which was as tall as the eternal void, put its palms together and closed its eyes. An endless stream of fate energy was circulating.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and a seven-star galaxy between his eyebrows shone brightly.","The light of the Invisible Sword in his hand had never been so magnificent before. The fate of the three Great Daos all returned to the blade, releasing endless power.","Facing the chaotic aura that could even destroy the eternal void, Jian Wushuang drew his sword and rose.","At this moment, even if he had to die, he would not regret it.","With the Selfless True Shadow and the support of three Great Dao fate energy, it was enough to easily kill a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","And on top of these foundations, what would happen if he released the Lake-Style Sword Intent?","The Lake-Style Sword Intent was the strongest sword move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","It was an unimaginable sword move. Even Jian Wushuang could not believe it.","As long as this sword move was unleashed, it would defy fate itself.","This was a sword move that even an Emperor could not block!","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, third move.","Lake.","This was Jian Wushuang’s strongest attack, and even his Sword Intent was the strongest.","In the eternal pale void, a huge door appeared. It was the door of providence.","It was so grand that even the moon, stars, and Heavenly Region Planes were just a drop in the ocean.","Words could not describe the magnificence of the Heavenly Gate, but it truly existed, making those who heard it feel incomparably small.","The light gold, dark red, and sky blue colors intertwined to form a supreme providence that turned into a quiet lake and flowed out of the giant door.","The pale eternal void was tainted at this moment.","Within the providence lake, the Blue Moon Star and the Giant Sun Planet were being born. The fate energy they gave birth to had all returned to one.","Inside the giant door, the Selfless True Shadow quietly opened its eyes.","His eyes seemed to contain the universe, and all origins were being born.","Then, the Selfless True Shadow shed tears.","A drop of tear streaked across the sky, as if it was filled with pity.","Jian Wushuang had arrived, stepping out from the Heavenly Gate.","Wrapped in supreme fate energy, one could no longer see his full appearance.","However, the divine blood had already surged out of his Immortal body at this moment. The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens seemed to be unable to withstand that kind of fate energy and began to burn.","This sword strike was unstoppable!","90 percent of the eternal void was devoured by the chaotic aura.","However, at this moment, Jiang Li, who was planning to sacrifice her Immortal Source, suddenly opened her eyes.","She could feel a majestic aura coming from behind her.","That aura was majestic and carried an unstoppable aura!","That aura and aura made even her heart palpitate.","Amidst the chaotic aura, she tried her best to look back and saw a scene that was engraved in her heart.","It could no longer be described as a single sword move. It was as if the fate energy of all things in the universe was fluctuating. It was magnificent and shocking.","Then, Jiang Li saw Jian Wushuang’s sword move arrive.","At this moment, no one could compete with him. Even Sword Immortals could only pale in comparison.","Seeing the Sword Intent of providence, all the chaotic auras seemed to have a consciousness and actually retreated crazily.","Black Cloud, who was laughing hideously, was shocked when he saw this.","An incomparable palpitation grew from the bottom of his heart. It was as if he had returned to countless years ago and was facing the wrath of a True Emperor.","“No, that’s impossible! How can there be another Emperor here? I’m the Emperor here! I’m the only Emperor!”"]},{"number":4990,"title":"Chapter 4990 The Fall","paragraphs":["4990 The Fall","Black Cloud roared hysterically. The terror of the supreme brilliance sweeping over made him completely timid!","He did not want to die. He wanted to live!","After being exiled to the Endless Sea, he could no longer remember why he was still alive. The only belief that supported him was to grow stronger and take revenge.","Countless Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals had died tragically at his hands, their fate energy devoured.","That fate energy had allowed him to touch the level of an Imperial Emperor.","But now, before he had fully developed, he was already suppressed by this kind of Heavenly Dao fate energy. How could he not be terrified?!","Black Cloud was hysterical and almost went crazy.","“No one can kill me, including Zhen Wuyang. I’m already an Emperor, who can stop me?!”","“Die!” he roared, and an endless chaotic aura was released from his body.","Then, a huge chaotic throne appeared.","Black Cloud raised his arms high, lifted the Chaotic Throne, and smashed it down, hoping to block the sword strike.","Not only the Chaotic Throne, but also the endless chaotic aura.","In the pale eternal void, this powerful attack was completely unleashed.","The connection with the sword was established, the endless Sword Intent was like a swan, drawing the power of the entire universe in the Heavenly Gate and easily tearing apart the chaotic aura.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, which had severely injured Yan Fan and contained the fate energy of the Emperor, only lasted for an instant before it was destroyed.","The Lake Sword Intent could no longer be blocked!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang’s right arm that was holding the sword was completely shattered. His Immortal body could not withstand such a degree of impact.","If it was not for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, he would have turned into dust when the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne shattered.","However, there was no ‘if’. Jian Wushuang was still alive. Although his right arm was completely broken, he used his left arm to lift the Invisible Sword and moved forward resolutely!","Countless painful and hoarse sounds rang out, and the chaotic aura was all defeated by this impact.","Only Black Cloud stood rooted to the ground, looking at him in disbelief.","Their eyes met, and the strongest Sword Intent descended!","One sword strike pierced the world!","The eternal void trembled. At that moment, the giant gate shattered, and the universe inside turned into destiny and erupted together.","The complexity and terror of this sword strike had reached an unimaginable level.","Even the Eternal Void was destroyed. The terrifying aura from the explosion made Jiang Li, a Sword Immortal, unable to stand still. She was pushed back a million feet!","Divine blood flowed out of her mouth. Jiang Li was still in shock.","She began to realize that the sword strike was released by Jian Wushuang.","This sword strike had completely pushed him to another level.","That kind of height meant that he was a Sword Immortal!","With the body of a Yan Immortal, he ascended to become a Sword Immortal.","Jiang Li smiled and then shed tears.","As a Sword Immortal, how could she not feel that the sword strike was too powerful and Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body could not withstand it?","This was a supreme sword move, and he could not survive at all.","Jiang Li’s eyes were filled with real sorrow, but nothing could be changed.","The appearance of this sword strike meant that there was no room for turning back.","The pale eternal void was shattered, and everything was destroyed.","The chaotic aura had completely subsided and was replaced by a magnificent Sword Intent.","The Sword Intent formed a sea, and it was boundless.","Jiang Li did not stay any longer and went to look for it.","In the sea of swords, the injuries on her body were recovering at a slow speed, as if she was enveloped by the sun.","However, the more she did so, the more flustered she became. She searched the entire sea of swords but could not find any trace of Jian Wushuang.","“Really, really ... What a terrifying junior...”","A hoarse voice that could not suppress the pain echoed in the void.","Then, a supreme power descended and wiped out the endless sea of swords.","Jiang Li did not see them until then.","Black Cloud’s originally ethereal Immortal body was completely shattered and slowly pieced back together. However, there was a sword slash mark on his heart that could not be healed no matter what.","Opposite the Black Cloud was an even more shattered Immortal body.","Except for his chest, almost all of his Immortal body had been shattered. His divine blood had long been drained, and his Immortal bones had been shattered.","Only the Nine Heavens Mysterious Robe was still emitting an azure light.","His arms had already ceased to exist under the powerful sword, and his pupils of pure gold had completely dimmed.","He was just standing there, but anyone could see that his life force was flowing out in an irreparable manner.","The traces of fate had completely disappeared. This was complete annihilation!","Like broken meteors, countless stars flew out from behind him, turning into nebulae that filled the eternal void of the Endless Sea.","Jiang Li rushed to Jian Wushuang like a mad person. When she reached out to touch him, he fell to the ground.","His golden eyes, which had already dimmed, were extremely chaotic. This was a sign that the traces of fate energy had disappeared.","Although his Immortal body was still there, it had indeed died.","Looking at this scene, Black Cloud muttered softly, “I killed a seedling that could become an Emperor. I killed a seedling that could become an Emperor...”","Jiang Li could not speak anymore. She hugged Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body, of which the fate energy had broken, and cried.","Immediately after, Black Cloud’s eyes were completely replaced by greed.","He looked at Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body!","“Give me his Immortal body and I’ll let you go. I only want his Immortal body!” Black Cloud said in a deep voice.","“I’ll kill you!” Jiang Li suddenly raised her head with determination in her eyes.","“You’re courting death!” Black Cloud was furious and raised his palm to smash forward.","However, his palm did not land. Instead, he retreated rapidly in panic.","Black Cloud was so shocked that he was completely speechless. He had seen a scene that could not have happened!","This unimaginable scene was even more terrifying than seeing Zhen Wuyang!","Because he saw three True Shadows, three True Shadows wearing imperial robes.","And only Emperors could wear such a robe!","They were three True Emperors!","At this moment, Yang Jun, Su He, and Daogong walked out of the Boyang Bottle. They stood behind Jiang Li and looked at the Black Cloud.","They had witnessed the magnificent battle and knew that Jian Wushuang had died.","It was also because of this that they were so furious that they walked out of the Boyang Bottle without caring about their True Souls.","“You, who are you? Stop playing tricks!” Black Cloud was completely shocked. The fear in his eyes revealed his current state of mind.","He could not believe that he would run into three Emperors at the same time.","Since when were there so many Emperors? To think that there would be three of them in a row?!","However, before he could question it, his face turned ashen when he saw the Emperor’s Radiance that could only be condensed by an Emperor.","The so-called Emperor’s Radiance was the symbol of the True Emperor’s fate energy. It was extremely difficult to condense. Even he, who had already comprehended the Emperor’s fate energy, had no way to condense the Emperor’s Radiance."]},{"number":4991,"title":"Chapter 4991 The Emperor’s Fury","paragraphs":["4991 The Emperor’s Fury","Once one possessed the Emperor’s Radiance, they would become a True Emperor!","Black Cloud’s face was ashen as he faced the Emperor’s Radiance. He did not even have the intention to resist.","There was no way to resist three Emperors.","Jiang Li was shocked as well. She did not expect three Emperors to appear at the same time. It was something that seemed impossible.","In her memory, such a scene did not even appear in the chaotic era.","“Take his Immortal body and leave.” Yang Jun, the tall and thin old man in the Emperor’s robe, said to Jiang Li. Then, he reached out and released Emperor Light to cover Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","Jiang Li was stunned, then she looked at the three Emperors gratefully. She quickly picked up Jian Wushuang and left for the Endless Void.","Upon seeing this scene, Black Cloud’s eyes nearly bled.","His desire for Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body had exceeded his fear of the three Emperors.","Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body was something he could not lose when he became an Emperor!","He could not just let Jiang Li leave!","As soon as Jiang Li left, Black Cloud was about to chase after her!","“How dare you?” Daogong roared, and the supreme Emperor’s Light blotted out the sky and covered the earth, blocking Black Cloud’s path.","“Don’t stop me!” Black Cloud was close to madness. In order to obtain Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body and become a supreme Emperor, he was not afraid of the three Emperors.","“I want to become an Emperor, and no one can stop me today. Whoever stops me, even if my destiny is completely destroyed, I won’t let you off easily!”","The three Emperors exchanged glances when they heard this. They could see the determination in each other’s eyes.","Having lost their Emperor bodies, they were still in the state of True Souls. Even under the nourishment of the Boyang Bottle, they were still weak.","They had no chance of winning against the crazy Emperor-to-be Black Cloud.","However, they were still determined.","...","“Wake up, don’t sleep anymore.”","...","It was ethereal, like smoke and dust, like a dream, and everything seemed to be a lifetime ago.","It was an indescribable pain that penetrated deep into his divine sense.","“Ah...”","As if he was drowning, he suddenly opened his eyes. As he opened his eyes, his broken Immortal body was completely restored in an instant.","As far as his eyes could see, it was a smoke-like illusion.","He panted heavily, and the unknown luck began to circulate around his body again.","“Where is this place? Aren’t I already dead?”","“You’re not dead yet, but without me, you would have died earlier.”","A figure in an imperial robe gradually became clear and stood in front of him.","Jian Wushuang’s lifeless eyes narrowed slightly. He was very familiar with this figure.","It was the Emperor who was sleeping in the Heavenly Palace on the White Bone Path under the Myriad Immortal Blood and Bones River, the Emperor, Zhen Wu.","“I was the one who captured your True Soul when you were about to die and placed it in the ring. Otherwise, with your cultivation level, it would be impossible for you to withstand your own sword move,” Emperor Zhen Wu said as he looked at him.","Jian Wushuang came back to his senses and cupped his hands with all his might. “Thank you for saving my life. I’ll remember it.”","Zhen Wu did not speak. After a moment, he said, “I did not expect your performance earlier. I thought you were just a talented and lucky little Yan Immortal expert. But now, it seems that I was wrong.”","“You are an unpredictable and unpredictable Yan Immortal.”","At this point, Emperor Zhen Wu lowered his head slowly and looked at Jian Wushuang with killing intent in his eyes. “Do you think I should kill a good seedling that can become an Emperor now?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly widened, and then he regained his composure, “You won’t kill me, at least not now.”","Emperor Zhen Wu said, “Tell me a reason. A reason not to kill you.”","Since things had come to this, he could only grit his teeth and say, “Only I can leave this place. Once you kill me, you can forget about leaving this place.”","“What if you lie to me and you can’t leave?”","“I won’t lie to you. If you realize that I’m lying to you, it won’t be too late for you to make a move.”","Hearing this, the Emperor Zhen Wu smiled. “Then I’ll spare your life for now. But I have to warn you first. If you do something as stupid as perishing with me again, don’t blame me for being rude.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and cold sweat dripped down from his temples.","From the unconcealed killing intent in Emperor Zhen Wu’s eyes, he knew that Emperor Zhen Wu definitely wanted to attack him.","However, because of his misgivings, he did not kill him.","And this worry was to borrow his hands to escape from this Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with worry. Emperor Zhen Wu was not a kind person. Even if he could escape from the Endless Sea, he would still be in danger.","If he could not escape, he would die. If he escaped, he would most likely die. This gave Jian Wushuang a headache.","However, he quickly thought it through.","The most important thing now was not to think about the future, but to deal with Black Cloud.","Thinking of this, he looked around. “Where is this place?”","“In your ring.”","“Can I wake up now?”","“Of course, anytime. But I have to warn you, don’t do those stupid things again. Some Grand Yan Immortals can be abandoned after being used. They are just the foundation for your advancement.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang curled his lips and was prepared to completely ignore this advice.","However, Emperor Zhen Wu’s next words made him break out in cold sweat. “Don’t forget that I know what you’re thinking.”","“I was wrong.”","...","In the endless void, Jian Wushuang, who was held by Jiang Li, opened his eyes quietly.","The chaos faded away, and the golden light reappeared in his pupils. His shattered Immortal body was slowly recovering.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In the void, the Emperor’s Radiance swept across and dispelled all the chaotic aura.","However, under the chaotic aura, even though the Emperor’s Radiance was glorious, it was already somewhat declining.","The three Emperors’ True Souls were still too weak.","Their Emperor bodies had been completely taken away, leaving only their True Souls. They could not deal with the Emperor-to-be Black Cloud anymore.","Black Cloud calmed down from his initial shock and anger. He was overjoyed when he realized the three Emperors’ weaknesses.","The three Emperors, who could only cause limited damage to him, were truly a delicacy in his eyes!","Once he devoured all of their Emperor’s fate energy, he would become a Supreme Emperor without Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body!","“It seems that fate has not forsaken me. It’s only right that I become an Emperor today!” Black Cloud laughed maniacally. A unique suction force swept out with him as the center.","The three Emperors, who were bitterly resisting, had their expressions change when they saw this.","“You two go first. I’ll hold him here,” Daogong suddenly said, his words not allowing for any argument."]},{"number":4992,"title":"Chapter 4992 Destroying Everything","paragraphs":["4992 Destroying Everything","When Yang Jun heard this, he immediately harrumphed heavily and said somewhat angrily, “Old Daogong, what do you mean? You look down on me?”","Daogong nodded without any hesitation. “Yes, I just don’t like you. Staying won’t help much. It’s better to leave quickly.”","“...”","“Old Daogong, you’re shameless. If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have helped your lousy Heavenly Court and let it fend for itself!!”","“You made it seem like you saved him. If you had come a moment later, I would have thought that you were drinking with Zhen Wuyang.”","“Motherf*cker, Old Dog, don’t insult me!!”","...","Seeing that the two Emperors were about to start fighting, Su He, who did not dare to make a sound, finally spoke up to stop them. “Alright, alright. We’ve been brothers for so many years. We have to look at the situation when we quarrel.”","“Su He, don’t pretend to be a good person. It’s because your Heavenly Court’s Great Heavenly Official and Grand Yan Immortals are not of high grade that caused you to lose so badly back then!”","“... Motherf*cker, I’ll fight you right here!”","Black Cloud nearly burst out laughing when he saw the three Emperors fighting amongst themselves. He was overjoyed.","After all, he had been severely injured by Jian Wushuang’s sword strike earlier. No matter how weak the three Emperors were, they could still injure him with the Emperor’s Radiance.","And now, there was nothing better than them fighting amongst themselves. Black Cloud only needed to ambush them from the side and subdue the three Emperors without any effort.","When he thought about how he would be able to devour the three Emperors’ True Souls and fate energy in a short while, Black Cloud could not help but feel excited.","As long as he could absorb all of them, he would be able to tear open the Endless Sea and become a true Imperial Emperor.","Sensing that the chaotic aura around them had relaxed a little, the three Emperors who were fighting suddenly stopped and exchanged glances with each other.","In the next moment, unparalleled Emperor’s Radiance erupted from their bodies. Then, like a shocking rainbow, they directly broke through the chaotic aura and rushed into the Endless Void in the distance.","Black Cloud, who was still watching the battle, turned pale with fright when he saw this scene. He hurriedly turned into an endless chaotic aura and chased after them.","“Run, that guy is catching up!” Daogong shouted, “Yang Jun, quickly stay behind to stop the enemy!”","Yang Jun, who ran faster than the other two Imperial Emperors, did not even turn his head back. “You want me to die for you? That’s wishful thinking. Let’s see who can escape. Old Daogong, don’t worry. I’ll get Wushuang to burn more paper money for you later.”","“Motherf*cker, I’ll eat you alive!!”","...","“You want to leave?”","As an Emperor-to-be, Black Cloud’s strength was still more than enough to deal with the three Emperors’ True Souls even though he had been injured again and again.","He caught up in an instant. His palms suddenly opened up, and endless chaotic aura covered him.","Although he was injured, he had only a True Soul and no physical body, so he reduced the damage of Jian Wushuang’s sword strike to the minimum. Therefore, he was still alive and kicking.","Seeing the chaotic aura that blotted out the sky and covered the earth, Daogong, who was at the back, gritted his teeth and actually stopped. Then, he turned around to face the chaotic aura and released the Emperor’s Radiance with all his might!","He wanted to use his own strength to block this aura and buy time for them to leave.","The magnificent Emperor’s Radiance collided with the chaotic aura, and it was extremely violent.","Daogong was forced back 10,000 feet, and his True Shadow was even a little dim.","However, he still did not take half a step back. He controlled the Emperor’s Radiance to block the chaotic aura.","Just as he was already a little tired and could not block it anymore, two figures and endless Emperor’s Radiance followed suit.","Neither Yang Jun nor Su He left.","“Didn’t I tell you to leave? Why did you stay?” Daogong’s eyes were filled with anxiety as he shouted in a deep voice.","Yang Jun curled his lips. “We’ll leave just because you want us to? You are an Emperor, and we are also Emperors. We are on equal footing. If we leave just like that, wouldn’t it be embarrassing?”","“If we’re leaving, we’ll leave together. If we’re staying, we’ll stay together.” Su He smiled. “Back then, we didn’t even take a step back when the Heavenly Court was destroyed, let alone now.”","“You guys, sigh...” Daogong sighed, but then his gaze became firm. “Alright, then I’ll be reckless for the last time!”","Yang Jun laughed loudly when he heard this. “That’s right. How would this stinking junior dare to go against the Emperor?”","The three Emperors laughed loudly at the same time.","The chaotic aura was also torn apart by the Emperor’s Radiance. Black Cloud quickly retreated and looked at them with extreme vigilance.","The three Emperors stepped forward slowly, looking at Black Cloud with disdain.","“A lowly Grand Yan Immortal like you is worthy of comprehending the fate energy of an Emperor?” Daogong said angrily, “Don’t disgrace the name of the Emperor. If my Heavenly Court was still around, the first person I would kill would be you.”","When Black Cloud heard this, he laughed strangely. “You should worry about yourselves. Only by becoming one with me will you not have to struggle to survive.”","“You think you can be compared to us?” Yang Jun was disdainful. He took a step forward, and layers of Emperor’s Radiance circulated around his body.","At this moment, the three of them seemed to have returned to the clouds and become the masters of the Heavenly Court.","Three Emperors were enough to destroy everything.","Even if the celestial river was cut off and the Heavens shattered, it still could not change the fact that they were real Emperors.","Even though Black Cloud was an Emperor-to-be, he still felt fear when facing a real Emperor.","It was a deep-seated fear that came from the suppression of his bloodline.","“Back then, I was not even afraid of Zhen Wuyang, let alone a bug like you!” Su He said loudly, “Today, I will destroy everything once again!”","At this moment, the three Emperors returned to their original state.","An unparalleled Emperor’s Radiance shone out, destroying everything in its path.","Black Cloud did not dare to be arrogant. Even if he was certain that he had them in his grasp, he did not dare to slack off.","With that in mind, a huge Chaotic Emperor’s Throne materialized behind him once again. It carried an unimaginable power as it crashed towards the three Emperors.","In the void of silence, a world-shaking power erupted again.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne swept over with a chaotic aura, devouring the Emperor’s Radiance that was spreading out.","Black Cloud, who had swallowed countless Grand Yan Immortals to get to where he was today, it was not a problem for him to swallow the Emperor’s Radiance. He stood in the void, his stomach rolling as he swallowed in an unimaginable manner.","However, the three Emperors were not to be underestimated. They were terrifying existences who could fight against Emperor Zhen Wuyang in the Ancient Era. Even so, they were still powerful even though they were only left with their True Souls.","They had experienced the destruction of Heavenly Court, millions of Yan Immortals as enemies, walking out of the blood sea of Immortal Corpses. They were not afraid at all.","This puny guy was just an Emperor-to-be. To them, he was not worthy. He was indeed beneath them."]},{"number":4993,"title":"Chapter 4993 Emperor! Emperor!","paragraphs":["4993 Emperor! Emperor!","The Emperor’s Radiance shone, and chaos descended.","Facing the chaotic Emperor’s Throne, the three Emperors did not take a single step back. Even though their Emperor’s Radiance was suppressed and they were forced back, they were still suppressing the chaotic aura at a rapid pace.","Black Cloud grew increasingly panicked. He had thought that he had already devoured the three Emperors’ True Souls. However, as time passed and his strength continued to diminish, he began to panic.","If he did not devour them in a short period of time, there would probably be another change!","Thinking of this, Black Cloud roared angrily and controlled the huge Chaotic Emperor’s Throne to smash down.","When the Emperor’s Throne exploded, he opened his arms and unleashed an unimaginable power.","Endless chaotic aura condensed behind him and transformed into an ugly and magnificent supreme face.","The giant face was extremely ugly. Its mouth took up almost two-thirds of the entire face. When it appeared, it opened its mouth and released a strong suction force.","Under this suction force, even the Emperor’s Radiance could not withstand it. Some of it shattered, and even the void was devoured by the giant face.","The true souls of the three Emperors, who had been struggling to resist, were truly at their wits’ end at this moment.","“Hurry up and leave. There’s no need for everyone to stay here!” Daogong said in a deep voice, ” Don’t forget, if we all stay here, how are we going to find that old man Zhen Wuyang to take revenge?”","“Yang Jun should leave. He’s the worst,” Su He said loudly.","Yang Jun immediately felt extremely ashamed and indignant. “Why? You dare to mock me? Then I won’t leave today. I’ll let you see who’s the worse one!”","As soon as he finished speaking, endless Emperor’s Radiance burst forth from his palm, even overshadowing Su He and Daogong for a moment.","A moment later, Daogong said in a deep voice, “Su He, Yang Jun, you guys go first. I’ll stay behind and hold on for a while. Don’t destroy our last True Souls here.”","“Yes, let’s go... We have to see if we can escape...” Yang Jun’s face flushed red as he tried his best to stop the chaotic aura from corroding him.","Daogong did not say anything else. While Yang Jun and Su He were fully focused, he directly sent the two of them flying thousands of feet away with a palm strike, allowing them to leave this chaotic encirclement.","“Hurry up and leave. Don’t take a step back. If anyone takes a step back, I, Daogong, will shatter their True Soul on the spot!” he shouted angrily, filled with unquestionable determination.","At this moment, Yang Jun and Su He were stunned. They could not speak and could not regain their senses for a long time.","“Hurry up and leave!” Daogong was already an arrow at the end of its flight, and the endless Emperor’s Radiance was about to be devoured by the chaotic aura.","“Old, old dog, we...” Yang Jun muttered.","Su He did not wait for him to finish his words. He grabbed him and flew into the void far away. In an instant, he disappeared without a trace.","Black Cloud panicked when he saw this. He would never let them escape.","“You want to chase after them? Get past me first, little bug.” Daogong laughed loudly and controlled the Emperor’s Radiance to block his path.","“You’re courting death!” Black Cloud was furious, and he swung his palm down.","Daogong responded, but he was already extremely weak and could not deal with it effectively. The last layer of Emperor’s Radiance was destroyed.","Then, Black Cloud controlled the chaotic aura and turned it into a huge palm that grabbed him.","Daogong was still laughing loudly, and his gaze toward Black Cloud was still filled with disdain. “Being controlled by you is really damaging my dignity.”","After he finished speaking, he broke the Emperor’s True Soul without any hesitation.","Black Cloud smiled strangely. The ugly face behind him opened its mouth and swallowed Daogong, preventing him from shattering his True Soul.","An Emperor’s True Soul fell into his stomach, and he trembled with excitement. He could clearly feel the increase in his strength.","As long as he devoured the other two, he would be able to enter to truly enter the Emperor’s cultivation realm!","After figuring this out, his body directly disintegrated into thousands of chaotic auras and disappeared into the void.","“Su He, the old man’s aura is gone.”","In the void, Yang Jun suddenly stopped and turned around to look at the endless void.","Su He also stopped in his tracks, loneliness flashing in the depths of his eyes.","“So, he’s gone too?”","Yang Jun slowly closed his eyes, his voice low and hoarse. “Su He, I’m tired.”","“We can’t be tired. We still have things to do!” Su He suddenly opened his eyes. “We still have to find Zhen Wuyang to take revenge for Daogong!”","“Do we still have a chance?”","Su He was stunned. He thought of Jian Wushuang in his divine thoughts and nodded heavily. “Of course. As long as we don’t die, everything can be done!”","Yang Jun’s eyes gradually became clear. “Then let’s leave this place and make plans in the future.”","As his voice fell, Black Cloud’s figure suddenly appeared in the void.","“You want to leave? How can I bear to let you leave? Go into my stomach!” He let out a strange laugh and waved his hand to summon a chaotic cage.","The cage pressed down and completely surrounded the two Emperors.","Yang Jun looked at Su He with bitterness in his eyes. “We really can’t leave this time.”","Black Cloud laughed maniacally, and the giant face behind him opened its mouth wide and swallowed.","Yang Jun and Su He only felt the Emperor’s Radiance around their bodies rapidly fade away. Even their True Souls began to dim.","“This is really unpleasant. If I had known this would happen, I would have died together with Zhen Wuyang.”","Su He shook his head and sighed.","Yang Jun sighed slightly. There was nothing he could do.","To die in this nameless place, in the hands of a nameless person, was truly a disgrace to be called an Emperor. However, there was nothing he could do.","However, the scene he had imagined did not happen. In the next moment, the huge Chaos Cage actually exploded and shattered without any warning!","Yang Jun and Su He were both shocked. They subconsciously looked at the place where the cage had been broken, their eyes filled with disbelief.","“W-Wushuang?!”","As the endless chaotic aura retreated, Jian Wushuang drew his sword with his hand and stepped on the air!","The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens emitted a sky blue intent. On his naked chest, unimaginable ancient fate energy flowed.","Behind him stood Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Fu Yao.","They were supposed to leave, but now they all returned.","But at this moment, Yang Jun and Su He looked at Jian Wushuang with disbelief and shock.","They could clearly feel the terrifying and familiar ancient fate energy flowing from Jian Wushuang.","That kind of fate energy was the fate energy of an Imperial Emperor!","Jian Wushuang carried the Emperor’s fate energy!","Not only did they feel it, even Black Cloud felt it. The fear in his eyes had reached an extreme level.","He, who had lost all his fate energy and was dead, had actually come back to life in less than half a day?!","This was simply unimaginable."]},{"number":4994,"title":"Chapter 4994 Pulling Out the Emperor’s Bone","paragraphs":["4994 Pulling Out the Emperor’s Bone","What was even more unimaginable was that Jian Wushuang’s body was flowing with Emperor’s fate energy!","Even Black Cloud, who was an Emperor-to-be, could not envelop his body with the Emperor’s fate energy.","Only a true Emperor could do it.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang did it. Not only did he do it, but he also released Emperor’s Radiance directly.","Black Cloud was so frightened that he could not speak. Even if he did not believe it, this scene had really appeared in front of him.","That mere Yan Immortal who had single-handedly injured him with a single sword strike, at this moment, actually possessed the fate energy of an Emperor and became an Emperor.","‘Run!’ This was the only thought left in Black Cloud’s mind. Ever since he had grown up, he had never been willing to do anything too risky.","For example, Jian Wushuang was too strange. As an expert only in the Yan Immortal realm, he had created too many shocking occurrences.","Even he, who was an Emperor-to-be, felt his heart tremble when he saw Jian Wushuang.","Thinking of this, Black Cloud no longer hesitated. He leaped forward and wanted to escape.","However, Jian Wushuang, who had the Emperor’s fate energy and his eyes were intimidating, snorted coldly, “You want to leave?”","At this moment, the power of heaven and earth was under his feet. An unimaginable Emperor’s Heavenly Dao pressed down and smashed into Black Cloud.","Black Cloud was shocked. He fled in a panic, but no matter what, he could not escape the control of the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","In just an instant, he was firmly pressed down by the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao. No matter how many transformations he had, he could not escape at all.","Seeing him effortlessly capture Black Cloud, Yang Jun and Su He were so shocked that their jaws almost dropped to the ground.","Initially, they did not believe that Jian Wushuang carried the Emperor’s fate energy, but now they all believed it.","Not only the two Imperial Emperors, but the two Sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan, as well as Di Qing and Immortal Fu Yao, were also shocked.","Before they could figure out what was going on, they saw Jian Wushuang become an Emperor and then grab Black Cloud.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan looked at each other and saw the bitterness in each other’s eyes.","The disciple they had forcefully acknowledged had already far exceeded their expectations.","Jian Wushuang, who was carrying a thick Emperor fate energy, waved his hand gently across the air. Black Cloud, which was suppressed by the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao, was forced to come in front of him.","Facing the fate energy of a True Emperor, Black Cloud was terrified to the extreme. He was only an Emperor-to-be, how could he dare to resist a True Emperor?","At this moment, Jian Wushuang seemed to have changed into a different person. His eyes were full of dignity and no emotion.","And all of this was because of the True Emperor.","Previously, Emperor Zhenwu had captured a wisp of Jian Wushuang’s True Soul and hid it in the ring to prevent him from dying.","Jian Wushuang did not listen to his warning and insisted on saving the Three Emperors, Jiang Li, and Yan Fan.","Left with no other choice, Emperor Zhen Wu wanted to use his Emperor’s fate energy to make him suffer.","However, he did not expect that Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body could perfectly match his Emperor’s fate energy without any rejection.","While Emperor Zhen Wu was surprised, he agreed to help Jian Wushuang. He injected the Emperor’s fate energy into Jian Wushuang’s body as long as his Immortal body could withstand it.","That was why Jian Wushuang had become an Emperor in a short period of time.","The first thing Jian Wushuang did after becoming an Emperor was to find Black Cloud and seal him.","Sensing the Imperial Lord’s fate that was like an arm, he looked at the black clouds in front of him and was about to kill them with a wave of his hand.","However, at this moment, Yang Jun and Su He said anxiously at the same time, ” Wait, Wushuang, Daogong is still in his stomach.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Black Cloud again.","Black Cloud trembled. “Let me go. I’m willing to return him.”","He smiled contemptuously and started dissecting the body himself.","“No, you can’t. I promise you, I’ll return him immediately..”","However, it was too late. Jian Wushuang used his hand as a sword and slashed open his stomach!","In an instant, the void trembled. Endless chaotic aura surged out, and it was extremely chaotic.","However, the chaos was destroyed by Jian Wushuang’s palm.","He was already too terrifying with the Emperor’s fate energy. Even the Emperor-to-be Black Cloud could only be slaughtered.","As the chaotic aura gushed out, a true soul that had almost become transparent came out.","That True Soul was Daogong.","Yang Jun and Su He immediately pounced over and laughed as he patted Daogong, who was still in a daze. “Old thing, congratulations on not leaving before us.”","“Eh? I haven’t died yet. That shouldn’t be. I remember that I was clearly dead...” Daogong scratched his head.","“If it wasn’t for Little Friend Wushuang, you would have died long ago,” Yang Jun slapped him and scolded.","Daogong reacted and looked at Jian Wushuang. His eyes almost popped out, “Damn, how long have I been sleeping? Wushuang has become an Emperor?!”","“Not long, you only slept for less than half a day.”","“W-What?!”","...","He used the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao to tear open Black Cloud’s stomach. His remaining Emperor’s fate energy and chaotic aura were all destroyed. He was on the verge of death, as if he could die at any moment.","But even so, he still used all his strength to say, “Let, let me go. I’ll disappear from here...”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly as if he had heard the funniest thing.","Everything that had happened today was caused by the black clouds. Jiang Li and Yan Fan were almost on the verge of death, and the three Emperors had almost lost their True Souls to save him.","Even he himself would have perished if not for the True Martial Emperor’s help.","Therefore, Black Cloud must die today. Even if he was the Quasi-Emperor, he would not be able to escape death!","With Emperor Real Martial’s luck, Jian Wushuang had the power to suppress Black Cloud.","Looking at Black Cloud whose stomach had been cut open and was on the verge of death, he was prepared to kill him with a palm strike.","However, just as he waved his hand, his gaze pierced through the hazy black fog and saw something emitting a rainbow halo in the belly of the black cloud.","Jian Wushuang did not know what it was, but he subconsciously pulled it out of Black Cloud’s body.","Black Cloud’s eyes instantly dimmed, and his ethereal Immortal body was also rapidly being destroyed.","As soon as this item appeared, it immediately began to shine with a brilliant light that covered billions of kilometers. All colors dimmed.","It was a lustrous ink-black bone the length of an arm!","The indescribable mysterious runes seemed to have been flowing since ancient times, making those who heard it have the urge to worship.","The three Imperial Emperors who were watching from afar had a change in expression. They could not help but say in unison, “The Emperor Bone?!”"]},{"number":4995,"title":"Chapter 4995 Emperor-To-Be Self-Destruct","paragraphs":["4995 Emperor-To-Be Self-Destruct","The Emperor’s Bone.","It was the symbol of a peak Grand Yan Immortal ascending to the throne and controlling the Emperor’s Radiance.","Once the Emperor’s Bone was formed, it meant that the path to becoming an Emperor had been opened.","This was the bone of an Emperor, which was on par with the Emperor’s Radiance and the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao. To Emperors, it was an existence that was exclusive to them!","The three Emperors had not expected that Black Cloud would have already formed the Emperor’s Bone.","If he had not been too greedy and offended Jian Wushuang, which led to the series of wars, he would have established the Heavenly Court and become an Emperor in less than five Hua Years!","However, there were no ifs. He could only suffer the consequences of his actions.","Black Cloud, who had his bone extracted, wailed in grief, his voice shaking the void.","“Give it back to me, give it back to me!” He went completely mad and reached out to grab Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang, who was surrounded by the Emperor’s fate energy, was not someone he could touch. Almost at the same time, the Emperor’s fate energy shattered his arms.","After losing the Emperor’s Bone and having his arms severed by the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao, Black Cloud fell into despair.","Even if Jian Wushuang did not kill him now, losing the Emperor’s Bone meant that he would never be able to become an Emperor.","Looking at the black jade Emperor’s Bone in his hand, which was as long as an arm, Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment. He did not destroy it but put it into the Boyang Bottle.","After losing the Emperor’s Bone, Black Cloud’s face turned ashen. His Emperor’s fate energy began to dissipate, and his image without an immortal body gradually dimmed.","Seeing that there was nothing he could do, he was in complete despair. Then, his black pupils suddenly emitted a destructive aura.","Jian Wushuang sensed that something was wrong and hurriedly stretched out his hand to kill him.","However, a strange scene appeared. When the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao smashed toward Black Cloud, it was suddenly blocked by a layer of invisible and substantial fluctuations, and it could not advance an inch further.","Black Cloud swept away the panic from before and replaced it with madness and destruction.","At the same time, the chaotic aura that had almost completely disappeared rushed out from his open stomach again.","“I am an Emperor. Who can kill me?! I can only die in my own hands!” he roared.","“Those who want to kill me have already become a part of me. Today, even if I am destroyed, I drag you, all of you, the entire Endless Sea, down to be buried with me!”","As soon as he finished speaking, a chaotic aura that could not be resisted and stopped completely erupted.","The three Emperors were the first to react. When they sensed the unstable fluctuations, they shouted anxiously, “Little Friend Wushuang, run! He’s destroying his own fate energy!”","Jian Wushuang also sensed what Black Cloud was thinking, but he did not leave. Instead, he looked at Black Cloud calmly with disdain in his eyes.","“Be buried with me. It’s worth it to be able to drag you along with me at this last moment.”He smiled viciously, and all his aura entered an irreversible state of destruction.","Jian Wushuang didn’t panic when he saw this. He looked down at the insects with disdain.","Even though Black Cloud’s death was extremely tragic, he was still an Emperor-to-be.","It was unimaginable for an Emperor-to-be to die before his death.","Among all the Immortal Lords and Sword Immortals present, only the three Imperial Lords ‘true souls had experienced the fall of an Emperor. Therefore, they were the most nervous.","Even if it was an Emperor-to-be, they could not withstand the power of his own destiny.","As Sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan knew the severity of this situation. Without thinking, they rushed to Jian Wushuang’s side and released a powerful Energy Diffraction Barrier.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan, who had each taken a Martial Monarch Realm pill and had recovered 90% of their injuries, still stood in front of him.","The supreme aura gradually faded away and Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with warmth. Then, he stretched out his hand and used the Emperor’s Heaven Way to push the two Sword Immortals behind him.","“Wushuang, don’t be careless, let’s go together!”Yan Fan said in a serious voice, a little anxious.","Jian Wushuang nodded and faced them. He released all the Emperor’s fate energy in his body to protect them.","At this moment, the three Imperial Emperors, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Fuyao were all protected.","The destruction of the Emperor-to-be self-destruct had completely begun.","The shattered Banished City and the Sky Continent Realm instantly turned into nothingness!","The endless Endless Sea collapsed hundreds of millions of feet at this moment, like an abyss.","Under the destructive aura, the shattered void also collapsed into an ancient, pale void.","The energy released by the Emperor-to-be’s self-destruction was too terrifying. In an instant, it covered countless sea areas and destroyed everything.","The void tumbled backward, and the Endless Sea collapsed. Under this destruction, even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal did not have any confidence in surviving!","The destructive aura spread for billions of miles, but Jian Wushuang was sure that if it was in the outside world, it could wipe out millions of Heavenly Regions and countless suns in an instant.","This was too terrifying. The final self-destruction of an Emperor-to-be was definitely enough to turn a corner of the Great Heavenly Region into ruins.","Jian Wushuang grunted and his face turned red.","Then, he turned his back to them and looked at the void that had already turned into nothingness.","As he turned around, a large amount of divine blood gushed out of his seven orifices at the same time. Even his exposed Immortal body cracked.","In the end, he had underestimated Emperor-to-be Black Cloud’s self-destruction, but there was nothing he could do.","The Emperor’s fate energy that the True Zhen Wu had left in his body had already been exhausted. There was no way it could support him to do anything.","Therefore, he decided to use the last trace of Imperial Lord Fate in his body to form a fate energy barrier to protect them.","However, as a part of the providence barrier, nearly 70 percent of the destructive aura hit Jian Wushuang.","Under the pressure from the inside and outside, if it was not for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, his immortal body would have shattered and he would have died on the spot.","The endless destructive aura continued, but Jian Wushuang did not take a step back. The divine blood that spurted out of his seven orifices evaporated before it landed on the ground.","As a part of the providence barrier, he could only hold on bitterly and could not retreat. Once he retreated, all the people he had to protect behind him would no longer exist.","Jiang Li noticed something was wrong. She could not bear it and wanted to resist together.","However, Yan Fan immediately held her down and shook his head slightly.","Jian Wushuang was an Emperor the moment he stood in front of them. Even a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal could not touch him.","At this moment, even if his Immortal body was destroyed, he was still an unquestionable Emperor!","In the state of Yan Immortal, he was comparable to an Emperor.","His clothes were torn apart, and his immortal body, bones, and blood were reduced to nothingness. Even the last trace of Emperor’s fate energy had left him.","In the end, everything gradually quieted down as the destructive aura slowly dissipated."]},{"number":4996,"title":"Chapter 4996 Divine Thought Revival","paragraphs":["4996 Divine Thought Revival","Jiang Li could not hold it in anymore and rushed forward.","Yan Fan did not stop them and went forward together.","Di Qing and the three Emperors reached out their hands together to hold Jian Wushuang, who was falling from the sky.","Other than his chest which was protected by the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, he was almost like a skeleton, and he was already on the verge of death.","However, they were slightly relieved when they saw that. As long as Jian Wushuang was still breathing, he would definitely wake up.","Di Qing took out an Emperor-grade pill from his bosom and stuffed it into his mouth.","The pill entered his throat and turned into a clear spring that flowed to his limbs and bones.","Every clear spring was rapidly repairing the broken meridians, completely repairing any damage.","The three Emperors who were holding Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body held their breaths as they watched the great opportunity.","As Emperor Liu Ya’s treasured Emperor-grade pills, they had already reached a rather terrifying level.","Even an existence like Jiang Li and Yan Fan could defend their Life Source instantly after swallowing half of it, let alone Jian Wushuang.","Within a few seconds, Jian Wushuang’s broken Immortal body was completely repaired.","However, he did not wake up from his deep sleep.","Di Qing frowned. This was the first time he had encountered such a situation.","Jian Wushuang’s recovery ability had already reached an unimaginable level. He was almost alive and kicking when he was on the verge of death.","But this time, his Immortal body had completely recovered, but he did not wake up.","Di Qing panicked and wanted to reach out to check on him. However, the three Emperors were one step ahead of him. They released a warm Emperor’s Radiance to envelop Jian Wushuang.","“That kind of luck from before is not something he can withstand. Even if a rank nine Grand Yan Immortal wanted to withstand it, he would only end up exploding and dying.”","Dao Gong said slowly, “I don’t know where Wushuang borrowed that fate energy, nor do I know how he endured it. However, the consequences have just begun.”","“Once he can’t withstand the void in his divine sense, what awaits him is death.”","When he said that, they all sucked in a breath of cold air.","When Yang Jun heard this, he hurriedly said angrily, “Daogong, you old man, stop pretending to be mysterious. Little Friend Wushuang is definitely fine. He is just too tired and needs to rest.”","Daogong only sighed slightly and did not bicker.","Yang Jun and Su He’s hearts sank when they saw him like this. They knew that Daogong was right.","Absorbing the fate energy of an Emperor with his Yan Immortal body was simply unimaginable.","Even if Jian Wushuang could kill a Grand Yan Immortal and his Immortal body was unimaginably strong, it was impossible for him to absorb the Emperor’s fate energy and turn it into his own.","However, all of this happened. Jian Wushuang had perfectly absorbed the Emperor’s fate energy given to him by Emperor Zhen Wu and successfully suppressed Emperor-to-be Black Cloud.","However, just as Daogong said, the consequences had just begun.","With the protection of the Emperor’s Radiance, Jian Wushuang’s face was calm and there was no trace of pain.","Di Qing’s expression was solemn. Then, as if he had thought of something, he hurriedly took out a palm-sized strange fruit that was flowing with fate energy.","“This is a Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit that can allow Wushuang to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal. If I let him eat it, can he survive?”","Seeing the Dao Fruit in his hand, Yan Fan subconsciously said its name, “Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit?!”","Di Qing was slightly startled before looking at the three Emperors hopefully.","However, Yan Fan immediately shook his head. “This Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit is useless to Wushuang. He ate one earlier, but I can’t be sure. However, I’m afraid it’s really useless at this critical moment.”","Daogong also spoke at this moment, “I’m afraid all external forces are useless. Wushuang can only wake up after she passes the test of divine sense.”","Di Qing’s heart sank when he heard this.","Divine thought was a mysterious thing, and it was difficult to figure it out. Naturally, external forces could not provide any help.","One had to know that even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal would be troubled by divine thought.","They all suspected that Jian Wushuang’s divine thought was weak.","However, their guess was wrong. When Jian Wushuang was in the Divine Power Universe, his divine thoughts had already reached a perfect state.","Even when he was facing Emperor Liu Ya’s words that the Emperor Liu Ya had left in his mind, he had not suffered any damage.","Just as they were deep in thought, Jian Wushuang, who had been in a coma, quietly opened his eyes.","Immortal Lord Fu Yao was the first to notice and exclaimed, “He’s awake, he’s awake! He’s awake!”","The three Emperors, Jiang Li, and Yan Fan were overjoyed. Jian Wushuang had indeed woken up!","“How long have I been sleeping?” Jian Wushuang sat up straight and stretched his body, causing his joints to crack.","“Less than half a day. Little Friend Wushuang, your recovery speed is too terrifying,” Daogong said in shock.","Yang Jun, who was standing at the side, immediately blew his beard and glared, “I knew that this old thing would not say anything good. Little Friend Wushuang, remember, don’t save this guy in the future.”","“You’re full of nonsense. I was planning for the worst, understand? Even a Rank Nine Great Evolution Immortal would not be able to withstand the kind of injuries that Little friend Wushuang’s had gotten!”","...","Jian Wushuang stood up, not knowing whether to laugh or cry when he heard the three Emperors’ True Souls clashing with each other.","He smiled when he saw Jiang Li and Yan Fan looking at him passionately.","Yan Fan looked at Jian Wushuang carefully and patted his shoulder. “Good boy.”","Jiang Li was back to her usual cool and serious self, but her eyes were much gentler now.","In the end, Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and smiled.","Di Qing raised his eyebrows slightly. Then, he raised the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit in his hand, which emitted a rich Great Dao fate energy, and shook it.","“It seems that you’ve given the Immortal Giant Tree a beating.” Jian Wushuang laughed.","He smiled too. “It seems that the tree did tell on you.”","“I got some information about you from the Immortal Tree, and then I came.”","Di Qing walked up to Jian Wushuang and said sincerely, “Thank you. I don’t know how I can repay you.”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang put his arm around his shoulder and laughed. “Let’s not talk about this. It’s all in the past.”","Di Qing smiled knowingly and reached out to pass the Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit to him. “Find some time to eat it. This is very likely the opportunity to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal.”","“I know. After leaving this place, I’ll absorb it.”","Seeing this scene, Yang Jun stretched lazily. “I’m finally free. My old bones can’t take it anymore.”","Su He laughed loudly. “Daogong, you were right. That old fellow Yang Jun is indeed the weakest of the three of us.”","“Don’t talk nonsense. Back then, when I was still in the Heavenly Court, which one of you dare face me...”"]},{"number":4997,"title":"Chapter 4997 Great Chaos","paragraphs":["4997 Great Chaos","Emperor-to-be Black Cloud had fallen. With his Heavenly Continent Plane as the center, the destructive aura had spread in all directions.","The sky had completely turned into a void of silence. It was so pale that no one could sense the birth of any power.","The Endless Sea, which had also collapsed, had completely recovered, leaving no traces behind.","It was unknown how much of the Sea Area would be affected by the destruction of the Emperor-to-be fate energy. However, Jian Wushuang’s initial guess was that the Sea Area would be so vast that it was beyond imagination.","Who knew how many Grand Yan Immortals would die from this shockwave. These were not problems that he should be considering now.","Now that Di Qing had been found, it was time for this treacherous journey to the Endless Sea to end.","However, Jian Wushuang still had a headache.","Firstly, it was about how to leave. Secondly, it was about the Emperor Zhen Wu in the ring.","Initially, he was able to enter the Endless Sea because of the help of the Young Emperor and the effect of the golden jade ring.","Jian Wushuang felt that the golden jade ring in his hand should still be able to open the passage to the Endless Sea. However, he did not know how to open it.","But now, he was not in a hurry to leave the Endless Sea. Instead, he was thinking about something, something that concerned whether they could survive.","Except for Jian Wushuang himself, no one knew that there was an Emperor watching over them.","And that Emperor was precisely the most terrifying existence.","It was also because Jian Wushuang borrowed his power that he could see how terrifying he was.","Emperor Zhen Wu, who was sleeping in the Heavenly Palace on the White Bone Path under the Myriad Immortal Blood and Bones River, was the most terrifying existence he had ever seen other than Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","Moreover, it was very likely that he was at his peak and did not suffer any injuries.","Because of this, Jian Wushuang was worried that if he brought him out of the Endless Ocean, he would be involved in a turmoil.","However, these were still small matters. What he was really worried about was that Emperor Zhen Wu would suddenly erupt and slaughter them all.","Even someone as strong as Jiang Li and Yan Fan could only wait for death when facing an Emperor. This was too risky.","“Perhaps...”","Jian Wushuang had already thought of another direction, but he quickly stopped and his back was covered in cold sweat.","He remembered that Emperor Zhen Wu could see through the thoughts of the Yan Immortal. If he were to detect any devious thoughts, he would probably be broken by the neck before he could even leave the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and prepared to leave.","The three Emperors entered the Boyang Bottle again. Beside them were Jiang Li and Yan Fan, the two strongest Sword Immortals, Di Qing, who had terrifying strength, and Immortal Lord Fuyao, who was a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","This kind of foundation was enough to conquer any plane in the Endless Sea!","After all, it was almost impossible to have an Emperor-to-be in the future.","When Jian Wushuang and the others left, the eternal void fell silent.","This place was filled with chaos, the unknown and desolation, even if a rank six Grand Yan Immortal accidentally entered this place, they would definitely get lost.","After an unknown amount of time, when waves of ripples appeared on the completely silent sea surface, two figures stepped into this place.","If Jian Wushuang had seen these two figures, he would have been shocked. They were none other than his old acquaintances from the previous Heavenly Continent Plane.”","Bian Ziyuan and the Young Prince.","They stepped into the eternal void, and the Young Prince at the front stretched out his hand and released a mysterious light. Some unknown fate energy flowed out.","With the flow of this unknown fate, everything seemed to be slowly going back in time.","The Young Prince’s face turned pale rapidly.","At the same time, in the eternal void, the stars finally condensed together, and it turned into Black Cloud without a specific shape!","“Uhh... I didn’t die?”","“You’re already dead, but I revived you.”","“You, why did you do this?”","“Because my subordinates need you. I can revive you, so I naturally have a way to kill you. Therefore, from the moment you revive, you can only be loyal to me.”","“And as a reward, I can promise you that the Yan Immortal you want to kill will eventually kneel at your feet.”","...","As he continued to move forward, Jian Wushuang became more and more shocked. The area affected by the eternal void was far wider than he had imagined.","Even with their full speed, they still had not left the chaotic Sea Area.","One had to know that they could pass through a Heavenly Region in a few breaths, and what they saw was still a chaotic and empty sea.","This showed how terrifying the fate energy of an Emperor-to-be was.","When the pale void sky was replaced by a dark sky, they were finally free from the shockwave.","Since Di Qing had been found, there was no point in staying in the Endless Sea. However, Jian Wushuang did not dare to imagine what would happen after he left.","He was afraid that once the passageway opened, Emperor Zhen Wu, who was hiding in the ring, would suddenly kill them all.","After all, Jian Wushuang still remembered Emperor Zhen Wu’s unconcealed killing intent.","Now, he would dawdle as long as he could, preparing to think of a complete method before he planned to leave.","At this moment, Yan Fan, who was at the side, also asked, “Wushuang, now that you found your friend, how do you plan to get out?”","This was a difficult question, but Jian Wushuang had to answer. He quickly said, “I’m trying to find the entrance based on my memory. Once I find it, it’s time to go out.”","“Is that so? You still remember the location of the entrance?” What?” Yan Fan was surprised. He wanted to ask more, but Jiang Li slapped him on the head.","“Don’t ask so many questions that you shouldn’t ask.”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. He was not sure if Emperor Zhen Wu, who was hiding in the ring, could hear their conversation. Therefore, he could only try his best not to reveal any information.","Finding the original entrance was just a lie that Jian Wushuang made up. When he entered the Endless Sea, the passage had already been completely closed and there was no possibility of it opening again.","Even if the passageway opened again, he would have no chance of finding his way back. In this Endless Sea that had almost no markings, returning to his original position was no different from a fool’s dream.","The only thing he could do now was to continue moving forward and find a way to prevent Emperor Zhen Wu from killing them.","While Jian Wushuang was thinking about this problem, he continued to lead them forward.","This Endless Sea was boundless, and there was no need to worry about reaching the end.","Because there was no end."]},{"number":4998,"title":"Chapter 4998 Super Heavenly Continent","paragraphs":["4998 Super Heavenly Continent","In this final moment, he had to think of a foolproof plan to save his life.","As long as Emperor Zhen Wu did not attack him, this journey would be considered over.","As for now, he could not leave for the time being. As long as he was in the Endless Sea, he would be safe.","During this period of time, he was also thinking about something.","How did the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens Chang Duoling escape from the Endless Sea?","This was his confusion.","One had to know that there were even terrifying existences like the Quasi-Emperor and actual Imperial Emperor in the Endless Sea. The lowest level was the initial-stage Grand Yan Immortals.","When Chang Duoling was exiled to the Endless Sea, he was only an initial-stage Grand Yan Immortal. How did he survive and escape from this extremely harsh environment?","‘Did he know something? Or did he find the crack in the Endless Sea?’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","However, Chang Duoling had already died, so there was no answer. However, Jian Wushuang was certain that there would be a crack in the Endless Sea that could lead him to the outside world.","If he could find this crack, he might be able to save himself the trouble of thinking of other ways to leave this place.","After all, without the help of the Young Emperor, Jian Wushuang was still worried that he would not be able to open the passage with only the golden jade ring.","After leaving the sea area destroyed by Emperor-to-be Black Cloud, Jian Wushuang brought Jiang Liyan back. Di Qing and Immortal Lord Fu Yao continued to move forward and stopped at some point.","Along the way, Immortal Lord Fu Yao, who had a good figure, pressed tightly against him. Di Qing was already speechless. He wanted to flare up several times, but he remembered that she was here to help and could only endure it.","However, towards the end, Di Qing felt a chill down his spine as he looked at Immortal Lord Fu Yao. She seemed to be unable to hold back her passion and was ready to fuse with his bloodline at any moment.","He could no longer care about her face and said, “I say, shouldn’t you leave?”","“What? You want to chase me away?” Immortal Lord Fu Yao recovered from her passion, and there was only disappointment in her eyes.","Di Qing was speechless. He knew that he had said something wrong, so he could only stutter, “No, that’s not it. What I want to say is that perhaps you can go back and see if anything has happened to your Heavenly Continent.”","Upon hearing this, Immortal Lord Fu Yao beamed with joy. “It’s alright. They can protect themselves. If they can’t, then it’s useless for me to go. I’m not going anywhere now. I’ll just follow you.”","Di Qingxin looked at Jian Wushuang for help.","However, Jian Wushuang could not hold back his laughter and sent a voice transmission to him, “You’ve been alone for so many years. It’s not impossible for you to have a moment of peace.”","Sensing Di Qing’s resentful gaze, Jian Wushuang turned serious and flew forward.","“Miss, please have some self-respect.”","“Don’t call me Miss, it makes me seem distant. You can just call me Fu Yao.”","...","The border of the sea realm was still boundless. If the Grand Yan Immortal who was exiled here did not find a place to rest, then he would definitely be lost in the sea realm and become the nourishment of the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang also began to understand that all the continents in the Endless Sea were formed from the corpses of Yan Immortals.","Furthermore, he guessed that during the Ancient Era, when Zhen Wuyang proclaimed himself Emperor, he definitely did not just exile Grand Yan Immortals here. There must be a lot of Yan Immortals too.","But now, the reason why he had not seen a Yan Immortal in the Endless Sea was already clear.","The Heavenly Continent Plane where the Grand Yan Immortal rested was paved with the bones of the Yan Immortals.","The reason why the Great Si Region, which included countless Heavenly Regions, had so few Grand Yan Immortal.","It was now clear that all the Grand Yan Immortals had already been exiled by Zhen Wuyang into the Endless Sea.","Although it was just a few words, the tragic and bloody intent contained in it was absolutely unforgettable.","The strength of the Grand Yan Immortals who could survive in the Endless Sea had also declined to a certain level. They were no longer the great warriors from back then.","They were living in the wrong era, and their endless lifespan had become a real cage for them.","After this journey, Jian Wushuang had a new understanding of Zhen Wuyang. Being able to banish so many Grand Yan Immortals here was enough to prove how terrifying he was in the Ancient Era.","He finally understood the meaning behind the words that Emperor Liu Ya had said before his death.","Zhen Wuyang was terrifying.","If he were to be his opponent, even an Emperor would have to pay the price of losing all of their Emperor’s Fate Energy.","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart and continued forward.","With 3 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals and two Sword Immortal companions as their guarantee, it was difficult for any of the Heavenly Continent Planes in the Endless Ocean to be a match for them.","The Sea Area was quiet, but as they continued to advance, Jian Wushuang and the others became vigilant.","Because he discovered that there was a breath of life that could not be ignored.","This was really too strange, because, in this Endless Sea, it was impossible for such life and fate energy to exist.","However, the next scene happened to clear their doubts.","In front of the boundless deathly stillness, a real Heavenly Continent Plane unfolded in front of them.","The Heavenly Continent was so huge that Jian Wushuang could directly tell that the Heavenly Continent was bigger than anything he had seen before.","Even Emperor-to-be Black Cloud’s Heavenly Continent Plane could not compare to it. The Heavenly Continent Plane controlled by Immortal Lord Fu Yao was even more insignificant in front of this one.","This was a Heavenly Continent Plane that spanned across almost ten Heavenly Regions. It was boundless, and it was impossible to see the scene in the Heavenly Continent from the outside.","This was because there was a grand barrier that was enough to encompass the entire Heavenly Continent.","The life force and luck that Jian Wushuang had sensed earlier was emitted by that barrier.","Looking at the Super Heavenly Continent, Jian Wushuang hesitated. He suspected that the person who could control this Super Heavenly Continent was another Emperor-to-be.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing looked solemn.","They had not fully recovered from the previous battle. If they met another Emperor-to-be, they might really be powerless.","“Let’s take a detour and leave to avoid any more trouble.”","Jian Wushuang finally made up his mind.","They nodded. After all, it was not a wise move to rashly enter at such a critical juncture.","Although this Super Heavenly Continent was vast, it was not difficult to cross. At most, it would only take a hundred breaths to cross.","However, it was this hundred breaths of time that was truly dangerous.","Jian Wushuang held his breath and focused his mind. He brought Jiang Liyan back, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fu Yao across the Super Heavenly Continent in an instant, heading towards the boundless front.","However, at the same time they moved, there was a sudden change!"]},{"number":4999,"title":"Chapter 4999 Third and Fifth Heaven","paragraphs":["4999 Third and Fifth Heaven","The hazy Life Breath Barrier that enveloped the entire Super Heavenly Continent suddenly trembled. Without warning, billions of rays of light shot out at them.","Jian Wushuang had already predicted that it would not be so calm, so he was ready to make a move.","However, Yan Fan was a step faster than him. The True Sword at his waist was instantly unsheathed and then returned to its sheath. The entire process did not even take a breath.","Rumble...","Then, the billions of huge light pillars were all cut in the middle and shattered.","That majestic power did not even affect them before it was completely annihilated.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn. He knew that this was only the beginning.","Following that, just as he had imagined, as billions of light pillars shattered, the Life Breath Barrier began to fluctuate continuously.","Then, figures shot out from under the barrier like flowing lights. There were ten of them, no more no less.","Ten figures, but their realms were not too high. They were all Qing Yishui’s initial stage Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang raised the corner of his eyes slightly. He felt that the master of the Heavenly Continent Plan seemed to be testing them.","As expected, the ten figures at the front faced the Grand Yan Immortal who was rather mature. They took a step forward and said in a serious voice, “What do you guys do? Are you coveting my Heavenly Continent?”","Jian Wushuang then said, “That’s not the case. We were just on our way and passing by. We didn’t want to disturb you.”","“Passing by? Where are you going? What’s your purpose?” that Grand Yan Immortal immediately asked.","He said calmly, “This doesn’t concern you. We’re just hurrying along and have no intention of disturbing you. Please let us leave. ”","” Oh, since it has nothing to do with us, then we won’t ask too much,” the Grand Yan Immortal with an old face said. “But you have to pay a toll. ”","....","“You’re courting death!” Di Qing shouted. He could no longer tolerate their provocation.","However, Di Qing was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","He said calmly, ” I was in a hurry, so I didn’t have any of those things on me. I think even if I did, my fellow nobles of this Heavenly Continent wouldn’t take those things.”","His words were said so flawlessly that they could not find fault with him.","However, the old Grand Yan Immortal still continued, “You say you have none? Do you dare to let us search you?”","Jian Wushuang was almost amused by them. The terrified expressions of these Grand Yan Immortals said it all, but they still tried to provoke their group. This was something that even a brainless person would not do.","After all, Jian Wushuang and the others had just experienced a life-and-death battle, so they did not deliberately hide their auras.","Not to mention Jian Wushuang, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing were all Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals who were all from the Ancient Era. They were terrifying existences that could be killed by these Grand Yan Immortals with just a spit.","Even the weakest Immortal Lord Fu Yao was a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, they could not contend against her at all.","However, these Grand Evolution Immortals still provoked them. The only possibility was that someone behind them had instructed them to do so, forcing Jian Wushuang and the rest to take the lead.","In the end, Jian Wushuang endured it and said with a faint smile, “Do you dare to search if I ask you to?”","As soon as he said that, the ten Grand Yan Immortals looked at each other and no one dared to say anything.","Especially the elderly Grand Yan Immortal who was leading the group, his legs and stomach were starting to go weak.","Terrifying, it was too terrifying.","The Grand Yan Immortals who were able to survive in the Endless Sea until now were all extremely intelligent existences. How could they not sense the terrifying aura on the bodies of these uninvited guests?","Each of these seemingly calm figures emitted a profound aura that pressured him to the point that he almost could not breathe.","Especially that small Yan Immortal with a calm expression and a faint smile. His aura was even more vigorous, like a mountain entrenched, the sun and stars prostrated under his feet.","This aura was unheard of and could not be looked at directly.","Cold sweat dripped down from the old Grand Yan Immortal’s temples. He was already certain that if he were to say another word of provocation, then he would definitely die.","“You can leave now. I won’t make things difficult for you.”","Jian Wushuang said, helping them out and letting them leave.","The old Grand Yan Immortal heaved a sigh of relief. However, he still braced himself and said, “Why don’t you try beating us up?”","At this moment, Jiang Li and Yan Fan had strange expressions on their faces, and Di Qing’s eyes twitched. Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh at this strange question.","“Why? Tell me the reason, and I’ll consider teaching you a lesson.”","The old Grand Yan Immortal also felt that he was an idiot. His face turned red and he finally said, “Forget it, you guys should leave quickly. I’m afraid that you guys will destroy this place.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and prepared to leave.","However, at this moment, the hazy Life Breath Barrier fluctuated again. A total of nearly 100 figures suddenly rushed out like black clouds, blocking their way.","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned serious. He then realized that there were still so many Grand Evolution Immortals waiting below the barrier.","If they had attacked just now, they would have been surrounded long ago.","Looking at the Grand Yan Immortal in front of him, he was not worried. Instead, he was a little puzzled. What was the person behind this going to do?","“Everyone, if you’re not in a hurry, please come to the Third and Fifth Heaven for a while. My Immortal Lord has something to tell you.”","At the front of these hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals was an old man with a faint smile.","Jian Wushuang was unmoved, but he was thinking quickly in his heart.","The old man revealed two pieces of information.","The first piece of news was that this Super Heavenly Continent was called the Third and Fifth Heaven, which was a bit awkward to pronounce.","The second piece of news was that the owner of this Super Heavenly Continent was an Immoortal Lord.","The so-called Immortal Lord was actually a title passed down from the Ancient Era. Any Grand Yan Immortal below the Emperor-to-be level could be called an Immortal Lord. It was an elegant title, but it also carried some respect for strength.","Although the title of Immortal Lord was rarely used by Grand Yan Immortals in the outside world, it was still widely used in the Endless Sea.","This old man claimed that the master behind the Third and Fifth Heaven was an Immortal Lord, which meant that the strength of this person had not reached the Emperor-to-be level.","Undoubtedly, this was a friendly message that calmed Jian Wushuang down.","The doddering old man seemed to have noticed that his guard had been slightly lowered, so he invited them with a smile, “Please come to the Third and Fifth Heaven and have a chat. With your strength, we can’t control you at all.”"]},{"number":5000,"title":"Chapter 5000 Yu Yao","paragraphs":["5000 Yu Yao","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang looked at the old man and said, “We don’t have any interactions. I don’t think there’s much to talk about.”","The old man spoke very steadily and did not reveal any more important information.","Jian Wushuang did not know what to do. He looked at Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing.","“Agree with him and see what it is,” Yan Fan said in a low voice with a mysterious expression.","Jiang Li and Di Qing nodded in agreement.","“Isn’t it too dangerous?” Immortal Lord Fu Yao said worriedly.","Di Qing opened his mouth and finally said, “Be careful with what you tell him.”","In the end, after a moment of consideration, Jian Wushuang agreed to the elder’s request.","The old man nodded and smiled. Then, he waved his hand and opened the barrier.","The Life Breath Barrier opened, revealing the scene of the Heavenly Continent.","As the barrier opened, an extremely dense life aura rose and nourished all the Grand Yan Immortals.","“Immortals, please follow me.”","Stepping into the Super Heavenly Continent that was filled with the aura of life, the Life Breath Barrier closed again.","It was not the grayish-white skeleton of the Yan Immortal beneath his feet, but the Immortal Grass that was as tall as his legs. They were moving rhythmically, and the endless aura of life was coming from them.","This was a paradise, of course, in the harsh environment of the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang looked around and saw only endless green Immortal Grass. There were no other buildings.","After entering the barrier, all the Grand Yan Immortals consciously avoided him. Only the old man walked side by side with Jian Wushuang.","He did not ask any more questions and just walked forward leisurely.","In the end, the old man was the first to speak, “Immortal Lord, this is the Third Heaven. It’s the outermost layer of the entire Third and Fifth Heaven, and the inner layer is the Fifth Heaven.”","“Oh? There was another plane hidden under this barrier?”Jian Wushuang looked ahead and said.","As soon as he finished speaking, he stretched out his hand and pointed at the void in front of him.","The green immortal grass disappeared and was replaced by a Heaven Palace in the void.","The great sun and stars revolved above the Heavenly Hall. The Grand Yan Immortal was patrolling and cultivating in the vast square. It was like a truly hidden Heavenly Domain.","Looking at the mysterious scene in the crack, the old man nodded slightly and said, “Immortal Lord, this is the Fifth Heaven. It’s also where my Immortal Lord lives.”","Jian Wushuang came back to his senses and looked at the old man meaningfully.","To be able to show this true Secret Realm to outsiders who had just met them for the first time, firstly, it meant that the person behind this had absolute confidence in his strength. Secondly, it meant that he had a friendly and sincere attitude.","For a moment, even Jian Wushuang was curious about what the person behind this was thinking.","The old man smiled and led them from the Third Heaven to the Fifth Heaven.","The structure of the Third and Fifth Heaven was extremely exquisite and mysterious. They were two different spaces, but they were unimaginably superimposed.","If an external force intruded, even if the Third Heaven was completely destroyed, they would never be able to find the shadow of the Fifth Heaven. This was because they could not sense the Fifth Heaven, but the Fifth Heaven was actually right in front of them.","Third Heaven was just an appearance, while Fifth Heaven was the real important part.","Such a mysterious plane was enough to deal with any difficulty.","Stepping into the Fifth Heaven, Jian Wushuang looked at the brilliant sun and stars above his head and began to reconsider the true strength of the person behind him.","Jian Wushuang, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Fu Yao all arrived at the grand Heavenly Palace.","The Heavenly Gate of the Heavenly Palace was wide open, and wisps of smoke and mist came out of it.","Immediately after, a little Daoist Child with red lips and white teeth walked out of the Heavenly Palace and said with a smile, “Immortals, please come in. My Immortal Lord has been waiting for a long time.”","The old man cupped his hands and his figure slowly disappeared from where he was.","Looking at the opened gate, Jian Wushuang stepped in without hesitation.","Clouds and mist curled up, and the bright celestial river flowed on the dome of the Heavenly Hall. It was beautiful.","The entire Heaven Palace was made of some kind of jade, and it continuously emitted the aura of life.","As soon as he stepped into the Heaven Palace, Jian Wushuang fixed his eyes on the only figure standing in the middle of the palace.","It was a woman dressed in robes that resembled flowing clouds. She was clean and neat.","She had long eyebrows and was neither charming nor heroic. She only gave people an extremely gentle temperament, and it was impossible for people to have any dangerous thoughts.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang remained calm. He had already guessed that this woman was the mastermind behind all this.","“I think you want to die.” Jiang Li said casually, but she was full of killing intent.","“Darling, you’re thinking wrongly. I’m talking about her cultivation realm...”","Just as Yan Fan had said, the gentle woman in the flying cloud robe had a very good cultivation level. She did not deliberately hide her cultivation level. The fate energy of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal flowed slowly to support the operation of the entire Heavenly Palace.","Looking at the five figures who stepped into the Heavenly Palace, the gentle woman slowly walked towards them.","Her eyes, which were like the autumn water’s silhouette, slowly swept past and finally fell on Jian Wushuang, who was not very eye-catching.","Then, she smiled, “I can’t remember how many years it has been since I last saw a foreign Yan Immortal. It feels pretty good to see you guys today.”","“My name is Yu Yao, and I am the creator of the Third and Fifth Heaven.”","The gentle woman who called herself Yu Yao looked at Jian Wushuang as if she only wanted to know his name.","After pondering for a moment, he said, “Wu Shuang.”","“Wu Shuang? What a strange name. I’ll remember it,” the gentle-looking woman said, then waved her hand. “Everyone, please take a seat.”","No one moved, they all looked at Jian Wushuang.","In the end, Jian Wushuang said slowly, “I wonder if you have something to say to us. If there’s nothing else, we’ll leave now.”","When the gentle woman heard this, she smiled and said, “Of course, we have something to discuss. However, if we all stand and talk, it would be too uncomfortable. If this gets out, it would be bad if people say that I, Yu Yao, don’t know how to treat guests.”","“Therefore, please take a seat first.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything else and sat down at a jade table.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and the others also sat down. Their expressions were all different as if they were thinking about something."]}]);
